#: manual/verification.md:11
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:5
msgid "`ball_float` is interval arithmetic over `BinFloat` endpoints. A `BallFloat` is a closed real interval $[\\underline{x}, \\overline{x}]$, possibly unbounded, or the empty set; every operation returns an interval that contains all exact results of the operation on points of its operands (the *inclusion property*). `BallFloatDecorated` adds the decorations of IEEE 1788-2015, `BallContext` rounds results into a target binary format and reports `BallFlags`."
msgstr "`ball_float` 是以 `BinFloat` 为端点的区间算术。`BallFloat` 是一个闭实数区间 $[\\underline{x}, \\overline{x}]$（可以无界），或者空集；每个运算返回的区间都包含该运算作用于操作数中各点时的全部精确结果（即*包含性质*）。`BallFloatDecorated` 增加了 IEEE 1788-2015 的装饰（decoration），`BallContext` 将结果舍入到目标二进制格式并报告 `BallFlags`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:12
msgid "Despite the name, the stored representation is the endpoint pair, not a midpoint and a radius: `BallFloat::new(center, radius)`, `center()` and `radius()` convert to and from the midpoint–radius view. The [tutorial](../tutorial/ball_float.md) shows typical use; the [design page](../design/ball_float.md) derives the formulas and proves the inclusion property. The fallible pipeline wrapper is [`ball_float_checked`](ball_float_checked.md)."
msgstr "虽然名字叫“球”，其存储表示却是端点对，而不是中点与半径：`BallFloat::new(center, radius)`、`center()` 和 `radius()` 负责与中点–半径视图之间的相互转换。[教程](../tutorial/ball_float.md)展示了典型用法；[设计文档](../design/ball_float.md)推导了相关公式并证明了包含性质。可能失败的管线包装为 [`ball_float_checked`](ball_float_checked.md)。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:20
msgid "Conventions used on this page:"
msgstr "本页使用的约定："

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:22
msgid "$\\operatorname{RD}_p$ and $\\operatorname{RU}_p$ round toward $-\\infty$ and $+\\infty$ to $p$ significant bits. \"Rounded outward\" means the lower endpoint is rounded with $\\operatorname{RD}_p$ and the upper with $\\operatorname{RU}_p$."
msgstr "$\\operatorname{RD}_p$ 和 $\\operatorname{RU}_p$ 分别向 $-\\infty$ 和 $+\\infty$ 舍入到 $p$ 位有效二进制位。“向外舍入”是指下端点用 $\\operatorname{RD}_p$ 舍入、上端点用 $\\operatorname{RU}_p$ 舍入。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:26
msgid "The *precision* of an interval is a tag in bits. Operations round their result outward to the larger precision of their operands; elementary functions use the precision of their argument."
msgstr "区间的*精度*是一个以位为单位的标记。运算会将结果向外舍入到其操作数中较大的那个精度；初等函数使用其参数的精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:29
msgid "The exponent range of `BinFloat` endpoints is the implementation range of `bin_float`: leading-bit exponents up to $e_{\\max} = 2^{30} - 1$, and nonzero magnitudes down to $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}$ with $e_{\\min} = -(2^{30} - 1)$. Use a `BallContext` to impose a narrower range."
msgstr "`BinFloat` 端点的指数范围就是 `bin_float` 的实现范围：首位指数最大为 $e_{\\max} = 2^{30} - 1$，非零绝对值最小为 $2^{e_{\\min} - p + 1}$，其中 $e_{\\min} = -(2^{30} - 1)$。如需更窄的范围，请使用 `BallContext`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:33
msgid "*Empty* is the empty set, *Entire* is $(-\\infty, +\\infty)$. An unbounded interval stores $-\\infty$ and/or $+\\infty$ as endpoints; these mean that the set is unbounded on that side, never that it contains an infinite value."
msgstr "*Empty* 表示空集，*Entire* 表示 $(-\\infty, +\\infty)$。无界区间以 $-\\infty$ 和/或 $+\\infty$ 作为端点存储；这仅表示集合在该侧无界，绝不表示它包含无穷值。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:36
msgid "The few inputs for which the code currently loses part of the input set, widens without need, or rounds or flags a context result incorrectly are noted where they occur, with their tracking issue, and collected under [Known limitations](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations) on the design page."
msgstr "目前代码会丢失部分输入集合、无谓地放宽结果，或对上下文结果舍入或置标志出错的少数输入，都在出现处注明并附上对应的跟踪 issue，并汇总在设计文档的[已知局限](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations)中。"

