#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1567
msgid "`Add`, `Sub`, `Mul`, `Div` and `Neg` for `BallFloat` and `BallFloatDecorated`"
msgstr "`BallFloat` 和 `BallFloatDecorated` 的 `Add`、`Sub`、`Mul`、`Div` 和 `Neg`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1569
msgid "`BallFloat` implements `Add`, `Sub`, `Mul`, `Div` and `Neg`; `BallFloatDecorated` implements `Add`, `Sub`, `Mul` and `Div`. The operators call the methods of the same name."
msgstr "`BallFloat` 实现了 `Add`、`Sub`、`Mul`、`Div` 和 `Neg`；`BallFloatDecorated` 实现了 `Add`、`Sub`、`Mul` 和 `Div`。这些运算符调用同名方法。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1587
msgid "`Show` writes an interval in an exact text form."
msgstr "`Show` 以精确的文本形式输出区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1601
msgid "A bounded `BallFloat` prints as `center +/- radius` with both numbers in the exact `BinFloat` notation (`3p-1` is $3 \\cdot 2^{-1}$), so the text denotes exactly the stored set (up to the far-endpoint case noted under [`BallFloat::center`](#ballfloatcenter-and-ballfloatradius)); an unbounded one prints as `[lo, hi]`, Empty as `[empty]`. A decorated interval appends `_` and the decoration; NaI prints as `[nai]`."
msgstr "有界的 `BallFloat` 输出为 `center +/- radius`，两个数都使用精确的 `BinFloat` 记法（`3p-1` 表示 $3 \\cdot 2^{-1}$），因此文本恰好表示所存储的集合（[`BallFloat::center`](#ballfloatcenter-and-ballfloatradius) 中提到的远端点情形除外）；无界的输出为 `[lo, hi]`，Empty 输出为 `[empty]`。装饰区间会附加 `_` 及装饰；NaI 输出为 `[nai]`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1619
msgid "These are the derived `Eq` and `Debug` methods of the structures."
msgstr "这些是各结构体派生的 `Eq` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1633
msgid "These are the derived `Eq` and `Debug` methods of the enums."
msgstr "这些是各枚举派生的 `Eq` 和 `Debug` 方法。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1644
msgid "The `Eq` implementations compare representations. For `BallFloat` and `BallFloatDecorated` this distinguishes equal sets stored with different precision tags or endpoint precisions; use `set_equal` for sets. `to_repr` gives the structural `Debug` form."
msgstr "`Eq` 的实现比较的是表示。对于 `BallFloat` 和 `BallFloatDecorated`，这会区分以不同精度标记或端点精度存储的相等集合；比较集合请使用 `set_equal`。`to_repr` 给出结构化的 `Debug` 形式。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1649
msgid "`@def.Floating` for `BallFloat`"
msgstr "`BallFloat` 的 `@def.Floating`"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1651
msgid "`BallFloat` implements the `Floating` trait of [`def`](def.md) with `classify`, `sign`, `precision`, `with_precision` and `normalized` as described above, so the generic predicates `@def.is_finite` (bounded), `@def.is_infinite` (unbounded), `@def.is_nan` (Empty) and `@def.is_zero` (sign `Zero`, that is, contains 0) apply to intervals."
msgstr "`BallFloat` 实现了 [`def`](def.md) 的 `Floating` trait，其中 `classify`、`sign`、`precision`、`with_precision` 和 `normalized` 如上文所述，因此通用谓词 `@def.is_finite`（有界）、`@def.is_infinite`（无界）、`@def.is_nan`（Empty）和 `@def.is_zero`（符号为 `Zero`，即包含 0）也适用于区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1661
msgid "The laws of `Floating` that speak of keeping a value hold only as enclosures: `with_precision` and `normalized` return supersets of the input (see the warning under [`BallFloat::with_precision`](#ballfloatwith_precision))."
msgstr "`Floating` 中关于保持值不变的定律只在包络意义下成立：`with_precision` 和 `normalized` 返回输入的超集（参见 [`BallFloat::with_precision`](#ballfloatwith_precision) 下的警告）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1668
msgid "`BallFloat` implements the enclosure relation traits of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`."
msgstr "`BallFloat` 实现了 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的包络关系 trait。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1678
msgid "`Contains::contains(x, y)` is `y.subset(x)` (set inclusion, not the point-taking method); the others call the methods of the same name."
msgstr "`Contains::contains(x, y)` 即 `y.subset(x)`（集合包含，而不是接受点的那个方法）；其他方法调用同名方法。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1683
msgid "`BallFloat` implements `DivChecked`, `PowNatChecked` and `PowIntChecked`; their methods are promoted."
msgstr "`BallFloat` 实现了 `DivChecked`、`PowNatChecked` 和 `PowIntChecked`；它们的方法被提升为该类型的方法。"

#: manual/api/ball_float.md:1695
msgid "Only `ctx.precision` is used: the operands are re-rounded to it with `with_precision`, the operation is applied, and the result is re-rounded outward (see [`BallFloat::with_precision`](#ballfloatwith_precision)). At the operands' own precision the result is that of the plain operation; at a lower precision it can be wider. They always return `Ok`. `div_checked` follows the division rules above (a divisor containing 0 gives an unbounded result, not an error). `pow_int_checked` uses `pown`. `pow_nat_checked` uses binary powering by repeated interval multiplication, which treats the factors as independent: for an argument containing 0 its result is wider than `pown`. An Empty base gives Empty for every exponent, including 0, as `pown` does."
msgstr "只使用 `ctx.precision`：操作数先用 `with_precision` 重新舍入到该精度，再应用运算，然后将结果向外重新舍入（参见 [`BallFloat::with_precision`](#ballfloatwith_precision)）。在操作数自身的精度下，结果与普通运算相同；在更低的精度下结果可能更宽。它们总是返回 `Ok`。`div_checked` 遵循上述除法规则（除数包含 0 时给出无界结果，而不是错误）。`pow_int_checked` 使用 `pown`。`pow_nat_checked` 通过重复的区间乘法进行二进制求幂，这会把各因子视为相互独立：对于包含 0 的参数，其结果比 `pown` 更宽。与 `pown` 一样，Empty 底数对任何指数（包括 0）都给出 Empty。"

