#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:1
msgid "ball_float_checked API"
msgstr "ball_float_checked API"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:5
msgid "`ball_float_checked` provides `BallFloatResult`, a closed wrapper around `Result[BallFloat, ArithmeticError]` for interval computations. Construction validates its inputs, every operation passes on the first error, and the interval operations of [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) are applied when all operands are successes. A valid but uninformative enclosure (the empty set, the whole line) is a success, not an error. The wrapper stores no decorations and no `BallFlags`. The [tutorial](../tutorial/ball_float_checked.md) builds pipelines; the [design page](../design/ball_float_checked.md) explains which outcomes are errors and why."
msgstr "`ball_float_checked` 提供 `BallFloatResult`，它是用于区间计算的、对 `Result[BallFloat, ArithmeticError]` 的封闭包装。构造时会校验输入，每个运算都会传递遇到的第一个错误，当所有操作数都成功时则应用 [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) 的区间运算。一个有效但不含信息的包络（空集、整条实轴）属于成功，而不是错误。该包装不存储装饰，也不存储 `BallFlags`。[教程](../tutorial/ball_float_checked.md)介绍如何构建计算管线；[设计文档](../design/ball_float_checked.md)解释哪些结果属于错误及其原因。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:17
msgid "Add the wrapper and the endpoint package to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中添加该包装及端点包："

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:28
msgid "The examples refer to the packages as `@ball_float_checked.`, `@ball_float.`, `@bin_float.`, `@def.` (for the `Sign` of an infinity) and `@lf_arith.` (for `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`). They print a result with this helper (`to_string` of a bounded ball is `center +/- radius` in exact binary notation, `mpe` meaning $m \\cdot 2^{e}$):"
msgstr "示例中将这些包称为 `@ball_float_checked.`、`@ball_float.`、`@bin_float.`、`@def.`（用于无穷的 `Sign`）和 `@lf_arith.`（对应 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`）。示例使用以下辅助函数输出结果（有界球的 `to_string` 为精确二进制记法下的 `center +/- radius`，`mpe` 表示 $m \\cdot 2^{e}$）："

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:44
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:45
msgid "The wrapper type"
msgstr "包装类型"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:48
msgid "`BallFloatResult` is either a successful `BallFloat` or an `ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "`BallFloatResult` 要么是成功的 `BallFloat`，要么是 `ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:56
msgid "The single private field holds a `Result[@ball_float.BallFloat, @arithmetic.ArithmeticError]`. The type has no `Eq` or `Show`; use `result()`."
msgstr "唯一的私有字段保存一个 `Result[@ball_float.BallFloat, @arithmetic.ArithmeticError]`。该类型没有 `Eq` 或 `Show`；请使用 `result()`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:63
msgid "These functions wrap an existing interval, error or `Result` unchanged."
msgstr "这些函数原样包装一个已有的区间、错误或 `Result`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:73
msgid "These constructors enclose an integer through `BallFloat::from_int` / `BallFloat::from_coefficient`; they never fail."
msgstr "这些构造函数通过 `BallFloat::from_int` / `BallFloat::from_coefficient` 构建整数的包络；它们从不失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:81
msgid "The default precision is **16 bits**. The integer is converted exactly and then rounded outward to the precision, so the result always contains it: a singleton when the integer fits in the precision, otherwise the two-point interval of its neighbours (for example `from_int(100001)`, a 17-bit odd integer, gives an interval of width 2). Pass a precision large enough for the integer to get a point."
msgstr "默认精度为 **16 位**。整数先被精确转换，再向外舍入到该精度，因此结果总是包含它：当整数能用该精度表示时为单点集，否则为由其两个相邻值构成的两点区间（例如 `from_int(100001)` 是一个 17 位的奇数，给出宽度为 2 的区间）。要得到点区间，请传入足以表示该整数的精度。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:90
msgid "These constructors enclose a finite `Double` or `Float`."
msgstr "这些构造函数包络一个有限的 `Double` 或 `Float`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:97
msgid "The source is converted exactly (at least 53 or 24 bits) and then rounded outward to `precision` (defaults 53 and 24), so the result always contains the source value. A NaN or infinite source gives a `DomainError` (`ball double source must be finite`, `ball float source must be finite`)."
msgstr "源值先被精确转换（至少 53 或 24 位），然后向外舍入到 `precision`（默认分别为 53 和 24），因此结果总是包含源值。NaN 或无穷的源值给出 `DomainError`（`ball double source must be finite`、`ball float source must be finite`）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:104
msgid "`exact(x, precision~)` encloses a finite `BinFloat`."
msgstr "`exact(x, precision~)` 包络一个有限的 `BinFloat`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:110
msgid "`precision` defaults to `x.precision()`. The bounds are `x` rounded down and up to that precision, so the result contains `x`. A non-finite `x` gives a `DomainError` (`ball exact source must be finite`)."
msgstr "`precision` 默认为 `x.precision()`。两个界分别是 `x` 向下和向上舍入到该精度的结果，因此结果包含 `x`。非有限的 `x` 给出 `DomainError`（`ball exact source must be finite`）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:116
msgid "`from_bounds(lo, hi, precision~)` builds the interval $[\\textit{lo}, \\textit{hi}]$."
msgstr "`from_bounds(lo, hi, precision~)` 构建区间 $[\\textit{lo}, \\textit{hi}]$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:123
msgid "`precision` defaults to the larger bound precision; `lo` is rounded down and `hi` up. It returns a `DomainError` when a bound is NaN, when `lo` is $+\\infty$, when `hi` is $-\\infty$ (IEEE 1788 intervals are subsets of $\\mathbb{R}$, so $[+\\infty, +\\infty]$ is not an interval), or when `lo > hi`. Infinite bounds on the open side are allowed: $[-\\infty, 0]$ is valid."
msgstr "`precision` 默认为两个界中较大的精度；`lo` 向下舍入，`hi` 向上舍入。当某个界为 NaN、`lo` 为 $+\\infty$、`hi` 为 $-\\infty$（IEEE 1788 区间是 $\\mathbb{R}$ 的子集，因此 $[+\\infty, +\\infty]$ 不是区间），或 `lo > hi` 时，返回 `DomainError`。开放一侧允许使用无穷界：$[-\\infty, 0]$ 是有效的。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:132
msgid "`whole(precision~)` is the entire real line $[-\\infty, +\\infty]$ (default precision 53); it never fails."
msgstr "`whole(precision~)` 是整条实轴 $[-\\infty, +\\infty]$（默认精度 53）；它从不失败。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:166
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:101
#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:158
#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:102
msgid "Observation"
msgstr "观察"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:170
msgid "These methods expose the wrapped `Result`, test its branch, or return the error as an option."
msgstr "这些方法暴露被包装的 `Result`、检测其分支，或以 option 形式返回错误。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:180
msgid "`error()` is `Some(e)` exactly when `result()` is `Err(e)`."
msgstr "当且仅当 `result()` 为 `Err(e)` 时，`error()` 为 `Some(e)`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:182
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:116
msgid "Composition"
msgstr "组合"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:186
msgid "`map(f)` applies an infallible interval function to a success; `bind(f)` applies one that may fail. Errors pass through unchanged."
msgstr "`map(f)` 将一个不会失败的区间函数应用于成功值；`bind(f)` 应用一个可能失败的函数。错误原样传递。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:194
msgid "They satisfy the monad and functor laws proved in the [`bin_float_checked` design](../design/bin_float_checked.md#the-monad-laws); the proof does not depend on the value type."
msgstr "它们满足 [`bin_float_checked` 设计文档](../design/bin_float_checked.md#the-monad-laws)中证明的 monad 定律与 functor 定律；该证明不依赖于值的类型。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:198
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:164
msgid "Unary value maps"
msgstr "一元值映射"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:202
msgid "These methods are `map` of the `BallFloat` method of the same name."
msgstr "这些方法是对同名 `BallFloat` 方法的 `map`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:211
msgid "`neg` and `abs` are the exact interval images $\\{-t\\}$ and $\\{|t|\\}$; `with_precision` rounds the endpoints outward to the new precision for every rounding mode (the mode is ignored), which is the tightest enclosure of the input. Neither it nor `normalized` changes an interval that is already representable at the target precision (see [`BallFloat::with_precision`](ball_float.md#ballfloatwith_precision))."
msgstr "`neg` 和 `abs` 是精确的区间像 $\\{-t\\}$ 和 $\\{|t|\\}$；`with_precision` 对任何舍入模式都把端点向外舍入到新精度（模式被忽略），这就是输入的最紧包络。它和 `normalized` 都不会改变在目标精度下已可表示的区间（参见 [`BallFloat::with_precision`](ball_float.md#ballfloatwith_precision)）。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:222
msgid "These methods combine two wrappers with the `BallFloat` operators."
msgstr "这些方法用 `BallFloat` 运算符组合两个包装值。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:231
msgid "The left operand's error comes first, then the right one's. Interval arithmetic itself never fails: the result encloses $\\{\\, s \\circ t : s \\in X, t \\in Y \\,\\}$. Division by an interval that is exactly $\\{0\\}$ gives the empty set, and division by an interval that contains zero in its interior gives the whole line."
msgstr "左操作数的错误优先，其次是右操作数的。区间算术本身从不失败：结果包络 $\\{\\, s \\circ t : s \\in X, t \\in Y \\,\\}$。除以恰为 $\\{0\\}$ 的区间得到空集，除以内部包含零的区间得到整条实轴。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:239
msgid "These methods raise an interval to an integer power through the Luna-Flow/arithmetic traits `PowNatChecked` and `PowIntChecked`."
msgstr "这些方法通过 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的 trait `PowNatChecked` 和 `PowIntChecked` 计算区间的整数次幂。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:247
msgid "The context is `ArithmeticContext::new(x.precision())`; `ball_float` uses only its precision, and re-rounds the base and the result outward with `with_precision`, which adds nothing when they are already representable. `pow_int` encloses $\\{t^{n}\\}$ with `BallFloat::pown`, which treats the base as one point (so `pow_int(2)` of $[-1, 1]$ is $[0, 1]$, tighter than `x * x`, which is $[-1, 1]$). A zero base with a negative exponent gives the empty set. `pow_nat` instead uses binary powering by repeated interval multiplication, which treats the factors as independent: `pow_nat(2)` of $[-1, 1]$ is $[-1, 1]$, like `x * x`. For even powers of an interval containing 0, prefer `pow_int`. An empty base stays empty for every exponent, including `pow_nat(0)` and `pow_int(0)`."
msgstr "上下文为 `ArithmeticContext::new(x.precision())`；`ball_float` 只使用其精度，并用 `with_precision` 将底数和结果向外重新舍入，当它们已可表示时不会增加任何宽度。`pow_int` 用 `BallFloat::pown` 包络 $\\{t^{n}\\}$，它把底数视为同一个点（因此 $[-1, 1]$ 的 `pow_int(2)` 为 $[0, 1]$，比 `x * x` 的 $[-1, 1]$ 更紧）。零底数配负指数得到空集。`pow_nat` 则通过重复的区间乘法进行二进制求幂，把各因子视为相互独立：$[-1, 1]$ 的 `pow_nat(2)` 为 $[-1, 1]$，与 `x * x` 相同。对于包含 0 的区间的偶次幂，请优先使用 `pow_int`。空底数对任何指数都保持为空，包括 `pow_nat(0)` 和 `pow_int(0)`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:260
msgid "`rootn(n)` encloses the real $n$-th root with `BallFloat::try_rootn`."
msgstr "`rootn(n)` 用 `BallFloat::try_rootn` 包络实 $n$ 次方根。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:266
msgid "Degree $0$ gives a `DomainError`. Even roots ignore the negative part of the interval (set semantics): the root of $[-1, 1]$ is $[0, 1]$."
msgstr "次数 $0$ 给出 `DomainError`。偶次方根忽略区间的负值部分（集合语义）：$[-1, 1]$ 的方根为 $[0, 1]$。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:271
msgid "These binary functions enclose $x^{y}$, $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$ and the angle of $(\\text{abscissa}, \\text{self})$."
msgstr "这些二元函数包络 $x^{y}$、$\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$ 以及 $(\\text{abscissa}, \\text{self})$ 的辐角。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:280
msgid "They call `try_pow_interval`, `try_hypot` and `try_atan2_interval`. Operand errors are taken left first; the operation can fail with a `CertificationFailure`. Points outside the real domain are dropped from the result set, so $(-2)^{0.5}$ is the empty interval."
msgstr "它们调用 `try_pow_interval`、`try_hypot` 和 `try_atan2_interval`。操作数错误先取左侧；运算本身可能以 `CertificationFailure` 失败。实定义域之外的点会从结果集合中去除，因此 $(-2)^{0.5}$ 是空区间。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:317
msgid "These methods enclose the image of the interval under the exponentials and logarithms."
msgstr "这些方法包络区间在指数函数和对数函数下的像。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:333
msgid "These methods enclose the image of the interval under the trigonometric functions and their inverses."
msgstr "这些方法包络区间在三角函数及其反函数下的像。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:350
msgid "These methods enclose the image of the interval under the hyperbolic functions and their inverses."
msgstr "这些方法包络区间在双曲函数及其反函数下的像。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:362
msgid "Each method is `bind` of `BallFloat::try_<name>_interval` at the interval's precision. The result $Y$ satisfies $f(X \\cap \\operatorname{dom} f) \\subseteq Y$; parts of $X$ outside the domain are ignored, so $\\ln([-1, 1]) = [-\\infty, 0]$ and $\\ln([-2, -2])$ is empty. The only error is a `CertificationFailure` when an enclosure cannot be certified, for example the cosine of $2^{70000}$ (reason `ResourceLimit`). There are no context variants; precision is set with `with_precision`."
msgstr "每个方法都是以区间精度对 `BallFloat::try_<name>_interval` 进行 `bind`。结果 $Y$ 满足 $f(X \\cap \\operatorname{dom} f) \\subseteq Y$；$X$ 中位于定义域之外的部分被忽略，因此 $\\ln([-1, 1]) = [-\\infty, 0]$，而 $\\ln([-2, -2])$ 为空。唯一的错误是无法认证包络时的 `CertificationFailure`，例如 $2^{70000}$ 的余弦（原因为 `ResourceLimit`）。没有上下文变体；精度通过 `with_precision` 设置。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:400
msgid "`Add`, `Sub`, `Mul`, `Div`, `Neg` for `BallFloatResult`"
msgstr "`BallFloatResult` 的 `Add`、`Sub`、`Mul`、`Div`、`Neg`"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:402
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:685
msgid "The operators `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` and unary `-` call `add`, `sub`, `mul`, `div` and `neg`."
msgstr "运算符 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 和一元 `-` 调用 `add`、`sub`、`mul`、`div` 和 `neg`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:413
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:699
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "已弃用"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:417
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:703
msgid "`flat_map` is the former name of `bind`. Replace `r.flat_map(f)` with `r.bind(f)`."
msgstr "`flat_map` 是 `bind` 的旧名称。请将 `r.flat_map(f)` 替换为 `r.bind(f)`。"

