msgstr "以下快照是该包完整的生成接口。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:1
msgid "bench API"
msgstr "bench API"

#: manual/api/bench.md:5
msgid "`bench` is the shared benchmark toolkit of `floating`, built on the Maremark framework (`Luna-Flow/mare_mark`). It builds immutable benchmark specifications, describes the measurement environment, runs a specification under a validated protocol, and reduces the recorded observations: paired comparisons with bootstrap confidence intervals, a regression verdict, and per-dataset auto-tuning decisions. The per-core suites [bench/bin_float](bench/bin_float.md), [bench/decimal](bench/decimal.md), [bench/decimal_gda](bench/decimal_gda.md) and [bench/ball_float](bench/ball_float.md) use it. The [tutorial](../tutorial/bench.md) shows how to run the suites and the [design page](../design/bench.md) derives the statistics."
msgstr "`bench` 是 `floating` 共用的基准测试工具包，构建于 Maremark 框架（`Luna-Flow/mare_mark`）之上。它构建不可变的基准测试规格，描述测量环境，在经过验证的协议下运行规格，并对记录下来的观测数据进行归约：带 bootstrap 置信区间的配对比较、回归判定，以及按数据集的自动调优决策。各核心的基准套件 [bench/bin_float](bench/bin_float.md)、[bench/decimal](bench/decimal.md)、[bench/decimal_gda](bench/decimal_gda.md) 和 [bench/ball_float](bench/ball_float.md) 都使用它。[教程](../tutorial/bench.md)介绍如何运行这些套件，[设计页面](../design/bench.md)推导其中的统计方法。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:19
msgid "Import the package in `moon.pkg`. The Maremark packages are needed only to build specifications and observations; the reduction functions take plain arrays and observations:"
msgstr "在 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包。只有在构建规格和观测数据时才需要 Maremark 的包；归约函数接受普通数组和观测数据："

#: manual/api/bench.md:32
msgid "The examples on this page use the alias `@bench`. The benchmark suites import the same package under the alias `@benchkit` (`\"Luna-Flow/floating/bench\" @benchkit`). Types prefixed `@model`, `@runner`, `@event` and `@stats` belong to `Luna-Flow/mare_mark`. An `@model.Observation` records one timed batch: case, implementation, dataset, repetition and block ids, phase (exploratory or confirmatory), `raw_elapsed_us` (batch time divided by the batch's iteration count, so the mean time of one call in microseconds), and a `valid` flag."
msgstr "本页示例使用别名 `@bench`。基准测试套件以别名 `@benchkit`（`\"Luna-Flow/floating/bench\" @benchkit`）导入同一个包。带 `@model`、`@runner`、`@event` 和 `@stats` 前缀的类型属于 `Luna-Flow/mare_mark`。一个 `@model.Observation` 记录一次计时批次：用例、实现、数据集、重复编号和区块编号、阶段（探索性或确认性）、`raw_elapsed_us`（批次耗时除以该批次的迭代次数，即单次调用的平均耗时，单位为微秒），以及一个 `valid` 标志。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:40
msgid "Building and running benchmarks"
msgstr "构建和运行基准测试"

#: manual/api/bench.md:44
msgid "`immutable_bench(id, operation, scales, scale_text, generate, fingerprint, implementations, reference, comparator, input_text, output_text)` builds a benchmark whose input is generated once per scale and never mutated."
msgstr "`immutable_bench(id, operation, scales, scale_text, generate, fingerprint, implementations, reference, comparator, input_text, output_text)` 构建一个基准测试，其输入在每个规模下只生成一次，且从不被修改。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:52
#: manual/api/cli.md:39
msgid "Argument"
msgstr "参数"

#: manual/api/bench.md:54
msgid "case id, also used for the fixture (`id-fixture`, version `\"1\"`) and the oracle (`id-reference`)"
msgstr "用例 id，也用于夹具（`id-fixture`，版本 `\"1\"`）和预言机（`id-reference`）"

#: manual/api/bench.md:55
msgid "operation name recorded in the case descriptor"
msgstr "记录在用例描述符中的运算名"

#: manual/api/bench.md:56
msgid "the datasets (for example bit or digit sizes) and their labels; dataset $k$ is `scales[k]`"
msgstr "数据集（例如位数或数字位数）及其标签；数据集 $k$ 为 `scales[k]`"

#: manual/api/bench.md:57
msgid "build the input for a scale; identify it in reports"
msgstr "为某一规模构建输入；在报告中标识该输入"

#: manual/api/bench.md:58
msgid "stateless implementations compared on the same input"
msgstr "在同一输入上进行比较的无状态实现"

#: manual/api/bench.md:59
msgid "the expected value for an input and the check of every output against it; nothing forces `reference` to be independent of the implementations"
msgstr "某个输入的期望值，以及将每个输出与之对照的检查；没有任何机制强制 `reference` 独立于各实现"

#: manual/api/bench.md:60
msgid "text forms for reports and replay"
msgstr "用于报告和重放的文本形式"

#: manual/api/bench.md:62
msgid "The specification keeps the last output of each batch as a sink (so the work cannot be optimized away), validates outputs with the reference oracle, uses one repetition unit, and describes each case as stateless and exact."
msgstr "该规格将每个批次的最后一个输出保留为汇点（sink，使计算无法被优化掉），用参考预言机验证输出，使用单一重复单位，并将每个用例描述为无状态且精确的。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:68
msgid "`environment(target, dtype_abi, run_id)` builds the environment snapshot recorded with every run."
msgstr "`environment(target, dtype_abi, run_id)` 构建随每次运行一起记录的环境快照。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:75
msgid "It records the target, a fixed toolchain label, the `release` profile and the given data-type ABI label; the performance and provenance fields that only the calling tool knows (CPU, frequency policy, commit) are marked `external-metadata`, and the source state as `working-tree`."
msgstr "它记录目标平台、一个固定的工具链标签、`release` 配置以及给定的数据类型 ABI 标签；只有调用工具才知道的性能与来源字段（CPU、频率策略、提交）被标记为 `external-metadata`，源码状态被标记为 `working-tree`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:82
msgid "`run(spec, environment, sink, seed, protocol)` compiles a specification and executes it, streaming observations to `sink`."
msgstr "`run(spec, environment, sink, seed, protocol)` 编译并执行一个规格，将观测数据以流的方式写入 `sink`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:89
msgid "`seed` is passed to the input generators through `@model.GenerationContext` and, under a `BalancedBlocks(s)` order policy, fixes the rotation offset $(s \\oplus \\mathit{seed}) \\bmod K$ of the $K$ implementations in every block; `protocol` is normally a preset such as `@runner.ProtocolPreset::Development.validated()`. The function aborts if the specification does not compile. The returned summary counts observations, calibrations, validations and oracle outcomes (`passed_count`, `failed_count`, …)."
msgstr "`seed` 通过 `@model.GenerationContext` 传给输入生成器，并且在 `BalancedBlocks(s)` 顺序策略下，固定每个区块中 $K$ 个实现的轮换偏移 $(s \\oplus \\mathit{seed}) \\bmod K$；`protocol` 通常是一个预设，例如 `@runner.ProtocolPreset::Development.validated()`。若规格无法编译，函数会中止。返回的摘要统计观测、校准、验证和预言机结果的数量（`passed_count`、`failed_count`、…）。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:98
msgid "Reducing observations"
msgstr "归约观测数据"

#: manual/api/bench.md:102
msgid "`paired_hotspot(observations, case_id, dataset_id, baseline_id, candidate_id, practical_delta_pct, seed)` compares two implementations on one dataset."
msgstr "`paired_hotspot(observations, case_id, dataset_id, baseline_id, candidate_id, practical_delta_pct, seed)` 在一个数据集上比较两个实现。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:109
msgid "It selects the valid confirmatory observations of each implementation for the case and dataset, orders them by block id, pairs them by position (the $j$-th remaining baseline sample with the $j$-th remaining candidate sample, not by equal block id) and calls `@stats.compare_paired_with_bootstrap` with 2000 resamples. The comparison's `relative_delta_pct` is $\\Delta_{\\%} = 100 \\cdot \\operatorname{med}(c - b) / \\operatorname{med}(b)$ (0 when $\\operatorname{med}(b) = 0$), and its `decision` is `Faster` when $\\Delta_{\\%} \\le -\\delta$, `Slower` when $\\Delta_{\\%} \\ge \\delta$ and `Equivalent` otherwise, for $\\delta$ = `practical_delta_pct`. Its `interval` is the 95 % percentile-bootstrap interval of the median paired difference $\\operatorname{med}(c - b)$, in microseconds. Errors: `MismatchedPairs` when the two implementations have different numbers of samples, `EmptySamples` when there are none, `NonFiniteSample` when a time is NaN or infinite."
msgstr "它为该用例和数据集选出每个实现的有效确认性观测，按区块编号排序，按位置配对（剩余的第 $j$ 个基线样本与剩余的第 $j$ 个候选样本配对，而不是按相同的区块编号配对），然后以 2000 次重采样调用 `@stats.compare_paired_with_bootstrap`。比较结果的 `relative_delta_pct` 为 $\\Delta_{\\%} = 100 \\cdot \\operatorname{med}(c - b) / \\operatorname{med}(b)$（当 $\\operatorname{med}(b) = 0$ 时为 0），其 `decision` 在 $\\Delta_{\\%} \\le -\\delta$ 时为 `Faster`，在 $\\Delta_{\\%} \\ge \\delta$ 时为 `Slower`，否则为 `Equivalent`，其中 $\\delta$ = `practical_delta_pct`。其 `interval` 为配对差中位数 $\\operatorname{med}(c - b)$ 的 95 % 百分位 bootstrap 区间，单位为微秒。错误：两个实现的样本数不同时为 `MismatchedPairs`，没有样本时为 `EmptySamples`，某个耗时为 NaN 或无穷时为 `NonFiniteSample`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:124
msgid "Pairing is by position after the filter: if one implementation has an invalid observation in some block and the other does not, the counts differ and the call returns `MismatchedPairs`; if both lose one observation in different blocks, the counts agree and later samples are paired across blocks."
msgstr "配对是在过滤之后按位置进行的：如果一个实现在某个区块中有一个无效观测而另一个没有，则两者的数量不同，调用返回 `MismatchedPairs`；如果两者各自在不同区块中丢失一个观测，则数量一致，后面的样本会跨区块配对。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:131
msgid "`confirmatory_regression(baseline, candidate, seed)` compares two paired sample arrays with a 95 % percentile-bootstrap interval."
msgstr "`confirmatory_regression(baseline, candidate, seed)` 用 95 % 百分位 bootstrap 区间比较两个配对的样本数组。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:138
msgid "The practical threshold is 3 %, the bootstrap uses 10 000 resamples, and the interval is on the median paired difference `candidate[j] - baseline[j]` in the samples' unit. The labels identify the baseline and the current candidate."
msgstr "实用阈值为 3 %，bootstrap 使用 10 000 次重采样，区间针对的是配对差值 `candidate[j] - baseline[j]` 的中位数，单位与样本相同。标签分别标识基线和当前候选。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:145
msgid "`is_significant_regression(comparison)` is true when the candidate is practically slower and the interval of the median difference lies entirely above zero."
msgstr "当候选在实用意义上更慢，且中位数差值的区间完全位于零之上时，`is_significant_regression(comparison)` 为真。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:153
msgid "That is, `decision` is `Slower` and `interval.low > 0`."
msgstr "即 `decision` 为 `Slower` 且 `interval.low > 0`。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:168
msgid "Auto-tuning"
msgstr "自动调优"

#: manual/api/bench.md:172
msgid "`TuneDecision` is the implementation chosen for one dataset."
msgstr "`TuneDecision` 是为一个数据集选定的实现。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:183
msgid "`median_us` is the median per-call time of the chosen candidate and `valid_samples` the number of finite, non-negative confirmatory samples it was computed from."
msgstr "`median_us` 是所选候选的单次调用耗时中位数，`valid_samples` 是计算该中位数所用的有限且非负的确认性样本数。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:189
msgid "`tune_dataset(observations, case_id, dataset_id, candidate_ids, practical_delta_pct)` picks the fastest candidate for one dataset."
msgstr "`tune_dataset(observations, case_id, dataset_id, candidate_ids, practical_delta_pct)` 为一个数据集挑选最快的候选。"

#: manual/api/bench.md:196
msgid "For every candidate it takes the valid confirmatory observations of the case and dataset, and scores the candidate by the median of the finite, non-negative samples. Candidates without such samples are invalid. The result is the valid candidate with the smallest median, ties broken by the smaller candidate id; `None` when no candidate is valid. Because the score is used as both the primary and the secondary criterion of `@tune.select_best`, `practical_delta_pct` does not change the choice. Which secondary criterion is intended is open in [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60)."
msgstr "对每个候选，它取该用例和数据集的有效确认性观测，并以其中有限且非负样本的中位数为候选打分。没有此类样本的候选无效。结果是中位数最小的有效候选，平局时取候选 id 较小者；没有有效候选时为 `None`。由于该分数同时用作 `@tune.select_best` 的主要和次要判据，`practical_delta_pct` 不会改变选择结果。预期采用哪个次要判据尚在 [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60) 中讨论。"

#: manual/api/bench/ball_float.md:1
msgid "bench/ball_float API"
msgstr "bench/ball_float API"

#: manual/api/bench/ball_float.md:5
msgid "`bench/ball_float` holds the interval (ball) arithmetic benchmarks of `floating`. It is a test-only package: all content is in `*_test.mbt` files built on the [`bench`](../bench.md) toolkit, and it exports no MoonBit items. This page records the benchmark cases it defines; the [tutorial](../../tutorial/bench/ball_float.md) shows how to run them and the [design page](../../design/bench/ball_float.md) explains the workloads."
msgstr "`bench/ball_float` 包含 `floating` 的区间（球）算术基准测试。它是一个仅用于测试的包：所有内容都位于基于 [`bench`](../bench.md) 工具包的 `*_test.mbt` 文件中，不导出任何 MoonBit 项。本页记录它定义的基准用例；[教程](../../tutorial/bench/ball_float.md)介绍如何运行它们，[设计页面](../../design/bench/ball_float.md)解释其工作负载。"

