#: manual/api/bench/bin_float.md:38
msgid "Every specification has a plan test that runs in normal test runs and checks that it compiles (`binary benchmark plans compile`, `elementary benchmark plans compile`, `binary auto tune plan compiles`), and a performance test marked `#skip(\"performance benchmark\")` that only `tools/benchmark.py` runs. In the reported lines `DATASET` is the 0-based index into the datasets column. The performance tests stream every observation as a `MAREMARK_JSONL=` line and print the reduced results as `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…` for arithmetic, `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/elementary/OP/DATASET full_pct=…` for elementary functions, and `MAREMARK_TUNE`, `MAREMARK_CROSSOVER` and `MAREMARK_POLICY` lines for the square experiment."
msgstr "每个规格都有一个计划测试，它在常规测试运行中执行并检查规格能否编译（`binary benchmark plans compile`、`elementary benchmark plans compile`、`binary auto tune plan compiles`），还有一个标记为 `#skip(\"performance benchmark\")` 的性能测试，只有 `tools/benchmark.py` 会运行它。在报告的行中，`DATASET` 是数据集列中从 0 开始的索引。性能测试将每个观测以 `MAREMARK_JSONL=` 行的形式输出，并打印归约结果：算术运算为 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…`，初等函数为 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/elementary/OP/DATASET full_pct=…`，平方实验则为 `MAREMARK_TUNE`、`MAREMARK_CROSSOVER` 和 `MAREMARK_POLICY` 行。"

