#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:39
#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:37
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:38
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:41
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:44
msgid "print one JSON object instead of text"
msgstr "打印一个 JSON 对象而非文本"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:42
#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:45
msgid "`--shard-count N`, `--shard-index I` (also `=` forms)"
msgstr "`--shard-count N`、`--shard-index I`（也接受 `=` 形式）"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:42
msgid "run shard `I` of `N` (default `1`, `0`)"
msgstr "运行 `N` 个分片中的第 `I` 个（默认分别为 `1`、`0`）"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:43
msgid "also fail when a selected row is unsupported or legacy"
msgstr "当所选的行不受支持或属于遗留行时也判为失败"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:44
msgid "row filter: comma-separated ids or `first..last` ranges (see `RunOptions::new`)"
msgstr "行过滤器：逗号分隔的 id 或 `first..last` 范围（参见 `RunOptions::new`）"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:45
msgid "print the usage line and return `2`"
msgstr "打印用法行并返回 `2`"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:46
msgid "`.decTest` files or directories (direct file entries ending in `.decTest`); default `testdata/decimal/smoke.decTest`"
msgstr "`.decTest` 文件或目录（目录中直接以 `.decTest` 结尾的文件条目）；默认为 `testdata/decimal/smoke.decTest`"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:48
msgid "Any other argument starting with `-` is an error `unknown option: …`. A directory contributes its direct file entries whose names end in `.decTest` (a directory without any adds no file); a named file without that suffix is the error `not a .decTest file: PATH`, and a path that does not exist is the error `path does not exist: PATH`, both with exit status 2. Files are sorted, each file is run once even if named twice, parsed in order (the first parse diagnostic of a file is printed as `source:line:1: message` and ends the run), and executed together, so row ordinals and shards span all files."
msgstr "其他任何以 `-` 开头的参数都会产生错误 `unknown option: …`。目录贡献其名称以 `.decTest` 结尾的直接文件条目（不含此类文件的目录不添加任何文件）；被指定的文件若没有该后缀，则是错误 `not a .decTest file: PATH`，不存在的路径是错误 `path does not exist: PATH`，二者的退出状态都是 2。文件经过排序，每个文件即使被指定两次也只运行一次，依次解析（文件的第一条解析诊断以 `source:line:1: message` 的形式打印，并结束本次运行），然后一并执行，因此行序号和分片跨越所有文件。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:57
msgid "Text output lists the counts (`cases`, `selected cases`, `executable cases`, `passed cases`, `failed cases`, `skipped cases`), the shard, and one `failed ID: MESSAGE` line per failing row. JSON output has the keys `totalCases`, `supportedCases` (executable rows), `diagnosticCases`, `legacyConditionCases`, `unsupportedCases` and an `execution` object with `executableCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases`, `skippedCases`, `failedIds`, `shardCount`, `shardIndex`. `totalCases` counts the rows that match `--cases` in all shards; every other counter, including the top-level `supportedCases`, `diagnosticCases`, `legacyConditionCases` and `unsupportedCases`, counts only the rows of this shard. `legacyConditionCases` is always 0 with the current frontend."
msgstr "文本输出列出各项计数（`cases`、`selected cases`、`executable cases`、`passed cases`、`failed cases`、`skipped cases`）、分片信息，并为每个失败的行输出一行 `failed ID: MESSAGE`。JSON 输出包含键 `totalCases`、`supportedCases`（可执行的行）、`diagnosticCases`、`legacyConditionCases`、`unsupportedCases`，以及一个 `execution` 对象，其中含有 `executableCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases`、`skippedCases`、`failedIds`、`shardCount`、`shardIndex`。`totalCases` 统计所有分片中与 `--cases` 匹配的行数；其他每个计数器，包括顶层的 `supportedCases`、`diagnosticCases`、`legacyConditionCases` 和 `unsupportedCases`，都只统计本分片的行。在当前前端下，`legacyConditionCases` 始终为 0。"

#: manual/api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:69
msgid "Return value: `2` for usage, file or parse errors; `1` when a row failed, or with `--strict-supported` when any legacy or unsupported row was selected; `0` otherwise. Diagnostic rows (`#` and `?` placeholders) never change the exit status, even with `--strict-supported`."
msgstr "返回值：用法、文件或解析错误时为 `2`；有行失败，或指定 `--strict-supported` 时选中了任何遗留或不支持的行，为 `1`；否则为 `0`。诊断行（`#` 和 `?` 占位符）从不改变退出状态，即使指定了 `--strict-supported` 也是如此。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "cli/itl_expr_cli API"
msgstr "cli/itl_expr_cli API"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:5
msgid "`cli/itl_expr_cli` is the command-line runner for ITF1788 `.itl` interval test files. It parses them with [`frontend/itl_expr`](../frontend/itl_expr.md), executes every case against `ball_float` and prints a JSON report. It is normally reached as `floating-conformance --backend itl …`. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/cli/itl_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/itl_expr_cli` 是 ITF1788 `.itl` 区间测试文件的命令行运行器。它用 [`frontend/itl_expr`](../frontend/itl_expr.md) 解析这些文件，针对 `ball_float` 执行每个用例，并打印 JSON 报告。通常以 `floating-conformance --backend itl …` 的方式调用它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md)和[设计页面](../../design/cli/itl_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:23
msgid "The examples use the alias `@itl_expr_cli`. `run` reads files through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the repository builds and tests the runners on the native target."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@itl_expr_cli`。`run` 通过 `moonbitlang/x/fs` 读取文件；本仓库在 native 目标上构建和测试这些运行器。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:39
msgid "also fail when any case is unsupported"
msgstr "当有任何用例不受支持时也判为失败"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:40
msgid "keep only cases of this operation; repeatable (cases of any listed operation are kept)"
msgstr "只保留该运算的用例；可重复指定（保留所列任一运算的用例）"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:41
msgid "`.itl` files, read in the given order; default `testdata/interval/smoke.itl`"
msgstr "`.itl` 文件，按给定顺序读取；默认为 `testdata/interval/smoke.itl`"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:43
msgid "Any other argument starting with `-` (including `--json`, `--help` and the shard options, which this runner does not have) is an error `unknown option: …`; `--operation` without a value prints `missing value for --operation`. Paths are files; directories are not expanded, and an unreadable path prints `cannot read ITL file: PATH`. Every file is parsed completely before the operation filter is applied, so a parse error in a statement of an unselected operation still ends the run: every diagnostic of that file is printed as `PATH: MESSAGE`."
msgstr "其他任何以 `-` 开头的参数（包括本运行器不支持的 `--json`、`--help` 和分片选项）都会产生错误 `unknown option: …`；没有值的 `--operation` 会打印 `missing value for --operation`。路径均视为文件；目录不会被展开，无法读取的路径会打印 `cannot read ITL file: PATH`。每个文件都会在应用运算过滤器之前被完整解析，因此即使解析错误出现在未选中运算的语句中，也会结束本次运行：该文件的每条诊断都以 `PATH: MESSAGE` 的形式打印。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:52
msgid "The output is always one JSON object with the keys `schemaVersion` (`1`), `runner` (`\"itl-expression-interpreter\"`), `totalCases`, `executableCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases`, `unsupportedCases`, `diagnosticCases`, `failedIds`, `failedMessages` (`ID: MESSAGE`), `unsupportedIds` and `diagnosticIds`."
msgstr "输出始终是一个 JSON 对象，包含键 `schemaVersion`（`1`）、`runner`（`\"itl-expression-interpreter\"`）、`totalCases`、`executableCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases`、`unsupportedCases`、`diagnosticCases`、`failedIds`、`failedMessages`（`ID: MESSAGE`）、`unsupportedIds` 和 `diagnosticIds`。"

#: manual/api/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:58
msgid "Return value: `2` for usage, file or parse errors; `1` when a case failed, a case was a diagnostic, or with `--strict-supported` a case was unsupported; `0` otherwise. Cases are executed with the default precision 53."
msgstr "返回值：用法、文件或解析错误时为 `2`；有用例失败、有用例属于诊断，或指定 `--strict-supported` 时有用例不受支持，为 `1`；否则为 `0`。用例以默认精度 53 执行。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "cli/mpfr_expr_cli API"
msgstr "cli/mpfr_expr_cli API"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:5
msgid "`cli/mpfr_expr_cli` is the command-line runner for MPFR reference data. It reads one file, detects its format, parses and executes it with [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md) and prints a summary. It is normally reached as `floating-conformance --backend mpfr …`. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/mpfr_expr_cli` 是 MPFR 参考数据的命令行运行器。它读取一个文件，检测其格式，用 [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md) 解析并执行，然后打印摘要。通常以 `floating-conformance --backend mpfr …` 的方式调用它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)和[设计页面](../../design/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:23
msgid "The examples use the alias `@mpfr_expr_cli`. `run` reads files through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the repository builds and tests the runners on the native target."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@mpfr_expr_cli`。`run` 通过 `moonbitlang/x/fs` 读取文件；本仓库在 native 目标上构建和测试这些运行器。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:35
msgid "`arguments[0]` is the program name and is ignored. The runner accepts `--json` and exactly one path. After `--json` is removed, any other number of arguments (none, or two or more, including shard options, which are disabled for this runner) prints `usage: mpfr-expr [--json] <MPFR sqrt, pow, or elementary corpus>`. A single remaining argument is always taken as the path, even when it starts with `-`: `--help` or a mistyped option is reported as `cannot read file: --help`. Both cases return `2`."
msgstr "`arguments[0]` 是程序名，会被忽略。该运行器接受 `--json` 和恰好一个路径。去掉 `--json` 后，若剩余参数个数为其他值（零个，或两个及以上，包括本运行器禁用的分片选项），会打印 `usage: mpfr-expr [--json] <MPFR sqrt, pow, or elementary corpus>`。剩下的单个参数总是被当作路径，即使它以 `-` 开头：`--help` 或拼错的选项会被报告为 `cannot read file: --help`。这两种情况都返回 `2`。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:44
msgid "The format is chosen from the file content:"
msgstr "格式根据文件内容选择："

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:46
msgid "Content contains"
msgstr "内容包含"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:46
msgid "Parser and executor"
msgstr "解析器与执行器"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:46
msgid "JSON `corpus`"
msgstr "JSON `corpus`"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:48
msgid "elementary matrix"
msgstr "初等函数矩阵"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:49
msgid "`input_coefficient_hex` (and not the above)"
msgstr "`input_coefficient_hex`（且不满足上一条）"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:49
msgid "integer powers"
msgstr "整数幂"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:50
msgid "neither"
msgstr "两者都不包含"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:50
msgid "square-root `data_check`"
msgstr "平方根 `data_check`"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:52
msgid "On a parse error the first diagnostic is printed as `source:line:1: message`. Text output prints a title, `cases`, `passed cases`, `failed cases` and one `failed ID: MESSAGE` line per failure. JSON output has the keys `corpus`, `totalCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases` and `failedIds`."
msgstr "出现解析错误时，第一条诊断以 `source:line:1: message` 的形式打印。文本输出打印一个标题、`cases`、`passed cases`、`failed cases`，并为每个失败输出一行 `failed ID: MESSAGE`。JSON 输出包含键 `corpus`、`totalCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases` 和 `failedIds`。"

#: manual/api/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:57
msgid "Return value: `2` for usage, file or parse errors (including an elementary `pow`, `hypot` or `atan2` row whose second operand is `-`, see [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md#parse_elementary_data)); `1` when a row failed; `0` otherwise."
msgstr "返回值：用法、文件或解析错误时为 `2`（包括第二个操作数为 `-` 的初等 `pow`、`hypot` 或 `atan2` 行，参见 [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md#parse_elementary_data)）；有行失败时为 `1`；否则为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "cli/testfloat_expr_cli API"
msgstr "cli/testfloat_expr_cli API"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:5
msgid "`cli/testfloat_expr_cli` is the command-line runner for Berkeley TestFloat vector files. It builds a `TestFloatSpec` from its options, parses one vector file with [`frontend/testfloat_expr`](../frontend/testfloat_expr.md), executes it against `bin_float` and prints a summary. It is normally reached as `floating-conformance --backend testfloat …`. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/testfloat_expr_cli` 是 Berkeley TestFloat 向量文件的命令行运行器。它根据选项构建一个 `TestFloatSpec`，用 [`frontend/testfloat_expr`](../frontend/testfloat_expr.md) 解析一个向量文件，针对 `bin_float` 执行，并打印摘要。通常以 `floating-conformance --backend testfloat …` 的方式调用它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)和[设计页面](../../design/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:24
msgid "The examples use the alias `@testfloat_expr_cli`. `run` reads files through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the repository builds and tests the runners on the native target."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@testfloat_expr_cli`。`run` 通过 `moonbitlang/x/fs` 读取文件；本仓库在 native 目标上构建和测试这些运行器。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:40
msgid "TestFloat function, for example `f64_mulAdd` (required)"
msgstr "TestFloat 函数，例如 `f64_mulAdd`（必需）"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:41
msgid "rounding mode, default `rnear_even`"
msgstr "舍入模式，默认为 `rnear_even`"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:42
msgid "`after` (default) or `before`"
msgstr "`after`（默认）或 `before`"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:43
msgid "the `-exact` variant of `roundToInt` and integer conversions"
msgstr "`roundToInt` 及整数转换的 `-exact` 变体"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:45
msgid "run shard `I` of `N`"
msgstr "运行 `N` 个分片中的第 `I` 个"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:46
msgid "exactly one vector file (required)"
msgstr "恰好一个向量文件（必需）"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:48
msgid "The names are interpreted by `TestFloatSpec::parse`. A value option given twice keeps the last value. `--help` is not an option of this runner and is reported as `unknown option: --help`. Errors such as `--function is required`, `a TestFloat vector path is required`, `only one TestFloat vector file is accepted per invocation`, `unknown option: …` or an unsupported name are printed and return `2`; so is the first parse diagnostic of the file (`source:line:1: message`)."
msgstr "这些名称由 `TestFloatSpec::parse` 解释。带值的选项给出两次时保留最后一个值。`--help` 不是本运行器的选项，会被报告为 `unknown option: --help`。诸如 `--function is required`、`a TestFloat vector path is required`、`only one TestFloat vector file is accepted per invocation`、`unknown option: …` 或不支持的名称之类的错误会被打印并返回 `2`；文件的第一条解析诊断（`source:line:1: message`）也是如此。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:56
msgid "Text output prints the function, rounding, tininess, the counts `cases`, `selected cases`, `passed cases`, `failed cases` and one `failed ID: MESSAGE` line per failure. JSON output has the keys `function`, `rounding`, `tininess`, `exact`, `totalCases`, `selectedCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases` and `failedIds`."
msgstr "文本输出打印函数、舍入、微小性（tininess）、计数 `cases`、`selected cases`、`passed cases`、`failed cases`，并为每个失败输出一行 `failed ID: MESSAGE`。JSON 输出包含键 `function`、`rounding`、`tininess`、`exact`、`totalCases`、`selectedCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases` 和 `failedIds`。"

#: manual/api/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:62
msgid "Return value: `2` for usage, specification, file or parse errors; `1` when a vector failed; `0` otherwise."
msgstr "返回值：用法、规格、文件或解析错误时为 `2`；有向量失败时为 `1`；否则为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:1
msgid "consistency API"
msgstr "consistency API"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:5
msgid "`consistency` is a white-box test package. It exports no MoonBit items; its content is a suite of about 250 deterministic tests (28 in `api_audit_wbtest.mbt` and 228 in `core_wbtest.mbt` on the current branch) that check laws *across* the packages of `floating`: that the binary, decimal, GDA and interval cores, their checked wrappers, `semantic`, and the shared `internal` helpers agree with each other and with exact `BigInt` and rational oracles. This page records the package's role and its (empty) interface; the [tutorial](../tutorial/consistency.md) shows how to run and extend it and the [design page](../design/consistency.md) explains what is checked."
msgstr "`consistency` 是一个白盒测试包。它不导出任何 MoonBit 项；其内容是一套约 250 个确定性测试（在当前分支上，`api_audit_wbtest.mbt` 中有 28 个，`core_wbtest.mbt` 中有 228 个），用于检查*跨越* `floating` 各包的规律：二进制、十进制、GDA 和区间核心，它们的 checked 包装，`semantic`，以及共享的 `internal` 辅助函数，彼此之间以及与精确的 `BigInt` 和有理数预言机之间是否一致。本页记录该包的作用及其（空的）接口；[教程](../tutorial/consistency.md)介绍如何运行和扩展它，[设计页面](../design/consistency.md)解释检查了哪些内容。"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:17
msgid "Nothing can be imported from `consistency`. Its `moon.pkg` imports the cores for white-box tests only:"
msgstr "无法从 `consistency` 导入任何内容。它的 `moon.pkg` 仅为白盒测试导入各核心："

#: manual/api/consistency.md:38
msgid "Test files"
msgstr "测试文件"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:40
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:40
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:42
msgid "audits of public behaviour that spans packages: `def` predicates, `internal` rounding and parsing helpers, error and context types, the decimal interchange facade (bit-exact encodings, canonical predicates, sign operations), checked compare of `bin_float`, generic checked traits through `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, and the `semantic` interpretation of binary, decimal and interval values"
msgstr "对跨包公开行为的审计：`def` 谓词、`internal` 的舍入与解析辅助函数、错误与上下文类型、十进制交换格式门面（逐位精确的编码、规范性谓词、符号操作）、`bin_float` 的 checked 比较、通过 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 使用的泛型 checked trait，以及二进制、十进制和区间值的 `semantic` 解释"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:43
msgid "cross-package arithmetic laws: `internal` digit and trimming helpers against `BigInt`, `bin_float` exactness on dyadics and generic trait use, `decimal` and `decimal_gda` cohort, signed-zero and NaN-payload rules (many rows taken from the official decTest suite), `ball_float` enclosure properties, checked-pipeline closure, and total constructors"
msgstr "跨包的算术规律：`internal` 的数字与截尾辅助函数对照 `BigInt` 的检验、`bin_float` 在二进有理数上的精确性及泛型 trait 用法、`decimal` 与 `decimal_gda` 的同值类（cohort）、有符号零及 NaN 载荷规则（许多行取自官方 decTest 套件）、`ball_float` 的包络性质、checked 流水线的封闭性，以及全域构造函数"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:44
msgid "helpers that build `BinFloat` values from `BigInt` for the tests above"
msgstr "为上述测试从 `BigInt` 构建 `BinFloat` 值的辅助函数"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:46
msgid "All tests are white-box (`*_wbtest.mbt`) and import every core package for `wbtest` only, so the package adds nothing to any build of the library."
msgstr "所有测试都是白盒测试（`*_wbtest.mbt`），且只在 `wbtest` 中导入各核心包，因此该包不会给库的任何构建增加内容。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1
msgid "decimal API"
msgstr "decimal API"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:5
msgid "`Luna-Flow/floating/decimal` is the IEEE 754-2019 decimal floating-point package of `floating`. A `Decimal` is an arbitrary-precision decimal value that keeps its quantum (exponent), its sign of zero and its NaN payload; a `DecimalContext` fixes precision, rounding, exponent range, clamping and tininess; every context operation returns the rounded value together with the `DecimalFlags` it raised. The package also encodes and decodes the decimal32/64/128 interchange formats in both DPD and BID, and evaluates elementary functions with certified rounding."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/floating/decimal` 是 `floating` 中的 IEEE 754-2019 十进制浮点包。`Decimal` 是任意精度的十进制值，保留其量子（quantum，即指数）、零的符号以及 NaN 的载荷；`DecimalContext` 确定精度、舍入、指数范围、钳制（clamping）与微小性（tininess）；每个上下文运算都返回舍入后的值及其引发的 `DecimalFlags`。该包还能以 DPD 和 BID 两种方式编码与解码 decimal32/64/128 交换格式，并以经过认证的舍入计算初等函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:14
msgid "The [decimal tutorial](../tutorial/decimal.md) walks through typical tasks and the [decimal design](../design/decimal.md) explains the arithmetic model, encodings, rounding and certification. The finite evidence for the IEEE claim is recorded in [decimal conformance](../conformance/decimal.md). Sticky General Decimal Arithmetic status and traps live in the separate [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) package; [`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) accumulates the flags of a pipeline of `Decimal` operations."
msgstr "[decimal 教程](../tutorial/decimal.md)介绍常见任务，[decimal 设计](../design/decimal.md)解释算术模型、编码、舍入与认证。支持 IEEE 声明的有限证据记录在 [decimal 符合性](../conformance/decimal.md)中。粘滞的 General Decimal Arithmetic 状态与陷阱（trap）位于独立的 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 包中；[`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) 则累积一串 `Decimal` 运算的标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:22
msgid "[!WARNING] Exact results of non-integral powers among the [elementary functions](#elementary-functions) do not yet meet the contracts described below. The note there links the GitHub issue that tracks them and the proposed fix."
msgstr "[!WARNING] [初等函数](#elementary-functions)中非整数次幂的精确结果尚不满足下文所述的约定。那里的说明链接到跟踪它们的 GitHub issue 以及所提出的修复。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:30
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:30
#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:18
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/decimal.md:38
msgid "The examples call the package through the alias `@decimal.`. Some of them also use `@def.` for `Luna-Flow/floating/def` (the shared `RoundingMode` and `Sign`), `@lf_arith.` for `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, `@lf_alg.` for `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` and `@bigint.` for `moonbitlang/core/bigint`; import those packages too when you copy such an example. Most examples build values with a local helper `d(s)`, which is `@decimal.Decimal::from_string(s).unwrap()`."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@decimal.` 调用该包。其中一些示例还使用 `@def.` 表示 `Luna-Flow/floating/def`（共享的 `RoundingMode` 与 `Sign`）、`@lf_arith.` 表示 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`、`@lf_alg.` 表示 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`、`@bigint.` 表示 `moonbitlang/core/bigint`；复制此类示例时也请导入这些包。大多数示例用局部辅助函数 `d(s)` 构造值，它即 `@decimal.Decimal::from_string(s).unwrap()`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:45
msgid "Notation"
msgstr "记号"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:47
msgid "Notation used below: a finite value is $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{q}$ with sign $s$, non-negative integer coefficient $c$ and exponent (quantum) $q$; $p$ is the context precision, $e_{\\max}$ and $e_{\\min}$ the context exponent limits for the *adjusted* exponent $q + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$, and $E_{\\text{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ the smallest exponent of a subnormal."
msgstr "下文记号：有限值为 $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{q}$，其中符号为 $s$，非负整数系数为 $c$，指数（量子）为 $q$；$p$ 为上下文精度，$e_{\\max}$ 与 $e_{\\min}$ 为上下文对*调整后*指数 $q + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$ 的限制，$E_{\\text{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ 为次正规数的最小指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:53
msgid "Values and representation"
msgstr "值与表示"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:57
msgid "`Decimal` is an immutable decimal floating-point value."
msgstr "`Decimal` 是不可变的十进制浮点值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:65
msgid "A `Decimal` is one of: a finite value $(-1)^s c\\,10^q$ (including $\\pm 0$), $\\pm\\infty$, or a quiet or signaling NaN with a sign and a non-negative integer payload. Every value also carries a working `precision`, used by the plain operators and by conversions that have no context argument. The fields are private; use the observers below. Two values with the same mathematical value but different exponents (for example `1.2` and `1.20`) are different members of the same *cohort*: they compare equal numerically but are distinguished by `quantum`, `same_quantum`, `compare_total`, formatting and interchange encoding."
msgstr "`Decimal` 是以下之一：有限值 $(-1)^s c\\,10^q$（包括 $\\pm 0$）、$\\pm\\infty$，或带符号与非负整数载荷的静默 NaN 或信号 NaN。每个值还带有一个工作精度 `precision`，供普通运算符以及没有上下文参数的转换使用。字段是私有的；请使用下面的观察函数。数学值相同但指数不同的两个值（例如 `1.2` 与 `1.20`）是同一*同值类（cohort）*的不同成员：它们在数值上比较相等，但可以通过 `quantum`、`same_quantum`、`compare_total`、格式化以及交换编码加以区分。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:75
msgid "The derived `Debug` implementation is promoted as `Decimal::to_repr`; see [Trait implementations](#trait-implementations)."
msgstr "派生的 `Debug` 实现被提升为 `Decimal::to_repr`；参见 [trait 实现](#trait-implementations)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:80
msgid "These observers return the stored representation of a value."
msgstr "这些观察函数返回值的存储表示。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:90
msgid "`precision` is the working precision stored in the value (at least 1). `coefficient` and `magnitude` both return the non-negative coefficient $c$; for a NaN they return the payload and for an infinity `0`. The sign is never part of the coefficient: use `is_negative`. `exponent10` and `quantum` both return the stored exponent $q$; for special values it is `0`."
msgstr "`precision` 是值中存储的工作精度（至少为 1）。`coefficient` 和 `magnitude` 都返回非负系数 $c$；对 NaN 返回载荷，对无穷返回 `0`。符号从不属于系数：请使用 `is_negative`。`exponent10` 和 `quantum` 都返回存储的指数 $q$；对特殊值为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:109
msgid "These observers report the sign of a value."
msgstr "这些观察函数报告值的符号。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:117
msgid "`sign` returns `@def.Sign::Zero` for both zeros and for every NaN, and `Negative`/`Positive` otherwise. `is_negative` and `is_signed` are the same predicate: they return the stored sign bit, so they are `true` for $-0$, for $-\\infty$ and for a negative NaN."
msgstr "`sign` 对两个零以及所有 NaN 返回 `@def.Sign::Zero`，其余情况返回 `Negative`/`Positive`。`is_negative` 与 `is_signed` 是同一个谓词：它们返回存储的符号位，因此对 $-0$、$-\\infty$ 以及负 NaN 都为 `true`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:124
msgid "`classify` returns the coarse class of a value; `class_name` returns the General Decimal Arithmetic class string under a context."
msgstr "`classify` 返回值的粗略类别；`class_name` 返回某上下文下的 General Decimal Arithmetic 类别字符串。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:132
msgid "`classify` returns `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`. `class_name` returns one of `\"sNaN\"`, `\"NaN\"`, `\"-Infinity\"`, `\"+Infinity\"`, `\"-Zero\"`, `\"+Zero\"`, `\"-Subnormal\"`, `\"+Subnormal\"`, `\"-Normal\"` or `\"+Normal\"`; the normal/subnormal split uses the context's $e_{\\min}$."
msgstr "`classify` 返回 `Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。`class_name` 返回 `\"sNaN\"`、`\"NaN\"`、`\"-Infinity\"`、`\"+Infinity\"`、`\"-Zero\"`、`\"+Zero\"`、`\"-Subnormal\"`、`\"+Subnormal\"`、`\"-Normal\"` 或 `\"+Normal\"` 之一；正规/次正规的划分使用上下文的 $e_{\\min}$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:139
msgid "These predicates test the class of a value."
msgstr "这些谓词检测值的类别。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:156
msgid "`is_qnan` and `is_snan` are the General Decimal Arithmetic spellings of `is_quiet_nan` and `is_signaling_nan`. `is_canonical` always returns `true`: a `Decimal` has no non-canonical form; non-canonical *encodings* are a property of [`DecimalInterchange`](#decimalinterchange-decimalinterchangeformat-encoding-to_hex). A value is normal under a context when it is finite, non-zero and its adjusted exponent is at least $e_{\\min}$; it is subnormal when it is finite, non-zero and its adjusted exponent is below $e_{\\min}$. Zeros, infinities and NaNs are neither."
msgstr "`is_qnan` 和 `is_snan` 是 `is_quiet_nan` 与 `is_signaling_nan` 的 General Decimal Arithmetic 写法。`is_canonical` 总是返回 `true`：`Decimal` 不存在非规范形式；非规范的*编码*是 [`DecimalInterchange`](#decimalinterchange-decimalinterchangeformat-encoding-to_hex) 的性质。在某上下文下，若值有限、非零且调整后指数至少为 $e_{\\min}$，则它是正规的；若值有限、非零且调整后指数小于 $e_{\\min}$，则它是次正规的。零、无穷与 NaN 两者都不是。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:166
msgid "These functions read and replace the payload of a NaN."
msgstr "这些函数读取并替换 NaN 的载荷。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:175
msgid "`nan_payload` and `get_payload` return the payload of a NaN and `0` for every other value. `set_payload` returns a quiet NaN with the given payload (its absolute value) and the original sign; `set_payload_signaling` returns a signaling NaN. Both return a non-NaN argument unchanged."
msgstr "`nan_payload` 和 `get_payload` 返回 NaN 的载荷，对其他所有值返回 `0`。`set_payload` 返回带给定载荷（取其绝对值）且保持原符号的静默 NaN；`set_payload_signaling` 返回信号 NaN。二者对非 NaN 参数都原样返回。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:180
msgid "Construction and conversion"
msgstr "构造与转换"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:184
msgid "`make` builds a finite value from a signed integer coefficient and an exponent, rounding it to a precision."
msgstr "`make` 由带符号的整数系数和指数构建有限值，并将其舍入到某个精度。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:191
msgid "`Decimal::make(c, q, p, mode~)` represents $c \\cdot 10^{q}$; the sign comes from `c`. Trailing zeros are removed first, the coefficient is then rounded to `p` digits with `mode` (default `ToNearestEven`) if it is longer, and trailing zeros are removed again. The result is therefore always in the *reduced* member of its cohort, and `make(0, q, p)` is $+0$ with exponent `0`. No exponent range applies."
msgstr "`Decimal::make(c, q, p, mode~)` 表示 $c \\cdot 10^{q}$；符号取自 `c`。首先去除尾随零，若系数更长，则以 `mode`（默认 `ToNearestEven`）舍入到 `p` 位，然后再次去除尾随零。因此结果总是其同值类中的*约简*成员，且 `make(0, q, p)` 是指数为 `0` 的 $+0$。不施加任何指数范围。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:200
msgid "These constructors build the special and unit values."
msgstr "这些构造函数构建特殊值与单位值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:212
msgid "The default precision is 34. `zero`, `negative_zero` and `one` have exponent `0`. `inf(sign)` is $-\\infty$ for `Negative` and $+\\infty$ otherwise. `nan` is a positive quiet NaN with payload 0; `quiet_nan` and `signaling_nan` default to payload 0 and a positive sign."
msgstr "默认精度为 34。`zero`、`negative_zero` 和 `one` 的指数为 `0`。`inf(sign)` 对 `Negative` 为 $-\\infty$，否则为 $+\\infty$。`nan` 是载荷为 0 的正静默 NaN；`quiet_nan` 和 `signaling_nan` 默认载荷为 0、符号为正。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:219
msgid "These constructors convert an integer."
msgstr "这些构造函数转换整数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:226
msgid "Both are `make(n, 0, precision)` with the default precision 34: the result is reduced (`from_int(1000)` is `1E+3`, exponent 3) and an integer with more than `precision` digits is rounded half-even."
msgstr "二者都是采用默认精度 34 的 `make(n, 0, precision)`：结果是约简的（`from_int(1000)` 为 `1E+3`，指数为 3），位数超过 `precision` 的整数按半值取偶（half-even）舍入。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:232
msgid "These constructors convert a binary floating-point number."
msgstr "这些构造函数转换二进制浮点数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:239
msgid "Every finite `Double` is a dyadic rational $m \\cdot 2^{k}$ and therefore has a finite decimal expansion $m \\cdot 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$ for $k<0$; the conversion forms that exact expansion and rounds it half-even to `precision` digits (default 34). Signed zeros and infinities are preserved; every NaN becomes a quiet NaN with payload 0 and the input's sign. `from_float` widens to `Double` first, which is exact."
msgstr "每个有限 `Double` 都是二进有理数 $m \\cdot 2^{k}$，因而当 $k<0$ 时具有有限十进制展开 $m \\cdot 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$；转换会构造这一精确展开，并按半值取偶舍入到 `precision` 位（默认 34）。带符号的零与无穷得以保留；每个 NaN 都变为载荷为 0、符号与输入相同的静默 NaN。`from_float` 先扩展为 `Double`，这一步是精确的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:248
msgid "These functions convert between `Decimal` and the binary [`BinFloat`](bin_float.md)."
msgstr "这些函数在 `Decimal` 与二进制 [`BinFloat`](bin_float.md) 之间转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:256
msgid "`from_bin_float(x, precision~)` is exact whenever the decimal expansion of `x` fits in `precision` decimal digits (default: the precision of `x`) and is otherwise rounded half-even; a binary zero keeps its sign ($-0$ becomes $-0$, as IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.2 and §6.3 require), and a NaN becomes a quiet NaN with payload 0. `to_bin_float(precision~, mode~)` rounds the exact decimal value to a `BinFloat` of `precision` bits (default: the decimal's precision field) with `mode` (default `ToNearestEven`). Most decimal fractions are not dyadic, so this direction is usually inexact; converting with `TowardNegative` and `TowardPositive` gives a binary enclosure of the decimal value. Zeros keep their sign and NaN payloads are not kept."
msgstr "只要 `x` 的十进制展开能容纳于 `precision` 位十进制数字（默认：`x` 的精度），`from_bin_float(x, precision~)` 就是精确的，否则按半值取偶舍入；二进制零保留其符号（$-0$ 变为 $-0$，这是 IEEE 754-2019 §5.4.2 与 §6.3 的要求），NaN 变为载荷为 0 的静默 NaN。`to_bin_float(precision~, mode~)` 以 `mode`（默认 `ToNearestEven`）将精确的十进制值舍入为 `precision` 位（默认：该十进制值的精度字段）的 `BinFloat`。大多数十进制小数都不是二进有理数，因此这一方向通常不精确；分别以 `TowardNegative` 和 `TowardPositive` 转换可得到该十进制值的二进制包络。零保留其符号，NaN 载荷不予保留。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:269
msgid "These functions are the canonical maps out of the naturals and the integers."
msgstr "这两个函数是从自然数和整数出发的典范映射。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:276
msgid "They return `from_bigint(n).normalized()` with precision 34. They are the `FromNat` and `FromInteger` implementations. To convert another Luna-Flow integer type, pick its representative with `Integral::normalize` first, or use `lift_to`."
msgstr "它们以精度 34 返回 `from_bigint(n).normalized()`，即 `FromNat` 与 `FromInteger` 的实现。要转换其他 Luna-Flow 整数类型，请先用 `Integral::normalize` 取其代表元，或使用 `lift_to`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:281
msgid "Parsing and formatting"
msgstr "解析与格式化"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:285
msgid "`parse` converts decimal text to a `Decimal` while keeping its quantum."
msgstr "`parse` 将十进制文本转换为 `Decimal`，同时保留其量子。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:292
msgid "The accepted syntax is an optional sign, digits with an optional decimal point, an optional exponent `E`/`e` with optional sign, or one of `Inf`, `Infinity`, `NaN` and `sNaN` (any letter case) followed for NaNs by optional decimal payload digits. If the significant digits fit `precision` (default 34) the exponent of the text is kept exactly: `\"1.2300\"` has coefficient 12300 and exponent $-4$, and `\"0.00\"` is $+0$ with exponent $-2$. A longer coefficient is rounded half-even to `precision` digits and reduced. Invalid text returns `Err(parse_error)` from `parse` and `None` from `from_string`."
msgstr "可接受的语法为：可选符号、带可选小数点的数字、带可选符号的可选指数 `E`/`e`；或者 `Inf`、`Infinity`、`NaN`、`sNaN` 之一（不区分大小写），NaN 后面还可跟可选的十进制载荷数字。若有效数字能容纳于 `precision`（默认 34），则文本中的指数被精确保留：`\"1.2300\"` 的系数为 12300、指数为 $-4$，`\"0.00\"` 是指数为 $-2$ 的 $+0$。更长的系数按半值取偶舍入到 `precision` 位并约简。无效文本使 `parse` 返回 `Err(parse_error)`，使 `from_string` 返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:301
msgid "No context exponent range is applied; the only limits are those of the representation: the stored exponent must be at least $-2^{31}$ and the adjusted exponent at most $2^{31}-1$. As IEEE 754 §5.12 requires, a valid literal beyond them still converts, with the conversion rounded once: a literal too large is a signed infinity (`\"1e3000000000\"` is `inf`), and one too small is rounded half-even to the exponent $-2^{31}$, possibly to a signed zero (`\"1e-3000000000\"` is `0E-2147483648`, `\"15e-2147483649\"` is `2E-2147483648`). Use `from_string_ctx` to get the `overflow` and `underflow` flags."
msgstr "不施加任何上下文指数范围，唯一的限制来自表示本身：存储的指数至少为 $-2^{31}$，调整指数至多为 $2^{31}-1$。按照 IEEE 754 §5.12 的要求，超出这些限制的有效字面量仍会被转换，且转换只舍入一次：过大的字面量得到带符号的无穷（`\"1e3000000000\"` 为 `inf`），过小的字面量按半值取偶舍入到指数 $-2^{31}$，可能得到带符号的零（`\"1e-3000000000\"` 为 `0E-2147483648`，`\"15e-2147483649\"` 为 `2E-2147483648`）。如需得到 `overflow` 与 `underflow` 标志，请使用 `from_string_ctx`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:313
msgid "`from_string_ctx` converts text under a context and reports conversion flags."
msgstr "`from_string_ctx` 在上下文下转换文本并报告转换标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:319
msgid "The syntax is the one of `parse`. The value is rounded to the context precision (raising `rounded`, and `inexact` when non-zero digits are discarded), checked against the exponent range (overflow, subnormal, underflow, clamping) and, when `clamp` is set, folded down. A NaN payload with more digits than the context allows (precision $-1$ digits when `clamp` is set, otherwise precision) is a syntax error. Invalid text returns a quiet NaN with only the `conversion_syntax` flag set. In a non-extended context, `Inf` and `NaN` spellings are conversion-syntax errors."
msgstr "语法与 `parse` 相同。值被舍入到上下文精度（引发 `rounded`，若丢弃了非零数字还会引发 `inexact`），按指数范围检查（上溢、次正规、下溢、钳制），并在设置了 `clamp` 时进行折叠（fold-down）。若 NaN 载荷的位数超过上下文允许的位数（设置 `clamp` 时为精度 $-1$ 位，否则为精度位），则视为语法错误。无效文本返回仅设置了 `conversion_syntax` 标志的静默 NaN。在非扩展上下文中，`Inf` 与 `NaN` 写法属于转换语法错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:343
msgid "These functions implement the General Decimal Arithmetic `to-scientific-string` and `to-engineering-string` conversions of a text operand."
msgstr "这些函数对文本操作数实现 General Decimal Arithmetic 的 `to-scientific-string` 与 `to-engineering-string` 转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:351
msgid "Both take *text*, convert it with `from_string_ctx` and format the result. Scientific form writes the coefficient with an exponent `E±n` whenever the exponent is positive or the adjusted exponent is below $-6$, and plain digits otherwise; engineering form uses an exponent that is a multiple of three. Special values are written `Infinity`, `-Infinity`, `NaN`, `sNaN`, with a payload such as `NaN7`. The flags are those of the conversion."
msgstr "二者都接受*文本*，用 `from_string_ctx` 转换后格式化结果。科学记数形式在指数为正或调整后指数小于 $-6$ 时，用指数 `E±n` 书写系数，否则写成普通数字；工程记数形式使用 3 的倍数作为指数。特殊值写作 `Infinity`、`-Infinity`、`NaN`、`sNaN`，带载荷时如 `NaN7`。标志即转换所产生的标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:358
msgid "Values without a context are formatted by `Decimal::to_string` (the `Show` implementation), which uses the same scientific rule; see [`Show` and `Debug`](#show-and-debug-decimalto_string-output-to_repr)."
msgstr "不带上下文的值由 `Decimal::to_string`（`Show` 实现）格式化，它使用同样的科学记数规则；参见 [`Show` 与 `Debug`](#show-and-debug-decimalto_string-output-to_repr)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:362
msgid "Contexts"
msgstr "上下文"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:366
msgid "A `DecimalContext` is an immutable set of arithmetic parameters."
msgstr "`DecimalContext` 是一组不可变的算术参数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:374
msgid "A context holds a precision $p$, a shared Luna-Flow `rounding` mode, a decimal rounding mode (`decimal_rounding`, the one the arithmetic uses), the adjusted-exponent limits $e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$, the `clamp` switch, the `extended` switch and a tininess rule. No operation reads ambient state: every context operation receives its context as an argument."
msgstr "上下文包含精度 $p$、共享的 Luna-Flow `rounding` 模式、十进制舍入模式（`decimal_rounding`，即算术实际使用的模式）、调整后指数的限制 $e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$、`clamp` 开关、`extended` 开关以及微小性规则。任何运算都不读取环境状态：每个上下文运算都以参数形式接收其上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:382
msgid "These constructors build a context from named parameters."
msgstr "这些构造函数由命名参数构建上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:389
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:389
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:391
msgid "coefficient digits $p$"
msgstr "系数位数 $p$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:392
msgid "shared rounding mode"
msgstr "共享舍入模式"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:393
msgid "from `rounding`"
msgstr "由 `rounding` 推出"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:393
msgid "rounding mode used by the arithmetic"
msgstr "算术所用的舍入模式"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:394
msgid "adjusted-exponent range"
msgstr "调整后指数的范围"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:395
msgid "fold large exponents down to $e_{\\max}-p+1$"
msgstr "将大指数折叠到 $e_{\\max}-p+1$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:396
msgid "IEEE/extended arithmetic; `false` selects the GDA subset"
msgstr "IEEE/扩展算术；`false` 选择 GDA 子集"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:397
msgid "when a result counts as tiny"
msgstr "结果何时算作微小"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:399
msgid "When `decimal_rounding` is omitted it is `DecimalRoundingMode::from_arithmetic(rounding)`; pass it explicitly to use `HalfUp`, `HalfDown` or `ZeroFiveUp`. `new` aborts when `precision <= 0` or `e_min > e_max`; `try_new` returns `Err(domain_error)` instead."
msgstr "省略 `decimal_rounding` 时，它取 `DecimalRoundingMode::from_arithmetic(rounding)`；若要使用 `HalfUp`、`HalfDown` 或 `ZeroFiveUp`，请显式传入。`new` 在 `precision <= 0` 或 `e_min > e_max` 时中止；`try_new` 则返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:404
msgid "[!IMPORTANT] The default exponent range is wider than the range the elementary functions accept ($|e| \\le 999\\,999$ and $p \\le 999\\,999$). With `DecimalContext::new()` they return NaN with `invalid_context`; use a format preset or explicit `e_min`/`e_max`."
msgstr "[!IMPORTANT] 默认指数范围比初等函数所接受的范围（$|e| \\le 999\\,999$ 且 $p \\le 999\\,999$）更宽。在 `DecimalContext::new()` 下，它们返回带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN；请使用格式预设或显式的 `e_min`/`e_max`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:410
msgid "The subset mode (`extended=false`) reproduces the classic decNumber subset: operands longer than $p$ digits are rounded first (raising `lost_digits`), zero results lose their sign and exponent, and special-value text is rejected. It exists for General Decimal Arithmetic test compatibility."
msgstr "子集模式（`extended=false`）重现经典的 decNumber 子集：长于 $p$ 位的操作数先被舍入（引发 `lost_digits`），零结果丢失其符号和指数，特殊值文本被拒绝。它是为了兼容 General Decimal Arithmetic 测试而存在的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:417
msgid "These constructors return the interchange-format contexts and an exact working context."
msgstr "这些构造函数返回交换格式的上下文以及一个精确的工作上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:427
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:442
msgid "clamp"
msgstr "clamp"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:429
#: manual/api/decimal.md:430
#: manual/api/decimal.md:431
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:445
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:446
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:447
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:440
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:433
msgid "All three use `ToNearestEven` (`HalfEven`), extended arithmetic and after-rounding tininess. `exact()` has precision 0, which means \"unlimited\": results keep every digit and no rounding by precision happens; its exponent range is the default one. It is the only way to obtain precision 0."
msgstr "三者都使用 `ToNearestEven`（`HalfEven`）、扩展算术以及舍入后微小性判定。`exact()` 的精度为 0，表示“无限”：结果保留所有数字，不按精度进行舍入；其指数范围为默认范围。这是获得精度 0 的唯一途径。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:440
msgid "`from_arithmetic_context` converts the shared Luna-Flow context."
msgstr "`from_arithmetic_context` 转换共享的 Luna-Flow 上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:446
msgid "Precision, rounding and clamp are copied; a missing `e_min` or `e_max` becomes $\\mp 999\\,999\\,999$. The result is extended and uses after-rounding tininess. The contextual and checked trait implementations use this conversion."
msgstr "精度、舍入与 clamp 被复制；缺失的 `e_min` 或 `e_max` 变为 $\\mp 999\\,999\\,999$。结果为扩展上下文，并采用舍入后微小性判定。contextual 与 checked 的 trait 实现都使用这一转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:452
msgid "These accessors return the fields of a context."
msgstr "这些访问函数返回上下文的字段。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:465
msgid "`precision` is 0 only for `exact()`."
msgstr "只有 `exact()` 的 `precision` 为 0。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:469
msgid "These functions derive a context or describe its standard."
msgstr "这些函数派生上下文或描述其所遵循的标准。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:478
msgid "`with_rounding` replaces both rounding fields (the decimal mode becomes `from_arithmetic(rounding)`). `with_tininess` replaces the tininess rule. `ieee754` returns the context unchanged: every context already follows the IEEE 754-2019 semantics of this package. `is754version2019` always returns `true`."
msgstr "`with_rounding` 替换两个舍入字段（十进制模式变为 `from_arithmetic(rounding)`）。`with_tininess` 替换微小性规则。`ieee754` 原样返回上下文：每个上下文都已遵循本包的 IEEE 754-2019 语义。`is754version2019` 总是返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:484
msgid "Rounding modes and tininess"
msgstr "舍入模式与微小性"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:488
msgid "`DecimalRoundingMode` lists the eight decimal rounding directions."
msgstr "`DecimalRoundingMode` 列出八种十进制舍入方向。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:503
msgid "Let $x>0$ lie strictly between two adjacent representable coefficients $c$ and $c+1$ (in units of the last place). `Down` returns $c$, `Up` $c+1$; `Ceiling` and `Floor` round toward $+\\infty$ and $-\\infty$ (so they depend on the sign); `HalfEven`, `HalfUp` and `HalfDown` return the nearer of the two and break an exact tie toward the even coefficient, away from zero, and toward zero respectively; `ZeroFiveUp` returns $c+1$ when the last digit of $c$ is 0 or 5 and $c$ otherwise. IEEE 754 calls `HalfEven` roundTiesToEven, `HalfUp` roundTiesToAway, `Down` roundTowardZero, `Ceiling` roundTowardPositive and `Floor` roundTowardNegative."
msgstr "设 $x>0$ 严格位于两个相邻可表示系数 $c$ 与 $c+1$ 之间（以末位单位计）。`Down` 返回 $c$，`Up` 返回 $c+1$；`Ceiling` 和 `Floor` 分别向 $+\\infty$ 和 $-\\infty$ 舍入（因此依赖于符号）；`HalfEven`、`HalfUp` 和 `HalfDown` 返回两者中较近的一个，恰好处于中点时分别取偶系数、远离零、趋向零；`ZeroFiveUp` 在 $c$ 的末位数字为 0 或 5 时返回 $c+1$，否则返回 $c$。IEEE 754 将 `HalfEven` 称为 roundTiesToEven，`HalfUp` 称为 roundTiesToAway，`Down` 称为 roundTowardZero，`Ceiling` 称为 roundTowardPositive，`Floor` 称为 roundTowardNegative。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:515
msgid "These functions map between decimal modes and the shared `@arithmetic.RoundingMode`."
msgstr "这些函数在十进制模式与共享的 `@arithmetic.RoundingMode` 之间映射。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:531
msgid "`to_arithmetic` returns `None` for `HalfUp`, `HalfDown` and `ZeroFiveUp`, which the shared enum does not have."
msgstr "`to_arithmetic` 对 `HalfUp`、`HalfDown` 和 `ZeroFiveUp` 返回 `None`，因为共享枚举中没有这些模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:536
msgid "`DecimalTininessDetection` chooses when a non-zero result is tiny."
msgstr "`DecimalTininessDetection` 决定非零结果何时为微小。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:545
msgid "`BeforeRounding` calls a result tiny when the adjusted exponent of the exact result is below $e_{\\min}$; `AfterRounding` uses the result rounded to $p$ digits with unbounded exponent. A tiny result raises `subnormal`, and also `underflow` when it is inexact."
msgstr "`BeforeRounding` 在精确结果的调整后指数小于 $e_{\\min}$ 时判定结果微小；`AfterRounding` 则使用在无界指数下舍入到 $p$ 位后的结果进行判定。微小结果会引发 `subnormal`，若同时不精确还会引发 `underflow`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:550
msgid "The two rules differ only for results just below $10^{e_{\\min}}$. With $p = 3$, $e_{\\min} = 0$ and `HalfEven`, `plus_ctx` of `0.9951` returns the subnormal-grid rounding `1.00`, but its rounding to three digits is $0.995 < 1$, so under `AfterRounding` it is tiny and raises `underflow`, `subnormal` and `inexact`; `0.99951` rounds to $1.00$ at three digits and raises only `inexact`."
msgstr "两条规则仅对略低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 的结果有所不同。取 $p = 3$、$e_{\\min} = 0$ 和 `HalfEven`，`0.9951` 的 `plus_ctx` 返回次正规网格上的舍入结果 `1.00`，但它舍入到三位数字是 $0.995 < 1$，因此在 `AfterRounding` 下它是微小的，并引发 `underflow`、`subnormal` 和 `inexact`；`0.99951` 在三位数字下舍入为 $1.00$，只引发 `inexact`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:557
msgid "Status flags"
msgstr "状态标志"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:561
msgid "`DecimalFlags` records the conditions raised by one operation."
msgstr "`DecimalFlags` 记录一次运算所引发的条件。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:581
#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:32
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:581
msgid "Raised when"
msgstr "引发条件"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:583
msgid "the result differs from the exact result"
msgstr "结果与精确结果不同"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:584
msgid "digits were discarded, even if they were all zero"
msgstr "丢弃了数字，即使它们全为零"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:585
msgid "a subset-mode operand longer than $p$ lost non-zero digits"
msgstr "子集模式下长于 $p$ 位的操作数丢失了非零数字"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:586
msgid "the operation is invalid (signaling NaN, $\\infty-\\infty$, $0\\times\\infty$, bad quantize, domain error)"
msgstr "运算无效（信号 NaN、$\\infty-\\infty$、$0\\times\\infty$、无效的 quantize、定义域错误）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:587
msgid "an exact infinite result from finite operands ($x/0$, $\\ln 0$, $\\log_2 0$, $\\log_{10} 0$, $\\operatorname{logb} 0$, $\\operatorname{log1p}(-1)$)"
msgstr "有限操作数产生的精确无穷结果（$x/0$、$\\ln 0$、$\\log_2 0$、$\\log_{10} 0$、$\\operatorname{logb} 0$、$\\operatorname{log1p}(-1)$）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:588
msgid "the rounded result's adjusted exponent exceeds $e_{\\max}$"
msgstr "舍入后结果的调整后指数超过 $e_{\\max}$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:589
msgid "the result is tiny and inexact"
msgstr "结果微小且不精确"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:590
msgid "the result is tiny"
msgstr "结果微小"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:591
msgid "the exponent was changed to fit (fold-down or zero exponent clamp)"
msgstr "为适配而改变了指数（折叠或零指数钳制）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:592
msgid "text could not be parsed"
msgstr "文本无法解析"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:593
msgid "an integer quotient needs more than $p$ digits"
msgstr "整数商需要多于 $p$ 位数字"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:594
msgid "$0/0$ (raised together with `invalid_operation`)"
msgstr "$0/0$（与 `invalid_operation` 一同引发）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:595
msgid "the context is outside the range an elementary function supports"
msgstr "上下文超出初等函数所支持的范围"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:597
msgid "Fields are public and read-only; the flags never accumulate implicitly."
msgstr "字段是公开且只读的；标志从不隐式累积。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:601
msgid "These functions create, merge and query flag sets."
msgstr "这些函数创建、合并与查询标志集合。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:610
msgid "`new` has every flag clear. `combine` is the field-wise OR, so it is associative, commutative and idempotent with `new()` as identity. `contains` reads the flag named by a `DecimalSignal`. `has_error` is"
msgstr "`new` 的所有标志均为清除状态。`combine` 是逐字段的 OR，因此满足结合律、交换律和幂等律，并以 `new()` 为单位元。`contains` 读取由 `DecimalSignal` 指定的标志。`has_error` 为"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:620
msgid "the conditions for which IEEE 754 or General Decimal Arithmetic delivers no meaningful number (`conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible` and `division_undefined` are conditions of the Invalid operation signal). A failed `from_string_ctx`, which raises only `conversion_syntax`, therefore counts as an error. `has_error` does not include `overflow`, `underflow`, `inexact`, `rounded`, `subnormal`, `clamped` or `lost_digits`."
msgstr "即 IEEE 754 或 General Decimal Arithmetic 无法给出有意义数值的那些条件（`conversion_syntax`、`division_impossible` 和 `division_undefined` 是 Invalid operation 信号下的条件）。因此，只引发 `conversion_syntax` 的失败的 `from_string_ctx` 也算作错误。`has_error` 不包括 `overflow`、`underflow`、`inexact`、`rounded`、`subnormal`、`clamped` 或 `lost_digits`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:645
msgid "`DecimalSignal` names one flag of `DecimalFlags`."
msgstr "`DecimalSignal` 指定 `DecimalFlags` 中的一个标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:665
msgid "Each constructor corresponds to the field of the same name."
msgstr "每个构造子对应同名的字段。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:667
msgid "Plain operations without a context"
msgstr "无上下文的普通运算"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:669
msgid "The operators and the functions in this group take no context and return no flags. They are convenient for exact work and for generic code over the Luna-Flow algebra traits; use the [context arithmetic](#context-arithmetic) whenever rounding, the exponent range or flags matter."
msgstr "本组中的运算符和函数既不接受上下文，也不返回标志。它们便于进行精确计算，以及编写基于 Luna-Flow 代数 trait 的泛型代码；只要舍入、指数范围或标志有影响，就请使用[上下文算术](#context-arithmetic)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:676
msgid "These functions are the arithmetic operators `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` and unary `-`."
msgstr "这些函数即算术运算符 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 以及一元 `-`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:686
msgid "The result precision is $\\max(p_a, p_b)$ of the operand precision fields."
msgstr "结果精度为操作数精度字段的 $\\max(p_a, p_b)$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:688
msgid "`add`/`sub` compute the exact sum, round it half-even to that precision and return the reduced cohort member: `1.20 + 3.40` is `4.6`."
msgstr "`add`/`sub` 计算精确和，按半值取偶舍入到该精度，并返回同值类中的约简成员：`1.20 + 3.40` 为 `4.6`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:690
msgid "`mul` returns the exact product with exponent $q_a+q_b$ and is **not rounded**: `1.25 * 2.50` is `3.1250`, and the coefficient may be longer than the precision field."
msgstr "`mul` 返回指数为 $q_a+q_b$ 的精确乘积，且**不进行舍入**：`1.25 * 2.50` 为 `3.1250`，系数可能比精度字段更长。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:693
msgid "`div` rounds the quotient half-even to that precision and reduces it. The quotient is computed with a few guard digits and rounded with `ZeroFiveUp` first, which makes the second rounding equal to one correct rounding: `15 / 83294` at five digits is `0.00018009`."
msgstr "`div` 将商按半值取偶舍入到该精度并约简。商先以若干保护位计算，并首先用 `ZeroFiveUp` 舍入，这使第二次舍入等同于一次正确舍入：`15 / 83294` 在五位精度下为 `0.00018009`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:697
msgid "`neg` flips the sign bit of every value, including zeros and NaNs."
msgstr "`neg` 翻转每个值的符号位，包括零和 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:699
msgid "Special values: a NaN operand gives a quiet NaN with the first NaN's sign and payload; $\\infty-\\infty$, $0\\times\\infty$, $0/0$ and $\\infty/\\infty$ give a positive NaN; $x/0$ gives a signed infinity; finite$/\\infty$ gives $+0$. No context exponent range is applied, only the limits of the representation described under [`parse`](#decimalparse-from_string): a result whose adjusted exponent would exceed $2^{31}-1$ is a signed infinity, and a result that needs an exponent below $-2^{31}$ is rounded half-even to that exponent, possibly to a signed zero, as IEEE 754 §7.4 and §7.5 prescribe for that range (`1E+1500000000 * 1E+1500000000` is `inf`, `123E-2147483640 * 1E-10` is `1E-2147483648`). Exact cancellation gives $+0$; the sum of two negative zeros is $-0$."
msgstr "特殊值：NaN 操作数产生一个静默 NaN，其符号和载荷取自第一个 NaN；$\\infty-\\infty$、$0\\times\\infty$、$0/0$ 和 $\\infty/\\infty$ 产生正 NaN；$x/0$ 产生带符号的无穷；有限值$/\\infty$ 产生 $+0$。不施加任何上下文指数范围，只适用 [`parse`](#decimalparse-from_string) 下所述的表示限制：调整指数将超过 $2^{31}-1$ 的结果为带符号的无穷，需要低于 $-2^{31}$ 的指数的结果按半值取偶舍入到该指数，可能得到带符号的零，这正是 IEEE 754 §7.4 与 §7.5 对该范围的规定（`1E+1500000000 * 1E+1500000000` 为 `inf`，`123E-2147483640 * 1E-10` 为 `1E-2147483648`）。精确抵消得到 $+0$；两个负零之和为 $-0$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:726
msgid "These functions change only the sign bit."
msgstr "这些函数只改变符号位。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:736
msgid "They never round, never raise flags and keep exponent, payload and NaN kind. `abs` and `copy_abs` clear the sign, `copy_negate` flips it, `copy_sign` copies the sign bit of the second operand and `copy` returns its argument."
msgstr "它们从不舍入，从不引发标志，并保持指数、载荷与 NaN 种类不变。`abs` 和 `copy_abs` 清除符号，`copy_negate` 翻转符号，`copy_sign` 复制第二个操作数的符号位，`copy` 返回其参数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:742
msgid "These functions change the cohort member or the precision field."
msgstr "这些函数改变同值类成员或精度字段。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:750
msgid "`normalized` returns the reduced member of the cohort (all trailing zeros removed, zero with exponent 0), rounding half-even to the value's own precision if the coefficient is longer. `trim` removes the trailing zeros of the fractional part: with a negative exponent it stops at exponent 0 (`12.300` becomes `12.3`, `1200` stays `1200`), with a positive exponent it removes all of them (`1.20E+3` becomes `1.2E+3`); a zero gets exponent 0. `with_precision(p, mode)` rounds a finite value to `p` digits with `mode`, reduces it and stores `p` as the precision field; special values only get the new precision field. All three are flag-free."
msgstr "`normalized` 返回同值类中的约简成员（去除所有尾随零，零的指数为 0），若系数更长则按半值取偶舍入到该值自身的精度。`trim` 去除小数部分的尾随零：指数为负时在指数 0 处停止（`12.300` 变为 `12.3`，`1200` 保持 `1200`），指数为正时全部去除（`1.20E+3` 变为 `1.2E+3`）；零的指数变为 0。`with_precision(p, mode)` 以 `mode` 将有限值舍入到 `p` 位，约简后将 `p` 存为精度字段；特殊值只获得新的精度字段。三者都不产生标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:762
msgid "These functions divide and take a square root, reporting domain errors as `Result`."
msgstr "这些函数执行除法和求平方根，并以 `Result` 报告定义域错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:770
msgid "`div_checked(a, b)` is `div_ctx` under `DecimalContext::new(precision=max(p_a, p_b))`; it returns `Err(division_by_zero)` for $x/0$ and `Err(domain_error)` for an invalid division. `sqrt` is `sqrt_ctx` under `DecimalContext::new(precision=p)` and returns `Err(domain_error)` for a negative non-zero operand. Both are correctly rounded half-even."
msgstr "`div_checked(a, b)` 即 `DecimalContext::new(precision=max(p_a, p_b))` 下的 `div_ctx`；对 $x/0$ 返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，对无效除法返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`sqrt` 即 `DecimalContext::new(precision=p)` 下的 `sqrt_ctx`，对负的非零操作数返回 `Err(domain_error)`。二者都按半值取偶正确舍入。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:776
msgid "Context arithmetic"
msgstr "上下文算术"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:778
msgid "Every function in this group takes a `DecimalContext` and returns `(result, flags)`. The result is the exact result rounded once to the context precision with the context's decimal rounding mode, then checked against the exponent range: overflow gives the rounding-mode-dependent result of the [design page](../design/decimal.md#overflow), a result whose exact magnitude is below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ is rounded directly to the subnormal grid $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ (a normal result is rounded only to $p$ digits, even when its exact exponent is below $E_{\\text{tiny}}$), and with `clamp` large exponents are folded down to $e_{\\max}-p+1$. When the exact result fits, the exponent is the *preferred exponent* of the operation, so cohorts carry information. NaN operands propagate as a quiet NaN with the first NaN's sign and payload (the payload is cut to its low $p$ digits, even with `clamp`, where `from_string_ctx` and the interchange encodings allow only $p-1$); any signaling NaN operand raises `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "本组中的每个函数都接受一个 `DecimalContext` 并返回 `(result, flags)`。结果是将精确结果以上下文的十进制舍入模式一次性舍入到上下文精度，再按指数范围检查：上溢得到依赖于舍入模式的结果（见[设计页面](../design/decimal.md#overflow)），精确绝对值小于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 的结果被直接舍入到次正规网格 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$（正规结果只舍入到 $p$ 位，即使其精确指数低于 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$），并且在设置 `clamp` 时，大指数被折叠到 $e_{\\max}-p+1$。当精确结果可以容纳时，指数取该运算的*首选指数*，因此同值类携带了信息。NaN 操作数以静默 NaN 传播，其符号和载荷取自第一个 NaN（载荷截取为其低 $p$ 位，即使在设置 `clamp` 时也是如此，而 `from_string_ctx` 和交换编码只允许 $p-1$ 位）；任何信号 NaN 操作数都会引发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:793
msgid "Near the underflow threshold the single rounding matters. In decimal32, the exact product `3.000001E-45 * 1.500001E-45` is $4.5000045000015\\cdot 10^{-90}$, a normal number whose exact exponent is below $E_{\\text{tiny}} = -101$; it is rounded once to seven digits, `4.500005E-90`. The quotient `1 / 1.9999999999998E+101` is $5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$, which is subnormal; its guarded quotient is rounded once to the grid $10^{-101}$, giving `1E-101` with `inexact`, `underflow` and `subnormal`."
msgstr "在下溢阈值附近，单次舍入至关重要。在 decimal32 中，精确乘积 `3.000001E-45 * 1.500001E-45` 为 $4.5000045000015\\cdot 10^{-90}$，这是一个精确指数低于 $E_{\\text{tiny}} = -101$ 的正规数；它被一次舍入到七位数字，得到 `4.500005E-90`。商 `1 / 1.9999999999998E+101` 为 $5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$，是次正规的；其带保护位的商被一次舍入到网格 $10^{-101}$，得到 `1E-101`，并带 `inexact`、`underflow` 和 `subnormal`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:803
msgid "These functions are the correctly rounded arithmetic operations."
msgstr "这些函数是正确舍入的算术运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:812
msgid "Preferred exponents: $\\min(q_a,q_b)$ for addition and subtraction, $q_a+q_b$ for multiplication, $q_a-q_b$ for division. An exact quotient is returned in the member closest to the preferred exponent; an inexact quotient has $p$ digits, except a subnormal one, which ends at $E_{\\text{tiny}}$. A zero sum is $+0$ except under `Floor` (where it is $-0$ if either operand is negative) or when both operands are $-0$."
msgstr "首选指数：加法与减法为 $\\min(q_a,q_b)$，乘法为 $q_a+q_b$，除法为 $q_a-q_b$。精确的商以最接近首选指数的成员返回；不精确的商有 $p$ 位数字，但次正规的商除外，它截止于 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$。零和为 $+0$，除非在 `Floor` 下（此时只要有一个操作数为负即为 $-0$）或两个操作数均为 $-0$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:819
msgid "Special cases: $\\infty-\\infty$ and $0\\times\\infty$, $\\infty/\\infty$ give NaN with `invalid_operation`; $0/0$ gives NaN with `invalid_operation` and `division_undefined`; $x/0$ for finite non-zero $x$ gives a signed infinity with `division_by_zero`; finite$/\\infty$ gives a signed zero with exponent $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ and `clamped`."
msgstr "特殊情形：$\\infty-\\infty$、$0\\times\\infty$ 与 $\\infty/\\infty$ 产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN；$0/0$ 产生带 `invalid_operation` 与 `division_undefined` 的 NaN；对有限非零的 $x$，$x/0$ 产生带 `division_by_zero` 的带符号无穷；有限值$/\\infty$ 产生指数为 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ 的带符号零，并引发 `clamped`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:825
msgid "When one operand of `add_ctx` or `sub_ctx` lies entirely below every rounding boundary of the sum, an extended context does not align it digit by digit: it is replaced by a sticky unit of the same sign just below those boundaries, and the sum is rounded once (see the [design](../design/decimal.md#addition-with-a-far-smaller-addend)). With precision 7, `1598617.000000000001 - 0.000000000002` is `1598616` under `Down`, and `6.0000005E-73 + 1E-101` is `6.000001E-73` under `HalfEven`."
msgstr "当 `add_ctx` 或 `sub_ctx` 的一个操作数完全低于和的每个舍入边界时，扩展上下文不会逐位对齐它：它被替换为一个恰好低于这些边界、符号相同的粘滞单位，然后对和只舍入一次（参见[设计](../design/decimal.md#addition-with-a-far-smaller-addend)）。在精度 7 下，`1598617.000000000001 - 0.000000000002` 在 `Down` 下为 `1598616`，`6.0000005E-73 + 1E-101` 在 `HalfEven` 下为 `6.000001E-73`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:866
msgid "`fma_ctx` computes $x \\cdot y + z$ with a single rounding."
msgstr "`fma_ctx` 以单次舍入计算 $x \\cdot y + z$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:872
msgid "The product is formed exactly and added to `z` exactly; only the sum is rounded. $0\\times\\infty + z$ is invalid for a number or infinite `z`; when `z` is a quiet NaN the result is that NaN **without** `invalid_operation` (IEEE 754-2019 §7.2 leaves this case to the implementation). $\\infty \\cdot y + (-\\infty)$ with opposite signs is invalid. In a non-extended context the operation returns NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "乘积被精确地构造并精确地加到 `z` 上；只对和进行舍入。当 `z` 为数值或无穷时，$0\\times\\infty + z$ 是无效的；当 `z` 是静默 NaN 时，结果即该 NaN，**不**引发 `invalid_operation`（IEEE 754-2019 §7.2 将这种情形留给实现决定）。符号相反的 $\\infty \\cdot y + (-\\infty)$ 是无效的。在非扩展上下文中，该运算返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:881
msgid "`sqrt_ctx` returns the correctly rounded square root."
msgstr "`sqrt_ctx` 返回正确舍入的平方根。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:887
msgid "The preferred exponent is $\\lfloor q/2 \\rfloor$. An exact root is returned in the member closest to it (`sqrt(0.0400)` is `0.20`); an inexact root has $p$ digits and raises `inexact` and `rounded`. $\\sqrt{-0} = -0$; a negative non-zero operand or $-\\infty$ gives NaN with `invalid_operation`; $\\sqrt{+\\infty}=+\\infty$."
msgstr "首选指数为 $\\lfloor q/2 \\rfloor$。精确的根以最接近它的成员返回（`sqrt(0.0400)` 为 `0.20`）；不精确的根有 $p$ 位数字，并引发 `inexact` 和 `rounded`。$\\sqrt{-0} = -0$；负的非零操作数或 $-\\infty$ 产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN；$\\sqrt{+\\infty}=+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:895
msgid "These functions round one operand to the context."
msgstr "这些函数将单个操作数舍入到上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:904
msgid "`apply_ctx` rounds a value to the context (precision, exponent range, clamping) and quiets a NaN, keeping the sign of zero. `plus_ctx` is $0 + x$: like `apply_ctx`, but a zero becomes $+0$. `minus_ctx` is $0 - x$ and `abs_ctx` is $|x|$ rounded to the context; signaling NaNs raise `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "`apply_ctx` 将值舍入到上下文（精度、指数范围、钳制），并将 NaN 静默化，保留零的符号。`plus_ctx` 即 $0 + x$：与 `apply_ctx` 类似，但零变为 $+0$。`minus_ctx` 即 $0 - x$，`abs_ctx` 即舍入到上下文的 $|x|$；信号 NaN 会引发 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:912
msgid "These functions compute integer quotients and remainders."
msgstr "这些函数计算整数商和余数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:921
msgid "`divide_integer(x, y)` is $\\operatorname{trunc}(x/y)$ with exponent 0. When the integer quotient needs more than $p$ digits, the result is NaN with `division_impossible` and `invalid_operation`. `remainder(x, y)` is $x - y\\cdot\\operatorname{trunc}(x/y)$ with the sign of $x$ (General Decimal Arithmetic *remainder*). `remainder_near(x, y)` is $x - y\\cdot n$ where $n$ is $x/y$ rounded to the nearest integer, ties to even (IEEE 754 *remainder*); `remainder_ctx` is the same operation. The remainder is exact when it fits, with preferred exponent $\\min(q_x, q_y)$, and its sign is that of $x$ when it is zero. $x \\operatorname{rem} 0$ and $\\infty \\operatorname{rem} y$ are invalid ($0 \\operatorname{rem} 0$ also raises `division_undefined`); $x \\operatorname{rem} \\infty = x$."
msgstr "`divide_integer(x, y)` 为 $\\operatorname{trunc}(x/y)$，指数为 0。当整数商需要多于 $p$ 位数字时，结果为带 `division_impossible` 和 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。`remainder(x, y)` 为 $x - y\\cdot\\operatorname{trunc}(x/y)$，符号与 $x$ 相同（General Decimal Arithmetic 的 *remainder*）。`remainder_near(x, y)` 为 $x - y\\cdot n$，其中 $n$ 是将 $x/y$ 就近舍入（偶数优先）得到的整数（IEEE 754 的 *remainder*）；`remainder_ctx` 是同一运算。余数在可容纳时是精确的，首选指数为 $\\min(q_x, q_y)$；余数为零时其符号与 $x$ 相同。$x \\operatorname{rem} 0$ 与 $\\infty \\operatorname{rem} y$ 是无效的（$0 \\operatorname{rem} 0$ 还会引发 `division_undefined`）；$x \\operatorname{rem} \\infty = x$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:945
msgid "Quantum and exponent operations"
msgstr "量子与指数运算"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:949
msgid "`quantize` rounds a value to the exponent of another value."
msgstr "`quantize` 将值舍入到另一个值的指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:955
msgid "`x.quantize(y, ctx)` returns the value of `x` with exponent $q_y$, rounding with the context's mode when digits are dropped (raising `rounded`, and `inexact` if they were non-zero). The result is NaN with `invalid_operation` when the target exponent is outside $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$, when the resulting coefficient needs more than $p$ digits, when its adjusted exponent exceeds $e_{\\max}$, or when exactly one operand is infinite. Two infinities give the infinity of `x`. The quantum never silently changes to another value of the cohort range: if the result cannot have exponent $q_y$ the operation fails. The one exception is `clamp`: a target exponent in $(e_{\\max}-p+1,\\ e_{\\max}]$ is accepted and the result is then folded down to exponent $e_{\\max}-p+1$ with `clamped`, like every other result (`1E+384` quantized to `1E+384` in decimal64 is `1.000000000000000E+384`)."
msgstr "`x.quantize(y, ctx)` 返回指数为 $q_y$ 的 `x` 的值，丢弃数字时以上下文的模式舍入（引发 `rounded`，若丢弃的数字非零还会引发 `inexact`）。当目标指数超出 $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$、结果系数需要多于 $p$ 位数字、其调整后指数超过 $e_{\\max}$，或恰有一个操作数为无穷时，结果为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。两个无穷产生 `x` 的无穷。量子从不悄然变为同值类范围内的另一个值：若结果无法具有指数 $q_y$，运算即失败。唯一的例外是 `clamp`：位于 $(e_{\\max}-p+1,\\ e_{\\max}]$ 的目标指数会被接受，随后结果像其他所有结果一样被折叠到指数 $e_{\\max}-p+1$ 并带 `clamped`（在 decimal64 中，将 `1E+384` 量化到 `1E+384` 得到 `1.000000000000000E+384`）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:985
msgid "`rescale` sets the exponent to an integer operand."
msgstr "`rescale` 将指数设为一个整数操作数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:991
msgid "`x.rescale(n, ctx)` is `quantize` with target exponent $n$, where $n$ must be a finite integer; any other second operand gives NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "`x.rescale(n, ctx)` 即目标指数为 $n$ 的 `quantize`，其中 $n$ 必须是有限整数；任何其他第二操作数都产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:997
#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:378
msgid "`same_quantum` tests whether two values have the same exponent."
msgstr "`same_quantum` 检测两个值是否具有相同的指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1003
msgid "Two finite values have the same quantum when their exponents are equal; two infinities, and two NaNs, always have the same quantum; any other pair does not. It never raises flags."
msgstr "两个有限值在指数相等时具有相同的量子；两个无穷、两个 NaN 总是具有相同的量子；其他任何组合都不具有。它从不引发标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1009
msgid "These functions round a value to the context and remove trailing zeros."
msgstr "这些函数将值舍入到上下文并去除尾随零。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1016
msgid "`reduce_ctx` applies the context, then removes trailing zeros while the exponent stays at most $e_{\\max}$ (with `clamp`, at most $e_{\\max}-p+1$). A zero becomes a zero with exponent 0 (keeping its sign in an extended context). `normalize_ctx` is the same operation under its older General Decimal Arithmetic name."
msgstr "`reduce_ctx` 先应用上下文，然后在指数不超过 $e_{\\max}$（设置 `clamp` 时不超过 $e_{\\max}-p+1$）的前提下去除尾随零。零变为指数为 0 的零（在扩展上下文中保留其符号）。`normalize_ctx` 是同一运算在 General Decimal Arithmetic 中的旧名称。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1024
msgid "These functions round to an integer."
msgstr "这些函数舍入到整数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1031
msgid "A finite value with exponent $\\ge 0$ is already an integer and is returned unchanged, even when it is longer than $p$ digits (a `clamp` context still folds its exponent down). A value with negative exponent is quantized to exponent 0 with the context's rounding mode, at a working precision of $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$, so the integral part is never rounded to $p$ digits: at precision 3, `12345.6` gives `12346`. `to_integral_exact` reports `rounded`/`inexact` when digits are dropped; `to_integral_value` returns the same value with those two flags cleared. In a subset context the operand is first rounded to $p$ digits, with `lost_digits`. Infinities are returned unchanged; NaNs are quieted."
msgstr "指数 $\\ge 0$ 的有限值本身已是整数，按原样返回，即使它长于 $p$ 位（`clamp` 上下文仍会把它的指数向下折叠）。指数为负的值以上下文的舍入模式、以 $\\max(p, \\text{其位数})$ 的工作精度量化到指数 0，因此整数部分从不被舍入到 $p$ 位：精度为 3 时，`12345.6` 得到 `12346`。丢弃数字时 `to_integral_exact` 报告 `rounded`/`inexact`；`to_integral_value` 返回相同的值，但清除这两个标志。在子集上下文中，操作数先被舍入到 $p$ 位并报告 `lost_digits`。无穷原样返回；NaN 被静默化。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1042
msgid "IEEE 754 §5.9 defines roundToIntegral for an operand in the context's format (at most $p$ digits), and for such an operand these are its results. An operand longer than $p$ digits is not a value of the format, so §5.9 does not cover it and the result is implementation-defined. The behaviour described above for such operands (a longer integer unchanged, a longer fraction quantized at $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$ digits) is the package's chosen, GDA-style behaviour: General Decimal Arithmetic rounds to an integral value at the operand's own precision."
msgstr "IEEE 754 §5.9 为上下文格式内（至多 $p$ 位）的操作数定义 roundToIntegral，对这类操作数，上述结果就是它的结果。长于 $p$ 位的操作数不是该格式的值，§5.9 不涵盖它，其结果由实现定义。上文对这类操作数描述的行为（更长的整数原样返回，更长的小数以 $\\max(p, \\text{其位数})$ 位量化）是本包选定的 GDA 风格行为：通用十进制算术（General Decimal Arithmetic）以操作数自身的精度舍入为整数值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1053
msgid "These functions scale by a power of ten and extract the adjusted exponent."
msgstr "这些函数按 10 的幂进行缩放，并提取调整后指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1060
msgid "`x.scaleb_ctx(n, ctx)` returns $x \\cdot 10^{n}$ by adding $n$ to the exponent; $n$ must be a finite integer with exponent 0 and $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max}+p)$, otherwise the result is NaN with `invalid_operation`. The scaled value is then rounded once like every other context result: a coefficient longer than $p$ digits is rounded to $p$ digits (`12345678901234567890` scaled by 0 in decimal64 is `1.234567890123457E+19` with `inexact`), a subnormal result is rounded to $E_{\\text{tiny}}$, overflow gives the rounding-mode-dependent result with `overflow`, `inexact` and `rounded` (in decimal64 with `TowardZero`, `9E+384` scaled by 1 is `9.999999999999999E+384`), and `clamp` folds large exponents down. A zero keeps its sign and has its exponent clamped into the range with `clamped`: `0` scaled by 700 in decimal64 is `0E+369`."
msgstr "`x.scaleb_ctx(n, ctx)` 通过将 $n$ 加到指数上返回 $x \\cdot 10^{n}$；$n$ 必须是指数为 0 且满足 $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max}+p)$ 的有限整数，否则结果为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。缩放后的值随后像其他所有上下文结果一样只舍入一次：长于 $p$ 位的系数被舍入到 $p$ 位（在 decimal64 中，`12345678901234567890` 缩放 0 得到带 `inexact` 的 `1.234567890123457E+19`），次正规结果被舍入到 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$，上溢得到依赖于舍入模式的结果并带 `overflow`、`inexact` 和 `rounded`（在 decimal64 中使用 `TowardZero` 时，`9E+384` 缩放 1 得到 `9.999999999999999E+384`），并且 `clamp` 会把大指数折叠下来。零保留其符号，其指数被钳制到范围内并带 `clamped`：在 decimal64 中，`0` 缩放 700 得到 `0E+369`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1088
msgid "`logb_ctx(x)` returns the adjusted exponent $\\lfloor\\log_{10}|x|\\rfloor$ as an integer `Decimal`; $\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm 0) = -\\infty$ with `division_by_zero` and $\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$."
msgstr "`logb_ctx(x)` 以整数 `Decimal` 的形式返回调整后指数 $\\lfloor\\log_{10}|x|\\rfloor$；$\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm 0) = -\\infty$ 并引发 `division_by_zero`，$\\operatorname{logb}(\\pm\\infty) = +\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1092
msgid "Adjacent values"
msgstr "相邻值"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1096
msgid "These functions return the neighbouring representable values."
msgstr "这些函数返回相邻的可表示值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1104
msgid "`next_plus` is the smallest representable value greater than `x` in the context and `next_minus` the largest smaller one, including subnormals down to $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ and the largest finite value $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$; `next_plus(-∞)` is the most negative finite value. They raise no flags for finite results. `next_toward(x, y)` moves `x` one step toward `y`; when $x = y$ it returns `x` with the sign of `y` for zeros. A step of `next_toward` that ends in an infinity raises `overflow`, `inexact` and `rounded`; one that ends subnormal or zero raises `underflow`, `subnormal`, `inexact` and `rounded`."
msgstr "`next_plus` 是上下文中大于 `x` 的最小可表示值，`next_minus` 是比它小的最大可表示值，范围包括低至 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ 的次正规数以及最大有限值 $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$；`next_plus(-∞)` 是最小（最负）的有限值。对有限结果，它们不引发任何标志。`next_toward(x, y)` 将 `x` 朝 `y` 移动一步；当 $x = y$ 时返回 `x`，对零则取 `y` 的符号。`next_toward` 的一步若落到无穷，则引发 `overflow`、`inexact` 和 `rounded`；若落到次正规数或零，则引发 `underflow`、`subnormal`、`inexact` 和 `rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1128
msgid "`compare` is the numeric three-way comparison used by `Compare`, `==` and the comparison operators."
msgstr "`compare` 是 `Compare`、`==` 及比较运算符所使用的数值三路比较。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1135
msgid "`compare` returns $-1$, 0 or 1 by numeric value, with $-0 = +0$ and all members of a cohort equal. NaN has no numeric order, so that `Compare` stays a total preorder (sorting never aborts) every NaN compares equal to every other NaN and greater than every non-NaN. `equal` (`==`) agrees with `compare`: NaN `==` NaN is `true`. This is *not* IEEE equality; use [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked), `compare_ctx` or the NaN predicates when NaN must be unordered. The operator methods are listed under [trait implementations](#eq-and-compare-decimalequal-not_equal-op_lt-op_le-op_gt-op_ge)."
msgstr "`compare` 按数值返回 $-1$、0 或 1，其中 $-0 = +0$，同值类的所有成员相等。NaN 没有数值顺序，为使 `Compare` 保持全预序（排序永不中止），每个 NaN 与其他任何 NaN 比较相等，且大于所有非 NaN。`equal`（`==`）与 `compare` 一致：NaN `==` NaN 为 `true`。这*不是* IEEE 相等；当 NaN 必须无序时，请使用 [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked)、`compare_ctx` 或 NaN 谓词。运算符方法列在 [trait 实现](#eq-and-compare-decimalequal-not_equal-op_lt-op_le-op_gt-op_ge)下。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1159
msgid "`compare_checked` is the IEEE numeric comparison with NaN as an error."
msgstr "`compare_checked` 是将 NaN 视为错误的 IEEE 数值比较。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1165
msgid "It returns `Ok(compare(x, y))` when neither operand is a NaN and `Err(unordered_comparison)` otherwise. It is the `CompareChecked` implementation."
msgstr "当两个操作数都不是 NaN 时，它返回 `Ok(compare(x, y))`，否则返回 `Err(unordered_comparison)`。它是 `CompareChecked` 的实现。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1171
msgid "These functions are the General Decimal Arithmetic comparisons with a decimal result."
msgstr "这些函数是结果为十进制值的 General Decimal Arithmetic 比较。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1179
msgid "They return the `Decimal` $-1$, 0 or 1, or a quiet NaN when an operand is a NaN. `compare_ctx` raises `invalid_operation` only for a signaling NaN; `compare_signal_ctx` raises it for every NaN (IEEE *signaling* comparison)."
msgstr "它们返回 `Decimal` 值 $-1$、0 或 1；当某个操作数为 NaN 时返回静默 NaN。`compare_ctx` 仅对信号 NaN 引发 `invalid_operation`；`compare_signal_ctx` 对所有 NaN 都引发（IEEE *signaling* 比较）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1185
msgid "These functions implement the IEEE 754 `totalOrder` predicate as a three-way comparison."
msgstr "这些函数以三路比较的形式实现 IEEE 754 的 `totalOrder` 谓词。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1195
msgid "`compare_total` orders every representation:"
msgstr "`compare_total` 对所有表示进行排序："

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1202
msgid "Equal finite values are ordered by exponent: for positive values the smaller exponent comes first ($1.00 < 1.0$), for negative values the larger. NaNs of the same sign and kind are ordered by payload (reversed for negative NaNs). It returns 0 only for identical representations. `compare_total_magnitude` compares the absolute values. The `_ctx` forms first prepare the operands for the context (which only matters in subset mode) and return the flags of that step."
msgstr "相等的有限值按指数排序：对正值，较小指数在前（$1.00 < 1.0$），对负值则较大指数在前。符号与种类相同的 NaN 按载荷排序（负 NaN 则逆序）。仅当表示完全相同时才返回 0。`compare_total_magnitude` 比较绝对值。`_ctx` 形式先为上下文准备操作数（仅在子集模式下有影响），并返回该步骤的标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1212
msgid "These functions select by numeric order without a context."
msgstr "这些函数在无上下文的情况下按数值顺序进行选择。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1221
msgid "`min` and `max` return the other operand when exactly one is a quiet NaN, a quiet NaN when both are NaNs or either is signaling, and the receiver on ties. `clamp` returns `min` below the range, `max` above it, and the value (including a NaN) otherwise; it aborts when a bound is NaN or `min > max`. `clamp_checked` returns `Err(domain_error)` in those cases."
msgstr "当恰有一个操作数是静默 NaN 时，`min` 和 `max` 返回另一个操作数；当两者都是 NaN 或任一为信号 NaN 时，返回静默 NaN；相等时返回接收者。`clamp` 在低于范围时返回 `min`，高于范围时返回 `max`，否则返回该值（包括 NaN）；当某个边界为 NaN 或 `min > max` 时中止。`clamp_checked` 在这些情形下返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1229
msgid "These functions are the General Decimal Arithmetic `min`, `max`, `min-magnitude` and `max-magnitude` operations."
msgstr "这些函数是 General Decimal Arithmetic 的 `min`、`max`、`min-magnitude` 和 `max-magnitude` 运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1239
msgid "A quiet NaN loses to a number; two NaNs give the first quieted; a signaling NaN gives a quiet NaN with `invalid_operation`. Numerically equal operands are separated by `compare_total` (so `min_ctx(1.0, 1.00)` is `1.00` and `min_ctx(-0, 0)` is `-0`). The selected value is rounded to the context."
msgstr "静默 NaN 输给数值；两个 NaN 时返回静默化后的第一个；信号 NaN 产生带 `invalid_operation` 的静默 NaN。数值相等的操作数由 `compare_total` 区分（因此 `min_ctx(1.0, 1.00)` 为 `1.00`，`min_ctx(-0, 0)` 为 `-0`）。所选的值被舍入到上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1246
msgid "These twelve functions are the IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 minimum and maximum operations."
msgstr "这十二个函数是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.6 中的最小值与最大值运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1264
msgid "`minimum_ctx` and `maximum_ctx` propagate NaN: any NaN operand gives a quiet NaN. The `_number_` variants return the number when exactly one operand is a NaN. In both, a signaling NaN raises `invalid_operation`. The magnitude variants compare $|x|$ and $|y|$ and fall back to the signed order on equal magnitudes. Ties are broken by `compare_total`, so $-0 < +0$. The `_mag_` spellings are aliases of the `_magnitude_` ones. The selected value is rounded to the context."
msgstr "`minimum_ctx` 和 `maximum_ctx` 传播 NaN：任何 NaN 操作数都产生静默 NaN。`_number_` 变体在恰有一个操作数为 NaN 时返回数值。在这两种情形下，信号 NaN 都会引发 `invalid_operation`。按大小比较的变体比较 $|x|$ 与 $|y|$，大小相等时退回到带符号的顺序。相等时由 `compare_total` 决定，因此 $-0 < +0$。`_mag_` 写法是 `_magnitude_` 写法的别名。所选的值被舍入到上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1272
msgid "Digit-wise operations"
msgstr "逐位运算"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1276
msgid "These functions apply Boolean operations digit by digit to *logical operands*."
msgstr "这些函数对*逻辑操作数*逐位应用布尔运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1286
msgid "A logical operand is a finite, non-negative value with exponent 0 whose coefficient digits are all 0 or 1, such as `1101`. The operation works on the low $p$ digits and returns a logical operand; any other operand gives NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "逻辑操作数是指数为 0、系数各位均为 0 或 1 的有限非负值，例如 `1101`。运算作用于低 $p$ 位并返回一个逻辑操作数；任何其他操作数都产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1293
msgid "These functions shift or rotate the coefficient digits."
msgstr "这些函数对系数数字进行移位或循环移位。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1300
msgid "The coefficient is viewed as $p$ digits. A positive count $n$ moves digits toward the most significant end, a negative one toward the least significant end; `shift_ctx` fills with zeros and drops digits that leave the window, `rotate_ctx` wraps them around. The exponent and sign are kept. The count must be an integer with exponent 0 and $|n| \\le p$; otherwise the result is NaN with `invalid_operation`. Infinities are returned unchanged."
msgstr "系数被视为 $p$ 位数字。正的计数 $n$ 将数字向最高有效端移动，负的计数则向最低有效端移动；`shift_ctx` 用零填充并丢弃移出窗口的数字，`rotate_ctx` 则将它们循环移回。指数与符号保持不变。计数必须是指数为 0 且 $|n| \\le p$ 的整数；否则结果为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。无穷原样返回。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1309
msgid "Every elementary function exists in two forms. `f_ctx(x, ctx)` returns `(result, flags)`. `try_f_ctx(x, ctx)` returns the same pair in `Ok`, or `Err` with an `ArithmeticError` whose `certification_failure_detail()` names the operation, the target precision and the exhausted refinement budget when the result could not be certified. When certification fails, `f_ctx` returns NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "每个初等函数都有两种形式。`f_ctx(x, ctx)` 返回 `(result, flags)`。`try_f_ctx(x, ctx)` 在 `Ok` 中返回同样的二元组；当结果无法认证时返回 `Err`，其中的 `ArithmeticError` 的 `certification_failure_detail()` 给出运算名称、目标精度以及已耗尽的细化预算。认证失败时，`f_ctx` 返回带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1316
msgid "Transcendental results are **certified**: the implementation evaluates a guaranteed enclosure of $f(x)$ in [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) and accepts it only when both endpoints round to the same `Decimal` with the same flags (see the [design](../design/decimal.md#certified-elementary-functions)). Because rounding is monotone, an accepted result is the rounding of $f(x)$ in every `DecimalRoundingMode`. A list of exact cases (such as $\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$, $e^0 = 1$, $\\sin 0 = 0$, $\\operatorname{cospi}(1) = -1$, $\\operatorname{tanpi}(0.25) = 1$, $\\operatorname{acos}(1) = 0$, $x^{0.5}$, exact roots such as `rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` $= 0.2$, exact norms such as `hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` $= 0.5$) is decided before the enclosure loop and returned without `inexact`, and an exact binary result such as `power_ctx(4, 1.5)` $= 8$ is returned exactly by the enclosure itself. Integer powers are not certified: [`power_ctx`](#decimalpower_ctx-pown_ctx-rootn_ctx-hypot_ctx-try_power_ctx-try_pown_ctx-try_rootn_ctx-try_hypot_ctx) rounds them once, in an extended context, from the exact power or from refined directed bounds."
msgstr "超越函数的结果是**经过认证**的：实现会在 [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) 中计算 $f(x)$ 的一个有保证的包络，仅当两个端点以相同标志舍入到同一个 `Decimal` 时才接受它（参见[设计](../design/decimal.md#certified-elementary-functions)）。由于舍入是单调的，被接受的结果在每种 `DecimalRoundingMode` 下都是 $f(x)$ 的舍入。一系列精确情形（例如 $\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$、$e^0 = 1$、$\\sin 0 = 0$、$\\operatorname{cospi}(1) = -1$、$\\operatorname{tanpi}(0.25) = 1$、$\\operatorname{acos}(1) = 0$、$x^{0.5}$、精确的根如 `rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` $= 0.2$、精确的范数如 `hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` $= 0.5$）会在包络循环之前判定，并以不带 `inexact` 的形式返回；而像 `power_ctx(4, 1.5)` $= 8$ 这样的精确二进制结果则由包络本身精确返回。整数次幂不经过认证：[`power_ctx`](#decimalpower_ctx-pown_ctx-rootn_ctx-hypot_ctx-try_power_ctx-try_pown_ctx-try_rootn_ctx-try_hypot_ctx) 在扩展上下文中，从精确幂或细化后的定向界出发，对其只舍入一次。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1332
msgid "[!NOTE] **Exact non-integral powers.** A power whose exact value is a representable decimal but not a binary fraction is decided in decimal before the loop, so in decimal64 `power_ctx(0.0016, 0.25)` is `0.2`, `power_ctx(32, 0.2)` is `2` and `power_ctx(0.04, 1.5)` is `0.008`, all without `inexact` and in every rounding mode. The exponent is reduced to $p/q$ in lowest terms — a decimal exponent is $c \\cdot 10^{-k}$, so $q$ keeps only the twos and fives the coefficient cannot cancel — and the power is exact exactly when $x$ itself is a perfect $q$-th power. The root is taken first and then raised to $p$, so the test never handles a number longer than the result. It finds every exact result of at most `precision + 1` digits, the only ones that sit on a rounding boundary; a longer exact value lies inside its rounding cell and the enclosure rounds it like any other."
msgstr "[!NOTE] **精确的非整数次幂。** 精确值是可表示的十进制数但不是二进分数的幂，会在循环之前在十进制中判定，因此在 decimal64 下 `power_ctx(0.0016, 0.25)` 为 `0.2`、`power_ctx(32, 0.2)` 为 `2`、`power_ctx(0.04, 1.5)` 为 `0.008`，全都不带 `inexact`，且在每种舍入模式下都如此。指数被约化为最简形式 $p/q$——十进制指数为 $c \\cdot 10^{-k}$，因此 $q$ 只保留系数无法约掉的 2 和 5——而该幂精确的充要条件是 $x$ 本身为完全 $q$ 次幂。代码先开根，再把根升到 $p$ 次，因此检验处理的数从不比结果更长。它能找出所有至多 `precision + 1` 位的精确结果，而只有这些结果会落在舍入边界上；更长的精确值位于其舍入单元内部，包络会像对待其他值一样舍入它。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1346
msgid "All of them except `power_ctx`/`pown_ctx` with an integral exponent or the exponent $0.5$ return NaN with `invalid_context` when $p > 999\\,999$, $e_{\\max} > 999\\,999$ or $e_{\\min} < -999\\,999$, or when a finite operand has more than 999,999 digits or an adjusted exponent beyond about $\\pm 10^6$. Integral powers and $x^{0.5}$ work in any context up to $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$, so `power_ctx(2, 3)` is `8` under `DecimalContext::new()` while `power_ctx(2, 1.5)` and `exp2_ctx(2)` are NaN with `invalid_context`."
msgstr "除带整数指数或指数为 $0.5$ 的 `power_ctx`/`pown_ctx` 外，当 $p > 999\\,999$、$e_{\\max} > 999\\,999$ 或 $e_{\\min} < -999\\,999$，或者某个有限操作数超过 999,999 位数字、或其调整后指数超出约 $\\pm 10^6$ 时，它们都返回带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN。整数次幂和 $x^{0.5}$ 在指数范围直到 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$ 的任何上下文中都可用，因此在 `DecimalContext::new()` 下 `power_ctx(2, 3)` 为 `8`，而 `power_ctx(2, 1.5)` 和 `exp2_ctx(2)` 是带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1356
msgid "These functions are the General Decimal Arithmetic exponential and logarithms."
msgstr "这些函数是 General Decimal Arithmetic 的指数函数与对数函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1368
msgid "$e^{\\pm 0} = 1$, $e^{+\\infty}=+\\infty$, $e^{-\\infty} = +0$. $\\ln$ and $\\log_{10}$ of $\\pm 0$ are $-\\infty$ with `division_by_zero` in an extended context, as IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 requires and as `log2_ctx`, `log1p_ctx` and `logb_ctx` do (General Decimal Arithmetic, which [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) follows, raises no condition here; a subset context makes a zero operand invalid); of $+\\infty$ are $+\\infty$, of a negative value or $-\\infty$ are NaN with `invalid_operation`; $\\ln 1 = 0$, and $\\log_{10}$ of a power of ten is the exact integer exponent. Arguments so large or small that $e^x$ certainly overflows or underflows are decided without evaluation."
msgstr "$e^{\\pm 0} = 1$，$e^{+\\infty}=+\\infty$，$e^{-\\infty} = +0$。在扩展上下文中，$\\pm 0$ 的 $\\ln$ 和 $\\log_{10}$ 为 $-\\infty$ 并引发 `division_by_zero`，这是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 的要求，与 `log2_ctx`、`log1p_ctx` 和 `logb_ctx` 的行为一致（[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 所遵循的 General Decimal Arithmetic 在此不引发任何条件；子集上下文则使零操作数无效）；$+\\infty$ 的为 $+\\infty$，负值或 $-\\infty$ 的为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN；$\\ln 1 = 0$，10 的幂的 $\\log_{10}$ 为精确的整数指数。对于大到或小到 $e^x$ 必然上溢或下溢的参数，无需求值即可判定。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1381
msgid "These functions compute powers, roots and the Euclidean norm."
msgstr "这些函数计算幂、方根和欧几里得范数。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1394
msgid ""
"`power_ctx(x, y)` is $x^y$ with the General Decimal Arithmetic special cases: an integral exponent gives the exact power when it fits in $p$ digits and otherwise, in an extended context, the correctly rounded power (in decimal32, `power_ctx(3.339434, 3)` is `37.24077`; the exact cube is $37.240765000\\ldots$); $x^{0.5}$ is `sqrt_ctx`; a positive base with a non-integer exponent is certified; a negative base with a non-integer exponent is invalid; $0^0$ is invalid in an extended context; $0^{-n}$ is $\\pm\\infty$. A context that is not extended keeps the General Decimal Arithmetic square-and-multiply with $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 2$ working digits, whose error is below one unit in the last place. `pown_ctx(x, n)` is `power_ctx` with the integer `n` converted exactly, so $(-1)^{12345679}$ is $-1$ at any precision. `rootn_ctx(x, n)` is $x^{1/n}$ for integer $n \\n"
"e 0$; an even root of a negative value and $n=0$ are invalid, and $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n<0)$ is an infinity with `division_by_zero`; an exactly representable root is returned exactly (`rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` is `0.2` with no flag). `hypot_ctx(x, y)` is $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$; it is $+\\infty$ if either operand is infinite, even if the other is a quiet NaN, and an exactly representable norm, or $|x|$ when $y$ is zero, is returned exactly (`hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` is `0.5`)."
msgstr ""
"`power_ctx(x, y)` 即 $x^y$，并采用 General Decimal Arithmetic 的特殊情形：整数指数在可容纳于 $p$ 位时得到精确幂，否则在扩展上下文中得到正确舍入的幂（在 decimal32 中，`power_ctx(3.339434, 3)` 为 `37.24077`；精确的立方为 $37.240765000\\ldots$）；$x^{0.5}$ 即 `sqrt_ctx`；正底数配非整数指数会经过认证；负底数配非整数指数是无效的；在扩展上下文中 $0^0$ 是无效的；$0^{-n}$ 为 $\\pm\\infty$。非扩展的上下文保留 General Decimal Arithmetic 的平方-乘算法，使用 $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 2$ 位工作精度，其误差小于末位的一个单位。`pown_ctx(x, n)` 即把整数 `n` 精确转换后的 `power_ctx`，因此 $(-1)^{12345679}$ 在任何精度下都是 $-1$。`rootn_ctx(x, n)` 对整数 $n \\n"
"e 0$ 为 $x^{1/n}$；负值的偶次方根以及 $n=0$ 是无效的，$\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n<0)$ 为带 `division_by_zero` 的无穷；可精确表示的根被精确返回（`rootn_ctx(0.008, 3)` 为 `0.2`，不带标志）。`hypot_ctx(x, y)` 即 $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}$；只要任一操作数为无穷，结果就是 $+\\infty$，即使另一个是静默 NaN；可精确表示的范数，或 $y$ 为零时的 $|x|$，被精确返回（`hypot_ctx(0.3, 0.4)` 为 `0.5`）。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1416
msgid "These functions are the IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 exponentials and logarithms in bases 2 and 10 and near zero. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 中以 2 和 10 为底以及在零附近的指数函数与对数函数。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1434
msgid "These functions are the trigonometric functions of $x$ and of $\\pi x$. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是 $x$ 和 $\\pi x$ 的三角函数。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1454
msgid "These functions are the inverse trigonometric functions; `atan2(y, x)` is the angle of the point $(x, y)$. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是反三角函数；`atan2(y, x)` 是点 $(x, y)$ 的辐角。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1470
msgid "These functions are the hyperbolic functions and their inverses. Each has the `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` shape described at the start of this section."
msgstr "这些函数是双曲函数及其反函数。每个函数都具有本节开头所述的 `f_ctx`/`try_f_ctx` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1488
msgid "Domain and special values of the functions in these four groups:"
msgstr "这四组函数的定义域与特殊值："

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1490
