#: manual/api/decimal.md:1492
msgid "integer argument (via `power_ctx`), $\\pm 0 \\mapsto 1$, $-\\infty \\mapsto 0$, $+\\infty \\mapsto +\\infty$"
msgstr "整数参数（通过 `power_ctx`），$\\pm 0 \\mapsto 1$，$-\\infty \\mapsto 0$，$+\\infty \\mapsto +\\infty$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1494
msgid "$1 \\mapsto 0$, exact binary powers ($0.125 \\mapsto -3$), $+\\infty \\mapsto +\\infty$"
msgstr "$1 \\mapsto 0$，精确的 2 的幂（$0.125 \\mapsto -3$），$+\\infty \\mapsto +\\infty$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1497
msgid "`tanpi` at odd half-integers"
msgstr "`tanpi` 在奇数的一半处"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1497
msgid "integers, half-integers, `tanpi` at odd quarter-integers ($\\pm 1$)"
msgstr "整数、半整数，以及 `tanpi` 在四分之一的奇数倍处（$\\pm 1$）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1499
msgid "$\\pm 0$; $\\pm\\infty \\mapsto \\pm\\pi/2$ (certified)"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$；$\\pm\\infty \\mapsto \\pm\\pi/2$（经过认证）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1500
msgid "$\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, x) = \\pm 0$ for $x = +0$ or $x > 0$, and $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, +\\infty) = \\pm 0$ for finite $y$; any other zero or infinite operand gives $\\pi$, $\\pi/2$, $\\pi/4$ or $3\\pi/4$ with the sign of $y$ (certified)"
msgstr "当 $x = +0$ 或 $x > 0$ 时 $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, x) = \\pm 0$，对有限的 $y$ 有 $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, +\\infty) = \\pm 0$；其他任何零或无穷操作数都得到符号同 $y$ 的 $\\pi$、$\\pi/2$、$\\pi/4$ 或 $3\\pi/4$（经过认证）"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1501
msgid "$\\pm0\\mapsto\\pm0$; $\\sinh$, $\\operatorname{asinh}$ keep $\\pm\\infty$; $\\tanh(\\pm\\infty)=\\pm 1$"
msgstr "$\\pm0\\mapsto\\pm0$；$\\sinh$、$\\operatorname{asinh}$ 保持 $\\pm\\infty$；$\\tanh(\\pm\\infty)=\\pm 1$"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1506
msgid "These special values follow IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1: in decimal64, `atan2_ctx(-0, -1)` is `-3.141592653589793`, `atan2_ctx(+∞, -∞)` is `2.356194490192345` and `atan2_ctx(-1, +∞)` is `-0`."
msgstr "这些特殊值遵循 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1：在 decimal64 中，`atan2_ctx(-0, -1)` 为 `-3.141592653589793`，`atan2_ctx(+∞, -∞)` 为 `2.356194490192345`，`atan2_ctx(-1, +∞)` 为 `-0`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1551
msgid "Interchange formats"
msgstr "交换格式"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1555
msgid "`DecimalInterchangeFormat` names an IEEE 754 decimal interchange format."
msgstr "`DecimalInterchangeFormat` 指定一种 IEEE 754 十进制交换格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1566
msgid "`context` returns `DecimalContext::decimal32()`, `decimal64()` or `decimal128()`."
msgstr "`context` 返回 `DecimalContext::decimal32()`、`decimal64()` 或 `decimal128()`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1571
msgid "`DecimalInterchangeEncoding` selects how the coefficient is stored in the bits."
msgstr "`DecimalInterchangeEncoding` 选择系数在比特中的存储方式。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1581
msgid "`DPD` stores three decimal digits per 10-bit declet (densely packed decimal); `BID` stores the coefficient as a binary integer. Functions without an encoding argument use `DPD`."
msgstr "`DPD` 每个 10 位 declet 存储三个十进制数字（densely packed decimal，密集压缩十进制）；`BID` 将系数存储为二进制整数。没有编码参数的函数使用 `DPD`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1587
msgid "These functions encode a value as interchange bits written in hexadecimal."
msgstr "这些函数将值编码为以十六进制书写的交换比特。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1594
msgid "A finite value is first rounded with `apply_ctx` under the format context (its flags are returned), then encoded with its exponent, so the cohort is kept when it fits. The text is `#` followed by 8, 16 or 32 upper-case hex digits. Infinities are encoded with a zero trailing field. A NaN keeps its sign and kind, and its payload is stored as an integer, independent of the value's precision field (IEEE 754-2019 §3.5.2): a payload below $10^{p-1}$ is kept, and a longer one keeps its low $p-1$ digits, in DPD and BID alike. `NaN7` encodes to decimal64 as `#7C00000000000007` in both encodings."
msgstr "有限值先在格式上下文下用 `apply_ctx` 舍入（返回其标志），再连同其指数一起编码，因此在可容纳时会保留同值类成员。文本为 `#` 后跟 8、16 或 32 个大写十六进制数字。无穷以全零的尾随字段编码。NaN 保留其符号和种类，其载荷作为整数存储，与值的精度字段无关（IEEE 754-2019 §3.5.2）：小于 $10^{p-1}$ 的载荷被保留，更长的载荷保留其低 $p-1$ 位，DPD 与 BID 皆然。`NaN7` 在两种编码下都编码为 decimal64 的 `#7C00000000000007`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1605
msgid "These functions decode interchange hex text."
msgstr "这些函数解码交换十六进制文本。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1612
msgid "The text may have surrounding ASCII whitespace and a leading `#`; it must have exactly the format's number of hex digits, in either case, or the result is `None`. Decoding is exact and keeps the exponent, the sign of zero, the NaN kind and payload. Non-canonical encodings decode to the value IEEE 754 assigns them: a non-canonical DPD declet to its digits, a BID coefficient $\\ge 10^{p}$ to zero, an out-of-range BID NaN payload to 0; the unused exponent bits of infinities and NaNs are ignored. The result has the format's precision."
msgstr "文本两侧可以有 ASCII 空白，并可带前导 `#`；它必须恰好具有该格式规定数量的十六进制数字（大小写均可），否则结果为 `None`。解码是精确的，并保留指数、零的符号、NaN 种类和载荷。非规范编码被解码为 IEEE 754 为其指定的值：非规范的 DPD declet 解码为其数字，满足 $\\ge 10^{p}$ 的 BID 系数解码为零，超出范围的 BID NaN 载荷解码为 0；无穷与 NaN 中未使用的指数位被忽略。结果具有该格式的精度。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1640
msgid "`DecimalInterchange` holds the raw bits of one interchange value together with its format and encoding."
msgstr "`DecimalInterchange` 保存一个交换值的原始比特及其格式和编码。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1652
msgid "Use it when bits must be inspected or kept exactly, including non-canonical encodings that a `Decimal` cannot represent. `format` and `encoding` return the format and encoding the bits belong to; `to_hex` writes `#` and the full-width upper-case hex digits."
msgstr "当需要检查或精确保留比特时（包括 `Decimal` 无法表示的非规范编码），请使用它。`format` 和 `encoding` 返回这些比特所属的格式和编码；`to_hex` 写出 `#` 以及全宽的大写十六进制数字。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1659
msgid "These functions build an interchange value from text or from a `Decimal`."
msgstr "这些函数由文本或 `Decimal` 构建交换值。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1668
msgid "`from_hex` stores the bits unchanged (text rules as in `from_interchange_hex`). `from_decimal` encodes like `to_interchange_hex` and returns the same flags. The forms without an encoding use `DPD`."
msgstr "`from_hex` 原样存储比特（文本规则同 `from_interchange_hex`）。`from_decimal` 的编码方式与 `to_interchange_hex` 相同，并返回相同的标志。不带编码参数的形式使用 `DPD`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1674
msgid "These functions decode the stored bits."
msgstr "这些函数解码所存储的比特。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1681
msgid "Decoding is exact. `to_decimal_ctx` additionally raises `subnormal` when the decoded value is subnormal in the format; no other flag is possible."
msgstr "解码是精确的。若解码值在该格式中为次正规数，`to_decimal_ctx` 还会引发 `subnormal`；不可能出现其他标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1686
msgid "These functions canonicalize the stored bits."
msgstr "这些函数将所存储的比特规范化。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1693
msgid "`canonical` decodes and re-encodes in the same format and encoding: every non-canonical declet, out-of-range BID coefficient, and unused bit of an infinity or NaN is replaced by its canonical form. It is idempotent. `is_canonical` tests whether the bits are already canonical."
msgstr "`canonical` 以相同的格式和编码进行解码并重新编码：每个非规范的 declet、超出范围的 BID 系数以及无穷或 NaN 中未使用的比特都被替换为其规范形式。它是幂等的。`is_canonical` 检测比特是否已经是规范的。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1700
msgid "These functions change only the sign bit of the stored bits."
msgstr "这些函数只改变所存储比特中的符号位。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1709
msgid "All other bits, canonical or not, are kept. `copy_sign` aborts unless both operands have the same format and encoding."
msgstr "其他所有比特（无论是否规范）都被保留。除非两个操作数具有相同的格式和编码，否则 `copy_sign` 会中止。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1714
msgid "`Zero`, `One`, `Ring` and the operator traits"
msgstr "`Zero`、`One`、`Ring` 与运算符 trait"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1716
msgid "`Decimal` implements the Luna-Flow algebra traits through the plain operators."
msgstr "`Decimal` 通过普通运算符实现 Luna-Flow 代数 trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1738
msgid "`Zero::zero()` and `One::one()` are `Decimal::zero()` and `Decimal::one()`. The ring laws hold exactly for `+`, `-` and `*` as long as no sum is rounded (sums whose exact coefficient fits the operand precision, and every product, since `*` is exact); a rounded sum is only approximately associative. `from_natural` and `from_integer` are documented under [construction](#decimalfrom_natural-from_integer)."
msgstr "`Zero::zero()` 和 `One::one()` 即 `Decimal::zero()` 和 `Decimal::one()`。只要没有和被舍入（精确系数能容纳于操作数精度的和，以及所有乘积，因为 `*` 是精确的），环公理对 `+`、`-` 和 `*` 精确成立；经过舍入的和只是近似满足结合律。`from_natural` 和 `from_integer` 的说明见[构造](#decimalfrom_natural-from_integer)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1747
msgid "`Decimal` implements the `floating` scalar trait."
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 `floating` 的标量 trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1753
msgid "The trait methods are `classify`, `sign`, `precision`, `with_precision` and `normalized`, all documented above; `@def.is_finite(x)` and the other generic predicates work through it."
msgstr "trait 方法为 `classify`、`sign`、`precision`、`with_precision` 和 `normalized`，均已在上文说明；`@def.is_finite(x)` 及其他泛型谓词都通过它工作。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1759
msgid "These functions implement the contextual traits of [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)."
msgstr "这些函数实现了 [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 的 contextual trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1786
msgid "Each `*_contextual` operation converts the context with `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context`, runs the matching `*_ctx` operation and returns `Err(division_by_zero)` when `division_by_zero` was raised, `Err(domain_error)` when another `has_error` flag was raised, and otherwise `Ok` with diagnostics `inexact`, `rounded`, `overflow`, `underflow`, `subnormal` and `clamped` copied from the flags. Because the converted context has the default exponent range, `exp_contextual` without explicit `e_min`/`e_max` fails with `domain_error` (`invalid_context`)."
msgstr "每个 `*_contextual` 运算都用 `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` 转换上下文，执行对应的 `*_ctx` 运算：若引发了 `division_by_zero` 则返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，若引发了其他 `has_error` 标志则返回 `Err(domain_error)`，否则返回 `Ok`，其诊断信息 `inexact`、`rounded`、`overflow`、`underflow`、`subnormal` 和 `clamped` 复制自标志。由于转换后的上下文采用默认指数范围，未显式指定 `e_min`/`e_max` 的 `exp_contextual` 会以 `domain_error`（`invalid_context`）失败。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1795
msgid "`zero_contextual` and `one_contextual` have the context precision. `epsilon_contextual` is $10^{1-p}$ (`next_plus(1) - 1`). `min_normal_contextual` is $10^{e_{\\min}}$ (default $e_{\\min} = -999\\,999\\,999$). `max_finite_contextual` is $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$. `classify_contextual` is `classify`."
msgstr "`zero_contextual` 和 `one_contextual` 具有上下文精度。`epsilon_contextual` 为 $10^{1-p}$（`next_plus(1) - 1`）。`min_normal_contextual` 为 $10^{e_{\\min}}$（默认 $e_{\\min} = -999\\,999\\,999$）。`max_finite_contextual` 为 $(10^{p}-1)\\,10^{e_{\\max}-p+1}$。`classify_contextual` 即 `classify`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1803
msgid "These functions implement the checked traits of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`."
msgstr "这些函数实现了 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的 checked trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1818
msgid "`parse_checked(s, ctx)` is `Decimal::parse(s, precision=ctx.precision)`. `DivChecked::div_checked(x, y, ctx)` is `div_ctx` under the converted context with `Err(division_by_zero)` and `Err(domain_error)` as in [`div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-sqrt). `sqrt_checked` is `sqrt_ctx` under the converted context and fails for negative operands. `pow_nat_checked` and `pow_int_checked` are `power_ctx` with the integer exponent converted to a `Decimal` exactly (with at least ten digits, which hold every accepted exponent), so at precision 7 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` is `-1`; they return `Err(division_by_zero)` for a zero base with a negative exponent, `Err(domain_error)` for an invalid power, and `pow_nat_checked` returns `Err(unsupported)` for exponents above 999,999,999. `CompareChecked` is [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked)."
msgstr "`parse_checked(s, ctx)` 即 `Decimal::parse(s, precision=ctx.precision)`。`DivChecked::div_checked(x, y, ctx)` 即转换后上下文下的 `div_ctx`，其 `Err(division_by_zero)` 与 `Err(domain_error)` 同 [`div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-sqrt)。`sqrt_checked` 即转换后上下文下的 `sqrt_ctx`，对负操作数失败。`pow_nat_checked` 和 `pow_int_checked` 即把整数指数精确转换为 `Decimal`（至少十位数字，足以容纳每个可接受的指数）后的 `power_ctx`，因此精度为 7 时 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` 为 `-1`；它们对零底数配负指数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，对无效的幂返回 `Err(domain_error)`，且 `pow_nat_checked` 对大于 999,999,999 的指数返回 `Err(unsupported)`。`CompareChecked` 即 [`compare_checked`](#decimalcompare_checked)。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1831
msgid "`Eq` and `Compare`: `Decimal::equal`, `not_equal`, `op_lt`, `op_le`, `op_gt`, `op_ge`"
msgstr "`Eq` 与 `Compare`：`Decimal::equal`、`not_equal`、`op_lt`、`op_le`、`op_gt`、`op_ge`"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1833
msgid "These are the operator methods of `Eq` and `Compare`."
msgstr "这些是 `Eq` 与 `Compare` 的运算符方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1844
msgid "They are defined by [`compare`](#decimalcompare): `x == y` is `compare(x, y) == 0`, `x < y` is `compare(x, y) < 0`, and so on. Cohort members are equal (`1.0 == 1.00`), $-0 = +0$, every NaN equals every NaN and is greater than every number. Use `compare_total` to tell representations apart."
msgstr "它们由 [`compare`](#decimalcompare) 定义：`x == y` 即 `compare(x, y) == 0`，`x < y` 即 `compare(x, y) < 0`，依此类推。同值类成员相等（`1.0 == 1.00`），$-0 = +0$，每个 NaN 都等于每个 NaN，且大于所有数。要区分不同的表示，请使用 `compare_total`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1850
msgid "Derived equality: `DecimalContext::equal`, `DecimalContext::not_equal`, `DecimalFlags::equal`, `DecimalFlags::not_equal`, `DecimalRoundingMode::equal`, `DecimalRoundingMode::not_equal`, `DecimalTininessDetection::equal`, `DecimalTininessDetection::not_equal`, `DecimalSignal::equal`, `DecimalSignal::not_equal`, `DecimalInterchangeFormat::equal`, `DecimalInterchangeFormat::not_equal`, `DecimalInterchangeEncoding::equal`, `DecimalInterchangeEncoding::not_equal`"
msgstr "派生相等：`DecimalContext::equal`、`DecimalContext::not_equal`、`DecimalFlags::equal`、`DecimalFlags::not_equal`、`DecimalRoundingMode::equal`、`DecimalRoundingMode::not_equal`、`DecimalTininessDetection::equal`、`DecimalTininessDetection::not_equal`、`DecimalSignal::equal`、`DecimalSignal::not_equal`、`DecimalInterchangeFormat::equal`、`DecimalInterchangeFormat::not_equal`、`DecimalInterchangeEncoding::equal`、`DecimalInterchangeEncoding::not_equal`"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1852
msgid "These are the derived `Eq` methods of the context, flag and enum types."
msgstr "这些是上下文、标志与枚举类型的派生 `Eq` 方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1871
msgid "Contexts compare field by field (precision, both rounding fields, exponent limits, clamp, extended, tininess); flag sets compare all thirteen fields. `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context(ArithmeticContext::decimal64())` is equal to `DecimalContext::decimal64()`."
msgstr "上下文逐字段比较（精度、两个舍入字段、指数界限、clamp、extended、微小性判定）；标志集比较全部十三个字段。`DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context(ArithmeticContext::decimal64())` 等于 `DecimalContext::decimal64()`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1876
msgid "`Show` and `Debug`: `Decimal::to_string`, `output`, `to_repr`"
msgstr "`Show` 与 `Debug`：`Decimal::to_string`、`output`、`to_repr`"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1878
msgid "`Decimal` implements `Show` and `Debug`."
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 `Show` 和 `Debug`。"

#: manual/api/decimal.md:1887
msgid "`to_string` formats a value in scientific notation without a context. Finite values use the scientific-string rule of [`to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-to_eng_string), so trailing zeros and the exponent are visible: `1.20`, `1E+3`, `1.2E-7`. Special values are written in lower case: `inf`, `-inf`, `nan`, `snan`, `-nan12`. `output` writes the same text to a logger. `to_repr` is the derived structural representation used by `debug_inspect` and `assert_eq`."
msgstr "`to_string` 在不带上下文的情况下以科学记数法格式化值。有限值使用 [`to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-to_eng_string) 的科学记数字符串规则，因此尾随零和指数均可见：`1.20`、`1E+3`、`1.2E-7`。特殊值以小写书写：`inf`、`-inf`、`nan`、`snan`、`-nan12`。`output` 将相同文本写入 logger。`to_repr` 是 `debug_inspect` 和 `assert_eq` 所使用的派生结构表示。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_checked API"
msgstr "decimal_checked API"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:5
msgid "`decimal_checked` provides `DecimalChecked`, an immutable pipeline state for IEEE 754 decimal arithmetic with [`decimal`](decimal.md). The state holds the current value, one `DecimalContext`, the flags raised by the latest step, the flags accumulated over all steps, and an optional `ArithmeticError`. Each operation applies the matching `Decimal::*_ctx` operation under the stored context. IEEE exceptional results (infinities, NaNs, rounded values) remain values and only set flags; an error is recorded only when an elementary function cannot certify its result, and it stops the pipeline. The [tutorial](../tutorial/decimal_checked.md) shows typical pipelines; the [design page](../design/decimal_checked.md) models the state as a writer monad over the flag monoid and proves that the accumulated flags are the union of the per-step flags."
msgstr "`decimal_checked` 提供 `DecimalChecked`，这是基于 [`decimal`](decimal.md) 的 IEEE 754 十进制算术的不可变流水线状态。该状态保存当前值、一个 `DecimalContext`、最近一步引发的标志、所有步骤累积的标志，以及一个可选的 `ArithmeticError`。每个运算都在所存储的上下文下执行对应的 `Decimal::*_ctx` 运算。IEEE 异常结果（无穷、NaN、舍入后的值）仍然是值，只设置标志；只有当初等函数无法认证其结果时才记录错误，并使流水线停止。[教程](../tutorial/decimal_checked.md)展示了典型的流水线；[设计页面](../design/decimal_checked.md)将该状态建模为标志幺半群上的 writer 单子，并证明累积标志是各步标志的并。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:20
msgid "Add both packages to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将这两个包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:29
msgid "The examples use the aliases `@decimal_checked.` and `@decimal.`, and list flags with this helper:"
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@decimal_checked.` 和 `@decimal.`，并用以下辅助函数列出标志："

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:50
#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:50
msgid "The state type"
msgstr "状态类型"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:54
msgid "`DecimalChecked` is the state of an IEEE decimal pipeline."
msgstr "`DecimalChecked` 是 IEEE 十进制流水线的状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:62
msgid "Write a state as $\\sigma = (v, c, r, F, \\varepsilon)$: value $v$, context $c$, raised flags $r$ of the latest step, accumulated flags $F$, and error $\\varepsilon$ (absent or one `ArithmeticError`). Every operation returns a new state; nothing is mutated."
msgstr "将状态记为 $\\sigma = (v, c, r, F, \\varepsilon)$：值 $v$、上下文 $c$、最近一步引发的标志 $r$、累积标志 $F$，以及错误 $\\varepsilon$（不存在或为一个 `ArithmeticError`）。每个运算都返回新的状态；不修改任何东西。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:71
msgid "`from_outcome(value, context, flags)` starts a pipeline from a value and the flags that produced it."
msgstr "`from_outcome(value, context, flags)` 由一个值及产生它的标志开始一条流水线。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:78
msgid "The result is $(\\textit{value}, c', \\textit{flags}, \\textit{flags}, \\text{none})$ with $c' = \\textit{context}.\\texttt{ieee754()}$ (on the current branch `ieee754()` returns the context unchanged). The value is *not* re-rounded; use it with the `(value, flags)` pair returned by a `Decimal::*_ctx` call."
msgstr "结果为 $(\\textit{value}, c', \\textit{flags}, \\textit{flags}, \\text{none})$，其中 $c' = \\textit{context}.\\texttt{ieee754()}$（在当前分支上 `ieee754()` 原样返回上下文）。值*不会*被重新舍入；请将它与 `Decimal::*_ctx` 调用返回的 `(value, flags)` 二元组配合使用。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:86
msgid "`from_decimal(value, context)` rounds a value into the context."
msgstr "`from_decimal(value, context)` 将值舍入到上下文中。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:92
msgid "It applies `Decimal::apply_ctx`, which rounds the value to the context's precision and exponent range, and records the resulting flags as both raised and accumulated."
msgstr "它执行 `Decimal::apply_ctx`，将值舍入到上下文的精度和指数范围，并把所得标志同时记录为引发标志和累积标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:98
msgid "`parse(source, context)` converts a decimal string under the context."
msgstr "`parse(source, context)` 在上下文下转换十进制字符串。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:104
msgid "It uses `Decimal::from_string_ctx`. Extra digits are rounded (`inexact`, `rounded`); an invalid string gives a NaN value with `conversion_syntax` raised, not an error."
msgstr "它使用 `Decimal::from_string_ctx`。多余的数字会被舍入（`inexact`、`rounded`）；无效字符串得到一个 NaN 值并引发 `conversion_syntax`，而不是错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:110
msgid "These constructors convert a MoonBit number."
msgstr "这些构造函数转换 MoonBit 数值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:119
msgid "`from_int` and `from_bigint` parse the integer's decimal string, so integers longer than the precision are rounded with flags. `from_double` first converts the binary value to a decimal of 17 significant digits and `from_float` to 9 digits (enough to identify the binary value), then rounds into the context with `from_decimal`. So `from_double(0.1, decimal64)` is `0.1000000000000000` with `inexact` and `rounded` raised."
msgstr "`from_int` 和 `from_bigint` 解析整数的十进制字符串，因此长于精度的整数会被舍入并带有标志。`from_double` 先将二进制值转换为 17 位有效数字的十进制数，`from_float` 则转换为 9 位（足以唯一确定该二进制值），然后用 `from_decimal` 舍入到上下文中。因此 `from_double(0.1, decimal64)` 为 `0.1000000000000000`，并引发 `inexact` 和 `rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:126
msgid "This is a conversion in two roundings, not the correctly rounded value of the binary number. With a context precision above 17 (decimal128) the result keeps only 17 digits: `from_double(0.1, decimal128)` is `0.10000000000000001`, not the exact `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827`, and its flags describe only the second rounding. With a precision below 17 the half modes can round twice (a 17-digit midpoint created by the first rounding). For the exact binary value use `from_decimal(Decimal::from_double(x, precision=p), context)` with `p` at least the context precision plus one, or with `p = 767`, which holds every `Double` exactly."
msgstr "这是经过两次舍入的转换，而不是该二进制数的正确舍入值。当上下文精度高于 17（decimal128）时，结果只保留 17 位数字：`from_double(0.1, decimal128)` 为 `0.10000000000000001`，而不是精确的 `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827`，并且其标志只描述第二次舍入。当精度低于 17 时，half 模式可能舍入两次（第一次舍入产生了一个 17 位的中点）。如需精确的二进制值，请使用 `from_decimal(Decimal::from_double(x, precision=p), context)`，其中 `p` 至少为上下文精度加一，或取 `p = 767`，它能精确容纳每个 `Double`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:162
msgid "These accessors return the components of the state."
msgstr "这些访问函数返回状态的各个分量。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:171
msgid "`raised()` is $r$, the flags of the latest successful step only. `flags()` is $F$, the bitwise OR of the flags of every successful step since construction or the last `clear_flags`. After an error, `value`, `raised` and `flags` keep the state reached before the failing step."
msgstr "`raised()` 即 $r$，仅为最近一次成功步骤的标志。`flags()` 即 $F$，是自构造或上次 `clear_flags` 以来所有成功步骤标志的按位 OR。出错之后，`value`、`raised` 和 `flags` 保持失败步骤之前所达到的状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:178
msgid "These methods return the value with the accumulated flags."
msgstr "这些方法返回值及累积标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:185
msgid "`outcome()` is $(v, F)$ regardless of the error; `result()` is $\\mathrm{Err}(\\varepsilon)$ when an error is recorded and $\\mathrm{Ok}((v, F))$ otherwise."
msgstr "`outcome()` 无论是否有错误都为 $(v, F)$；`result()` 在记录了错误时为 $\\mathrm{Err}(\\varepsilon)$，否则为 $\\mathrm{Ok}((v, F))$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:191
msgid "These methods test for and return the recorded error."
msgstr "这些方法检测并返回所记录的错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:199
msgid "Controlling the state"
msgstr "控制状态"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:203
msgid "`clear_flags()` resets both $r$ and $F$ to the empty flag set."
msgstr "`clear_flags()` 将 $r$ 和 $F$ 都重置为空标志集。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:209
msgid "Value, context and error are kept. It also applies to a state with an error."
msgstr "值、上下文与错误保持不变。它同样适用于带有错误的状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:213
msgid "`with_context(context)` switches to a new context and rounds the current value into it."
msgstr "`with_context(context)` 切换到新的上下文，并将当前值舍入到其中。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:220
msgid "The value is re-applied with `apply_ctx` under the new context; the new flags become $r$ and are ORed into $F$. On a state with an error it returns the state unchanged."
msgstr "值在新上下文下用 `apply_ctx` 重新应用；新的标志成为 $r$，并 OR 到 $F$ 中。对带有错误的状态，它原样返回该状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:226
msgid "`apply()` rounds the current value into the stored context and records the flags."
msgstr "`apply()` 将当前值舍入到所存储的上下文中，并记录标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:254
msgid "Operations that cannot fail"
msgstr "不会失败的运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:258
msgid "These methods apply the IEEE decimal operation of the same meaning to the current value and a plain `Decimal` operand under the stored context."
msgstr "这些方法在所存储的上下文下，对当前值和一个普通 `Decimal` 操作数执行含义相同的 IEEE 十进制运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:281
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:283
msgid "$+v$, $-v$, $\\lvert v\\rvert$ rounded into the context"
msgstr "舍入到上下文的 $+v$、$-v$、$\\lvert v\\rvert$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:284
msgid "$v \\circ y$ correctly rounded"
msgstr "正确舍入的 $v \\circ y$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:285
msgid "$v \\cdot m + a$ with one rounding"
msgstr "只舍入一次的 $v \\cdot m + a$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:286
msgid "$\\sqrt{v}$ correctly rounded"
msgstr "正确舍入的 $\\sqrt{v}$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:287
msgid "$v$ rounded to the exponent of `q`"
msgstr "舍入到 `q` 的指数的 $v$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:288
msgid "IEEE remainder $v - d \\cdot n$, $n$ = $v/d$ rounded to nearest, ties to even"
msgstr "IEEE 余数 $v - d \\cdot n$，$n$ = $v/d$ 舍入到最近（平局取偶）"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:289
msgid "$v$ with trailing zeros removed"
msgstr "去除尾随零后的 $v$"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:290
msgid "General Decimal Arithmetic `min`/`max`: a quiet NaN loses to a number (IEEE 754-2008 minNum/maxNum, not the 2019 `minimum`)"
msgstr "General Decimal Arithmetic 的 `min`/`max`：静默 NaN 输给数值（IEEE 754-2008 minNum/maxNum，而非 2019 的 `minimum`）"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:291
msgid "same names"
msgstr "同名"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:291
msgid "adjacent representable value"
msgstr "相邻的可表示值"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:293
msgid "If an error is recorded, each method returns the state unchanged. Otherwise the step $(v', r') = \\mathrm{op}(v, c)$ gives the new state $(v', c, r', F \\lor r', \\text{none})$. Invalid operations produce NaN with `invalid_operation`, division by zero produces an infinity with `division_by_zero`, overflow produces an infinity or the largest finite number with `overflow`, `inexact` and `rounded`, as in IEEE 754 decimal arithmetic."
msgstr "若已记录错误，每个方法都原样返回状态。否则，步骤 $(v', r') = \\mathrm{op}(v, c)$ 给出新状态 $(v', c, r', F \\lor r', \\text{none})$。与 IEEE 754 十进制算术一致：无效运算产生带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，除以零产生带 `division_by_zero` 的无穷，上溢产生无穷或最大有限数，并带 `overflow`、`inexact` 和 `rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:320
msgid "Operations that can record an error"
msgstr "可能记录错误的运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:324
msgid "These methods apply the certified `Decimal::try_*_ctx` functions of the same name."
msgstr "这些方法应用同名的经认证的 `Decimal::try_*_ctx` 函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:358
msgid "The results are those of `decimal`, including its documented exception to correct rounding (exact decimal results of non-integral powers, such as $0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$; see the [decimal API](decimal.md#elementary-functions)). Zero and infinite operands of `atan2` give the IEEE 754 values (`atan2` of $+\\infty$ and 1 is $\\pi/2$, inexact). Domain violations are IEEE values with flags (`ln` of a negative number is NaN with `invalid_operation`, `tanpi(0.5)` is an infinity with `division_by_zero`). An error is recorded only when `try_*_ctx` returns `Err`, which these functions do for a `CertificationFailure` (the correctly rounded result could not be certified within the refinement budget). On error the new state is $(v, c, r, F, \\mathrm{Some}(e))$: the value and flags before the step are kept."
msgstr "结果即 `decimal` 的结果，包括其文档所述的正确舍入例外（非整数次幂的精确十进制结果，例如 $0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$；参见 [decimal API](decimal.md#elementary-functions)）。`atan2` 的零与无穷操作数得到 IEEE 754 值（$+\\infty$ 和 1 的 `atan2` 为 $\\pi/2$，不精确）。定义域违例是带标志的 IEEE 值（负数的 `ln` 是带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，`tanpi(0.5)` 是带 `division_by_zero` 的无穷）。只有当 `try_*_ctx` 返回 `Err` 时才记录错误，这些函数在发生 `CertificationFailure`（无法在细化预算内认证正确舍入的结果）时会如此。出错时新状态为 $(v, c, r, F, \\mathrm{Some}(e))$：保留该步骤之前的值和标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:370
msgid "[!IMPORTANT] Following the General Decimal Arithmetic rules for the mathematical functions, these operations require a context with precision and exponent limits within $\\pm 999\\,999$. The default `DecimalContext::new` range ($\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$), and any context built by `from_arithmetic_context` from an `ArithmeticContext` without exponent bounds, makes them return NaN with `invalid_context`. Use `decimal32()`, `decimal64()`, `decimal128()` or explicit `e_min` / `e_max`. `power` and `pown` with an integral exponent, and `power` with the exponent `0.5`, are not restricted."
msgstr "[!IMPORTANT] 依照 General Decimal Arithmetic 对数学函数的规定，这些运算要求上下文的精度和指数限制在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内。默认的 `DecimalContext::new` 范围（$\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$），以及由 `from_arithmetic_context` 从无指数边界的 `ArithmeticContext` 构建的任何上下文，都会使它们返回带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN。请使用 `decimal32()`、`decimal64()`、`decimal128()` 或显式的 `e_min` / `e_max`。带整数指数的 `power` 和 `pown`，以及指数为 `0.5` 的 `power`，不受此限制。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda API"
msgstr "decimal_gda API"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:5
msgid "`decimal_gda` implements the General Decimal Arithmetic Specification (GDA, version 1.70) by M. F. Cowlishaw. Its `Decimal` is a sign, an arbitrary-length decimal coefficient and a decimal exponent; its `GdaContext` carries the precision, rounding mode, exponent limits, clamping, the extended/subset switch, the sticky status and the enabled traps; and every GDA operation is a pure function that returns a `GdaOutcome` holding the defined result, the next context and the conditions it raised. The [tutorial](../tutorial/decimal_gda.md) shows the package in use; the [design page](../design/decimal_gda.md) derives the rules stated here."
msgstr "`decimal_gda` 实现了 M. F. Cowlishaw 的 General Decimal Arithmetic 规范（GDA，1.70 版）。其 `Decimal` 由符号、任意长度的十进制系数和十进制指数组成；其 `GdaContext` 携带精度、舍入模式、指数限制、钳制、扩展/子集开关、粘滞状态以及已启用的陷阱；每个 GDA 运算都是纯函数，返回一个 `GdaOutcome`，其中包含所定义的结果、下一个上下文以及它所引发的条件。[教程](../tutorial/decimal_gda.md)展示了该包的用法；[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda.md)推导了此处陈述的规则。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:15
msgid "The package does not depend on the IEEE 754 package `decimal`. Besides the GDA surface it publishes a lower, status-free layer — `DecimalContext`, `DecimalFlags` and the `Decimal::*_ctx` methods — on which the GDA functions are built, plus adapters to the `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` and `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` traits."
msgstr "该包不依赖 IEEE 754 包 `decimal`。除 GDA 接口外，它还公开一个更底层、无状态的层——`DecimalContext`、`DecimalFlags` 以及 `Decimal::*_ctx` 方法，GDA 函数即构建于其上——以及面向 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 和 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` trait 的适配器。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:21
msgid "Throughout, a finite value is written $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{e}$ with coefficient $c \\ge 0$ and exponent $e$; its *adjusted exponent* is $\\hat e = e + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$, the exponent of its leading digit. For a context with precision $p$, $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ is the smallest exponent a result may have, and with clamping $E_{\\mathrm{top}} = e_{\\max} - p + 1$ is the largest."
msgstr "全文中，有限值记作 $(-1)^s \\cdot c \\cdot 10^{e}$，其中系数 $c \\ge 0$，指数为 $e$；其*调整后指数*为 $\\hat e = e + \\operatorname{digits}(c) - 1$，即其首位数字的指数。对于精度为 $p$ 的上下文，$E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = e_{\\min} - p + 1$ 是结果可以具有的最小指数，在钳制时 $E_{\\mathrm{top}} = e_{\\max} - p + 1$ 是最大指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:38
msgid "The examples on this page call the package through the alias `@decimal_gda.`, and the trait adapters through `@lf_arith.` for `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`. Several examples define a local helper `d(s)`, which parses a literal with `Decimal::from_string` and keeps its exponent."
msgstr "本页示例通过别名 `@decimal_gda.` 调用该包，并通过 `@lf_arith.`（对应 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`）调用 trait 适配器。若干示例定义了局部辅助函数 `d(s)`，它用 `Decimal::from_string` 解析字面量并保留其指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:44
msgid "The `Decimal` value"
msgstr "`Decimal` 值"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:48
msgid "`Decimal` is an immutable GDA number: a finite value, an infinity, a quiet NaN or a signaling NaN."
msgstr "`Decimal` 是不可变的 GDA 数：有限值、无穷、静默 NaN 或信号 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:57
msgid "Finite values keep their exponent, so `2.50` and `2.5` are distinct members of the same *cohort*: they compare equal numerically and differ in `compare_total`, `same_quantum` and printing. Zero is signed. NaNs carry a sign and a non-negative integer payload. Every value also stores a *precision attribute* (`precision()`), the precision of the context or constructor that produced it; GDA operations ignore it and use the context precision instead. The coefficient is stored as a persistent decimal limb array, so a value can be shared freely."
msgstr "有限值保留其指数，因此 `2.50` 与 `2.5` 是同一*同值类*的不同成员：它们在数值上比较相等，但在 `compare_total`、`same_quantum` 和打印上有所不同。零带有符号。NaN 携带符号和非负整数载荷。每个值还存储一个*精度属性*（`precision()`），即产生它的上下文或构造函数的精度；GDA 运算忽略它，而改用上下文精度。系数以持久化的十进制分段（limb）数组存储，因此值可以自由共享。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:68
msgid "These return $+0$, $-0$ and $1$, each with exponent 0."
msgstr "它们分别返回 $+0$、$-0$ 和 $1$，指数均为 0。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:76
msgid "`precision` (default 34, clamped to at least 1) is only the stored precision attribute."
msgstr "`precision`（默认 34，至少钳制为 1）仅是所存储的精度属性。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:81
msgid "These build the special values."
msgstr "这些函数构建特殊值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:90
msgid "`inf(Negative)` is $-\\infty$; any other `Sign` gives $+\\infty$. `nan()` is a positive quiet NaN with payload 0. The payload is stored as its absolute value. A signaling NaN raises `InvalidOperation` when an arithmetic operation consumes it and is replaced by the quiet NaN with the same sign and payload."
msgstr "`inf(Negative)` 为 $-\\infty$；其他任何 `Sign` 都得到 $+\\infty$。`nan()` 是载荷为 0 的正静默 NaN。载荷以其绝对值存储。信号 NaN 在被算术运算使用时引发 `InvalidOperation`，并被替换为符号和载荷相同的静默 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:97
msgid "`make(c, e, p)` returns $c \\cdot 10^{e}$ rounded to `p` significant digits and with trailing zeros removed."
msgstr "`make(c, e, p)` 返回舍入到 `p` 位有效数字并去除尾随零的 $c \\cdot 10^{e}$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:104
msgid "The sign comes from the sign of `c`. Rounding uses `mode` (default `ToNearestEven`). Because trailing zeros are removed, `make(1200, 0, 34)` is `1.2E+3`; build from a string when the quantum matters. No flags are reported."
msgstr "符号取自 `c` 的符号。舍入使用 `mode`（默认 `ToNearestEven`）。由于尾随零会被去除，`make(1200, 0, 34)` 为 `1.2E+3`；当量子重要时，请从字符串构建。不报告任何标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:110
msgid "These convert binary values to decimal, round half to even to `precision` digits and remove trailing zeros."
msgstr "这些函数将二进制值转换为十进制，按半值取偶舍入到 `precision` 位，并去除尾随零。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:121
msgid "`precision` defaults to 34 (for `from_bin_float`, to the precision of the argument). A binary float $m \\cdot 2^{k}$ with $k < 0$ is first written exactly as $m 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$, so the conversion is exact whenever the result fits in `precision` digits; for example `from_double(0.1)` is the 34-digit rounding of the binary64 value nearest to $0.1$. NaNs become the quiet NaN (sign kept by `from_double`), infinities keep their sign, zeros keep their sign (`from_bin_float` returns $+0$). `from_int(100)` is `1E+2`."
msgstr "`precision` 默认为 34（对 `from_bin_float` 而言默认为参数的精度）。$k < 0$ 的二进制浮点数 $m \\cdot 2^{k}$ 首先被精确写成 $m 5^{-k} \\cdot 10^{k}$，因此只要结果能容纳于 `precision` 位，转换就是精确的；例如 `from_double(0.1)` 是最接近 $0.1$ 的 binary64 值舍入到 34 位的结果。NaN 变为静默 NaN（`from_double` 保留符号），无穷保留符号，零保留符号（`from_bin_float` 返回 $+0$）。`from_int(100)` 为 `1E+2`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:131
msgid "`to_bin_float` rounds the value to a binary `BinFloat` with `precision` significant bits."
msgstr "`to_bin_float` 将值舍入为具有 `precision` 位有效二进制位的 `BinFloat`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:138
msgid "`precision` defaults to the stored precision attribute and `mode` to `ToNearestEven`. With `TowardNegative` and `TowardPositive` the two results enclose the decimal value; the elementary functions use exactly this to build their certified input intervals. Zeros map to $+0$, NaNs to the binary NaN."
msgstr "`precision` 默认为所存储的精度属性，`mode` 默认为 `ToNearestEven`。用 `TowardNegative` 和 `TowardPositive` 得到的两个结果包住该十进制值；初等函数正是借此构建其经过认证的输入区间。零映射为 $+0$，NaN 映射为二进制 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:145
msgid "These read a GDA numeric string without a GDA context."
msgstr "这些函数在没有 GDA 上下文的情况下读取 GDA 数值字符串。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:152
msgid "Accepted syntax is the GDA numeric-string grammar: an optional sign, digits with an optional decimal point, an optional exponent `E±n`, or `Infinity`/`Inf`/`NaN`/`sNaN` (case-insensitive) with an optional decimal NaN payload. The exponent is kept exactly, so `from_string(\"2.50\")` has exponent $-2$. A literal with more than `precision` (default 34) significant digits is rounded half to even and its trailing zeros are removed. A malformed literal gives `Err(parse_error)` or `None`. No context exponent range applies, only the limits of the representation (stored exponent at least $-2^{31}$, adjusted exponent at most $2^{31}-1$); as in the GDA to-number conversion, a numeric string beyond them still converts: `\"1e3000000000\"` is `inf` and `\"1e-3000000000\"` is `0E-2147483648` (a tiny literal is rounded half to even to the exponent $-2^{31}$). Use the package function [`parse`](#parse) when the exponent limits, flags, status or traps of a context must apply."
msgstr "可接受的语法为 GDA 数值字符串文法：可选符号、带可选小数点的数字、可选指数 `E±n`，或者 `Infinity`/`Inf`/`NaN`/`sNaN`（不区分大小写）并可带十进制 NaN 载荷。指数被精确保留，因此 `from_string(\"2.50\")` 的指数为 $-2$。有效数字多于 `precision`（默认 34）位的字面量按半值取偶舍入，并去除尾随零。格式错误的字面量得到 `Err(parse_error)` 或 `None`。不适用任何上下文指数范围，只适用表示本身的限制（存储的指数至少为 $-2^{31}$，调整指数至多为 $2^{31}-1$）；与 GDA 的 to-number 转换一样，超出这些限制的数值字符串仍会被转换：`\"1e3000000000\"` 为 `inf`，`\"1e-3000000000\"` 为 `0E-2147483648`（过小的字面量按半值取偶舍入到指数 $-2^{31}$）。当必须应用上下文的指数限制、标志、状态或陷阱时，请使用包函数 [`parse`](#parse)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:169
msgid "These print the value in GDA scientific notation, with lowercase special values."
msgstr "这些函数以 GDA 科学记数法打印值，特殊值使用小写。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:178
msgid "A finite value with $e \\le 0$ and $\\hat e \\ge -6$ prints without an exponent (`0.000123`, `7.50`); otherwise it prints one digit, the remaining digits after a point, and `E±`$\\hat e$ (`1.23E+7`, `1E-7`, `0E+2`). Infinities print as `inf`/`-inf`, NaNs as `nan`, `snan`, `-nan`, followed by the payload when it is not zero. For the GDA spellings `Infinity`/`NaN`/`sNaN` use [`Decimal::to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-decimalto_eng_string)."
msgstr "满足 $e \\le 0$ 且 $\\hat e \\ge -6$ 的有限值不带指数打印（`0.000123`、`7.50`）；否则打印一位数字、小数点后的其余数字以及 `E±`$\\hat e$（`1.23E+7`、`1E-7`、`0E+2`）。无穷打印为 `inf`/`-inf`，NaN 打印为 `nan`、`snan`、`-nan`，载荷非零时后跟载荷。若要使用 GDA 写法 `Infinity`/`NaN`/`sNaN`，请使用 [`Decimal::to_sci_string`](#decimalto_sci_string-decimalto_eng_string)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:187
msgid "These convert a numeric *string* under a `DecimalContext` and print it with GDA to-scientific-string or to-engineering-string."
msgstr "这些函数在 `DecimalContext` 下转换数值*字符串*，并以 GDA 的 to-scientific-string 或 to-engineering-string 打印。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:195
msgid "The string is converted exactly as by [`Decimal::from_string_ctx`](#decimalfrom_string_ctx) (rounding to the context, with the conversion flags returned), then formatted. Engineering notation uses an exponent that is a multiple of three (`123E+5` prints as `12.3E+6`). Special values print as `Infinity`, `-Infinity`, `NaN`, `sNaN` with payload."
msgstr "字符串的转换方式与 [`Decimal::from_string_ctx`](#decimalfrom_string_ctx) 完全相同（舍入到上下文，并返回转换标志），然后再格式化。工程记数法使用 3 的倍数作为指数（`123E+5` 打印为 `12.3E+6`）。特殊值打印为 `Infinity`、`-Infinity`、`NaN`、`sNaN`，并带载荷。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:203
msgid "`from_string_ctx` is the GDA *to-number* conversion under a status-free context."
msgstr "`from_string_ctx` 是无状态上下文下的 GDA *to-number* 转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:210
msgid "The literal is rounded to the context precision, checked against the exponent range (overflow, subnormal, underflow, clamping) and returned with its flags. Malformed input returns a quiet NaN with `conversion_syntax`. In a non-extended context, infinities and NaNs are themselves a conversion-syntax error, and zeros lose their sign and exponent."
msgstr "字面量被舍入到上下文精度，按指数范围检查（上溢、次正规、下溢、钳制），并连同其标志一起返回。格式错误的输入返回带 `conversion_syntax` 的静默 NaN。在非扩展上下文中，无穷与 NaN 本身就是转换语法错误，且零会丢失其符号和指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:238
msgid "These report the class, the numeric sign and the stored precision attribute."
msgstr "这些函数报告类别、数值符号以及所存储的精度属性。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:246
msgid "`classify` returns `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`. `sign` returns `Zero` for zeros of either sign and for NaNs, and `Positive`/`Negative` otherwise; use `is_negative` to read the sign bit."
msgstr "`classify` 返回 `Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。`sign` 对任一符号的零以及 NaN 返回 `Zero`，否则返回 `Positive`/`Negative`；若要读取符号位，请使用 `is_negative`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:252
msgid "These expose the stored representation $(c, e)$."
msgstr "这些函数暴露所存储的表示 $(c, e)$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:261
msgid "`coefficient` and `magnitude` both return $c \\ge 0$ (the payload for a NaN, 0 for an infinity). `exponent10` and `quantum` both return $e$ (0 for special values)."
msgstr "`coefficient` 和 `magnitude` 都返回 $c \\ge 0$（对 NaN 为载荷，对无穷为 0）。`exponent10` 和 `quantum` 都返回 $e$（对特殊值为 0）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:267
msgid "These are the class and sign predicates."
msgstr "这些是类别与符号谓词。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:279
msgid "`is_negative` and `is_signed` are the same: they read the sign bit, so they are true for $-0$, $-\\infty$ and negative NaNs. `is_zero` is true for finite zeros of any exponent."
msgstr "`is_negative` 与 `is_signed` 相同：它们读取符号位，因此对 $-0$、$-\\infty$ 和负 NaN 为真。`is_zero` 对任意指数的有限零为真。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:285
msgid "These distinguish quiet from signaling NaNs; each pair are aliases."
msgstr "这些函数区分静默 NaN 与信号 NaN；每一对互为别名。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:296
msgid "`is_canonical` always returns `true`: every `Decimal` value is canonical (only interchange encodings can be non-canonical, see [`GdaInterchange::is_canonical`](#gdainterchangecanonical-gdainterchangeis_canonical))."
msgstr "`is_canonical` 总是返回 `true`：每个 `Decimal` 值都是规范的（只有交换编码可能是非规范的，参见 [`GdaInterchange::is_canonical`](#gdainterchangecanonical-gdainterchangeis_canonical)）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:306
msgid "These read and replace a NaN payload."
msgstr "这些函数读取并替换 NaN 载荷。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:315
msgid "`nan_payload` and `get_payload` return the payload of a NaN and 0 for any other value. `set_payload` turns a NaN into a quiet NaN with the given payload and the same sign; `set_payload_signaling` makes it signaling. Both return non-NaN values unchanged."
msgstr "`nan_payload` 和 `get_payload` 返回 NaN 的载荷，对其他任何值返回 0。`set_payload` 将 NaN 变为带给定载荷且符号不变的静默 NaN；`set_payload_signaling` 则使其成为信号 NaN。二者对非 NaN 值都原样返回。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:322
msgid "These classify a value against the exponent range of a `DecimalContext`."
msgstr "这些函数依据 `DecimalContext` 的指数范围对值进行分类。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:330
msgid "A nonzero finite value is normal when $\\hat e \\ge e_{\\min}$ and subnormal when $\\hat e < e_{\\min}$; zeros, infinities and NaNs are neither. `class_name` returns the GDA class string: `sNaN`, `NaN`, `-Infinity`, `+Infinity`, `-Zero`, `+Zero`, `-Subnormal`, `+Subnormal`, `-Normal` or `+Normal`. The GDA forms taking a `GdaContext` are the package functions [`class_name`, `is_normal`, `is_subnormal`](#class_name-is_normal-is_subnormal-same_quantum)."
msgstr "非零有限值在 $\\hat e \\ge e_{\\min}$ 时为正规数，在 $\\hat e < e_{\\min}$ 时为次正规数；零、无穷与 NaN 两者都不是。`class_name` 返回 GDA 类别字符串：`sNaN`、`NaN`、`-Infinity`、`+Infinity`、`-Zero`、`+Zero`、`-Subnormal`、`+Subnormal`、`-Normal` 或 `+Normal`。接受 `GdaContext` 的 GDA 形式是包函数 [`class_name`、`is_normal`、`is_subnormal`](#class_name-is_normal-is_subnormal-same_quantum)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:337
msgid "Sign, cohort and precision transformations"
msgstr "符号、同值类与精度变换"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:341
msgid "These change only the sign bit; they never round and never signal, even for a signaling NaN."
msgstr "这些函数只改变符号位；它们从不舍入，也从不发出信号，即使对信号 NaN 也是如此。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:353
msgid "`neg` and `copy_negate` flip the sign, `abs` and `copy_abs` clear it, `copy` returns the value, and `copy_sign(x, y)` gives `x` the sign bit of `y`. These are GDA *copy* operations; the rounding versions are the package functions [`minus`, `plus`, `abs`](#apply-plus-minus-abs)."
msgstr "`neg` 和 `copy_negate` 翻转符号，`abs` 和 `copy_abs` 清除符号，`copy` 返回该值，`copy_sign(x, y)` 赋予 `x` 以 `y` 的符号位。这些是 GDA 的 *copy* 运算；会舍入的版本是包函数 [`minus`、`plus`、`abs`](#apply-plus-minus-abs)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:360
msgid "These move a value within its cohort or round it to a new precision attribute."
msgstr "这些函数在同值类内移动值，或将其舍入到新的精度属性。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:368
msgid "`normalized` rounds half to even to the stored precision and removes all trailing zeros (`7.50` becomes `7.5`, `1200` becomes `1.2E+3`). `trim` removes only fractional trailing zeros and never makes the exponent positive (`7.50` becomes `7.5`, `1200` stays `1200`); a zero becomes `0` with exponent 0. `with_precision(p, mode)` rounds to `p` digits with `mode`, removes trailing zeros and sets the precision attribute; special values only get the new attribute. None of them report flags."
msgstr "`normalized` 按半值取偶舍入到所存储的精度，并去除所有尾随零（`7.50` 变为 `7.5`，`1200` 变为 `1.2E+3`）。`trim` 只去除小数部分的尾随零，且从不使指数变为正（`7.50` 变为 `7.5`，`1200` 保持 `1200`）；零变为指数为 0 的 `0`。`with_precision(p, mode)` 以 `mode` 舍入到 `p` 位，去除尾随零并设置精度属性；特殊值只获得新的属性。它们都不报告标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:384
msgid "It is true for two finite values with equal exponents, for two infinities and for two NaNs, and false otherwise."
msgstr "对于指数相等的两个有限值、两个无穷以及两个 NaN，它为真，否则为假。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:387
msgid "The GDA context"
msgstr "GDA 上下文"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:391
msgid "`GdaContext` is the immutable GDA context: arithmetic policy plus sticky status plus enabled traps."
msgstr "`GdaContext` 是不可变的 GDA 上下文：算术策略加上粘滞状态，再加上已启用的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:400
msgid "The policy is precision $p \\ge 1$, a `GdaRoundingMode`, $e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$, `clamp` and `extended`. The status is a `GdaFlags` value that operations only ever enlarge; the traps are a `GdaTrapSet`. Neither status nor traps influence the numerical result of an operation: they only decide the next context and whether the outcome is `Completed` or `Trapped`."
msgstr "策略包括精度 $p \\ge 1$、一个 `GdaRoundingMode`、$e_{\\min} \\le e_{\\max}$、`clamp` 以及 `extended`。状态是一个 `GdaFlags` 值，运算只会使它增大；陷阱是一个 `GdaTrapSet`。状态和陷阱都不影响运算的数值结果：它们只决定下一个上下文，以及结果是 `Completed` 还是 `Trapped`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:408
msgid "These build a context with an empty status."
msgstr "这些函数构建状态为空的上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:415
msgid "Defaults: `precision=34`, `rounding=HalfEven`, `e_min=-999_999_999`, `e_max=999_999_999`, `clamp=false`, `extended=true`, no traps. `new` aborts when `precision <= 0` or `e_min > e_max`; `try_new` returns `Err(domain_error)` instead. `clamp=true` limits exponents to $e_{\\max} - p + 1$ as the interchange formats do. `extended=false` selects GDA *subset* arithmetic: operands longer than $p$ digits are rounded first (raising `LostDigits` when that is inexact), special values cannot be parsed, zeros and some results are normalized, and `fma` is invalid."
msgstr "默认值：`precision=34`、`rounding=HalfEven`、`e_min=-999_999_999`、`e_max=999_999_999`、`clamp=false`、`extended=true`，无陷阱。`new` 在 `precision <= 0` 或 `e_min > e_max` 时中止；`try_new` 则返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`clamp=true` 像交换格式那样将指数限制为 $e_{\\max} - p + 1$。`extended=false` 选择 GDA *子集*算术：长于 $p$ 位的操作数先被舍入（若不精确则引发 `LostDigits`），特殊值无法解析，零以及某些结果会被规范化，且 `fma` 无效。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:424
msgid "[!NOTE] `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` with a non-integer exponent require $p \\le 999\\,999$, $e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ and $e_{\\min} \\ge -999\\,999$, as the GDA specification does for its mathematical functions. With the default exponent range they return NaN and raise `InvalidContext`."
msgstr "[!NOTE] 与 GDA 规范对其数学函数的要求一致，`exp`、`ln`、`log10` 以及非整数指数的 `power` 要求 $p \\le 999\\,999$、$e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999$ 且 $e_{\\min} \\ge -999\\,999$。在默认指数范围下，它们返回 NaN 并引发 `InvalidContext`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:432
msgid "These return the standard contexts."
msgstr "这些函数返回标准上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:442
msgid "rounding"
msgstr "舍入"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:442
msgid "extended"
msgstr "扩展"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:442
msgid "traps"
msgstr "陷阱"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:444
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:440
#: manual/numeric_semantics.md:305
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:444
msgid "DivisionByZero, InvalidOperation, Overflow, Underflow, Clamped"
msgstr "DivisionByZero、InvalidOperation、Overflow、Underflow、Clamped"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:449
msgid "`basic` is the GDA basic default context; `default` is the same value. The values are created once and shared."
msgstr "`basic` 是 GDA 的基本默认上下文；`default` 是同一个值。这些值只创建一次并共享。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:454
msgid "These package functions are shorthands for `GdaContext::new` (without a trap argument) and the three interchange presets."
msgstr "这些包函数是 `GdaContext::new`（不带陷阱参数）以及三个交换格式预设的简写。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:466
msgid "These read the arithmetic policy."
msgstr "这些函数读取算术策略。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:478
msgid "`radix` always returns 10."
msgstr "`radix` 总是返回 10。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:482
msgid "These read the sticky status and the enabled traps."
msgstr "这些函数读取粘滞状态和已启用的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:491
msgid "These return a new context with changed traps or status; the receiver is not modified."
msgstr "这些函数返回陷阱或状态被修改后的新上下文；接收者本身不被修改。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:501
msgid "`trap(s)` enables (or with `enabled=false` disables) one trap; `with_traps` replaces the whole set. `clear_status` empties the status and keeps the traps; `reset` empties both."
msgstr "`trap(s)` 启用（或在 `enabled=false` 时禁用）一个陷阱；`with_traps` 替换整个集合。`clear_status` 清空状态并保留陷阱；`reset` 将两者都清空。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:507
msgid "`GdaRoundingMode` lists the eight GDA rounding modes."
msgstr "`GdaRoundingMode` 列出八种 GDA 舍入模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:522
msgid "When the exact result lies strictly between two representable neighbours, `Down` takes the one nearer zero, `Up` the one farther from zero, `Ceiling` the larger, `Floor` the smaller; `HalfEven`, `HalfUp` and `HalfDown` take the nearer one and break an exact tie towards an even last digit, away from zero, or towards zero respectively; `ZeroFiveUp` rounds towards zero unless that leaves a last digit of 0 or 5, in which case it rounds away from zero. The [design page](../design/decimal_gda.md#rounding-to-precision) gives each mode as a formula."
msgstr "当精确结果严格位于两个可表示的相邻值之间时，`Down` 取更接近零的一个，`Up` 取离零更远的一个，`Ceiling` 取较大者，`Floor` 取较小者；`HalfEven`、`HalfUp` 和 `HalfDown` 取较近的一个，恰好处于中点时分别取末位为偶数者、远离零、趋向零；`ZeroFiveUp` 向零舍入，除非这样得到的末位数字为 0 或 5，此时改为远离零舍入。[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda.md#rounding-to-precision)以公式给出了每种模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:531
msgid "Signals, flags and traps"
msgstr "信号、标志与陷阱"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:535
msgid "`GdaSignal` names the thirteen GDA conditions."
msgstr "`GdaSignal` 指定十三种 GDA 条件。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:555
msgid "The GDA signals are `Clamped`, `DivisionByZero`, `Inexact`, `InvalidOperation`, `Overflow`, `Rounded`, `Subnormal` and `Underflow`. `ConversionSyntax`, `DivisionImpossible`, `DivisionUndefined` and `InvalidContext` are conditions that the specification reports through the `InvalidOperation` signal; the package keeps them as separate flags and traps so you can tell them apart. `LostDigits` is raised only in subset arithmetic."
msgstr "GDA 信号为 `Clamped`、`DivisionByZero`、`Inexact`、`InvalidOperation`、`Overflow`、`Rounded`、`Subnormal` 和 `Underflow`。`ConversionSyntax`、`DivisionImpossible`、`DivisionUndefined` 和 `InvalidContext` 是规范通过 `InvalidOperation` 信号报告的条件；本包将它们保留为独立的标志和陷阱，以便加以区分。`LostDigits` 仅在子集算术中引发。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:564
msgid "`GdaFlags` is a set of conditions, used both for the conditions raised by one operation and for the sticky status of a context."
msgstr "`GdaFlags` 是条件的集合，既用于表示单个运算引发的条件，也用于表示上下文的粘滞状态。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:585
msgid "The fields are public for reading, so `raised().inexact` works; there is no public constructor, so sets are built only with `none` and `combine`."
msgstr "字段对读取公开，因此 `raised().inexact` 可用；没有公开的构造函数，因此只能用 `none` 和 `combine` 构建集合。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:590
msgid "`none` is the empty set, `combine` the field-wise union and `contains` the membership test with the GDA invalid-operation grouping."
msgstr "`none` 是空集，`combine` 是逐字段并集，`contains` 是采用 GDA 无效运算分组的成员检测。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:599
msgid "`combine` is associative, commutative and idempotent with `none` as identity. `contains(s)` reads the field for `s`, except that `contains(InvalidOperation)` is true when any of `invalid_operation`, `conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined` or `invalid_context` is set."
msgstr "`combine` 满足结合律、交换律和幂等律，并以 `none` 为单位元。`contains(s)` 读取 `s` 对应的字段，但 `contains(InvalidOperation)` 例外：只要 `invalid_operation`、`conversion_syntax`、`division_impossible`、`division_undefined` 或 `invalid_context` 中任一被设置，它即为真。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:606
msgid "`GdaTrapSet` is the set of enabled traps."
msgstr "`GdaTrapSet` 是已启用陷阱的集合。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:628
msgid "These build and query trap sets."
msgstr "这些函数构建并查询陷阱集。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:636
msgid "`none` enables no trap. `with_signal(s)` enables one trap (or disables it with `enabled=false`); `contains(s)` reads exactly the field for `s`, with no invalid-operation grouping. The grouping happens on the raised side, in `GdaFlags::contains`."
msgstr "`none` 不启用任何陷阱。`with_signal(s)` 启用一个陷阱（或在 `enabled=false` 时禁用）；`contains(s)` 恰好读取 `s` 对应的字段，不做无效运算分组。分组发生在引发一侧，即 `GdaFlags::contains` 中。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:643
msgid "`GdaOutcome[T]` is the result of every GDA operation."
msgstr "`GdaOutcome[T]` 是每个 GDA 运算的结果。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:652
msgid "Both variants carry the GDA-defined result, the next context and the conditions raised by this operation; `Trapped` also names the trap that fired."
msgstr "两个变体都携带 GDA 定义的结果、下一个上下文以及本次运算引发的条件；`Trapped` 还指明所触发的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:657
msgid "These read the fields that both variants share, without a `match`."
msgstr "这些函数读取两个变体共有的字段，无需 `match`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:665
msgid "`value` is the defined result also for `Trapped`, `next_context` the context with the updated status, and `raised` the conditions of this operation only."
msgstr "`value` 是定义的结果（对 `Trapped` 亦然），`next_context` 是状态已更新的上下文，`raised` 只包含本次运算的条件。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:668
msgid "Trap selection"
msgstr "陷阱选择"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:670
msgid "Every GDA function finishes the same way. Let $R$ be the conditions the operation raised and $C$ the input context."
msgstr "每个 GDA 函数都以相同的方式结束。设 $R$ 为运算引发的条件，$C$ 为输入上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:673
msgid "If $R$ is empty the outcome is `Completed(v, C, none)`: the very same context comes back."
msgstr "若 $R$ 为空，结果为 `Completed(v, C, none)`：返回的正是同一个上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:675
msgid "Otherwise the next context is $C$ with status $C.\\mathrm{status} \\cup R$, where the `invalid_operation` flag is also set whenever $R$ contains one of the four detailed invalid conditions."
msgstr "否则，下一个上下文是状态为 $C.\\mathrm{status} \\cup R$ 的 $C$；只要 $R$ 包含四种细分无效条件之一，`invalid_operation` 标志也会被设置。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:678
msgid "The trapped signal is the first $s$ in the order below with `raised.contains(s)` and `traps.contains(s)`: InvalidOperation, DivisionByZero, DivisionUndefined, DivisionImpossible, InvalidContext, ConversionSyntax, Overflow, Underflow, Subnormal, Inexact, Rounded, Clamped, LostDigits. If there is one the outcome is `Trapped(s, v, C', R)`, otherwise `Completed(v, C', R)`."
msgstr "被捕获的信号是按以下顺序中第一个同时满足 `raised.contains(s)` 与 `traps.contains(s)` 的 $s$：InvalidOperation、DivisionByZero、DivisionUndefined、DivisionImpossible、InvalidContext、ConversionSyntax、Overflow、Underflow、Subnormal、Inexact、Rounded、Clamped、LostDigits。若存在这样的信号，结果为 `Trapped(s, v, C', R)`，否则为 `Completed(v, C', R)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:685
msgid "Because `contains(InvalidOperation)` covers the detailed invalid conditions, an `InvalidOperation` trap catches all of them, and it wins over a trap on the detailed condition itself."
msgstr "由于 `contains(InvalidOperation)` 涵盖了各细分无效条件，`InvalidOperation` 陷阱会捕获所有这些条件，并且优先于针对细分条件本身的陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:711
msgid "GDA operations"
msgstr "GDA 运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:713
msgid "Every function in this section takes its operands and a `GdaContext`, rounds to that context, and returns a `GdaOutcome` built by the [trap selection](#trap-selection) rule. A signaling-NaN operand raises `InvalidOperation` and yields the corresponding quiet NaN; a quiet NaN operand propagates without raising anything (the first NaN operand wins). In subset contexts (`extended=false`) finite operands longer than the precision are rounded first. Unless stated otherwise the result is the exact mathematical result rounded once, with the *ideal exponent* listed for the operation when the result is exact."
msgstr "本节中的每个函数都接受其操作数和一个 `GdaContext`，舍入到该上下文，并返回按[陷阱选择](#trap-selection)规则构建的 `GdaOutcome`。信号 NaN 操作数引发 `InvalidOperation` 并产生对应的静默 NaN；静默 NaN 操作数直接传播，不引发任何条件（第一个 NaN 操作数优先）。在子集上下文（`extended=false`）中，长于精度的有限操作数会先被舍入。除非另有说明，结果是精确数学结果只舍入一次所得；当结果精确时，其指数为该运算所列的*理想指数*。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:725
msgid "`parse` is the GDA to-number conversion of a string."
msgstr "`parse` 是对字符串进行的 GDA to-number 转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:731
msgid "The literal keeps its exponent unless it must be rounded to the precision or clamped to the exponent range; overflow and underflow are decided from the exact exponent of the text, however large. Malformed text gives a quiet NaN with `ConversionSyntax`. In subset contexts infinities and NaNs are also a conversion-syntax error."
msgstr "字面量保留其指数，除非必须舍入到精度或钳制到指数范围；上溢与下溢依据文本的精确指数判定，无论其多大。格式错误的文本得到带 `ConversionSyntax` 的静默 NaN。在子集上下文中，无穷与 NaN 也属于转换语法错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:739
msgid "These round one operand to the context: `plus` is $0 + x$, `minus` is $0 - x$, `abs` is $|x|$, and `apply` is the plain conversion of a value to the context."
msgstr "这些函数将单个操作数舍入到上下文：`plus` 即 $0 + x$，`minus` 即 $0 - x$，`abs` 即 $|x|$，`apply` 则是将值直接转换到上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:750
msgid "Ideal exponent: that of the operand. A zero result takes its sign from the GDA rule for a zero sum: `plus(x)` is $0 + x$ and `minus(x)` is $0 - x$, so `plus(-0)` and `minus(0)` are $-0$ under `Floor` and $+0$ in every other mode, while `plus(0)`, `minus(-0)` and `abs` of either zero are $+0$ (in a subset context every zero result is $+0$). `apply` keeps the sign of a zero and does not round subset operands first."
msgstr "理想指数：操作数的指数。零结果的符号遵循 GDA 关于零和的规则：`plus(x)` 为 $0 + x$，`minus(x)` 为 $0 - x$，因此 `plus(-0)` 和 `minus(0)` 在 `Floor` 下为 $-0$，在其他所有模式下为 $+0$；而 `plus(0)`、`minus(-0)` 以及任一零的 `abs` 都是 $+0$（在子集上下文中，所有零结果都是 $+0$）。`apply` 保留零的符号，且不会先舍入子集操作数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:759
msgid "These are the basic arithmetic operations; `fma(a, b, c)` is $a \\times b + c$ with a single rounding."
msgstr "这些是基本算术运算；`fma(a, b, c)` 是只舍入一次的 $a \\times b + c$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:770
msgid "Ideal exponents: $\\min(e_1, e_2)$ for `add` and `subtract`; $e_1 + e_2$ for `multiply`; $e_1 - e_2$ for `divide` (an inexact quotient has a full $p$-digit coefficient); for `fma`, the `add` rule applied to the exact product and the addend. An exact zero sum is $-0$ when both operands (for `subtract`, the first operand and the negated second) are negative, $+0$ when both are positive, and otherwise $+0$, or $-0$ under `Floor`; so `add(0, -0)` is `0` in `HalfEven` and `-0` in `Floor`, while `add(0, 0)` is `0` in every mode. Special cases: $\\infty - \\infty$, $0 \\times \\infty$ and $\\infty / \\infty$ are invalid; $x / 0$ is $\\pm\\infty$ with `DivisionByZero`; $0 / 0$ is NaN with `DivisionUndefined`; $x / \\infty$ is a zero with exponent $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ and `Clamped`. `fma` is invalid in a subset context."
msgstr "理想指数：`add` 和 `subtract` 为 $\\min(e_1, e_2)$；`multiply` 为 $e_1 + e_2$；`divide` 为 $e_1 - e_2$（不精确的商具有完整的 $p$ 位系数）；`fma` 则将 `add` 的规则应用于精确乘积与加数。精确的零和：当两个操作数（对 `subtract` 而言，是第一个操作数与取负后的第二个操作数）均为负时为 $-0$，均为正时为 $+0$，否则为 $+0$，在 `Floor` 下则为 $-0$；因此 `add(0, -0)` 在 `HalfEven` 下为 `0`，在 `Floor` 下为 `-0`，而 `add(0, 0)` 在所有模式下都为 `0`。特殊情形：$\\infty - \\infty$、$0 \\times \\infty$ 与 $\\infty / \\infty$ 是无效的；$x / 0$ 为 $\\pm\\infty$ 并带 `DivisionByZero`；$0 / 0$ 为带 `DivisionUndefined` 的 NaN；$x / \\infty$ 是指数为 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 的零并带 `Clamped`。在子集上下文中 `fma` 是无效的。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:782
msgid "A far smaller addend is absorbed as a sticky unit below every rounding boundary of the sum, and a result is rounded to the subnormal grid only when its exact value is below $10^{e_{\\min}}$, so every one of these operations rounds once: at precision 7, `add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` is `1598619`, and in decimal32 `multiply(3.000001E-45, 1.500001E-45)` is `4.500005E-90` and `divide(1, 1.9999999999998E+101)` is `1E-101`."
msgstr "远小得多的加数会被吸收为低于和的每个舍入边界的粘滞单位，并且只有当结果的精确值低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 时才会被舍入到次正规网格，因此这些运算都只舍入一次：精度为 7 时，`add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` 为 `1598619`；在 decimal32 中，`multiply(3.000001E-45, 1.500001E-45)` 为 `4.500005E-90`，`divide(1, 1.9999999999998E+101)` 为 `1E-101`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:791
msgid "These divide to an integer quotient."
msgstr "这些函数做除法得到整数商。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:799
msgid "`divide_integer` returns $q = \\operatorname{trunc}(x / y)$ with exponent 0; `remainder` returns $x - q y$ (the sign of $x$); `remainder_near` returns $x - n y$ where $n$ is $x / y$ rounded to the nearest integer, ties to even. The remainder has ideal exponent $\\min(e_x, e_y)$. When $q$ (or $n$) needs more than $p$ digits the result is NaN with `DivisionImpossible`. A zero divisor gives `DivisionByZero` (`divide_integer` of a nonzero number) or `DivisionUndefined` ($0 / 0$); a zero divisor or an infinite dividend makes both remainders invalid; a finite dividend with an infinite divisor is its own remainder."
msgstr "`divide_integer` 返回指数为 0 的 $q = \\operatorname{trunc}(x / y)$；`remainder` 返回 $x - q y$（符号与 $x$ 相同）；`remainder_near` 返回 $x - n y$，其中 $n$ 是将 $x / y$ 就近舍入（偶数优先）得到的整数。余数的理想指数为 $\\min(e_x, e_y)$。当 $q$（或 $n$）需要多于 $p$ 位数字时，结果为带 `DivisionImpossible` 的 NaN。除数为零时得到 `DivisionByZero`（非零数的 `divide_integer`）或 `DivisionUndefined`（$0 / 0$）；除数为零或被除数为无穷都会使两种余数无效；有限被除数除以无穷除数时，余数就是被除数本身。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:811
msgid "These round a value to a prescribed exponent."
msgstr "这些函数将值舍入到指定的指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:818
msgid "`quantize(x, q)` returns the value of $x$ with exponent $e_q$, rounded with the context mode (raising `Rounded`, and `Inexact` when digits are lost). `rescale(x, n)` does the same with exponent $n$, where $n$ must be an integer value. The result is invalid when the target exponent lies outside $[E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$ ($[e_{\\min}, e_{\\max}]$ in subset contexts), when the result coefficient would need more than $p$ digits, or when exactly one operand is infinite. Two infinities give the infinity. A subnormal result raises `Subnormal` (and `Inexact` and `Rounded` when digits are lost) but never `Underflow`: in `decimal32`, `quantize(1.55E-100, 1E-101)` is `1.6E-100` with `Subnormal`, `Inexact` and `Rounded`."
msgstr "`quantize(x, q)` 返回指数为 $e_q$ 的 $x$ 的值，并以上下文模式舍入（引发 `Rounded`，丢失数字时还引发 `Inexact`）。`rescale(x, n)` 以指数 $n$ 做同样的事，其中 $n$ 必须是整数值。当目标指数位于 $[E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$（子集上下文中为 $[e_{\\min}, e_{\\max}]$）之外、结果系数需要多于 $p$ 位数字，或恰有一个操作数为无穷时，结果无效。两个无穷得到该无穷。次正规结果会引发 `Subnormal`（丢失数字时还引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`），但从不引发 `Underflow`：在 `decimal32` 中，`quantize(1.55E-100, 1E-101)` 为 `1.6E-100`，并带 `Subnormal`、`Inexact` 和 `Rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:831
msgid "These round to an integer with the context rounding mode."
msgstr "这些函数以上下文舍入模式舍入到整数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:838
msgid "A value with exponent $\\ge 0$ is already an integer and is returned unchanged, even when it is longer than $p$ digits (a `clamp` context still folds its exponent down). A value with negative exponent is quantized to exponent 0 at a working precision of $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$, as decNumber does, so the integral part is never rounded to $p$ digits: at precision 3, `12345.6` gives `12346`. `to_integral_exact` raises `Inexact` and `Rounded` when digits are dropped and `to_integral_value` never does. In a subset context the operand is first rounded to $p$ digits, with `LostDigits`, like every other operand."
msgstr "指数 $\\ge 0$ 的值已经是整数，原样返回，即使它长于 $p$ 位（`clamp` 上下文仍会把其指数折叠下来）。指数为负的值以 $\\max(p, \\text{its digit count})$ 的工作精度量化到指数 0，与 decNumber 的做法相同，因此整数部分从不被舍入到 $p$ 位：在精度 3 下，`12345.6` 得到 `12346`。丢弃数字时 `to_integral_exact` 引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`，而 `to_integral_value` 从不引发。在子集上下文中，操作数与其他所有操作数一样，先被舍入到 $p$ 位并带 `LostDigits`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:864
msgid "These are the correctly rounded square root, exponential, natural logarithm and base-10 logarithm."
msgstr "这些是正确舍入的平方根、指数函数、自然对数和以 10 为底的对数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:874
msgid "They always round half to even, whatever the context rounding mode. Exact results: `sqrt` of a perfect square has the ideal exponent $\\lfloor e/2 \\rfloor$; `exp(0) = 1`; `ln(1) = 0`; `log10` of a power of ten $10^k$ is the integer $k$ (rounded if $k$ has more than $p$ digits). Every other finite result is inexact with $p$ digits. Domain: the square root and logarithms of a negative number are invalid, $\\ln 0 = \\log_{10} 0 = -\\infty$ (invalid in a subset context), $\\exp(-\\infty) = 0$, and $+\\infty$ maps to $+\\infty$ for all four. `exp`, `ln` and `log10` raise `InvalidContext` unless $p$, $e_{\\max}$ and $-e_{\\min}$ are at most 999,999, and also for a nonzero operand with more than 999,999 digits or an adjusted exponent above 999,999 or below $-1\\,999\\,997$. If the certified evaluation cannot decide the rounding within its refinement budget the result is NaN with `InvalidOperation`. In a subset context, `ln` reproduces the result of the classic reference algorithm, which can exceed the correctly rounded result by one unit in the last place."
msgstr "无论上下文舍入模式为何，它们总是按半值取偶舍入。精确结果：完全平方数的 `sqrt` 具有理想指数 $\\lfloor e/2 \\rfloor$；`exp(0) = 1`；`ln(1) = 0`；10 的幂 $10^k$ 的 `log10` 为整数 $k$（若 $k$ 多于 $p$ 位则舍入）。其他所有有限结果都是不精确的，具有 $p$ 位数字。定义域：负数的平方根和对数是无效的，$\\ln 0 = \\log_{10} 0 = -\\infty$（在子集上下文中无效），$\\exp(-\\infty) = 0$，且四者都将 $+\\infty$ 映射为 $+\\infty$。除非 $p$、$e_{\\max}$ 和 $-e_{\\min}$ 都不超过 999,999，否则 `exp`、`ln` 和 `log10` 会引发 `InvalidContext`；当非零操作数多于 999,999 位数字，或其调整后指数大于 999,999 或小于 $-1\\,999\\,997$ 时，也会如此。若认证求值无法在其细化预算内确定舍入，结果为带 `InvalidOperation` 的 NaN。在子集上下文中，`ln` 重现经典参考算法的结果，该结果可能比正确舍入的结果大一个末位单位。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:892
msgid "`power(x, y)` is $x^y$."
msgstr "`power(x, y)` 即 $x^y$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:898
msgid "For an integer $y$ the result is computed by binary powering with $p + \\operatorname{digits}(|y|) + 2$ working digits (one fewer in subset contexts) and then rounded with the context mode; an exact power that fits in $p$ digits is returned exactly with exponent $y \\cdot e_x$. For a non-integer $y$, $x$ must be positive (a negative base is invalid) and the result is certified to be correctly rounded *with the context rounding mode*; $y = 0.5$ is computed as a square root under the context rounding mode. The same context limits as for `exp` apply to non-integer exponents. Special cases follow GDA: $x^0 = 1$ (and $0^0$ is invalid), powers of $\\pm\\infty$ and $\\pm 0$ take their sign from the parity of an integer exponent, and $1^y = 1$. In a subset context $0^0$ is `1` and $0^{-n}$ is invalid instead of $\\infty$."
msgstr "对整数 $y$，结果通过二进制幂算法以 $p + \\operatorname{digits}(|y|) + 2$ 位工作精度（子集上下文中少一位）计算，然后以上下文模式舍入；能容纳于 $p$ 位的精确幂以指数 $y \\cdot e_x$ 精确返回。对非整数 $y$，$x$ 必须为正（负底数无效），并且结果经认证是*按上下文舍入模式*正确舍入的；$y = 0.5$ 按上下文舍入模式作为平方根计算。对非整数指数施加与 `exp` 相同的上下文限制。特殊情形遵循 GDA：$x^0 = 1$（而 $0^0$ 无效），$\\pm\\infty$ 和 $\\pm 0$ 的幂的符号取决于整数指数的奇偶性，且 $1^y = 1$。在子集上下文中，$0^0$ 为 `1`，$0^{-n}$ 是无效的，而不是 $\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:911
msgid "GDA treats every non-integer power as inexact, even when its exact value is representable: `power(4, 1.5)` at precision 5 is `8.0000` with `Inexact` and `Rounded` in every rounding mode. Such exact values (an exponent $a/q$ with a small denominator $q$ and $x^a$ a perfect $q$-th power) are decided before the certified loop, because they lie on the boundary of a directed rounding cell or on a midpoint, which the loop cannot certify. The specification allows an inexact power to be up to one unit in the last place in error; this package always returns the correctly rounded value, so `Down`, `Floor` and `ZeroFiveUp` give `8.0000` where libmpdec gives `7.9999`."
msgstr "GDA 把所有非整数次幂都视为不精确，即使其精确值可以表示：精度为 5 时，`power(4, 1.5)` 在每种舍入模式下都是 `8.0000`，并带有 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`。这类精确值（指数为 $a/q$，分母 $q$ 较小，且 $x^a$ 是完全 $q$ 次幂）在认证循环之前判定，因为它们落在定向舍入单元的边界上或中点上，循环无法认证。规范允许不精确的幂有至多一个末位单位的误差；本包始终返回正确舍入的值，因此 `Down`、`Floor` 和 `ZeroFiveUp` 给出 `8.0000`，而 libmpdec 给出 `7.9999`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:923
msgid "`reduce` rounds to the context and removes trailing zeros."
msgstr "`reduce` 舍入到上下文并去除尾随零。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:929
msgid "A zero becomes $0$ with exponent 0 (keeping its sign in extended contexts). In a clamped context the exponent is not raised above $e_{\\max} - p + 1$."
msgstr "零变为指数为 0 的 $0$（在扩展上下文中保留其符号）。在钳制上下文中，指数不会被提高到 $e_{\\max} - p + 1$ 以上。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:934
msgid "These scale by a power of ten and extract the adjusted exponent."
msgstr "这些函数按 10 的幂进行缩放，并提取调整后指数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:941
msgid "`scaleb(x, n)` returns $x \\cdot 10^n$ by adding $n$ to the exponent; $n$ must be an integer with exponent 0 and $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max} + p)$, otherwise the result is invalid. The result then goes through the shared finalization: a coefficient longer than $p$ digits is rounded, an overflow gives $\\pm\\infty$ or the largest finite number by rounding direction (in decimal32 under `Down`, `scaleb(9E+96, 1)` is `9.999999E+96`), and a zero result is clamped into the exponent range (`scaleb(0E+300, 400)` in decimal64 is `0E+369`). `logb(x)` returns $\\hat e$ as an integer; `logb(0)` is $-\\infty$ with `DivisionByZero` and `logb(±∞)` is $+\\infty$."
msgstr "`scaleb(x, n)` 通过将 $n$ 加到指数上返回 $x \\cdot 10^n$；$n$ 必须是指数为 0 且满足 $|n| \\le 2(e_{\\max} + p)$ 的整数，否则结果无效。之后结果经过共享的最终化例程：长于 $p$ 位的系数会被舍入，上溢按舍入方向给出 $\\pm\\infty$ 或最大有限数（在 decimal32 的 `Down` 下，`scaleb(9E+96, 1)` 为 `9.999999E+96`），零结果会被钳制到指数范围内（在 decimal64 中，`scaleb(0E+300, 400)` 为 `0E+369`）。`logb(x)` 以整数形式返回 $\\hat e$；`logb(0)` 为带 `DivisionByZero` 的 $-\\infty$，`logb(±∞)` 为 $+\\infty$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:953
msgid "These step to the adjacent representable value."
msgstr "这些函数步进到相邻的可表示值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:961
msgid "`next_plus` returns the smallest representable number greater than $x$ in the context and `next_minus` the largest smaller one; from a zero they step to $\\pm 10^{E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}}$, and past the largest finite number they reach $\\pm\\infty$. Neither raises flags for finite results. `next_toward(x, y)` steps from $x$ towards $y$ (returning $x$, with the sign of $y$ for zeros, when they compare equal) and raises `Overflow`, or `Underflow` and `Subnormal`, together with `Inexact` and `Rounded`, when the step leaves the normal range."
msgstr "`next_plus` 返回上下文中大于 $x$ 的最小可表示数，`next_minus` 返回比它小的最大可表示数；从零出发时它们步进到 $\\pm 10^{E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}}$，越过最大有限数时到达 $\\pm\\infty$。对有限结果，二者都不引发标志。`next_toward(x, y)` 从 $x$ 朝 $y$ 步进（当二者比较相等时返回 $x$，对零则取 $y$ 的符号）；当这一步离开正规范围时，引发 `Overflow`，或 `Underflow` 和 `Subnormal`，并同时引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:971
msgid "These are digit-wise logical operations on *logical operands*: non-negative integers with exponent 0 whose digits are all 0 or 1."
msgstr "这些是对*逻辑操作数*（指数为 0、各位均为 0 或 1 的非负整数）的逐位逻辑运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:981
msgid "Each operand is read as exactly $p$ digits: shorter operands are padded with leading zeros and only the low $p$ digits of longer ones are used. `logical_invert` inverts all $p$ digits. Any other operand makes the result invalid."
msgstr "每个操作数都恰好按 $p$ 位读取：较短的操作数以前导零填充，较长的只使用其低 $p$ 位。`logical_invert` 对全部 $p$ 位取反。任何其他操作数都会使结果无效。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:988
msgid "These move the coefficient digits of $x$ by $n$ places within a window of $p$ digits."
msgstr "这些函数在 $p$ 位的窗口内将 $x$ 的系数数字移动 $n$ 位。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:996
msgid "$n$ must be an integer with exponent 0 and $|n| \\le p$, otherwise the result is invalid. A positive $n$ moves digits to the left. `shift` drops the digits that leave the window and fills with zeros; `rotate` moves them round to the other end. The exponent and sign are unchanged; an infinite $x$ is returned unchanged."
msgstr "$n$ 必须是指数为 0 且满足 $|n| \\le p$ 的整数，否则结果无效。正的 $n$ 将数字向左移动。`shift` 丢弃移出窗口的数字并以零填充；`rotate` 将它们循环移到另一端。指数与符号不变；无穷的 $x$ 原样返回。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1004
msgid "These compare two values."
msgstr "这些函数比较两个值。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1013
msgid "`compare` returns the decimal $-1$, $0$ or $1$ by numeric value ($-0 = +0$, $2.50 = 2.5$), or a quiet NaN when an operand is a NaN (raising `InvalidOperation` only for a signaling NaN). `compare_signal` is the same but raises `InvalidOperation` for any NaN. `compare_total` returns $-1$, $0$ or $1$ in the GDA total order: by sign bit first, then, for positive values, $\\text{finite} < \\infty < \\text{sNaN} < \\text{NaN}$, finite values by numeric value and then by exponent (`2.50` < `2.5`), NaNs by payload; the order is reversed for negative values. `compare_total_magnitude` applies the total order to the absolute values. The total orders never raise flags."
msgstr "`compare` 按数值返回十进制值 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$（$-0 = +0$，$2.50 = 2.5$），当某个操作数为 NaN 时返回静默 NaN（仅对信号 NaN 引发 `InvalidOperation`）。`compare_signal` 与之相同，但对任何 NaN 都引发 `InvalidOperation`。`compare_total` 按 GDA 全序返回 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$：先比较符号位，然后对正值有 $\\text{finite} < \\infty < \\text{sNaN} < \\text{NaN}$，有限值先按数值、再按指数排序（`2.50` < `2.5`），NaN 按载荷排序；对负值则顺序相反。`compare_total_magnitude` 对绝对值应用该全序。全序比较从不引发标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1025
msgid "These are the GDA max and min operations, on values or on magnitudes."
msgstr "这些是 GDA 的 max 与 min 运算，作用于值或其大小。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1034
msgid "A single quiet NaN is ignored in favour of the number; two quiet NaNs give the first; a signaling NaN gives a quiet NaN with `InvalidOperation`. Values that compare equal are separated by the total order (so `max(2.5, 2.50)` is `2.5`); in a subset context the first operand is chosen instead. The selected operand is then rounded to the context as by `plus`, except that in an extended context a zero keeps its sign (`max(-0, -0)` is `-0` in every mode, while `plus(-0)` is `0` unless the rounding is `Floor`)."
msgstr "单个静默 NaN 会被忽略而取数值；两个静默 NaN 时取第一个；信号 NaN 产生带 `InvalidOperation` 的静默 NaN。比较相等的值由全序加以区分（因此 `max(2.5, 2.50)` 为 `2.5`）；在子集上下文中则改为选择第一个操作数。所选操作数随后像 `plus` 那样被舍入到上下文，只是在扩展上下文中零会保留其符号（`max(-0, -0)` 在每种模式下都为 `-0`，而 `plus(-0)` 除非舍入模式为 `Floor`，否则为 `0`）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1044
msgid "These classify values under a context; they never raise conditions, so they always return `Completed` with the input context."
msgstr "这些函数在上下文下对值进行分类；它们从不引发条件，因此总是返回带输入上下文的 `Completed`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1054
msgid "They wrap [`Decimal::class_name`](#decimalis_normal-decimalis_subnormal-decimalclass_name), `Decimal::is_normal`, `Decimal::is_subnormal` and [`Decimal::same_quantum`](#decimalsame_quantum)."
msgstr "它们包装 [`Decimal::class_name`](#decimalis_normal-decimalis_subnormal-decimalclass_name)、`Decimal::is_normal`、`Decimal::is_subnormal` 和 [`Decimal::same_quantum`](#decimalsame_quantum)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1084
msgid "Ordering and plain arithmetic on values"
msgstr "值上的排序与普通算术"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1086
msgid "These methods and operators take no context. They never signal and never trap; use the GDA functions when flags matter."
msgstr "这些方法和运算符不接受上下文。它们从不发出信号，也从不触发陷阱；当标志重要时，请使用 GDA 函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1091
msgid "`compare` is a three-way numeric comparison that is total on all values; `compare_checked` refuses NaNs."
msgstr "`compare` 是对所有值都完全的三路数值比较；`compare_checked` 拒绝 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1101
msgid "`compare` orders finite values and infinities numerically with $-0 = +0$ and places every NaN equal to every other NaN and above every number, so it is a total preorder and sorting never aborts. `compare_checked` returns `Err(unordered_comparison)` when either operand is a NaN."
msgstr "`compare` 按数值对有限值和无穷排序，其中 $-0 = +0$，并使每个 NaN 与其他所有 NaN 相等且大于所有数，因此它是全预序，排序永不中止。当任一操作数为 NaN 时，`compare_checked` 返回 `Err(unordered_comparison)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1108
msgid "These are the `Eq` and `Compare` operator methods."
msgstr "这些是 `Eq` 与 `Compare` 的运算符方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1120
msgid "`==` is numeric equality on finite values ($2.50 = 2.5$, $-0 = +0$), sign equality on infinities, and true for any two NaNs. `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=` follow `compare`."
msgstr "`==` 对有限值是数值相等（$2.50 = 2.5$，$-0 = +0$），对无穷是符号相等，对任意两个 NaN 为真。`<`、`<=`、`>`、`>=` 遵循 `compare`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1126
msgid "These are the GDA total orders as plain methods, returning $-1$, $0$ or $1$."
msgstr "这些是以普通方法形式提供的 GDA 全序，返回 $-1$、$0$ 或 $1$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1133
msgid "They agree with the package functions [`compare_total`, `compare_total_magnitude`](#compare-compare_signal-compare_total-compare_total_magnitude) (without subset operand rounding)."
msgstr "它们与包函数 [`compare_total`、`compare_total_magnitude`](#compare-compare_signal-compare_total-compare_total_magnitude) 一致（但不进行子集操作数舍入）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1139
msgid "These select between values without rounding."
msgstr "这些函数在值之间进行选择，不做舍入。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1148
msgid "`min` and `max` return the other operand when one is a quiet NaN, the first NaN (quieted) when a signaling NaN is involved or both are NaN, and the receiver when the two compare equal. `clamp` returns `min` or `max` when the value lies outside $[\\min, \\max]$ and the value otherwise (a NaN value is returned unchanged); it aborts when a bound is NaN or `min > max`, where `clamp_checked` returns `Err(domain_error)`."
msgstr "当一个操作数为静默 NaN 时，`min` 和 `max` 返回另一个操作数；涉及信号 NaN 或两者均为 NaN 时，返回（静默化的）第一个 NaN；两者比较相等时返回接收者。当值位于 $[\\min, \\max]$ 之外时，`clamp` 返回 `min` 或 `max`，否则返回该值（NaN 值原样返回）；当某个边界为 NaN 或 `min > max` 时它会中止，而 `clamp_checked` 在这些情形下返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1157
msgid "These implement `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` and unary `-` without a context."
msgstr "这些函数在无上下文的情况下实现 `+`、`-`、`*`、`/` 以及一元 `-`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1171
msgid "Let $P$ be the larger precision attribute of the operands. `+`, `-` and `/` round half to even to $P$ digits and then remove trailing zeros; `*` returns the exact product (it is never rounded) with attribute $P$. A result whose adjusted exponent would exceed $2^{31}-1$ is a signed infinity, and one that needs an exponent below $-2^{31}$ is rounded half to even to that exponent, possibly to a signed zero (`1E+1500000000 * 1E+1500000000` is `inf`). Special values follow IEEE rules without signals: NaN operands give a quiet NaN, $\\infty - \\infty$, $0 \\times \\infty$, $0/0$ and $\\infty/\\infty$ give NaN, $x/0$ gives a signed infinity and $x/\\infty$ gives $+0$. `neg` is [`Decimal::neg`](#decimalneg-decimalabs-decimalcopy-decimalcopy_abs-decimalcopy_negate-decimalcopy_sign)."
msgstr "设 $P$ 为操作数中较大的精度属性。`+`、`-` 和 `/` 按半值取偶舍入到 $P$ 位，然后去除尾随零；`*` 返回精确乘积（从不舍入），其属性为 $P$。调整指数将超过 $2^{31}-1$ 的结果为带符号的无穷，需要低于 $-2^{31}$ 的指数的结果按半值取偶舍入到该指数，可能得到带符号的零（`1E+1500000000 * 1E+1500000000` 为 `inf`）。特殊值遵循 IEEE 规则但不发出信号：NaN 操作数产生静默 NaN，$\\infty - \\infty$、$0 \\times \\infty$、$0/0$ 和 $\\infty/\\infty$ 产生 NaN，$x/0$ 产生带符号的无穷，$x/\\infty$ 产生 $+0$。`neg` 即 [`Decimal::neg`](#decimalneg-decimalabs-decimalcopy-decimalcopy_abs-decimalcopy_negate-decimalcopy_sign)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1184
msgid "These are checked conveniences that use a default context of the larger operand precision."
msgstr "这些是便利的 checked 函数，使用以较大操作数精度为精度的默认上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1192
msgid "`div_checked` divides with `DecimalContext::new(precision=P)` and returns `Err(division_by_zero)` for a zero divisor and `Err(domain_error)` for an invalid division. `sqrt` takes the square root at the value's own precision attribute and returns `Err(domain_error)` for negative operands."
msgstr "`div_checked` 用 `DecimalContext::new(precision=P)` 做除法，对零除数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，对无效除法返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`sqrt` 以值自身的精度属性求平方根，对负操作数返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1213
msgid "The status-free context layer"
msgstr "无状态上下文层"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1215
msgid "The GDA functions are thin wrappers over the methods below: each converts the `GdaContext` policy to a `DecimalContext`, calls one method, and feeds the returned `DecimalFlags` to [trap selection](#trap-selection). You can call the layer directly when you want per-operation flags without sticky status, or the IEEE-style extras it adds (IEEE 754-2019 `minimum`/`maximum`, a choice of tininess detection). The [`decimal`](decimal.md) package, not this layer, is the supported IEEE 754 implementation."
msgstr "GDA 函数是对以下方法的薄包装：每个 GDA 函数都将 `GdaContext` 策略转换为 `DecimalContext`，调用一个方法，并将返回的 `DecimalFlags` 交给[陷阱选择](#trap-selection)。当你需要不带粘滞状态的逐运算标志，或需要该层额外提供的 IEEE 风格功能（IEEE 754-2019 `minimum`/`maximum`、可选择的微小性检测方式）时，可以直接调用该层。受支持的 IEEE 754 实现是 [`decimal`](decimal.md) 包，而不是这一层。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1223
msgid "Each `Decimal` method of this layer whose name ends in `_ctx`, or that takes a `DecimalContext` and shares its name with a GDA function, is the status-free form of that function: it rounds with the given `DecimalContext` and returns `(result, DecimalFlags)`, and the result and flags are exactly those the GDA function reports in its outcome. (The GDA functions `parse`, `add`, `subtract`, `multiply` and `fma` first try a fast path for small exact integer operands; it is taken only when it produces the same value with no flags.) The exceptions are `sqrt_ctx`, `exp_ctx`, `ln_ctx` and `log10_ctx`, which the GDA functions call with a half-even copy of the context, and the IEEE extras at the end of this section, which have no GDA form."
msgstr "该层中名称以 `_ctx` 结尾、或接受 `DecimalContext` 且与某个 GDA 函数同名的每个 `Decimal` 方法，都是该函数的无状态形式：它以给定的 `DecimalContext` 舍入并返回 `(result, DecimalFlags)`，其结果和标志与该 GDA 函数在其结果中报告的完全相同。（GDA 函数 `parse`、`add`、`subtract`、`multiply` 和 `fma` 会先为小的精确整数操作数尝试一条快速路径；仅当它得到相同的值且没有标志时才会采用。）例外是 `sqrt_ctx`、`exp_ctx`、`ln_ctx` 和 `log10_ctx`（GDA 函数以上下文的半值取偶副本调用它们），以及本节末尾没有 GDA 形式的 IEEE 附加函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1236
msgid "`DecimalContext` is a status-free context: precision, two views of the rounding mode, exponent range, clamp, extended and tininess detection."
msgstr "`DecimalContext` 是无状态的上下文：精度、舍入模式的两种视图、指数范围、clamp、extended 以及微小性检测。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1245
msgid "The fields are private; build contexts with the constructors below and read them with the accessors."
msgstr "字段是私有的；请用下面的构造函数构建上下文，并用访问器读取。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1250
msgid "These build a context from explicit parameters."
msgstr "这些函数由显式参数构建上下文。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1257
msgid "Defaults are those of `GdaContext::new` with `rounding=ToNearestEven` and `tininess=BeforeRounding`. The rounding actually used is `decimal_rounding`, which defaults to the translation of `rounding` (`DecimalRoundingMode::from_arithmetic`); pass `decimal_rounding` to select `HalfUp`, `HalfDown` or `ZeroFiveUp`. If both are passed and disagree, `decimal_rounding` wins and `rounding()` keeps reporting the other value. `new` aborts and `try_new` returns `Err(domain_error)` for `precision <= 0` or `e_min > e_max`."
msgstr "默认值与 `GdaContext::new` 相同，并取 `rounding=ToNearestEven` 和 `tininess=BeforeRounding`。实际使用的舍入是 `decimal_rounding`，其默认值为 `rounding` 的转换结果（`DecimalRoundingMode::from_arithmetic`）；传入 `decimal_rounding` 可选择 `HalfUp`、`HalfDown` 或 `ZeroFiveUp`。若两者都传入且不一致，以 `decimal_rounding` 为准，而 `rounding()` 仍报告另一个值。对 `precision <= 0` 或 `e_min > e_max`，`new` 中止，`try_new` 返回 `Err(domain_error)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1268
msgid "These return preset contexts or translate an `ArithmeticContext`."
msgstr "这些函数返回预设上下文或转换 `ArithmeticContext`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1278
msgid "`exact()` is the unbounded-precision context (precision 0, exponent range $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$, half-even): results are never rounded to a precision. `decimal32`/`64`/`128` match the `GdaContext` presets. `from_arithmetic_context` copies precision, rounding, the optional exponent bounds (default $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$) and clamp, and always selects `extended=true` and `BeforeRounding`. The default is the full GDA range, not a choice of bounds for the mathematical functions: `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and non-integral `power` need bounds within $\\pm 999\\,999$, so under a context translated from an `ArithmeticContext` without `e_min` and `e_max` they return NaN with `invalid_context`."
msgstr "`exact()` 是精度无界的上下文（精度 0，指数范围 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$，半值取偶）：结果从不舍入到某个精度。`decimal32`/`64`/`128` 与 `GdaContext` 的预设一致。`from_arithmetic_context` 复制精度、舍入、可选的指数边界（默认 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$）以及 clamp，并总是选择 `extended=true` 和 `BeforeRounding`。该默认值是完整的 GDA 范围，并不是为数学函数选定的边界：`exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和非整数 `power` 要求边界在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内，因此在由未设置 `e_min` 和 `e_max` 的 `ArithmeticContext` 转换而来的上下文下，它们返回 NaN 并引发 `invalid_context`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1291
msgid "These read the parameters."
msgstr "这些函数读取参数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1304
msgid "`precision()` is 0 for `exact()`."
msgstr "对 `exact()`，`precision()` 为 0。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1308
msgid "These return a copy with one parameter replaced."
msgstr "这些函数返回替换了一个参数的副本。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1315
msgid "`with_rounding` sets both views of the rounding mode, so it cannot select `HalfUp`, `HalfDown` or `ZeroFiveUp`. The GDA functions always use `BeforeRounding` tininess."
msgstr "`with_rounding` 同时设置舍入模式的两种视图，因此无法选择 `HalfUp`、`HalfDown` 或 `ZeroFiveUp`。GDA 函数总是使用 `BeforeRounding` 微小性判定。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1321
msgid "`DecimalRoundingMode` is the same eight-mode set as `GdaRoundingMode`, for the status-free layer."
msgstr "`DecimalRoundingMode` 是与 `GdaRoundingMode` 相同的八种模式集合，供无状态层使用。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1339
msgid "These translate between the decimal modes and the five modes of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`."
msgstr "这些函数在十进制模式与 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的五种模式之间转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1347
msgid "`from_arithmetic` maps `ToNearestEven`, `TowardZero`, `TowardPositive`, `TowardNegative`, `AwayFromZero` to `HalfEven`, `Down`, `Ceiling`, `Floor`, `Up`; `to_arithmetic` is its inverse and returns `None` for `HalfUp`, `HalfDown` and `ZeroFiveUp`, so `to_arithmetic(from_arithmetic(m)) == Some(m)` for every `m`."
msgstr "`from_arithmetic` 将 `ToNearestEven`、`TowardZero`、`TowardPositive`、`TowardNegative`、`AwayFromZero` 映射为 `HalfEven`、`Down`、`Ceiling`、`Floor`、`Up`；`to_arithmetic` 是其逆映射，对 `HalfUp`、`HalfDown` 和 `ZeroFiveUp` 返回 `None`，因此对每个 `m` 都有 `to_arithmetic(from_arithmetic(m)) == Some(m)`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1355
msgid "`DecimalTininessDetection` chooses when a result counts as tiny for `Underflow` and `Subnormal`."
msgstr "`DecimalTininessDetection` 决定就 `Underflow` 和 `Subnormal` 而言结果何时算作微小。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1365
msgid "`BeforeRounding` tests the adjusted exponent of the exact result against $e_{\\min}$, as GDA does. `AfterRounding` is the IEEE 754 after-rounding rule: it tests the adjusted exponent of the exact result rounded to $p$ digits with the context rounding mode and an unbounded exponent range. The choice changes only which inexact results count as tiny, never the value, and the two rules differ only for results just below $10^{e_{\\min}}$. With $p = 3$ and $e_{\\min} = 0$, `0.9951` rounds to `0.995` at three digits, so it is tiny and the result `1.00` (rounded at $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = -2$) raises `Underflow` and `Subnormal`; `0.99951` rounds to `1.00` at three digits and raises only `Inexact` and `Rounded`."
msgstr "`BeforeRounding` 像 GDA 一样，将精确结果的调整后指数与 $e_{\\min}$ 比较。`AfterRounding` 是 IEEE 754 的舍入后规则：它检验以上下文舍入模式、在无界指数范围下舍入到 $p$ 位后的精确结果的调整后指数。这一选择只改变哪些不精确结果算作微小，从不改变值，并且两条规则仅对略低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 的结果有所不同。取 $p = 3$、$e_{\\min} = 0$，`0.9951` 在三位数字下舍入为 `0.995`，因此它是微小的，结果 `1.00`（在 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = -2$ 处舍入）引发 `Underflow` 和 `Subnormal`；`0.99951` 在三位数字下舍入为 `1.00`，只引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1397
msgid "`DecimalSignal` names the thirteen conditions of the status-free layer, with the same members as `GdaSignal`."
msgstr "`DecimalSignal` 命名无状态层的十三种条件，其成员与 `GdaSignal` 相同。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1420
msgid "`DecimalFlags` is the set of conditions raised by one status-free operation."
msgstr "`DecimalFlags` 是一次无状态运算所引发的条件的集合。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1440
msgid "The fields are public for reading. There is no sticky status in this layer: each call returns only its own flags."
msgstr "字段对读取公开。该层没有粘滞状态：每次调用只返回其自身的标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1445
msgid "These build and query flag sets."
msgstr "这些函数构建并查询标志集。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1454
msgid "`new` is the empty set and `combine` the union. Unlike `GdaFlags`, `DecimalFlags::contains(InvalidOperation)` reads only the `invalid_operation` field (the layer sets it together with `division_undefined` and `division_impossible`, but not with `conversion_syntax` or `invalid_context`). `has_error` is true when any of `invalid_operation`, `conversion_syntax`, `division_by_zero`, `division_undefined`, `division_impossible` or `invalid_context` is set, so a malformed literal read with `Decimal::from_string_ctx` counts as an error."
msgstr "`new` 是空集，`combine` 是并集。与 `GdaFlags` 不同，`DecimalFlags::contains(InvalidOperation)` 只读取 `invalid_operation` 字段（该层会将它与 `division_undefined` 和 `division_impossible` 一起设置，但不会与 `conversion_syntax` 或 `invalid_context` 一起设置）。只要 `invalid_operation`、`conversion_syntax`、`division_by_zero`、`division_undefined`、`division_impossible` 或 `invalid_context` 中任一被设置，`has_error` 即为真，因此用 `Decimal::from_string_ctx` 读取的格式错误的字面量也算作错误。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1465
msgid "These are the forms of [`apply`, `plus`, `minus`, `abs`](#apply-plus-minus-abs)."
msgstr "这些是 [`apply`、`plus`、`minus`、`abs`](#apply-plus-minus-abs) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1476
msgid "These are the forms of [`add`, `subtract`, `multiply`, `divide`, `fma`](#add-subtract-multiply-divide-fma)."
msgstr "这些是 [`add`、`subtract`、`multiply`、`divide`、`fma`](#add-subtract-multiply-divide-fma) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1489
msgid "These are the forms of [`divide_integer`, `remainder`, `remainder_near`](#divide_integer-remainder-remainder_near)."
msgstr "这些是 [`divide_integer`、`remainder`、`remainder_near`](#divide_integer-remainder-remainder_near) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1500
msgid "These are the forms of [`quantize`, `rescale`](#quantize-rescale) and [`to_integral_exact`, `to_integral_value`](#to_integral_exact-to_integral_value)."
msgstr "这些是 [`quantize`、`rescale`](#quantize-rescale) 和 [`to_integral_exact`、`to_integral_value`](#to_integral_exact-to_integral_value) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1512
msgid "These are the forms of [`reduce`](#reduce) and [`scaleb`, `logb`](#scaleb-logb)."
msgstr "这些是 [`reduce`](#reduce) 和 [`scaleb`、`logb`](#scaleb-logb) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1522
msgid "These are the forms of [`next_plus`, `next_minus`, `next_toward`](#next_plus-next_minus-next_toward)."
msgstr "这些是 [`next_plus`、`next_minus`、`next_toward`](#next_plus-next_minus-next_toward) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1533
msgid "These are the forms of the [logical operations](#logical_and-logical_or-logical_xor-logical_invert) and of [`shift`, `rotate`](#shift-rotate)."
msgstr "这些是[逻辑运算](#logical_and-logical_or-logical_xor-logical_invert)以及 [`shift`、`rotate`](#shift-rotate) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1548
msgid "These are the forms of the [GDA comparisons](#compare-compare_signal-compare_total-compare_total_magnitude)."
msgstr "这些是 [GDA 比较](#compare-compare_signal-compare_total-compare_total_magnitude)对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1560
msgid "These are the forms of [`max`, `min`, `max_mag`, `min_mag`](#max-min-max_mag-min_mag)."
msgstr "这些是 [`max`、`min`、`max_mag`、`min_mag`](#max-min-max_mag-min_mag) 对应的形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1571
msgid "These are the status-free elementary functions."
msgstr "这些是无状态的初等函数。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1581
msgid "Unlike the GDA functions `sqrt`, `exp`, `ln` and `log10`, these methods round with the context's own rounding mode (the GDA functions pass them a half-even copy of the context); `power_ctx` is exactly the GDA `power`. A certification failure gives NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "与 GDA 函数 `sqrt`、`exp`、`ln` 和 `log10` 不同，这些方法以上下文自身的舍入模式进行舍入（GDA 函数传给它们的是上下文的半值取偶副本）；`power_ctx` 即 GDA 的 `power`。认证失败时得到带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1588
msgid "These are the same functions with certification failures reported as errors."
msgstr "这些是同样的函数，但将认证失败作为错误报告。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1597
msgid "When the refinement budget (twelve evaluations at growing working precision) is exhausted without certifying the rounding, they return `Err(certification_failure(...))` with the operation name, target precision, final working precision and refinement count. Domain errors are still reported as NaN plus flags inside `Ok`."
msgstr "当细化预算（在逐步提高的工作精度下进行十二次求值）耗尽仍无法认证舍入时，它们返回 `Err(certification_failure(...))`，其中包含运算名称、目标精度、最终工作精度和细化次数。定义域错误仍在 `Ok` 中以 NaN 加标志的形式报告。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1604
msgid "These are aliases kept for the IEEE vocabulary."
msgstr "这些是为沿用 IEEE 术语而保留的别名。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1611
msgid "`normalize_ctx` is `reduce_ctx`; `remainder_ctx` is the IEEE remainder, which is `remainder_near`."
msgstr "`normalize_ctx` 即 `reduce_ctx`；`remainder_ctx` 是 IEEE 余数，即 `remainder_near`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1616
msgid "These are the IEEE 754-2019 `minimum`, `maximum`, `minimumNumber`, `maximumNumber`, `minimumMagnitude`, `maximumMagnitude`, `minimumMagnitudeNumber` and `maximumMagnitudeNumber` operations."
msgstr "这些是 IEEE 754-2019 的 `minimum`、`maximum`、`minimumNumber`、`maximumNumber`、`minimumMagnitude`、`maximumMagnitude`、`minimumMagnitudeNumber` 和 `maximumMagnitudeNumber` 运算。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1631
msgid "The plain variants return the first NaN operand, quieted, when either operand is a NaN; the `number` variants return the number when exactly one operand is a NaN. A signaling NaN raises `invalid_operation` in both. Values that compare equal are separated by the total order (so `maximum_ctx(-0, +0)` is `+0`). The selected operand is then rounded to the context. These are not GDA operations and have no `GdaContext` form."
msgstr "普通变体在任一操作数为 NaN 时返回第一个 NaN 操作数（经静默化）；`number` 变体在恰有一个操作数为 NaN 时返回数值。两者中信号 NaN 都会引发 `invalid_operation`。比较相等的值由全序加以区分（因此 `maximum_ctx(-0, +0)` 为 `+0`）。所选操作数随后被舍入到上下文。这些不是 GDA 运算，没有 `GdaContext` 形式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1640
msgid "These are shorter names for the magnitude variants above."
msgstr "这些是上述绝对值变体的简短名称。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1649
msgid "Each `*_mag_ctx` method is the `*_magnitude_ctx` method of the same prefix."
msgstr "每个 `*_mag_ctx` 方法即前缀相同的 `*_magnitude_ctx` 方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1679
msgid "`GdaInterchangeFormat` names the three IEEE 754 decimal interchange formats."
msgstr "`GdaInterchangeFormat` 指定三种 IEEE 754 十进制交换格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1691
msgid "`context` returns the `DecimalContext` preset of the format."
msgstr "`context` 返回该格式的 `DecimalContext` 预设。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1697
msgid "The presets are `DecimalContext::decimal32()`, `decimal64()` and `decimal128()`: precision 7, 16 or 34, half-even, clamped."
msgstr "预设为 `DecimalContext::decimal32()`、`decimal64()` 和 `decimal128()`：精度分别为 7、16、34，半值取偶，启用钳制。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1702
msgid "`GdaInterchange` is a decimal32, decimal64 or decimal128 bit pattern in the densely packed decimal (DPD) encoding."
msgstr "`GdaInterchange` 是采用密集压缩十进制（DPD）编码的 decimal32、decimal64 或 decimal128 比特模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1713
msgid "`format` returns the format of the pattern."
msgstr "`format` 返回该比特模式的格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1721
msgid "These encode and decode values."
msgstr "这些函数对值进行编码和解码。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1729
msgid "`from_decimal` rounds the value to the format (reporting the rounding, overflow, underflow and clamping flags) and encodes it. `to_decimal` decodes exactly, keeping the exponent; `to_decimal_ctx` also reports `subnormal` for a subnormal value."
msgstr "`from_decimal` 将值舍入到该格式（报告舍入、上溢、下溢和钳制标志）并对其编码。`to_decimal` 精确解码并保留指数；`to_decimal_ctx` 对次正规值还会报告 `subnormal`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1736
msgid "These convert between a bit pattern and its hexadecimal text."
msgstr "这些函数在比特模式与其十六进制文本之间转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1743
msgid "The text is `#` (optional on input) followed by exactly 8, 16 or 32 hexadecimal digits; surrounding spaces are ignored and any other input gives `None`. `to_hex` prints `#` and uppercase digits."
msgstr "文本为 `#`（输入时可选）后跟恰好 8、16 或 32 个十六进制数字；两侧空格被忽略，其他任何输入都得到 `None`。`to_hex` 打印 `#` 和大写数字。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1749
msgid "These canonicalize an encoding."
msgstr "这些函数将编码规范化。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1756
msgid "`canonical` decodes and re-encodes the pattern, which replaces non-canonical declets and payloads with their canonical form; `is_canonical` tests whether that changes the pattern."
msgstr "`canonical` 对比特模式解码后重新编码，从而将非规范的 declet 和载荷替换为其规范形式；`is_canonical` 检测这样做是否会改变比特模式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1762
msgid "These operate on the sign bit of the encoding without decoding it."
msgstr "这些函数直接操作编码的符号位，而无需解码。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1771
msgid "`copy_sign` aborts when the two patterns have different formats."
msgstr "当两个比特模式的格式不同时，`copy_sign` 会中止。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1775
msgid "These are the same conversions directly between `Decimal` and hexadecimal text."
msgstr "这些是直接在 `Decimal` 与十六进制文本之间进行的同样转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1801
msgid "These are the derived `Eq` methods of the enums, flag sets and status-free context."
msgstr "这些是枚举、标志集和无状态上下文的派生 `Eq` 方法。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1827
msgid "They compare field by field (or variant by variant), so two contexts are equal exactly when all their parameters agree; `GdaContext` has no `Eq`. `Decimal` has its own numeric `Eq`, documented under [`Decimal::equal`](#decimalequal-decimalnot_equal-decimalop_lt-decimalop_le-decimalop_gt-decimalop_ge)."
msgstr "它们逐字段（或逐变体）比较，因此两个上下文相等当且仅当它们的所有参数都一致；`GdaContext` 没有 `Eq`。`Decimal` 有自己的数值 `Eq`，见 [`Decimal::equal`](#decimalequal-decimalnot_equal-decimalop_lt-decimalop_le-decimalop_gt-decimalop_ge)。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1834
msgid "These implement the `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` contextual traits on top of the status-free layer."
msgstr "这些函数在无状态层之上实现 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的 contextual trait。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1854
msgid "Each converts the context with `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context`, calls the `_ctx` method, and returns `Err(unsupported)` when the operation raises `invalid_context`, `Err(division_by_zero)` when `division_by_zero` is raised, `Err(domain_error)` for any other error flag, and otherwise `Ok` with the value and diagnostics `inexact`, `rounded`, `overflow`, `underflow`, `subnormal` and `clamped`. The rounding is one of the five `ArithmeticContext` modes, and `sqrt_contextual` and `exp_contextual` round with it (not half-even as the GDA functions do)."
msgstr "每个函数都用 `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` 转换上下文，调用 `_ctx` 方法：若运算引发了 `invalid_context` 则返回 `Err(unsupported)`，若引发了 `division_by_zero` 则返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`，若引发了其他错误标志则返回 `Err(domain_error)`，否则返回带值及诊断信息 `inexact`、`rounded`、`overflow`、`underflow`、`subnormal` 和 `clamped` 的 `Ok`。舍入是 `ArithmeticContext` 的五种模式之一，`sqrt_contextual` 和 `exp_contextual` 以该模式舍入（而不像 GDA 函数那样采用半值取偶）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1863
msgid "`exp_contextual` requires the caller to set the exponent bounds. Like the GDA `exp`, it is defined only for precision, $e_{\\max}$ and $-e_{\\min}$ of at most $999\\,999$, and an `ArithmeticContext` without `e_min` or `e_max` is not given bounds by default: it translates to the full range $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$, which is an invalid context for `exp`. The result is `Err(unsupported)` whose message starts with `invalid context:`, states the limit and names the bounds the `ArithmeticContext` does not set, whatever the operand (as `exp(-Infinity)` is `Invalid_context` in the decTest row `expx901`). `ArithmeticContext::new(16)` therefore fails, while `ArithmeticContext::new(16, e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999)` and `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` work."
msgstr "`exp_contextual` 要求调用者设置指数边界。与 GDA 的 `exp` 一样，它只对精度、$e_{\\max}$ 和 $-e_{\\min}$ 都不超过 $999\\,999$ 的上下文有定义；未设置 `e_min` 或 `e_max` 的 `ArithmeticContext` 不会得到默认边界，而是转换为完整范围 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$，这对 `exp` 是无效上下文。此时结果为 `Err(unsupported)`，其消息以 `invalid context:` 开头，说明该限制，并指出 `ArithmeticContext` 未设置的边界；与操作数无关（如同 decTest 行 `expx901` 中 `exp(-Infinity)` 为 `Invalid_context`）。因此 `ArithmeticContext::new(16)` 会失败，而 `ArithmeticContext::new(16, e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999)` 和 `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` 可以正常工作。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1896
msgid "These implement `NumericFormatContextual`: they describe the number format of an `ArithmeticContext`."
msgstr "这些函数实现 `NumericFormatContextual`：它们描述 `ArithmeticContext` 的数值格式。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1909
msgid "`epsilon_contextual` is $\\operatorname{next\\_plus}(1) - 1 = 10^{1-p}$, `min_normal_contextual` is $10^{e_{\\min}}$ and `max_finite_contextual` is $(10^p - 1) \\cdot 10^{e_{\\max} - p + 1}$."
msgstr "`epsilon_contextual` 为 $\\operatorname{next\\_plus}(1) - 1 = 10^{1-p}$，`min_normal_contextual` 为 $10^{e_{\\min}}$，`max_finite_contextual` 为 $(10^p - 1) \\cdot 10^{e_{\\max} - p + 1}$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1915
msgid "These implement the checked traits of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`: they return `Result` instead of flags."
msgstr "这些函数实现 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的 checked trait：它们返回 `Result` 而不是标志。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1930
msgid "`parse_checked` is `Decimal::parse` at the context precision; it rounds half to even and ignores the context's rounding mode and exponent bounds. `sqrt_checked` returns `Err(domain_error)` for negative operands. `pow_int_checked` and `pow_nat_checked` call `power_ctx` with the integer exponent converted exactly (with at least ten digits, which hold every accepted exponent), so at precision 7 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` is `-1`; they return `Err(division_by_zero)` for a zero base with a negative exponent, `Err(unsupported)` with an `invalid context:` message when `power` raises `invalid_context` (a positive exponent above 999,999,999 under a context without exponent bounds within $\\pm 999\\,999$, as in the decTest rows `powx1183` and `powx1184`), `Err(domain_error)` for other invalid results, and `pow_nat_checked` returns `Err(unsupported)` for exponents above 999,999,999. `DivChecked::div_checked` divides under the given context with the same errors as [`Decimal::div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-decimalsqrt)."
msgstr "`parse_checked` 即以上下文精度进行的 `Decimal::parse`；它按半值取偶舍入，并忽略上下文的舍入模式和指数边界。`sqrt_checked` 对负操作数返回 `Err(domain_error)`。`pow_int_checked` 和 `pow_nat_checked` 以精确转换的整数指数（至少十位数字，足以容纳每个可接受的指数）调用 `power_ctx`，因此精度为 7 时 `(-1).pow_int_checked(12345679, ctx)` 为 `-1`；它们对零底数配负指数返回 `Err(division_by_zero)`；当 `power` 引发 `invalid_context` 时（在指数边界不在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内的上下文下使用大于 999,999,999 的正指数，如 decTest 行 `powx1183` 和 `powx1184`）返回带 `invalid context:` 消息的 `Err(unsupported)`；对其他无效结果返回 `Err(domain_error)`；且 `pow_nat_checked` 对大于 999,999,999 的指数返回 `Err(unsupported)`。`DivChecked::div_checked` 在给定上下文下做除法，其错误与 [`Decimal::div_checked`](#decimaldiv_checked-decimalsqrt) 相同。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1946
msgid "`Decimal::from_natural`, `Decimal::from_integer` and the `luna-generic` algebra traits"
msgstr "`Decimal::from_natural`、`Decimal::from_integer` 与 `luna-generic` 代数 trait"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1948
msgid "These let generic algebra code use `Decimal`."
msgstr "这些实现使泛型代数代码能够使用 `Decimal`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1964
msgid "`from_natural` and `from_integer` are the canonical maps out of the naturals and the integers. They convert with `Decimal::from_bigint` (34 digits, trailing zeros removed), so they are exact only for integers of at most 34 significant digits. To convert another Luna-Flow integer type, pick its representative with `Integral::normalize` first, or use `lift_to`. `Zero::zero` and `One::one` are `Decimal::zero()` and `Decimal::one()`. The ring structure uses the context-free operators; because `+` rounds to the operand precision, the ring laws hold exactly only while sums stay within that precision."
msgstr "`from_natural` 和 `from_integer` 是从自然数和整数出发的典范映射。它们用 `Decimal::from_bigint` 转换（34 位，去除尾随零），因此只对至多 34 位有效数字的整数是精确的。要转换其他 Luna-Flow 整数类型，请先用 `Integral::normalize` 取其代表元，或使用 `lift_to`。`Zero::zero` 和 `One::one` 即 `Decimal::zero()` 和 `Decimal::one()`。环结构使用无上下文的运算符；由于 `+` 会舍入到操作数精度，只有当和保持在该精度之内时，环公理才精确成立。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1973
msgid "`Decimal::to_repr` and the `@def.Floating`, `Show` and `Debug` implementations"
msgstr "`Decimal::to_repr` 以及 `@def.Floating`、`Show` 与 `Debug` 的实现"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1975
msgid "`Decimal` implements the floating vocabulary of the `def` package, `Show` (see [`Decimal::to_string`](#decimalto_string-decimaloutput)) and `Debug`."
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 `def` 包的浮点词汇、`Show`（参见 [`Decimal::to_string`](#decimalto_string-decimaloutput)）以及 `Debug`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1983
msgid "The `Floating` methods are `classify`, `sign`, `precision`, `with_precision` and `normalized`, documented above. `to_repr` is the structural `Debug` representation."
msgstr "`Floating` 方法为 `classify`、`sign`、`precision`、`with_precision` 和 `normalized`，均已在上文说明。`to_repr` 是结构化的 `Debug` 表示。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda_checked API"
msgstr "decimal_gda_checked API"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:5
msgid "`decimal_gda_checked` provides `GdaDecimalChecked`, a pipeline over the General Decimal Arithmetic (GDA) operations of [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md). It holds exactly one `GdaOutcome[Decimal]`: the current defined value, the next context (whose sticky `status` accumulates every signal raised so far), the signals raised by the latest operation, and, if a trap fired, the trapped signal. An operation on a completed state runs the GDA operation with the stored context; an operation on a trapped state does nothing. `resume_defined()` is the only way to continue after a trap. The package never produces an `ArithmeticError`. The [tutorial](../tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md) walks through traps and recovery; the [design page](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md) models the pipeline as a state monad with an absorbing trap and proves the sticky-status laws."
msgstr "`decimal_gda_checked` 提供 `GdaDecimalChecked`，即基于 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 中通用十进制算术（GDA）运算的流水线。它恰好持有一个 `GdaOutcome[Decimal]`：当前的定义值、下一个上下文（其粘滞的 `status` 累积迄今为止引发的所有信号）、最近一次运算引发的信号，以及（若有陷阱触发）被捕获的信号。对已完成状态执行运算时，会在所存储的上下文下执行相应的 GDA 运算；对已陷入陷阱的状态执行运算则不做任何事。`resume_defined()` 是陷阱触发后继续执行的唯一途径。本包从不产生 `ArithmeticError`。[教程](../tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md) 逐步讲解陷阱与恢复；[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md) 将该流水线建模为带吸收性陷阱的状态单子，并证明了粘滞状态的定律。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:20
msgid "Add both packages to your `moon.pkg`; the pipeline takes `decimal_gda` values and contexts:"
msgstr "将这两个包都添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中；该流水线接受 `decimal_gda` 的值和上下文："

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:30
msgid "The examples call the packages through the aliases `@decimal_gda.` and `@decimal_gda_checked.`, and list GDA flags with this helper:"
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@decimal_gda.` 和 `@decimal_gda_checked.` 调用这些包，并用以下辅助函数列出 GDA 标志："

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:54
msgid "`GdaDecimalChecked` wraps one `GdaOutcome[@decimal_gda.Decimal]`."
msgstr "`GdaDecimalChecked` 包装一个 `GdaOutcome[@decimal_gda.Decimal]`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:62
msgid "The outcome is either `Completed(value, next_context, raised)` or `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)`; see `GdaOutcome` in the [`decimal_gda` API](decimal_gda.md)."
msgstr "结果为 `Completed(value, next_context, raised)` 或 `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)` 之一；参见 [`decimal_gda` API](decimal_gda.md) 中的 `GdaOutcome`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:70
msgid "`from_outcome(outcome)` wraps the outcome of any `decimal_gda` operation."
msgstr "`from_outcome(outcome)` 包装任意 `decimal_gda` 运算的结果。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:76
msgid "A `Trapped` outcome gives a trapped pipeline."
msgstr "`Trapped` 结果会得到一个已陷入陷阱的流水线。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:80
msgid "`from_decimal(value, context)` rounds a value into the context with the GDA `apply` operation (the *plus*-like conversion to the context)."
msgstr "`from_decimal(value, context)` 通过 GDA `apply` 运算将值舍入到上下文中（即类似 *plus* 的、转换到该上下文的操作）。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:87
msgid "The signals of the rounding are raised, merged into the status and checked against the traps, so construction itself can trap."
msgstr "舍入所引发的信号会被引发、合并到状态中并与陷阱比对，因此构造本身也可能触发陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:92
msgid "`parse(source, context)` is the GDA *to-number* conversion of a string."
msgstr "`parse(source, context)` 是 GDA 中字符串的 *to-number* 转换。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:98
msgid "An invalid string gives NaN with `conversion_syntax`; because GDA treats conversion syntax as an invalid-operation condition, a context that traps `InvalidOperation` (such as `GdaContext::default()`) traps it."
msgstr "无效字符串会得到 NaN 并伴随 `conversion_syntax`；由于 GDA 将转换语法错误视为一种无效运算条件，捕获 `InvalidOperation` 的上下文（例如 `GdaContext::default()`）会对其触发陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:106
msgid "These methods return the wrapped outcome and its components."
msgstr "这些方法返回所包装的结果及其各组成部分。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:116
msgid "`value()` is the defined result, also when trapped. `context()` is the next context, including its updated status and its traps. `raised()` holds the signals of the latest operation only. `status()` is `context().status()`, the sticky union of everything raised since the context's status was last cleared; whenever any invalid-operation condition (`conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined`, `invalid_context`) is raised, the status also gets `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "`value()` 是定义结果，在陷入陷阱时亦然。`context()` 是下一个上下文，包括其更新后的状态及陷阱设置。`raised()` 仅保存最近一次运算的信号。`status()` 为 `context().status()`，即自上下文状态上次清除以来所引发的全部信号的粘滞并集；每当引发任何无效运算条件（`conversion_syntax`、`division_impossible`、`division_undefined`、`invalid_context`）时，状态中也会加入 `invalid_operation`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:126
msgid "These methods report whether a trap fired and which signal it was."
msgstr "这些方法报告是否有陷阱触发以及触发的是哪个信号。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:133
msgid "When several raised signals are trapped at once, the reported one is the first in the priority order `InvalidOperation`, `DivisionByZero`, `DivisionUndefined`, `DivisionImpossible`, `InvalidContext`, `ConversionSyntax`, `Overflow`, `Underflow`, `Subnormal`, `Inexact`, `Rounded`, `Clamped`, `LostDigits`."
msgstr "当多个被引发的信号同时被捕获时，报告的是按以下优先级顺序排在最前的那个：`InvalidOperation`、`DivisionByZero`、`DivisionUndefined`、`DivisionImpossible`、`InvalidContext`、`ConversionSyntax`、`Overflow`、`Underflow`、`Subnormal`、`Inexact`、`Rounded`、`Clamped`、`LostDigits`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:139
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "恢复"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:143
msgid "`resume_defined()` continues a trapped pipeline with its defined result."
msgstr "`resume_defined()` 以已陷入陷阱的流水线的定义结果继续执行。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:149
msgid "On `Trapped(signal, value, context, raised)` it returns `Completed(value, context, GdaFlags::none())`: the value and the context (with its status, which already contains the trapped signal) are kept, the trap marker and the latest-step flags are dropped. On a completed pipeline it does nothing. Traps stay enabled in the context, so the same condition traps again if it recurs."
msgstr "对于 `Trapped(signal, value, context, raised)`，它返回 `Completed(value, context, GdaFlags::none())`：值和上下文（其状态中已包含被捕获的信号）被保留，陷阱标记和最近一步的标志被丢弃。对于已完成的流水线，它不做任何事。陷阱在上下文中保持启用，因此同一条件若再次出现会再次触发陷阱。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:183
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:115
msgid "Operations"
msgstr "运算"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:185
msgid "Every operation method applies the `decimal_gda` function of the same name to the current value under the stored context; `remainder` is the GDA `remainder` (truncating), not `remainder_near`."
msgstr "每个运算方法都在所存储的上下文下，对当前值应用 `decimal_gda` 中的同名函数；`remainder` 是 GDA 的 `remainder`（截断），而非 `remainder_near`。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:189
msgid "On `Completed(v, c, _)` the method returns the outcome of `@decimal_gda.op(v, …, c)`; on `Trapped` it returns the state unchanged. The second operand (`other`, `multiplier`, `addend`, `exponent`, `quantum`, `divisor`, `target`) is a plain `Decimal`. The GDA operation computes the result under `c`'s precision, rounding, exponent limits, clamping and extended mode; if it raises no signal the context is passed on unchanged with empty `raised`; otherwise the raised signals are merged into the status of the next context and, if one of them is enabled in `c.traps()`, the outcome is `Trapped`. The mathematical functions `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` with a non-integer exponent need precision and exponent limits within $\\pm 999\\,999$; otherwise they return NaN with `invalid_context`, which an `InvalidOperation` trap catches."
msgstr "对于 `Completed(v, c, _)`，该方法返回 `@decimal_gda.op(v, …, c)` 的结果；对于 `Trapped`，它原样返回状态。第二个操作数（`other`、`multiplier`、`addend`、`exponent`、`quantum`、`divisor`、`target`）是普通的 `Decimal`。GDA 运算在 `c` 的精度、舍入、指数界限、钳制和扩展模式下计算结果；若未引发任何信号，则上下文原样传递且 `raised` 为空；否则，引发的信号会合并到下一个上下文的状态中，若其中有信号在 `c.traps()` 中启用，结果即为 `Trapped`。数学函数 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 以及带非整数指数的 `power` 要求精度和指数界限位于 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 之内；否则返回 NaN 并伴随 `invalid_context`，`InvalidOperation` 陷阱会捕获它。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:224
msgid "These round or change the sign of the current value: `apply` is the GDA conversion to the context, `plus` is $0 + x$, `minus` is $0 - x$ and `abs` is $|x|$."
msgstr "这些函数对当前值进行舍入或改变其符号：`apply` 是到上下文的 GDA 转换，`plus` 为 $0 + x$，`minus` 为 $0 - x$，`abs` 为 $|x|$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:237
msgid "These combine the current value with plain `Decimal` operands; `fma(b, c)` is $v \\times b + c$ with one rounding."
msgstr "这些函数将当前值与普通的 `Decimal` 操作数组合；`fma(b, c)` 为只舍入一次的 $v \\times b + c$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:250
msgid "These are the GDA elementary functions of the current value; `power(y)` is $v^y$."
msgstr "这些是当前值的 GDA 初等函数；`power(y)` 为 $v^y$。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:263
msgid "These set the exponent, take a remainder or remove trailing zeros."
msgstr "这些函数设置指数、求余数或去除尾随零。"

#: manual/api/decimal_gda_checked.md:273
msgid "These step to an adjacent representable value."
msgstr "这些函数步进到相邻的可表示值。"

#: manual/api/def.md:1
msgid "def API"
msgstr "def API"

#: manual/api/def.md:5
msgid "`def` is the shared vocabulary of the `floating` packages. It defines the sign classification `Sign`, the four-way comparison result `PartialOrder`, the open `Floating` trait that every scalar or interval representation of this repository implements, four generic predicates built on that trait, and re-exports the context, rounding, classification and error types of [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) so that callers need only one import. It contains no arithmetic. The [tutorial](../tutorial/def.md) shows the vocabulary in use; the [design page](../design/def.md) states the trait laws and explains why `PartialOrder` is not a total order."
msgstr "`def` 是 `floating` 各包的共享词汇。它定义了符号分类 `Sign`、四路比较结果 `PartialOrder`、本仓库中每种标量或区间表示都实现的开放 trait `Floating`、基于该 trait 构建的四个泛型谓词，并重新导出 [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 中的上下文、舍入、分类和错误类型，使调用者只需一次导入。它不包含任何算术运算。[教程](../tutorial/def.md) 展示了这些词汇的用法；[设计页面](../design/def.md) 陈述了 trait 定律，并解释了为何 `PartialOrder` 不是全序。"

#: manual/api/def.md:18
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`, next to the representation you use:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中，与你所用的表示放在一起："

#: manual/api/def.md:27
msgid "The examples on this page are complete tests. They call the package as `@def.`, the representations as `@bin_float.`, `@decimal.`, `@decimal_gda.` and `@ball_float.`, and `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` as `@lf_arith.`."
msgstr "本页示例都是完整的测试。它们以 `@def.` 调用该包，以 `@bin_float.`、`@decimal.`、`@decimal_gda.` 和 `@ball_float.` 调用各表示，并以 `@lf_arith.` 调用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:31
msgid "Sign and comparison results"
msgstr "符号与比较结果"

#: manual/api/def.md:35
msgid "`Sign` is the three-way sign classification returned by `Floating::sign`."
msgstr "`Sign` 是 `Floating::sign` 返回的三路符号分类。"

#: manual/api/def.md:45
msgid "`Zero` is returned for both signed zeros, so `Sign` does not distinguish $-0$ from $+0$; use the concrete package (for example `BinFloat::is_negative_zero`) when the sign bit of a zero matters. The scalar implementations also return `Zero` for every NaN, and an interval returns `Zero` when it contains $0$ (see [`Floating::sign`](#floatingsign)). `Sign` is also the payload of `SemanticScalar::Infinity` in the [`semantic`](semantic.md) package and the argument of constructors such as `BinFloat::inf`."
msgstr "两种带符号零都返回 `Zero`，因此 `Sign` 不区分 $-0$ 与 $+0$；当零的符号位很重要时，请使用具体的包（例如 `BinFloat::is_negative_zero`）。标量实现对每个 NaN 也返回 `Zero`，而区间在包含 $0$ 时返回 `Zero`（参见 [`Floating::sign`](#floatingsign)）。`Sign` 也是 [`semantic`](semantic.md) 包中 `SemanticScalar::Infinity` 的载荷，以及 `BinFloat::inf` 等构造函数的参数。"

#: manual/api/def.md:65
msgid "`PartialOrder` is the result of an IEEE 754 comparison: exactly one of the four mutually exclusive relations *less*, *equal*, *greater* and *unordered* holds between two floating-point data."
msgstr "`PartialOrder` 是 IEEE 754 比较的结果：两个浮点数据之间恰好成立 *小于*、*等于*、*大于* 和 *无序* 这四种互斥关系之一。"

#: manual/api/def.md:78
msgid "`Unordered` holds exactly when at least one operand is NaN; $-0$ and $+0$ compare `Equal`. The type is returned by `BinFloat::compare_quiet` and `BinFloat::compare_signaling` in [`bin_float`](bin_float.md) (each paired with the flags of the comparison). It is a value type only; `def` performs no comparison itself. Why four results and not a `Compare` instance is derived in the [design page](../design/def.md#partialorder-is-the-ieee-four-way-relation)."
msgstr "当且仅当至少一个操作数为 NaN 时 `Unordered` 成立；$-0$ 和 $+0$ 比较 `Equal`。该类型由 [`bin_float`](bin_float.md) 中的 `BinFloat::compare_quiet` 和 `BinFloat::compare_signaling` 返回（各自附带该比较的标志）。它仅是一个值类型；`def` 本身不执行任何比较。为何是四种结果而非 `Compare` 实例，其推导见[设计页面](../design/def.md#partialorder-is-the-ieee-four-way-relation)。"

#: manual/api/def.md:103
msgid "The `Floating` trait"
msgstr "`Floating` trait"

#: manual/api/def.md:107
msgid "`Floating` is the observation and re-precision interface shared by every representation in this repository."
msgstr "`Floating` 是本仓库中所有表示共享的观察与重设精度接口。"

#: manual/api/def.md:120
msgid "The trait is `pub(open)`, so downstream types may implement it. In this repository it is implemented by `@bin_float.BinFloat`, `@decimal.Decimal`, `@decimal_gda.Decimal` and `@ball_float.BallFloat`. Since the MoonBit 0.10 migration trait methods are not promoted automatically, so generic code calls them in the qualified form `@def.Floating::classify(x)`; the concrete types also provide inherent methods with the same names (`x.classify()`). The laws every implementation is expected to satisfy, and the places where `BallFloat` only satisfies a weaker form, are listed in the [design page](../design/def.md#the-floating-laws)."
msgstr "该 trait 为 `pub(open)`，因此下游类型可以实现它。在本仓库中，`@bin_float.BinFloat`、`@decimal.Decimal`、`@decimal_gda.Decimal` 和 `@ball_float.BallFloat` 实现了它。自 MoonBit 0.10 迁移以来，trait 方法不再自动提升，因此泛型代码以限定形式 `@def.Floating::classify(x)` 调用它们；具体类型也提供同名的固有方法（`x.classify()`）。每个实现应满足的定律，以及 `BallFloat` 只满足其较弱形式的地方，列于[设计页面](../design/def.md#the-floating-laws)。"

#: manual/api/def.md:132
msgid "`classify` returns the class of a value: `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`."
msgstr "`classify` 返回值的类别：`Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:138
msgid "For the scalar types this is the IEEE class with signalling and quiet NaNs merged. For `BallFloat` it is `Finite` for a bounded non-empty interval, `Infinity` for an interval with an infinite endpoint (including the entire line), and `NaN` for the empty interval. Total; never aborts."
msgstr "对于标量类型，这是将信号 NaN 与静默 NaN 合并后的 IEEE 类别。对于 `BallFloat`，有界非空区间为 `Finite`，带有无穷端点的区间（包括整条实数线）为 `Infinity`，空区间为 `NaN`。全函数；从不中止。"

#: manual/api/def.md:145
msgid "`sign` returns the sign classification of a value."
msgstr "`sign` 返回值的符号分类。"

#: manual/api/def.md:151
msgid "Implementation"
msgstr "实现"

#: manual/api/def.md:153
msgid "`BinFloat`, both `Decimal`s"
msgstr "`BinFloat`，两种 `Decimal`"

#: manual/api/def.md:153
msgid "value $< 0$, including $-\\infty$"
msgstr "值 $< 0$，包括 $-\\infty$"

#: manual/api/def.md:153
msgid "$\\pm 0$ and every NaN"
msgstr "$\\pm 0$ 及所有 NaN"

#: manual/api/def.md:153
msgid "value $> 0$, including $+\\infty$"
msgstr "值 $> 0$，包括 $+\\infty$"

#: manual/api/def.md:156
msgid "The interval rule also applies to unbounded intervals: $[-\\infty, -1]$ is `Negative`."
msgstr "区间规则同样适用于无界区间：$[-\\infty, -1]$ 为 `Negative`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:159
msgid "[!WARNING] `BallFloat::sign` aborts on the empty interval, which has no sign. Test `@def.is_nan(x)` (true exactly for the empty interval) before calling `sign` on an interval."
msgstr "[!WARNING] `BallFloat::sign` 在空区间上会中止，因为空区间没有符号。在对区间调用 `sign` 之前，请先检测 `@def.is_nan(x)`（当且仅当为空区间时为真）。"

#: manual/api/def.md:166
msgid "`precision` returns the working precision stored on the value."
msgstr "`precision` 返回值上存储的工作精度。"

#: manual/api/def.md:172
msgid "It counts significant bits for `BinFloat` and for the endpoints of a `BallFloat`, and significant decimal digits for both `Decimal` types. Every constructor clamps the stored precision to at least $1$, so the result is always at least $1$."
msgstr "对 `BinFloat` 和 `BallFloat` 的端点，它计算有效二进制位数；对两种 `Decimal` 类型，它计算有效十进制位数。每个构造函数都会将存储的精度限制为至少 $1$，因此结果总是至少为 $1$。"

#: manual/api/def.md:179
msgid "`with_precision(x, p, mode)` returns `x` re-expressed at precision $q = \\max(1, p)$."
msgstr "`with_precision(x, p, mode)` 返回以精度 $q = \\max(1, p)$ 重新表示的 `x`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:186
msgid "For a finite scalar the value is rounded to $q$ significant digits of its radix in the direction `mode`. No context exponent bounds apply and no flags are reported (use the `*_ctx` APIs of the concrete package for both). The decimal types have no other exponent limit. `BinFloat` keeps its implementation range: a result whose exponent leaves $\\pm(2^{30} - 1)$ (`binary_implementation_e_max`, `binary_implementation_e_min`) overflows to an infinity or to the largest finite value, or underflows, as in IEEE 754. Zeros keep their sign. Infinities and NaNs keep their class, sign and payload and only change the stored precision."
msgstr "对于有限标量，其值按 `mode` 方向舍入到其基数下的 $q$ 位有效数字。不应用上下文的指数界限，也不报告标志（两者都需要时请使用具体包的 `*_ctx` API）。十进制类型没有其他指数限制。`BinFloat` 保留其实现范围：指数超出 $\\pm(2^{30} - 1)$（`binary_implementation_e_max`、`binary_implementation_e_min`）的结果会像 IEEE 754 中那样上溢为无穷或最大有限值，或者下溢。零保留其符号。无穷和 NaN 保留其类别、符号和载荷，只改变存储的精度。"

#: manual/api/def.md:197
msgid "For `BallFloat` the endpoints are rounded outward (the lower one toward $-\\infty$, the upper one toward $+\\infty$), so the result is the tightest enclosure of `x` at the new precision whatever `mode` is; `mode` is not used. An interval whose endpoints are already representable at `p` bits is returned unchanged."
msgstr "对 `BallFloat`，端点向外舍入（下端点朝 $-\\infty$，上端点朝 $+\\infty$），因此无论 `mode` 为何，结果都是 `x` 在新精度下的最紧包络；`mode` 不被使用。端点在 `p` 位下已可表示的区间原样返回。"

#: manual/api/def.md:205
msgid "`normalized` returns the canonical representative of a value."
msgstr "`normalized` 返回值的规范代表。"

#: manual/api/def.md:211
msgid "For `BinFloat` this is the representation with an odd coefficient (or zero); for both `Decimal` types it removes trailing zeros of the coefficient, so `1.500` becomes `1.5` (the cohort changes, the value does not) and `-0.000` becomes `-0`. Non-finite scalars are returned unchanged. On the scalar types `normalized` keeps the value and is idempotent."
msgstr "对于 `BinFloat`，这是系数为奇数（或为零）的表示；对于两种 `Decimal` 类型，它去除系数末尾的零，因此 `1.500` 变为 `1.5`（同值类改变，值不变），`-0.000` 变为 `-0`。非有限标量原样返回。在标量类型上，`normalized` 保持值不变，并且是幂等的。"

#: manual/api/def.md:217
msgid "`BallFloat::normalized` normalizes the two endpoints and keeps them at the stored precision, so the interval denotes the same set: at 53 bits, $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ stays $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$."
msgstr "`BallFloat::normalized` 规范化两个端点并将其保持在存储精度上，因此区间表示的集合不变：在 53 位下，$[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ 仍为 $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$。"

#: manual/api/def.md:286
msgid "Generic predicates"
msgstr "泛型谓词"

#: manual/api/def.md:290
msgid "These functions test the class of any `Floating` value."
msgstr "这些函数检测任意 `Floating` 值的类别。"

#: manual/api/def.md:308
msgid "Exactly one of the first three is true for every value. For scalars `is_zero` is true for both signed zeros. For a `BallFloat`, `is_zero` is true for every bounded interval that *contains* zero (for example $[-1, 1]$), not only for $[0, 0]$; use `BallFloat::contains_zero` or compare the bounds when you mean something else. `is_zero` never calls `sign` on an empty interval, because the conjunction stops at `classify`."
msgstr "对每个值，前三者中恰有一个为真。对于标量，`is_zero` 对两种带符号零都为真。对于 `BallFloat`，`is_zero` 对每个*包含*零的有界区间（例如 $[-1, 1]$）都为真，而不仅限于 $[0, 0]$；若你指的是其他含义，请使用 `BallFloat::contains_zero` 或比较区间端点。`is_zero` 从不在空区间上调用 `sign`，因为合取在 `classify` 处即短路停止。"

#: manual/api/def.md:332
msgid "Re-exported types"
msgstr "重新导出的类型"

#: manual/api/def.md:334
msgid "`def` re-exports these types with `pub using`, so `@def.RoundingMode` and `@lf_arith.RoundingMode` name the same type and no conversion is needed. Their definitions and full semantics are documented by [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/)."
msgstr "`def` 以 `pub using` 重新导出这些类型，因此 `@def.RoundingMode` 与 `@lf_arith.RoundingMode` 指同一类型，无需任何转换。它们的定义和完整语义由 [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 文档说明。"

#: manual/api/def.md:341
msgid "`ArithmeticContext` is the precision, rounding direction and optional exponent bounds passed to the contextual traits of Luna-Flow/arithmetic."
msgstr "`ArithmeticContext` 是传递给 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 上下文 trait 的精度、舍入方向及可选指数界限。"

#: manual/api/def.md:348
msgid "`BinaryContext` and `DecimalContext` are built from it by their `from_arithmetic_context` constructors."
msgstr "`BinaryContext` 和 `DecimalContext` 由各自的 `from_arithmetic_context` 构造函数从它构建。"

#: manual/api/def.md:353
msgid "`ArithmeticError` is the structured error of every `Result`-returning (`*_checked`, `try_*`) API and of the checked wrapper packages; `ArithmeticErrorKind` is its kind."
msgstr "`ArithmeticError` 是所有返回 `Result` 的 API（`*_checked`、`try_*`）以及各 checked 包装包的结构化错误；`ArithmeticErrorKind` 是其种类。"

#: manual/api/def.md:362
msgid "The kinds are `DivisionByZero`, `ParseError`, `DomainError`, `FormatError`, `UnsupportedOperation`, `UnorderedComparison` and `CertificationFailure(detail)`; `ArithmeticError` has one `is_*` predicate per kind and a `message`."
msgstr "种类有 `DivisionByZero`、`ParseError`、`DomainError`、`FormatError`、`UnsupportedOperation`、`UnorderedComparison` 和 `CertificationFailure(detail)`；`ArithmeticError` 为每个种类提供一个 `is_*` 谓词，并提供 `message`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:369
msgid "These types are the payload of an `ArithmeticError` of kind `CertificationFailure`: an elementary function whose correctly rounded result could not be certified within its refinement budget."
msgstr "这些类型是种类为 `CertificationFailure` 的 `ArithmeticError` 的载荷：表示某个初等函数的正确舍入结果未能在其细化预算内完成认证。"

#: manual/api/def.md:379
msgid "The detail records the operation, the stage and reason, the target precision, and the final working precision and refinement count (see `certified_failure` in the [internal API](internal.md))."
msgstr "详情记录运算、阶段和原因、目标精度，以及最终的工作精度和细化次数（参见[内部 API](internal.md) 中的 `certified_failure`）。"

#: manual/api/def.md:385
msgid "`FpClass` is the result of `Floating::classify`: `Finite`, `Infinity` or `NaN`."
msgstr "`FpClass` 是 `Floating::classify` 的结果：`Finite`、`Infinity` 或 `NaN`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:394
msgid "`RoundingMode` lists the five rounding directions accepted by `with_precision` and by the concrete constructors: `ToNearestEven`, `TowardZero`, `TowardPositive`, `TowardNegative` and `AwayFromZero`."
msgstr "`RoundingMode` 列出 `with_precision` 及各具体构造函数接受的五种舍入方向：`ToNearestEven`、`TowardZero`、`TowardPositive`、`TowardNegative` 和 `AwayFromZero`。"

#: manual/api/def.md:404
msgid "`BigInt` is the arbitrary-precision integer of `moonbitlang/core/bigint`, used for coefficients and exact values."
msgstr "`BigInt` 是 `moonbitlang/core/bigint` 的任意精度整数，用于表示系数和精确值。"

#: manual/api/def.md:425
msgid "These methods are the derived `Eq` instance, promoted explicitly so that `a.equal(b)` remains available; prefer `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "这些方法是派生的 `Eq` 实例，经显式提升以使 `a.equal(b)` 仍然可用；请优先使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:1
msgid "doc_examples API"
msgstr "doc_examples API"

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:5
msgid "`doc_examples` is a test-only package. Its only source is `src/doc_examples/README.mbt.md`, whose `moonbit check` blocks are compiled and run as tests; it exports no MoonBit items. The blocks are short, executable versions of the main workflows of the public packages (binary contexts and interchange, GDA sticky status, IEEE decimal flags, intervals and decorations, checked pipelines, semantic comparison, `numeric_expr`, and the four conformance frontends). See the [tutorial](../tutorial/doc_examples.md) and the [design page](../design/doc_examples.md)."
msgstr "`doc_examples` 是一个仅用于测试的包。它唯一的源文件是 `src/doc_examples/README.mbt.md`，其中的 `moonbit check` 代码块会作为测试被编译和运行；它不导出任何 MoonBit 项。这些代码块是各公开包主要工作流程的简短可执行版本（二进制上下文与交换格式、GDA 粘滞状态、IEEE 十进制标志、区间与装饰（decoration）、checked 流水线、语义比较、`numeric_expr`，以及四个符合性前端）。参见[教程](../tutorial/doc_examples.md)和[设计页面](../design/doc_examples.md)。"

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:16
msgid "Nothing can be imported from `doc_examples`. Its `moon.pkg` imports the packages its examples use, for tests only:"
msgstr "无法从 `doc_examples` 导入任何内容。它的 `moon.pkg` 导入其示例所用的包，且仅用于测试："

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:38
#: manual/conventions.md:103
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: manual/api/doc_examples.md:40
msgid "The README holds eleven `moonbit check` tests, one per workflow: binary context and interchange, GDA sticky status, IEEE decimal status, interval and decorated semantics, checked pipelines, the semantic projection, `numeric_expr` callbacks, and one inline document for each of the GDA, ITL, MPFR and TestFloat frontends."
msgstr "README 包含十一个 `moonbit check` 测试，每个工作流程一个：二进制上下文与交换格式、GDA 粘滞状态、IEEE 十进制状态、区间与装饰语义、checked 流水线、语义投影、`numeric_expr` 回调，以及 GDA、ITL、MPFR 和 TestFloat 前端各一个内联文档。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/gda_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/gda_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/gda_expr` reads General Decimal Arithmetic test files (the `.decTest` format of Cowlishaw's decimal specification) and executes their rows against `decimal_gda`. Parsing turns every row into a `GdaCase` with its context and a [`numeric_expr`](../numeric_expr.md) expression; execution evaluates the expression and compares the result and the status flags with the row. The package does no file or process IO; the command-line runner is [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md). The [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md) shows the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md) specifies the row mapping and the pass rule."
msgstr "`frontend/gda_expr` 读取 General Decimal Arithmetic 测试文件（Cowlishaw 十进制规范的 `.decTest` 格式），并针对 `decimal_gda` 执行其中的行。解析将每一行转换为一个 `GdaCase`，附带其上下文和一个 [`numeric_expr`](../numeric_expr.md) 表达式；执行时对表达式求值，并将结果和状态标志与该行进行比较。该包不进行任何文件或进程 IO；命令行运行器是 [`cli/gda_expr_cli`](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md)。[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md)展示工作流程，[设计页面](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md)规定行映射和通过规则。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:18
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:14
#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:15
msgid "Add the package to the `import` block of your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 的 `import` 块中："

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:26
msgid "The examples call it through the alias `@gda_expr`. They need no other package: rows are written as text and the results are read through the accessors below."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@gda_expr` 调用它。它们不需要其他包：行以文本形式书写，结果通过下面的访问器读取。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:30
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:25
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:138
msgid "Parsing"
msgstr "解析"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:34
msgid "`parse_dectest(source, text)` parses a whole `.decTest` document."
msgstr "`parse_dectest(source, text)` 解析一个完整的 `.decTest` 文档。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:40
msgid ""
"`source` is a name used in spans (normally the file path) and `text` is the file content. The text is split at `\\n"
"`; line numbers start at 1. Each line is handled as follows:"
msgstr ""
"`source` 是用于跨度（span）中的名称（通常为文件路径），`text` 是文件内容。文本在 `\\n"
"` 处切分；行号从 1 开始。每一行的处理方式如下："

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:44
msgid "`--` outside quotes starts a comment; the rest of the line is dropped. Leading and trailing white space is trimmed and empty lines are skipped."
msgstr "引号之外的 `--` 开始一段注释；该行的其余部分被丢弃。首尾空白被修剪，空行被跳过。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:46
msgid "A line without `->` outside quotes is a directive `name: value`. The name is compared case-insensitively with `-`, `_`, spaces and tabs removed: `precision`, `rounding`, `minexponent`, `maxexponent`, `clamp`, `extended` and `dectest` update the context; `version` and unknown names are ignored. `precision`, `minExponent` and `maxExponent` must be integers, otherwise the line is a diagnostic. `clamp` is on only for the value `1`; `extended` is off only for the value `0`. A line without `:` is a diagnostic."
msgstr "引号之外不含 `->` 的行是指令 `name: value`。名称在去除 `-`、`_`、空格和制表符后按不区分大小写的方式比较：`precision`、`rounding`、`minexponent`、`maxexponent`、`clamp`、`extended` 和 `dectest` 会更新上下文；`version` 和未知名称被忽略。`precision`、`minExponent` 和 `maxExponent` 必须是整数，否则该行成为一条诊断。`clamp` 只有在值为 `1` 时才开启；`extended` 只有在值为 `0` 时才关闭。不含 `:` 的行是一条诊断。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:54
msgid "A line with `->` is a test row. The left side is tokenized into `id operation operand…` (at least two tokens), the right side into `expected condition…` (at least one token). Tokens are separated by spaces, tabs or line breaks; a token enclosed in `'…'` or `\"…\"` may contain spaces and loses its quotes. A quote also ends the token before it, so `ab'cd'` is the two tokens `ab` and `cd`. Inside a quoted token the delimiting quote written twice is one literal quote and does not end the token, as the decTest format specifies: `'1E''1'` is the operand `1E'1` and `\"1E\"\"\"\"\"` is `1E\"\"`. An unterminated quote after `->` is the diagnostic `unterminated quoted token`; a quote opened before `->` hides the arrow, so the line is reported as `expected directive or testcase row`. Fewer tokens than required give `malformed testcase row`."
msgstr "含有 `->` 的行是测试行。左侧被切分为记号 `id operation operand…`（至少两个记号），右侧被切分为 `expected condition…`（至少一个记号）。记号以空格、制表符或换行分隔；用 `'…'` 或 `\"…\"` 括起来的记号可以包含空格，并会去掉引号。引号也会结束它之前的记号，因此 `ab'cd'` 是两个记号 `ab` 和 `cd`。按照 decTest 格式的规定，在带引号的记号内部，连写两次的定界引号表示一个字面引号，不会结束该记号：`'1E''1'` 是操作数 `1E'1`，`\"1E\"\"\"\"\"` 是 `1E\"\"`。`->` 之后未闭合的引号产生诊断 `unterminated quoted token`；在 `->` 之前打开的引号会遮蔽箭头，因此该行被报告为 `expected directive or testcase row`。记号数少于要求时产生 `malformed testcase row`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:67
msgid "The result is `Ok(document)` when no diagnostic was produced, and otherwise `Err` with every diagnostic of the document in line order."
msgstr "没有产生诊断时结果为 `Ok(document)`，否则为 `Err`，其中按行序包含该文档的所有诊断。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:70
msgid "Documents and rows"
msgstr "文档与行"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:74
msgid "`GdaDocument` is a parsed file: its source name and its rows in file order."
msgstr "`GdaDocument` 是一个已解析的文件：包含其源名称和按文件顺序排列的行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:84
msgid "These methods return the source name, a copy of the rows and the number of rows."
msgstr "这些方法返回源名称、行的副本以及行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:95
msgid "`GdaCase` is one test row together with the context in force on its line."
msgstr "`GdaCase` 是一个测试行，连同其所在行生效的上下文。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:105
msgid "These methods return the row id, the operation as written, and the operation name used for dispatch: lower case, with `-`, `_`, spaces and tabs removed."
msgstr "这些方法返回行 id、按原样书写的运算，以及用于分派的运算名：小写，并去除 `-`、`_`、空格和制表符。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:116
msgid "These methods return the operand tokens, the expected-result token and the condition tokens, unquoted and otherwise exactly as written."
msgstr "这些方法返回操作数记号、期望结果记号和条件记号，均已去掉引号，其余与原文完全一致。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:125
msgid "The arrays are copies."
msgstr "这些数组都是副本。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:129
msgid "These methods return the directive context of the row, its span (source, line, column 1), and the row as an expression."
msgstr "这些方法返回该行的指令上下文、其跨度（源、行、第 1 列），以及该行对应的表达式。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:138
msgid "The expression is `Expr::invoke(Operation::new(normalized_operation), …)` applied to one `Expr::literal` per operand, all carrying the row's span."
msgstr "该表达式为 `Expr::invoke(Operation::new(normalized_operation), …)`，作用于每个操作数各一个 `Expr::literal`，它们都带有该行的跨度。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:143
msgid "`GdaContext` is the directive state of a document at a given row."
msgstr "`GdaContext` 是文档在某一行处的指令状态。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:151
msgid "It is a record of the directive values as written, not a `@decimal_gda.GdaContext`; execution converts it."
msgstr "它是按原样书写的指令值的记录，而不是 `@decimal_gda.GdaContext`；执行时会对其进行转换。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:156
msgid "`GdaContext::default()` is the context before the first directive."
msgstr "`GdaContext::default()` 是第一条指令之前的上下文。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:162
msgid "Precision 34, rounding `\"half_even\"`, `min_exponent` $-999999999$, `max_exponent` $999999999$, `clamp` off, `extended` on, `dectest` empty."
msgstr "精度 34，舍入 `\"half_even\"`，`min_exponent` 为 $-999999999$，`max_exponent` 为 $999999999$，`clamp` 关闭，`extended` 开启，`dectest` 为空。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:167
msgid "These accessors return the directive values."
msgstr "这些访问器返回指令值。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:179
msgid "`rounding` is the directive text as written (for example `\"half_up\"` or `\"05up\"`); it is only interpreted at execution time. `precision`, `min_exponent` and `max_exponent` are not range-checked when parsed: a `precision: 0` directive is accepted here, and `execute_documents` makes the rows under it `Diagnostic` (see below)."
msgstr "`rounding` 是按原样书写的指令文本（例如 `\"half_up\"` 或 `\"05up\"`）；它只在执行时才被解释。解析时不对 `precision`、`min_exponent` 和 `max_exponent` 做范围检查：`precision: 0` 指令在这里会被接受，而 `execute_documents` 会把其下的行设为 `Diagnostic`（见下文）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:187
msgid "`ParseDiagnostic` is one parse error with its location."
msgstr "`ParseDiagnostic` 是一条带位置的解析错误。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:197
msgid "These methods return the location (source, line, column 1) and the message, for example `\"unterminated quoted token\"`, `\"malformed testcase row\"`, `\"expected directive or testcase row\"` or `\"invalid precision directive\"`."
msgstr "这些方法返回位置（源、行、第 1 列）和消息，例如 `\"unterminated quoted token\"`、`\"malformed testcase row\"`、`\"expected directive or testcase row\"` 或 `\"invalid precision directive\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:230
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:82
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:237
msgid "Execution"
msgstr "执行"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:234
msgid "`execute_documents(documents, options?)` executes the selected rows of the documents, in order, and summarizes the results."
msgstr "`execute_documents(documents, options?)` 按顺序执行各文档中被选中的行，并汇总结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:241
msgid "Rows are visited document by document in file order. A row whose id does not match `options.case_filter()` is ignored entirely; the remaining rows are numbered $0, 1, 2, \\dots$ and row $k$ is executed when $k \\bmod n = i$ for shard count $n$ and shard index $i$. Each executed row first gets a disposition:"
msgstr "行按文档逐个、按文件顺序访问。id 与 `options.case_filter()` 不匹配的行被完全忽略；其余的行编号为 $0, 1, 2, \\dots$，对于分片数 $n$ 和分片索引 $i$，当 $k \\bmod n = i$ 时执行第 $k$ 行。每个被执行的行首先获得一个处置结果："

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:247
msgid "`Diagnostic` if the context is invalid (precision not positive, or `minexponent` above `maxexponent`), an operand is exactly `#` or `?`, or the expected result is exactly `#`;"
msgstr "若上下文无效（精度不为正，或 `minexponent` 大于 `maxexponent`）、某个操作数恰为 `#` 或 `?`，或期望结果恰为 `#`，则为 `Diagnostic`；"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:250
msgid "`Unsupported` if a condition is not one of the thirteen GDA conditions, the operation is not implemented, or the rounding directive is not recognized;"
msgstr "若某个条件不属于十三种 GDA 条件之一、运算尚未实现，或舍入指令无法识别，则为 `Unsupported`；"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:253
msgid "`Executable` otherwise."
msgstr "否则为 `Executable`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:255
msgid "Only `Executable` rows are evaluated. Operands are decoded as described on the [design page](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#rows-as-operations); plain decimal operands are read with every digit, so only the result is rounded. The row passes when the result matches the expected token and the raised conditions are exactly the listed ones; the [design page](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#the-pass-rule) gives the full rule. Non-executable rows get `passed() == false` and the message `\"skipped\"`, and are counted as skipped, not failed. Unreadable operands and operations that reject their operands give a failed row, not an abort."
msgstr "只有 `Executable` 行会被求值。操作数按[设计页面](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#rows-as-operations)所述解码；普通十进制操作数会保留每一位数字读取，因此只有结果被舍入。当结果与期望记号匹配，且引发的条件恰好是所列的条件时，该行通过；完整规则见[设计页面](../../design/frontend/gda_expr.md#the-pass-rule)。不可执行的行得到 `passed() == false` 和消息 `\"skipped\"`，并计为跳过而非失败。无法读取的操作数以及拒绝其操作数的运算会使该行失败，而不会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:267
msgid "`RunOptions` selects which rows `execute_documents` runs."
msgstr "`RunOptions` 选择 `execute_documents` 运行哪些行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:277
msgid "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?, strict_supported?, case_filter?)` builds the options."
msgstr "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?, strict_supported?, case_filter?)` 构建选项。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:284
msgid "Defaults: one shard, index 0, `strict_supported` off, empty filter (all rows). Aborts unless `shard_count > 0` and `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`."
msgstr "默认值：一个分片，索引 0，`strict_supported` 关闭，过滤器为空（所有行）。除非 `shard_count > 0` 且 `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`，否则中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:287
msgid "`case_filter` is a comma-separated list of selectors, each trimmed. A selector `id` matches that id exactly. A selector `first..last` matches every id that has the same length as `first` and `last` and lies between them in string order, so `add001..add099` selects a numbered block."
msgstr "`case_filter` 是逗号分隔的选择器列表，每个选择器都会被修剪。选择器 `id` 精确匹配该 id。选择器 `first..last` 匹配所有与 `first` 和 `last` 长度相同、且按字符串顺序位于两者之间的 id，因此 `add001..add099` 选择一个编号区段。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:292
msgid "`strict_supported` is stored for callers; `execute_documents` itself does not read it. The CLI uses it to turn unsupported rows into a failing exit code."
msgstr "`strict_supported` 仅为调用方保存；`execute_documents` 本身并不读取它。CLI 用它将不受支持的行转换为失败的退出码。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:297
msgid "These accessors return the option values."
msgstr "这些访问器返回选项值。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:306
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:160
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:296
#: manual/getting_started.md:13
msgid "Results"
msgstr "结果"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:310
msgid "`CaseDisposition` says whether a row was executed and, if not, why."
msgstr "`CaseDisposition` 说明一行是否被执行，若未执行则说明原因。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:321
msgid "The string is a short reason such as `\"diagnostic interchange/non-scalar row\"` or `\"unsupported operation frobnicate\"`. `Legacy` exists for the shared result model; the current executor never assigns it."
msgstr "字符串是一个简短的原因，例如 `\"diagnostic interchange/non-scalar row\"` 或 `\"unsupported operation frobnicate\"`。`Legacy` 是为共享的结果模型而存在的；当前的执行器从不赋予它。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:328
msgid "`CaseResult` is the outcome of one selected row."
msgstr "`CaseResult` 是一个被选中行的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:338
msgid "These methods return the row id, its disposition, whether it passed, and a message: empty for a pass, `\"skipped\"` for a non-executable row, `\"evaluation failed\"` when an operand could not be decoded or the operation rejected its operands, and otherwise a `\"result mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` or `\"status flags mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` text."
msgstr "这些方法返回行 id、其处置结果、是否通过，以及一条消息：通过时为空，不可执行的行为 `\"skipped\"`，操作数无法解码或运算拒绝其操作数时为 `\"evaluation failed\"`，否则为 `\"result mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` 或 `\"status flags mismatch: expected …, actual …\"` 文本。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:354
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates the results of a run."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一次运行的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:364
msgid "`total_cases` returns the number of rows that match the filter, counted over all shards; `selected_cases` returns the number of rows this shard executed or skipped."
msgstr "`total_cases` 返回与过滤器匹配的行数（所有分片合计）；`selected_cases` 返回本分片执行或跳过的行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:373
msgid "Every shard of one run reports the same `total_cases`. Rows removed by the filter are counted nowhere."
msgstr "同一次运行的每个分片都报告相同的 `total_cases`。被过滤器移除的行不计入任何计数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:378
msgid "These methods return the number of selected rows that were evaluated, and how many of them passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回被求值的选中行数，以及其中通过和失败的行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:389
msgid "These methods return the number of selected rows that were not evaluated, in total and by disposition."
msgstr "这些方法返回未被求值的选中行数，包括总数和按处置类别划分的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:399
msgid "`legacy_cases` is always 0 with the current executor. The counters of one summary satisfy"
msgstr "在当前执行器下，`legacy_cases` 始终为 0。同一个汇总的各计数器满足"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:412
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the per-row results in execution order; `success` is true when no executable row failed."
msgstr "`results` 返回按执行顺序排列的每行结果的副本；当没有可执行行失败时，`success` 为真。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:420
msgid "Skipped rows do not affect `success`."
msgstr "跳过的行不影响 `success`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:424
msgid "`RunSummary::merge(parts)` combines the summaries of the shards of one run."
msgstr "`RunSummary::merge(parts)` 合并一次运行中各分片的摘要。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:430
msgid "All counters except `total_cases` are added; `total_cases` is the maximum of the parts (every shard reports the same total). Results are concatenated in the order of `parts`. Merging the $n$ shards of a run gives the same counters as an unsharded run."
msgstr "除 `total_cases` 之外的所有计数器都相加；`total_cases` 取各部分的最大值（每个分片报告的总数相同）。结果按 `parts` 的顺序拼接。合并一次运行的 $n$ 个分片，得到的计数器与不分片运行相同。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:459
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:360
msgid "These methods come from `derive(Eq, @debug.Debug)`. Use `==`, `!=` and `debug_inspect` in new code."
msgstr "这些方法来自 `derive(Eq, @debug.Debug)`。新代码请使用 `==`、`!=` 和 `debug_inspect`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:464
msgid "`equal` compares all seven directive fields, `not_equal` is its negation and `to_repr` renders the record for `Debug`."
msgstr "`equal` 比较全部七个指令字段，`not_equal` 是其否定，`to_repr` 为 `Debug` 渲染该记录。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:473
msgid "`execute_documents` uses this equality to reuse the converted context of the previous row."
msgstr "`execute_documents` 利用这种相等性来复用上一行已转换的上下文。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:478
msgid "`equal` compares span and message; `to_repr` renders both."
msgstr "`equal` 比较源范围和消息；`to_repr` 渲染两者。"

#: manual/api/frontend/gda_expr.md:488
msgid "`equal` compares the shard, the strict flag and the filter text; `to_repr` renders them."
msgstr "`equal` 比较分片、严格标志和过滤器文本；`to_repr` 渲染它们。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/itl_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/itl_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/itl_expr` parses interval test cases in the ITL format of the ITF1788 suite (test data for the IEEE 1788-2015 interval standard) and executes them against `ball_float`. It is a pure library: the command-line runner is [`cli/itl_expr_cli`](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md). The [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/itl_expr.md) walks through the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/itl_expr.md) gives the pass rule."
msgstr "`frontend/itl_expr` 解析 ITF1788 套件（IEEE 1788-2015 区间标准的测试数据）中 ITL 格式的区间测试用例，并针对 `ball_float` 执行它们。它是一个纯库：命令行运行器是 [`cli/itl_expr_cli`](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md)。[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/itl_expr.md)逐步介绍工作流程，[设计页面](../../design/frontend/itl_expr.md)给出通过规则。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:22
msgid "The examples call it through the alias `@itl_expr`; cases are written as ITL text, so no interval package needs to be imported."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@itl_expr` 调用它；用例以 ITL 文本书写，因此无需导入任何区间包。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:29
msgid "`parse_itl(source)` parses ITL text into cases."
msgstr "`parse_itl(source)` 将 ITL 文本解析为用例。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:35
msgid "The text is read line by line, each line trimmed:"
msgstr "文本被逐行读取，每行都会被修剪："

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:37
msgid "`//` starts a comment that runs to the end of the line, so a statement may end in `; // note`; empty lines (also after removing the comment) are skipped; a line starting with `/*` starts a block comment that ends on the first later line containing `*/` (or on the same line);"
msgstr "`//` 开始一个延续到行尾的注释，因此语句可以以 `; // note` 结尾；空行（包括去除注释后为空的行）被跳过；以 `/*` 开头的行开始一个块注释，该注释结束于其后第一个包含 `*/` 的行（或同一行）；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:41
msgid "`testcase NAME …` starts a new block; `NAME` is the word after `testcase` and must be followed by a space, otherwise the diagnostic `\"invalid testcase declaration\"` is recorded; the statement counter restarts at 0;"
msgstr "`testcase NAME …` 开始一个新块；`NAME` 是 `testcase` 之后的单词，其后必须跟一个空格，否则记录诊断 `\"invalid testcase declaration\"`；语句计数器从 0 重新开始；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:45
msgid "a line equal to `}` is skipped;"
msgstr "等于 `}` 的行被跳过；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:46
msgid "every other line is appended (with a space) to the current statement, and a line ending in `;` completes it."
msgstr "其他每一行都（以一个空格）追加到当前语句中，以 `;` 结尾的行使语句完成。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:49
msgid "A completed statement `left = expected` is split at the first `=`. The left side is split into words at spaces and tabs outside square brackets; the first word is the operation and the rest are operands. The case id is `NAME:k`, where `k` counts statements in the block from 1 (statements before the first `testcase` use the name `anonymous`). A statement without `=` or without an operation is a diagnostic `\"NAME:k: missing '='\"` or `\"NAME:k: missing operation\"`; text left after the last `;` gives `\"unterminated ITL statement\"`. The result is `Ok(cases)` when there is no diagnostic and `Err(diagnostics)` otherwise."
msgstr "一个已完成的语句 `left = expected` 在第一个 `=` 处切分。左侧在方括号之外按空格和制表符切分为单词；第一个单词是运算，其余为操作数。用例 id 为 `NAME:k`，其中 `k` 从 1 开始统计块内的语句（第一个 `testcase` 之前的语句使用名称 `anonymous`）。不含 `=` 或不含运算的语句分别产生诊断 `\"NAME:k: missing '='\"` 或 `\"NAME:k: missing operation\"`；最后一个 `;` 之后剩余的文本产生 `\"unterminated ITL statement\"`。没有诊断时结果为 `Ok(cases)`，否则为 `Err(diagnostics)`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:61
msgid "`ItlCase` is one parsed statement."
msgstr "`ItlCase` 是一条已解析的语句。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:71
msgid "These methods return the id `NAME:k`, the operation word, a copy of the operand words and the expected text (trimmed, including any decoration suffix)."
msgstr "这些方法返回 id `NAME:k`、运算单词、操作数单词的副本，以及期望文本（已修剪，包含任何装饰后缀）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:86
msgid "`execute_case(case, precision?)` executes one case and returns its result."
msgstr "`execute_case(case, precision?)` 执行一个用例并返回其结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:92
msgid "`precision` (default `53`, must be positive) is the significand precision of the interval format the case runs in: bounds are read at `precision` bits and interval and number results are rounded with `@ball_float.BallContext::new(precision=precision)`, which has the binary64 exponent range. The default `53` is `BallContext::binary64()`, the format of the ITF1788 data."
msgstr "`precision`（默认 `53`，必须为正）是用例所在区间格式的有效数字精度：端点以 `precision` 位读取，区间结果和数值结果使用 `@ball_float.BallContext::new(precision=precision)` 舍入，其指数范围与 binary64 相同。默认值 `53` 即 `BallContext::binary64()`，也就是 ITF1788 数据所用的格式。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:99
msgid "Operands and expected values are read as follows. An interval literal is `[lo,hi]`, `[empty]`, `[entire]` or `[nai]`, optionally followed by `_dec` with `dec` one of `com`, `dac`, `def`, `trv`, `ill` (default `com`). A bound is `inf`/`infinity` with an optional sign, a hexadecimal float `0x…p…`, or decimal text. Decimal and hexadecimal bounds are rounded to nearest-even at `precision` bits, the lower bound as well as the upper one. This is the ITF1788 convention: its generator passes `[lo,hi]` to the inf-sup constructor of the target type as two floating constants, so a bound is the nearest number of the format, not the outward rounding that IEEE 1788 `textToInterval` applies to an interval literal string; the corpus relies on it (`isSingleton [17.1, 17.1] = true`). A decimal bound is first read as a decimal of $2p + 16$ significant digits; a literal with more digits is rounded twice."
msgstr "操作数和期望值按如下方式读取。区间字面量为 `[lo,hi]`、`[empty]`、`[entire]` 或 `[nai]`，后面可选地跟 `_dec`，其中 `dec` 为 `com`、`dac`、`def`、`trv`、`ill` 之一（默认 `com`）。端点为可带符号的 `inf`/`infinity`、十六进制浮点数 `0x…p…`，或十进制文本。十进制和十六进制端点以 `precision` 位按就近舍入（偶数优先）舍入，下端点和上端点都是如此。这是 ITF1788 的约定：其生成器把 `[lo,hi]` 作为目标类型的两个浮点常量传给 inf-sup 构造函数，因此端点是该格式中最接近的数，而不是 IEEE 1788 `textToInterval` 对区间字面量字符串所做的向外舍入；测试语料依赖这一点（`isSingleton [17.1, 17.1] = true`）。十进制端点首先被读取为具有 $2p + 16$ 位有效数字的十进制数；位数更多的字面量会被舍入两次。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:113
msgid "The case is dispatched on its operation and expected value:"
msgstr "用例根据其运算和期望值进行分派："

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:115
#: manual/performance_audit.md:25
msgid "Expected"
msgstr "预期"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:115
#: manual/numeric_semantics.md:573
msgid "Comparison"
msgstr "比较"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:117
#: manual/design/frontend/gda_expr.md:95
msgid "boolean"
msgstr "布尔"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:117
msgid "`true` or `false`"
msgstr "`true` 或 `false`"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:117
msgid "equal booleans"
msgstr "布尔值相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:118
msgid "overlap"
msgstr "重叠"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:118
msgid "an overlap state name (`before`, `meets`, `overlaps`, `starts`, `containedBy`, `finishes`, `equals`, `after`, `metBy`, `overlappedBy`, `startedBy`, `contains`, `finishedBy`, `bothEmpty`, `firstEmpty`, `secondEmpty`, `undefined`)"
msgstr "一个重叠状态名（`before`、`meets`、`overlaps`、`starts`、`containedBy`、`finishes`、`equals`、`after`、`metBy`、`overlappedBy`、`startedBy`、`contains`、`finishedBy`、`bothEmpty`、`firstEmpty`、`secondEmpty`、`undefined`）"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:118
msgid "equal names"
msgstr "名称相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:119
msgid "numeric"
msgstr "数值"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:119
msgid "a bound"
msgstr "一个端点"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:119
msgid "equal numbers"
msgstr "数值相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:120
msgid "unary"
msgstr "一元"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:120
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:121
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:123
msgid "interval"
msgstr "区间"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:120
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:121
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:123
msgid "equal sets"
msgstr "集合相等"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:121
msgid "ternary"
msgstr "三元"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
msgid "integer power"
msgstr "整数幂"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:122
msgid "`pown` (second operand an integer)"
msgstr "`pown`（第二个操作数为整数）"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:123
msgid "binary"
msgstr "二元"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:125
msgid "\"Equal sets\" means: both NaI, or both empty, or equal lower bounds and equal upper bounds (compared numerically, so $-0 = +0$). When the expected text contains `_`, the decorations must also be equal. The boolean dispatch is chosen whenever the expected text is `true` or `false`."
msgstr "“集合相等”的含义是：两者都是 NaI，或都为空，或下端点相等且上端点相等（按数值比较，因此 $-0 = +0$）。当期望文本包含 `_` 时，装饰也必须相等。只要期望文本是 `true` 或 `false`，就选择布尔分派。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:130
msgid "Dispositions:"
msgstr "处置结果："

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:132
msgid "`Executable` when the case was run; `passed()` tells the outcome;"
msgstr "用例已运行时为 `Executable`；`passed()` 给出结果；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:133
msgid "`Unsupported(reason)` for an unknown operation, whatever its operands and expected value, a binary-dispatch case whose expected value is not an interval (for example one followed by a `signal` annotation), a binary-dispatch case with other than two operands, or a boolean predicate other than the five unary ones whose second operand is missing or unreadable;"
msgstr "以下情况为 `Unsupported(reason)`：未知运算（无论其操作数和期望值如何）；二元分派的用例其期望值不是区间（例如后面跟有 `signal` 注记的期望值）；二元分派的用例其操作数不是两个；或除五个一元谓词之外的布尔谓词，其第二个操作数缺失或无法读取；"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:139
msgid "`Diagnostic(reason)` when the first operand of a boolean case, an operand of `isMember`, or an operand or the expected value of the overlap, numeric, unary, ternary or integer-power dispatch, cannot be read, or an operand of the binary dispatch is not an interval literal."
msgstr "以下情况为 `Diagnostic(reason)`：布尔用例的第一个操作数无法读取；`isMember` 的某个操作数无法读取；重叠、数值、一元、三元或整数幂分派中的某个操作数或期望值无法读取；或二元分派的某个操作数不是区间字面量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:144
msgid "Support is decided from the operation name before any operand is read, so `nums2interval 1.0 2.0`, `rootn [1.0,8.0] 3` and `sqrRev [0.0,1.0]` are unsupported and do not count against `RunSummary::success`."
msgstr "是否支持在读取任何操作数之前就根据运算名决定，因此 `nums2interval 1.0 2.0`、`rootn [1.0,8.0] 3` 和 `sqrRev [0.0,1.0]` 都不受支持，且不会影响 `RunSummary::success`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:148
msgid "`execute_case` does not abort on case content."
msgstr "`execute_case` 不会因用例内容而中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:152
msgid "`summarize_results(results)` counts a list of results."
msgstr "`summarize_results(results)` 对一组结果进行计数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:158
msgid "`total_cases` is the length of the list."
msgstr "`total_cases` 是列表的长度。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:164
msgid "`ItlDisposition` says whether a case was executed."
msgstr "`ItlDisposition` 说明一个用例是否被执行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:176
msgid "`ItlResult` is the outcome of one case."
msgstr "`ItlResult` 是一个用例的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:186
msgid "These methods return the case id, the disposition, whether the case passed, and a message: empty on success, `\"expected E, got A\"` on a mismatch (intervals printed by `BallFloatDecorated::to_string`), and a short reason or the offending text otherwise."
msgstr "这些方法返回用例 id、处置结果、该用例是否通过，以及一条消息：成功时为空，不匹配时为 `\"expected E, got A\"`（区间由 `BallFloatDecorated::to_string` 打印），其他情况下为简短的原因或出错的文本。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:200
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates a list of results."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一组结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:210
msgid "These methods return the number of results, the number of executed cases, and how many of those passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回结果数、已执行的用例数，以及其中通过和失败的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:222
msgid "These methods return the number of cases that were not executed, by disposition."
msgstr "这些方法按处置类别返回未执行的用例数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:232
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the results in the order they were given; `success` is the overall verdict."
msgstr "`results` 按给定顺序返回结果的副本；`success` 是总体判定。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:240
msgid "$\\text{total} = \\text{executable} + \\text{unsupported} + \\text{diagnostic}$ and $\\text{executable} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$. `success()` is true when no executable case failed **and** there is no diagnostic case; unsupported cases do not affect it."
msgstr "$\\text{total} = \\text{executable} + \\text{unsupported} + \\text{diagnostic}$ 且 $\\text{executable} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$。当没有可执行用例失败**并且**没有诊断用例时，`success()` 为真；不受支持的用例不影响它。"

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:267
msgid "These methods compare all fields of two cases and render a case for `Debug`. Use `==`, `!=` and `debug_inspect` in new code."
msgstr "这些方法比较两个用例的所有字段，并为 `Debug` 渲染一个用例。新代码中请使用 `==`、`!=` 和 `debug_inspect`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/mpfr_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/mpfr_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/mpfr_expr` parses reference data produced with GNU MPFR and executes it against `bin_float`. Three formats are supported: MPFR's square-root `data_check` files, integer-power rows, and an elementary-function matrix with exception flags. The package does no IO; the runner is [`cli/mpfr_expr_cli`](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md). See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md) for the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/mpfr_expr.md) for the pass rules."
msgstr "`frontend/mpfr_expr` 解析用 GNU MPFR 生成的参考数据，并针对 `bin_float` 执行它。支持三种格式：MPFR 的平方根 `data_check` 文件、整数幂行，以及带异常标志的初等函数矩阵。该包不进行任何 IO；运行器是 [`cli/mpfr_expr_cli`](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md)。工作流程参见[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md)，通过规则参见[设计页面](../../design/frontend/mpfr_expr.md)。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:23
msgid "The examples call it through the alias `@mpfr_expr`; rows are written as text, so `bin_float` does not need to be imported."
msgstr "示例通过别名 `@mpfr_expr` 调用它；行以文本形式书写，因此无需导入 `bin_float`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:26
msgid "Common row syntax"
msgstr "通用行语法"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:28
msgid ""
"All three parsers split the text at `\\n"
"`, trim each line, and skip empty lines and lines starting with `#`. Fields are separated by spaces, tabs or carriage returns. Line numbers start at 1. A rounding field is one of"
msgstr ""
"三个解析器都在 `\\n"
"` 处切分文本，修剪每一行，并跳过空行和以 `#` 开头的行。字段以空格、制表符或回车符分隔。行号从 1 开始。舍入字段为以下之一"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:41
msgid "and a number is read by `@bin_float.BinFloat::from_hex` (`0x…p…` with an integer hexadecimal significand and no point, `inf`, `-inf`, `nan`) at the precision named for that field; a significand with more bits than that precision is rounded to nearest-even. Each parser returns `Ok(document)` when every line is valid and otherwise `Err` with one `ParseDiagnostic` per invalid line."
msgstr "数值由 `@bin_float.BinFloat::from_hex` 以该字段所指定的精度读取（`0x…p…`，其有效数为不带小数点的十六进制整数；以及 `inf`、`-inf`、`nan`）；位数多于该精度的有效数按就近舍入（偶数优先）舍入。每个解析器在所有行都有效时返回 `Ok(document)`，否则返回 `Err`，其中每个无效行对应一个 `ParseDiagnostic`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:47
msgid "Square-root data"
msgstr "平方根数据"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:51
msgid "`parse_sqrt_data(source, text)` parses rows of five fields: `input_precision output_precision rounding input expected`."
msgstr "`parse_sqrt_data(source, text)` 解析由五个字段组成的行：`input_precision output_precision rounding input expected`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:58
msgid "The input is read at `input_precision` bits and the expected value at `output_precision` bits. Row ids are `sqrt:LINE`."
msgstr "输入以 `input_precision` 位读取，期望值以 `output_precision` 位读取。行 id 为 `sqrt:LINE`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:63
msgid "`execute_sqrt_data(document)` computes `input.sqrt_ctx(ctx)` for every row, where `ctx` is `BinaryContext::unbounded(output_precision, rounding~)`."
msgstr "`execute_sqrt_data(document)` 为每一行计算 `input.sqrt_ctx(ctx)`，其中 `ctx` 为 `BinaryContext::unbounded(output_precision, rounding~)`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:70
msgid "A row passes when the result is equal (`==`) to the expected `BinFloat`. Flags are not compared."
msgstr "当结果与期望的 `BinFloat` 相等（`==`）时该行通过。不比较标志。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:75
msgid "`MpfrDocument` is a parsed square-root file; `MpfrCase` is one of its rows and has no public methods."
msgstr "`MpfrDocument` 是一个已解析的平方根文件；`MpfrCase` 是其中的一行，没有公开方法。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:90
msgid "`source` returns the name given to the parser and `case_count` the number of rows."
msgstr "`source` 返回传给解析器的名称，`case_count` 返回行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:98
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:568
#: manual/tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:83
msgid "Integer powers"
msgstr "整数次幂"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:102
msgid "`parse_pow_data(source, text)` parses rows of ten fields."
msgstr "`parse_pow_data(source, text)` 解析由十个字段组成的行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:108
msgid "The fields are `precision rounding input_coefficient_hex input_exponent2 input_negative exponent expected_coefficient_hex expected_exponent2 expected_negative inexact`, where the two numbers are $(-1)^{\\text{negative}} \\cdot \\text{coefficient} \\cdot 2^{\\text{exponent2}}$, the signs and `inexact` are `0` or `1`, and `exponent` is the integer power. The input is read at 512 bits and the expected value at `precision` bits. Row ids are `pow:LINE`. The coefficient fields are bare hexadecimal digits; the parser builds `0xCOEFFpEXP` from them."
msgstr "字段为 `precision rounding input_coefficient_hex input_exponent2 input_negative exponent expected_coefficient_hex expected_exponent2 expected_negative inexact`，其中两个数均为 $(-1)^{\\text{negative}} \\cdot \\text{coefficient} \\cdot 2^{\\text{exponent2}}$，各符号位和 `inexact` 为 `0` 或 `1`，`exponent` 是整数幂指数。输入以 512 位读取，期望值以 `precision` 位读取。行 id 为 `pow:LINE`。系数字段是不带前缀的十六进制数字；解析器由它们构造 `0xCOEFFpEXP`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:119
msgid "`execute_pow_data(document)` computes `input.pow_int_ctx(exponent, ctx)` with `ctx = BinaryContext::unbounded(precision, rounding~)`."
msgstr "`execute_pow_data(document)` 计算 `input.pow_int_ctx(exponent, ctx)`，其中 `ctx = BinaryContext::unbounded(precision, rounding~)`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:126
msgid "A row passes when the result is equal (`==`) to the expected value, the inexact flag equals the row's flag, and no underflow, overflow, division by zero or invalid flag is raised."
msgstr "当结果与期望值相等（`==`）、不精确标志等于该行的标志，并且没有引发下溢、上溢、除以零或无效标志时，该行通过。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:132
msgid "`MpfrPowDocument` is a parsed power file; `MpfrPowCase` is one row and has no public methods."
msgstr "`MpfrPowDocument` 是一个已解析的幂文件；`MpfrPowCase` 是其中的一行，没有公开方法。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:147
#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:206
msgid "These methods return the name given to the parser and the number of rows."
msgstr "这些方法返回传给解析器的名称以及行数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:158
msgid "`parse_elementary_data(source, text)` parses rows of ten fields: `op precision rounding x y n expected inexact invalid divbyzero`."
msgstr "`parse_elementary_data(source, text)` 解析由十个字段组成的行：`op precision rounding x y n expected inexact invalid divbyzero`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:165
msgid "`op` is one of `exp`, `exp2`, `exp10`, `expm1`, `ln`, `log2`, `log10`, `log1p`, `sqrt`, `rootn`, `pown`, `pow`, `hypot`, `sin`, `cos`, `tan`, `sinpi`, `cospi`, `tanpi`, `asin`, `acos`, `atan`, `atan2`, `sinh`, `cosh`, `tanh`, `asinh`, `acosh`, `atanh`. `x` and `y` are operands read at 512 bits (`y` is `-` when unused), `n` is the integer argument of `rootn` and `pown`, `expected` is read at `precision` bits, and the last three fields are `0` or `1`. Row ids are `op:LINE`."
msgstr "`op` 为 `exp`、`exp2`、`exp10`、`expm1`、`ln`、`log2`、`log10`、`log1p`、`sqrt`、`rootn`、`pown`、`pow`、`hypot`、`sin`、`cos`、`tan`、`sinpi`、`cospi`、`tanpi`、`asin`、`acos`、`atan`、`atan2`、`sinh`、`cosh`、`tanh`、`asinh`、`acosh`、`atanh` 之一。`x` 和 `y` 是以 512 位读取的操作数（未使用时 `y` 为 `-`），`n` 是 `rootn` 和 `pown` 的整数参数，`expected` 以 `precision` 位读取，最后三个字段为 `0` 或 `1`。行 id 为 `op:LINE`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:173
msgid "A row of the two-operand functions `pow`, `hypot` and `atan2` whose `y` is `-` is the diagnostic `\"invalid MPFR elementary field\"`."
msgstr "双操作数函数 `pow`、`hypot` 和 `atan2` 中 `y` 为 `-` 的行是诊断 `\"invalid MPFR elementary field\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:178
msgid "`execute_elementary_data(document)` evaluates every row with the checked `try_*_ctx` method of `BinFloat` for its operation (`sqrt_ctx` and `pown_ctx` for `sqrt` and `pown`) in `BinaryContext::unbounded(precision, rounding~)`."
msgstr "`execute_elementary_data(document)` 在 `BinaryContext::unbounded(precision, rounding~)` 中，用 `BinFloat` 对应其运算的 checked 方法 `try_*_ctx`（对 `sqrt` 和 `pown` 则为 `sqrt_ctx` 和 `pown_ctx`）对每一行求值。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:186
msgid "A row passes when the result compares equal to the expected value (`compare == 0`, so every NaN equals every NaN) with the same sign when it is zero, the inexact, invalid and division-by-zero flags equal the row's flags, and neither underflow nor overflow is raised. If a `try_*_ctx` method returns `Err` (for example a certification failure) the row fails with the message `\"certification failure for MPFR differential case\"`."
msgstr "当结果与期望值比较相等（`compare == 0`，因此任意 NaN 都与任意 NaN 相等）且结果为零时符号相同，不精确、无效和除以零标志等于该行的标志，并且既没有引发下溢也没有引发上溢时，该行通过。若某个 `try_*_ctx` 方法返回 `Err`（例如认证失败），该行以消息 `\"certification failure for MPFR differential case\"` 失败。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:196
msgid "`MpfrElementaryDocument` is a parsed elementary file."
msgstr "`MpfrElementaryDocument` 是一个已解析的初等函数文件。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:213
msgid "Diagnostics and results"
msgstr "诊断与结果"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:217
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:218
msgid "`ParseDiagnostic` is one invalid line."
msgstr "`ParseDiagnostic` 是一个无效行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:227
#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:228
msgid "These methods return the name given to the parser, the 1-based line number and the message."
msgstr "这些方法返回传给解析器的名称、从 1 开始的行号和消息。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:236
msgid "Messages name the problem, for example `\"MPFR pow row must contain ten fields\"`, `\"invalid MPFR pow field\"` or `\"invalid MPFR elementary expected value\"`."
msgstr "消息指明问题所在，例如 `\"MPFR pow row must contain ten fields\"`、`\"invalid MPFR pow field\"` 或 `\"invalid MPFR elementary expected value\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:242
msgid "`CaseResult` is the outcome of one row."
msgstr "`CaseResult` 是一行的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:252
msgid "These methods return the row id, whether the row passed, and a message."
msgstr "这些方法返回行 id、该行是否通过，以及一条消息。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:260
msgid "The message is empty for a pass and otherwise shows expected and actual values in hexadecimal (and the compared flags for power and elementary rows)."
msgstr "通过时消息为空，否则以十六进制显示期望值和实际值（对于幂行和初等函数行，还显示所比较的标志）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:265
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates the rows of one document."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一个文档中的各行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:275
msgid "These methods return the number of rows, and how many passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回行数，以及通过和失败的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:285
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the per-row results; `success` is the verdict."
msgstr "`results` 返回逐行结果的副本；`success` 是判定。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:292
msgid "Every row is executed, so $\\text{total} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$; `success` is true when no row failed. `results` returns the results in row order."
msgstr "每一行都会被执行，因此 $\\text{total} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$；当没有行失败时 `success` 为真。`results` 按行序返回结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:315
msgid "These methods compare location and message and render a diagnostic for `Debug`. Use `==`, `!=` and `debug_inspect` in new code."
msgstr "这些方法比较位置和消息，并为 `Debug` 渲染诊断。新代码中请使用 `==`、`!=` 和 `debug_inspect`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:1
msgid "frontend/testfloat_expr API"
msgstr "frontend/testfloat_expr API"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:5
msgid "`frontend/testfloat_expr` parses Berkeley TestFloat test vectors and executes them against `bin_float` in the binary16, binary32, binary64 and binary128 interchange formats. A `TestFloatSpec` describes the function, rounding mode, tininess rule and exactness that produced a vector file; `parse_testfloat` reads the vectors and `execute_document` runs them. The package does no IO; the runner is [`cli/testfloat_expr_cli`](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md). The [tutorial](../../tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md) shows the workflow and the [design page](../../design/frontend/testfloat_expr.md) specifies the pass rule."
msgstr "`frontend/testfloat_expr` 解析 Berkeley TestFloat 测试向量，并在 binary16、binary32、binary64 和 binary128 交换格式下针对 `bin_float` 执行它们。`TestFloatSpec` 描述生成向量文件时所用的函数、舍入模式、微小性（tininess）规则和精确性；`parse_testfloat` 读取向量，`execute_document` 运行它们。该包不进行任何 IO；运行器是 [`cli/testfloat_expr_cli`](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)。[教程](../../tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md)展示工作流程，[设计页面](../../design/frontend/testfloat_expr.md)规定通过规则。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:17
msgid "Add the package to the `import` block of your `moon.pkg`; import `bin_float` as well when you compare the format or rounding mode of a specification:"
msgstr "将该包添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 的 `import` 块中；若要比较规格的格式或舍入模式，还需导入 `bin_float`："

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:27
msgid "The examples use the aliases `@testfloat_expr` and `@bin_float`."
msgstr "示例使用别名 `@testfloat_expr` 和 `@bin_float`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:29
msgid "Function specification"
msgstr "函数规格"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:33
msgid "`TestFloatOperation` lists the TestFloat functions the executor supports."
msgstr "`TestFloatOperation` 列出执行器支持的 TestFloat 函数。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:58
msgid "TestFloat name"
msgstr "TestFloat 名称"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:58
msgid "Operands"
msgstr "操作数"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:58
msgid "`bin_float` method"
msgstr "`bin_float` 方法"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:64
msgid "`to_integral_exact_ctx` if exact, else `to_integral_value_ctx`"
msgstr "精确时为 `to_integral_exact_ctx`，否则为 `to_integral_value_ctx`"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:65
msgid "`to_int_ctx`, `to_int64_ctx`, `to_uint_ctx`, `to_uint64_ctx` with `exact~`"
msgstr "带 `exact~` 的 `to_int_ctx`、`to_int64_ctx`、`to_uint_ctx`、`to_uint64_ctx`"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:71
msgid "`TestFloatSpec` is the configuration of one TestFloat run."
msgstr "`TestFloatSpec` 是一次 TestFloat 运行的配置。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:81
msgid "`TestFloatSpec::parse(function_name, rounding, tininess?, exact?)` builds a specification from TestFloat names."
msgstr "`TestFloatSpec::parse(function_name, rounding, tininess?, exact?)` 根据 TestFloat 名称构建一个规格。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:88
msgid "`function_name` is `FORMAT_OPERATION`: the part before the first `_` is the format (`f16`, `f32`, `f64`, `f128`) and the rest is the operation (`add`, `mulAdd`, `to_ui64`, `le_quiet`, …). Names are matched case-insensitively with `-`, `_` and spaces removed. TestFloat functions outside the eighteen operations, such as `f64_to_f32`, `i32_to_f64` or `f64_to_i32_r_minMag`, are rejected. `rounding` is one of `rnear_even`, `rnear_maxMag`, `rminMag`, `rmin`, `rmax` (also accepted without the leading `r`, or as the IEEE names `roundTiesToEven`, `roundTiesToAway`, `roundTowardZero`, `roundTowardNegative`, `roundTowardPositive`). `tininess` is `\"after\"` (default) or `\"before\"` (also `tininessAfter`, `tininessBefore`). `exact` (default `false`) selects TestFloat's `-exact` variants of `roundToInt` and the integer conversions. Errors are `\"unsupported TestFloat function name …\"`, `\"… format …\"`, `\"… operation …\"`, `\"… rounding mode …\"` and `\"… tininess mode …\"`."
msgstr "`function_name` 的形式为 `FORMAT_OPERATION`：第一个 `_` 之前的部分是格式（`f16`、`f32`、`f64`、`f128`），其余部分是运算（`add`、`mulAdd`、`to_ui64`、`le_quiet`、…）。名称在去除 `-`、`_` 和空格后按不区分大小写的方式匹配。十八种运算之外的 TestFloat 函数，例如 `f64_to_f32`、`i32_to_f64` 或 `f64_to_i32_r_minMag`，会被拒绝。`rounding` 为 `rnear_even`、`rnear_maxMag`、`rminMag`、`rmin`、`rmax` 之一（也接受去掉开头 `r` 的形式，或 IEEE 名称 `roundTiesToEven`、`roundTiesToAway`、`roundTowardZero`、`roundTowardNegative`、`roundTowardPositive`）。`tininess` 为 `\"after\"`（默认）或 `\"before\"`（也接受 `tininessAfter`、`tininessBefore`）。`exact`（默认 `false`）选择 TestFloat 中 `roundToInt` 及整数转换的 `-exact` 变体。错误为 `\"unsupported TestFloat function name …\"`、`\"… format …\"`、`\"… operation …\"`、`\"… rounding mode …\"` 和 `\"… tininess mode …\"`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:123
msgid "These accessors return the parsed configuration."
msgstr "这些访问器返回解析后的配置。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:134
msgid "`function_name` is the name as given. `exact` is stored for every operation but only changes the result of `roundToInt` and the four integer conversions."
msgstr "`function_name` 是按给定形式保存的名称。`exact` 对每个运算都会存储，但只改变 `roundToInt` 和四种整数转换的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:142
msgid "`parse_testfloat(source, text, spec)` parses the vectors of one function."
msgstr "`parse_testfloat(source, text, spec)` 解析一个函数的向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:148
msgid "Lines are trimmed; empty lines and lines starting with `#` are skipped. A vector has $k + 2$ white-space separated fields, where $k$ is the operand count of the operation: $k$ operand encodings, the expected result and a two-digit hexadecimal flag mask. Operand encodings are hexadecimal bit patterns of `spec.format()`. The expected result is an encoding for arithmetic operations, a hexadecimal integer of at most 16 digits for conversions, and `0` or `1` for comparisons. A wrong field count gives `\"unexpected TestFloat field count\"`, an unreadable field `\"invalid TestFloat hexadecimal field\"`. The result is `Ok` only when no line is invalid."
msgstr "各行会被修剪；空行和以 `#` 开头的行被跳过。一个向量有 $k + 2$ 个以空白分隔的字段，其中 $k$ 是该运算的操作数个数：$k$ 个操作数编码、期望结果，以及一个两位十六进制的标志掩码。操作数编码是 `spec.format()` 的十六进制位模式。对于算术运算，期望结果是一个编码；对于转换，是至多 16 位的十六进制整数；对于比较，是 `0` 或 `1`。字段数错误产生 `\"unexpected TestFloat field count\"`，字段无法读取产生 `\"invalid TestFloat hexadecimal field\"`。只有当没有无效行时结果才为 `Ok`。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:161
msgid "`TestFloatDocument` is a parsed vector file."
msgstr "`TestFloatDocument` 是一个已解析的向量文件。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:171
msgid "These methods return the name given to the parser, the specification, a copy of the vectors in file order, and their number."
msgstr "这些方法返回传给解析器的名称、规格、按文件顺序排列的向量的副本，以及向量的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:183
msgid "`TestFloatCase` is one vector."
msgstr "`TestFloatCase` 是一个向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:193
msgid "These methods return the id `FUNCTION:LINE`, for example `f64_mulAdd:17`, and the 1-based line number of the vector in the parsed text."
msgstr "这些方法返回 id `FUNCTION:LINE`（例如 `f64_mulAdd:17`），以及该向量在被解析文本中从 1 开始的行号。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:241
msgid "`execute_document(document, options?)` executes the selected vectors."
msgstr "`execute_document(document, options?)` 执行被选中的向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:247
msgid "Vector $k$ (counting from 0 in file order) is executed when $k \\bmod n = i$ for shard count $n$ and index $i$. Operands are decoded to `BinFloat` and the operation runs in `spec.format().context(rounding~, tininess~)`. The vector passes when:"
msgstr "对于分片数 $n$ 和索引 $i$，当 $k \\bmod n = i$ 时执行第 $k$ 个向量（按文件顺序从 0 开始计数）。操作数被解码为 `BinFloat`，运算在 `spec.format().context(rounding~, tininess~)` 中执行。向量在以下情况下通过："

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:252
msgid "**arithmetic:** the result, re-encoded in the format with the same rounding and tininess, has exactly the expected bit pattern, or the expected result is any NaN and the actual result is a quiet NaN; and the SoftFloat mask of the operation's flags combined with the encoding flags equals the expected mask;"
msgstr "**算术运算**：结果以相同的舍入和微小性规则重新编码到该格式后，其位模式与期望值完全一致，或者期望结果是任意 NaN 而实际结果是静默 NaN；并且运算标志与编码标志合并后的 SoftFloat 掩码等于期望掩码；"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:257
msgid "**integer conversion:** if the expected mask has the invalid bit `10`, the conversion must report invalid (`None`) and its value field is ignored; otherwise the conversion must return the expected integer (signed results compared as two's-complement bit patterns); in both cases the flag masks must be equal;"
msgstr "**整数转换**：若期望掩码含有无效位 `10`，则转换必须报告无效（`None`），其值字段被忽略；否则转换必须返回期望的整数（有符号结果按二进制补码位模式比较）；两种情况下标志掩码都必须相等；"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:262
msgid "**comparison:** the boolean and the flag mask are equal."
msgstr "**比较**：布尔值与标志掩码都相等。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:264
msgid "Every selected vector is executable; there are no skipped vectors."
msgstr "每个被选中的向量都是可执行的；不存在被跳过的向量。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:268
msgid "`RunOptions` selects a shard."
msgstr "`RunOptions` 选择一个分片。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:278
msgid "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?)` builds the options."
msgstr "`RunOptions::new(shard_count?, shard_index?)` 构建选项。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:284
msgid "Defaults: one shard, index 0. `RunOptions::new` aborts unless `shard_count > 0` and `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`."
msgstr "默认值：一个分片，索引 0。除非 `shard_count > 0` 且 `0 <= shard_index < shard_count`，否则 `RunOptions::new` 中止。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:289
msgid "These accessors return the shard count and index."
msgstr "这些访问器返回分片数和分片索引。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:300
msgid "`CaseResult` is the outcome of one vector."
msgstr "`CaseResult` 是一个向量的结果。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:310
msgid "These methods return the vector id, whether it passed, and a message."
msgstr "这些方法返回向量 id、它是否通过，以及一条消息。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:318
msgid "Messages: empty for a pass; `\"value mismatch: expected HEX, actual HEX\"`, `\"integer mismatch: …\"`, `\"comparison mismatch: …\"`, or `\"flags mismatch: expected M, actual M\"` (masks in decimal)."
msgstr "消息：通过时为空；否则为 `\"value mismatch: expected HEX, actual HEX\"`、`\"integer mismatch: …\"`、`\"comparison mismatch: …\"` 或 `\"flags mismatch: expected M, actual M\"`（掩码以十进制表示）。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:324
msgid "`RunSummary` aggregates a run."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 汇总一次运行。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:334
msgid "These methods return the number of vectors in the document, the number this shard executed, and how many of those passed and failed."
msgstr "这些方法返回文档中的向量数、本分片执行的数目，以及其中通过和失败的数目。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:346
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the results in vector order; `success` is the verdict."
msgstr "`results` 按向量顺序返回结果的副本；`success` 是判定。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:354
msgid "`total_cases` is the number of vectors in the document, `selected_cases = passed_cases + failed_cases` the number executed by this shard, and `success` is true when none failed."
msgstr "`total_cases` 是文档中的向量数，`selected_cases = passed_cases + failed_cases` 是本分片执行的向量数，当没有向量失败时 `success` 为真。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:365
msgid "`equal` compares constructors; `to_repr` renders the constructor name."
msgstr "`equal` 比较构造器；`to_repr` 渲染构造器名称。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:375
msgid "`equal` compares all six fields, including `function_name` as written, so `f64_mul` and `F64_MUL` give unequal specifications with the same behaviour."
msgstr "`equal` 比较全部六个字段，包括按书写形式比较的 `function_name`，因此 `f64_mul` 和 `F64_MUL` 给出行为相同但不相等的规格。"

#: manual/api/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:386
msgid "`equal` compares location and message; `to_repr` renders both."
msgstr "`equal` 比较位置和消息；`to_repr` 渲染两者。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:1
msgid "internal API"
msgstr "internal API"

#: manual/api/internal.md:5
msgid "`internal` holds exact integer and rational helpers for the numeric cores: powers of 2, 5 and 10, digit counting, removal of trailing factors, integer division with an explicit rounding mode, a decimal string splitter, reduced rationals, dyadic enclosures and the refinement budget of the certified elementary functions. It is an internal package: it cannot be imported from outside `Luna-Flow/floating`, and its interface may change without notice. The [design page](../design/internal.md) proves the rounding and enclosure invariants; the [tutorial](../tutorial/internal.md) shows how the helpers combine."
msgstr "`internal` 包含供各数值核心使用的精确整数与有理数辅助函数：2、5 和 10 的幂，数字位数计数，去除尾部因子，带显式舍入模式的整数除法，十进制字符串拆分器，最简有理数，二进有理数包络，以及经认证初等函数的细化预算。它是一个内部包：无法从 `Luna-Flow/floating` 之外导入，其接口可能在不另行通知的情况下变更。[设计页面](../design/internal.md)证明舍入与包络不变式；[教程](../tutorial/internal.md)展示这些辅助函数如何组合使用。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:15
msgid "Not every helper is used by every core. On the current branch the library code uses:"
msgstr "并非每个核心都使用每个辅助函数。在当前分支上，库代码的使用情况如下："

#: manual/api/internal.md:18
#: manual/getting_started.md:13
msgid "Package"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/api/internal.md:18
msgid "Helpers it uses"
msgstr "所用的辅助函数"

#: manual/api/internal.md:24
msgid "The binary and decimal cores round their own coefficients with their own kernels. The remaining helpers (`round_shift`, `remove_factor2`, `remove_factor10`, `trim_trailing_decimal_zeros`, `exact_divide_by_power_of_ten`, `compare_abs`, `sign_of_bigint`, `pow2`, the `CertifiedDyadic` family and the `result_lift2` combinators) are exercised by the `consistency` and package tests only."
msgstr "二进制和十进制核心使用各自的内核来舍入自己的系数。其余的辅助函数（`round_shift`、`remove_factor2`、`remove_factor10`、`trim_trailing_decimal_zeros`、`exact_divide_by_power_of_ten`、`compare_abs`、`sign_of_bigint`、`pow2`、`CertifiedDyadic` 系列以及 `result_lift2` 组合子）仅由 `consistency` 测试和包内测试使用。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:33
#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:17
#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:16
msgid "Inside the module, add the package to `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在模块内部，将该包添加到 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/internal.md:41
msgid "The examples call the package as `@internal.` and `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` as `@lf_arith.`; `BigInt` literals are written `12N`. The interface prints `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` as `@arithmetic` (`RoundingMode`, `ArithmeticError`, `CertificationStage`, `CertificationFailureReason`) and uses `@def.Sign`."
msgstr "示例以 `@internal.` 调用该包，以 `@lf_arith.` 调用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`；`BigInt` 字面量写作 `12N`。接口将 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 显示为 `@arithmetic`（`RoundingMode`、`ArithmeticError`、`CertificationStage`、`CertificationFailureReason`），并使用 `@def.Sign`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:46
msgid "Integer basics"
msgstr "整数基础"

#: manual/api/internal.md:50
msgid "These functions return the `BigInt` constants $0$ and $1$."
msgstr "这些函数返回 `BigInt` 常量 $0$ 和 $1$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:59
msgid "`abs_bigint(x)` is $|x|$, `sign_of_bigint(x)` is `Negative`, `Zero` or `Positive`, and `compare_abs(a, b)` compares $|a|$ with $|b|$."
msgstr "`abs_bigint(x)` 为 $|x|$，`sign_of_bigint(x)` 为 `Negative`、`Zero` 或 `Positive`，`compare_abs(a, b)` 比较 $|a|$ 与 $|b|$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:68
msgid "`compare_abs` returns a negative, zero or positive `Int` (the result of `BigInt::compare` on the magnitudes)."
msgstr "`compare_abs` 返回负数、零或正数的 `Int`（即对两者绝对值调用 `BigInt::compare` 的结果）。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:80
msgid "Powers"
msgstr "幂"

#: manual/api/internal.md:84
msgid "These functions return $2^n$, $5^n$ and $10^n$."
msgstr "这些函数返回 $2^n$、$5^n$ 和 $10^n$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:92
msgid "They abort when $n < 0$. `pow2` is a shift. `pow5` and `pow10` read a process-wide cache that starts with $n \\le 18$ and is extended on demand up to $n = 4096$; larger powers are computed each time without caching."
msgstr "当 $n < 0$ 时它们会中止。`pow2` 是一次移位。`pow5` 和 `pow10` 读取一个进程级缓存，该缓存初始包含 $n \\le 18$ 的幂，并按需扩展到至多 $n = 4096$；更大的幂每次都重新计算，不做缓存。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:98
msgid "`digits10(x)` is the number of decimal digits of $|x|$, with `digits10(0) == 1`."
msgstr "`digits10(x)` 是 $|x|$ 的十进制位数，且 `digits10(0) == 1`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:105
msgid ""
"For $x \\n"
"e 0$ it returns the unique $d$ with $10^{d-1} \\le |x| < 10^{d}$, starting from an estimate based on the bit length and correcting it with comparisons against powers of ten (no decimal string is built)."
msgstr ""
"对于 $x \\n"
"e 0$，它返回满足 $10^{d-1} \\le |x| < 10^{d}$ 的唯一 $d$：先根据位长给出估计，再通过与 10 的幂比较加以修正（不构造十进制字符串）。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:119
msgid "Trailing factors"
msgstr "尾部因子"

#: manual/api/internal.md:123
msgid "`remove_factor2(sig, exp)` removes all factors 2 from `sig`, adjusting the binary exponent."
msgstr "`remove_factor2(sig, exp)` 从 `sig` 中去除所有因子 2，并相应调整二进制指数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:130
msgid ""
"For $\\mathit{sig} \\n"
"e 0$ it returns $(\\mathit{sig}/2^t, \\mathit{exp} + t)$ with $t$ the number of trailing zero bits of $|\\mathit{sig}|$, so $\\mathit{sig} \\cdot 2^{\\mathit{exp}}$ is unchanged, the sign is kept and the new significand is odd. For $\\mathit{sig} = 0$ it returns $(0, 0)$: the exponent of a zero is not kept."
msgstr ""
"对于 $\\mathit{sig} \\n"
"e 0$，它返回 $(\\mathit{sig}/2^t, \\mathit{exp} + t)$，其中 $t$ 是 $|\\mathit{sig}|$ 尾部零比特的个数，因此 $\\mathit{sig} \\cdot 2^{\\mathit{exp}}$ 保持不变，符号得以保留，且新的有效数为奇数。对于 $\\mathit{sig} = 0$，它返回 $(0, 0)$：零的指数不会被保留。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:138
msgid "`remove_factor10(coeff, exp)` removes all factors 10 from `coeff`, adjusting the decimal exponent."
msgstr "`remove_factor10(coeff, exp)` 从 `coeff` 中去除所有因子 10，并相应调整十进制指数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:145
msgid "The value $\\mathit{coeff} \\cdot 10^{\\mathit{exp}}$ and the sign are preserved and the new coefficient is not divisible by 10. Zero gives $(0, 0)$."
msgstr "值 $\\mathit{coeff} \\cdot 10^{\\mathit{exp}}$ 和符号保持不变，且新的系数不能被 10 整除。零得到 $(0, 0)$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:150
msgid "`trim_trailing_decimal_zeros(coeff, exp, max_drop?)` removes up to `max_drop` trailing decimal zeros."
msgstr "`trim_trailing_decimal_zeros(coeff, exp, max_drop?)` 去除至多 `max_drop` 个十进制尾随零。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:157
msgid "It returns $(c', e', k)$ with $c = c' \\cdot 10^{k}$, $e' = e + k$, and $k$ maximal subject to $k \\le$ `max_drop`. A negative `max_drop` (the default $-1$) sets the limit to `digits10(c) - 1`, which never binds because a non-zero integer with $k$ trailing zeros has at least $k + 1$ digits; so the default removes every trailing zero. Zero gives $(0, 0, 0)$. A limit lets a caller stop at a target exponent, as decNumber-style trimming to an ideal exponent does."
msgstr "它返回 $(c', e', k)$，满足 $c = c' \\cdot 10^{k}$、$e' = e + k$，且 $k$ 在 $k \\le$ `max_drop` 的约束下取最大。负的 `max_drop`（默认 $-1$）将限制设为 `digits10(c) - 1`，该限制永远不会起作用，因为带有 $k$ 个尾随零的非零整数至少有 $k + 1$ 位数字；因此默认情况下会去除所有尾随零。零得到 $(0, 0, 0)$。设置限制可让调用方在某个目标指数处停下，正如 decNumber 风格的、截尾到理想指数的做法那样。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:167
msgid "`exact_divide_by_power_of_ten(coeff, shift)` is `Some(coeff / 10^shift)` when the division is exact and `None` otherwise."
msgstr "当除法精确时，`exact_divide_by_power_of_ten(coeff, shift)` 为 `Some(coeff / 10^shift)`，否则为 `None`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:174
msgid "The sign is kept. Zero gives `Some(0)` for every `shift`; for a non-zero coefficient a negative `shift` aborts."
msgstr "符号保持不变。对于任意 `shift`，零都得到 `Some(0)`；对于非零系数，负的 `shift` 会导致中止。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:190
msgid "Rounding integer quotients"
msgstr "整数商的舍入"

#: manual/api/internal.md:194
msgid "`round_positive_div(n, d, negative, mode)` rounds the quotient $n/d$ to an integer magnitude."
msgstr "`round_positive_div(n, d, negative, mode)` 将商 $n/d$ 舍入为一个整数量值。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:201
msgid "Requires $n \\ge 0$ and $d > 0$ (aborts otherwise). `negative` is the sign of the real quotient whose magnitude is $n/d$; the result is $|\\circ_{\\text{mode}}((-1)^{\\text{negative}}\\, n/d)|$, where $\\circ$ rounds to an integer:"
msgstr "要求 $n \\ge 0$ 且 $d > 0$（否则中止）。`negative` 是量值为 $n/d$ 的实数商的符号；结果为 $|\\circ_{\\text{mode}}((-1)^{\\text{negative}}\\, n/d)|$，其中 $\\circ$ 表示舍入到整数："

#: manual/api/internal.md:206
msgid "result for $n = qd + r$, $0 \\le r < d$"
msgstr "对 $n = qd + r$、$0 \\le r < d$ 的结果"

#: manual/api/internal.md:214
msgid "The result is exact (equal to $n/d$) exactly when $r = 0$."
msgstr "结果是精确的（等于 $n/d$）当且仅当 $r = 0$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:235
msgid "`round_shift(m, s, negative, mode)` is `round_positive_div(m, 2^s, negative, mode)` computed with shifts."
msgstr "`round_shift(m, s, negative, mode)` 即用移位计算的 `round_positive_div(m, 2^s, negative, mode)`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:242
msgid "For $s \\le 0$ it returns $m$ unchanged (it never shifts left). $m$ should be non-negative; this is not checked. For a negative $m$ the quotient is the floor $\\lfloor m / 2^{s} \\rfloor$ of an arithmetic shift and the remainder is non-negative, so the table above no longer describes the rounding of $|m|$: `round_shift(-5N, 1, false, TowardZero)` is $-3$, not $-2$."
msgstr "对于 $s \\le 0$，它原样返回 $m$（从不左移）。$m$ 应为非负数；这一点不会被检查。对于负的 $m$，商是算术移位的下取整 $\\lfloor m / 2^{s} \\rfloor$，余数为非负，因此上表不再描述 $|m|$ 的舍入：`round_shift(-5N, 1, false, TowardZero)` 为 $-3$，而不是 $-2$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:248
msgid "Decimal strings"
msgstr "十进制字符串"

#: manual/api/internal.md:252
msgid "`split_decimal_string(text)` splits a finite decimal literal into sign, digits and exponent; `split_decimal_string_wide` returns the exponent as an `Int64`."
msgstr "`split_decimal_string(text)` 将一个有限十进制字面量拆分为符号、数字串和指数；`split_decimal_string_wide` 以 `Int64` 返回指数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:261
msgid "The accepted grammar is"
msgstr "所接受的语法为"

#: manual/api/internal.md:267
msgid "The result $(\\mathit{neg}, D, q)$ satisfies $\\text{value} = (-1)^{\\mathit{neg}} \\cdot D \\cdot 10^{q}$, where $D$ is the string of all mantissa digits (leading zeros kept) and $q$ is the written exponent minus the number of fraction digits. In the wide form the written exponent is exact up to $10^{18}$ in magnitude and saturates there, which is far outside every exponent range. `split_decimal_string` returns `None` when $q$ does not fit `Int`. Anything else, including whitespace, `_`, `inf` and `nan`, gives `None`."
msgstr "结果 $(\\mathit{neg}, D, q)$ 满足 $\\text{value} = (-1)^{\\mathit{neg}} \\cdot D \\cdot 10^{q}$，其中 $D$ 是全部尾数数字组成的字符串（保留前导零），$q$ 是书写的指数减去小数部分的位数。在宽版本中，书写的指数在绝对值不超过 $10^{18}$ 时是精确的，超出则饱和于此，这远在任何指数范围之外。当 $q$ 不能放入 `Int` 时，`split_decimal_string` 返回 `None`。其他任何输入，包括空白、`_`、`inf` 和 `nan`，都得到 `None`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:290
msgid "Result combinators"
msgstr "Result 组合子"

#: manual/api/internal.md:294
msgid "These functions combine two `Result`s, returning the first error."
msgstr "这些函数组合两个 `Result`，返回第一个错误。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:301
msgid "`result_lift2(Ok(a), Ok(b), f)` is `Ok(f(a, b))`; `result_lift2_checked` returns `f(a, b)` itself. If `left` is `Err`, that error is returned; otherwise an `Err` in `right` is returned. `f` runs only when both are `Ok`."
msgstr "`result_lift2(Ok(a), Ok(b), f)` 为 `Ok(f(a, b))`；`result_lift2_checked` 则直接返回 `f(a, b)`。若 `left` 为 `Err`，则返回该错误；否则返回 `right` 中的 `Err`。只有当两者都为 `Ok` 时才会运行 `f`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:315
#: manual/api/semantic.md:44
msgid "Exact rationals"
msgstr "精确有理数"

#: manual/api/internal.md:319
msgid "`ExactRat` is a rational number in lowest terms."
msgstr "`ExactRat` 是一个最简形式的有理数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:329
msgid "`ExactRat::new(n, d)` reduces $n/d$ to lowest terms with a positive denominator; the accessors return the reduced parts."
msgstr "`ExactRat::new(n, d)` 将 $n/d$ 约简为分母为正的最简形式；访问器返回约简后的各部分。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:338
msgid "Aborts when $d = 0$. Zero is stored as $0/1$. Because the form is canonical, `==` on `ExactRat` is equality of rational numbers."
msgstr "当 $d = 0$ 时中止。零存储为 $0/1$。由于该形式是规范的，`ExactRat` 上的 `==` 就是有理数的相等。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:343
msgid "These methods compare canonical forms; use `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "这些方法比较规范形式；请使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:361
#: manual/design/internal.md:47
msgid "Dyadic enclosures"
msgstr "二进有理数包络"

#: manual/api/internal.md:365
msgid "`CertifiedDyadic` is the dyadic rational $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$, where $n$ is `numerator_` and the scale $s$ = `scale_` is non-negative."
msgstr "`CertifiedDyadic` 是二进有理数 $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$，其中 $n$ 为 `numerator_`，标度 $s$ = `scale_` 非负。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:375
msgid "The fields are readable but the struct cannot be built literally outside the package; build values with `new` or `from_int`."
msgstr "这些字段可读，但无法在包外以字面量方式构建该结构体；请用 `new` 或 `from_int` 构建值。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:380
msgid "`new(n, s)` is $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$ (aborts if $s < 0$); `from_int(k)` is $k \\cdot 2^{0}$; the accessors return the fields."
msgstr "`new(n, s)` 为 $n \\cdot 2^{-s}$（若 $s < 0$ 则中止）；`from_int(k)` 为 $k \\cdot 2^{0}$；访问器返回各字段。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:390
msgid "The representation is not normalized: $2 \\cdot 2^{-1}$ and $1 \\cdot 2^{0}$ are different values of the struct with the same number."
msgstr "该表示未经规范化：$2 \\cdot 2^{-1}$ 和 $1 \\cdot 2^{0}$ 是该结构体的两个不同的值，但表示同一个数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:395
msgid "These methods are exact arithmetic and comparison of dyadic numbers."
msgstr "这些方法是二进有理数的精确算术与比较。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:405
msgid "`add` and `sub` align to the larger scale; `mul` adds the scales; `compare` compares the numbers (not the representations), so `new(2N, 1).compare(from_int(1))` is `0`."
msgstr "`add` 和 `sub` 对齐到较大的标度；`mul` 将标度相加；`compare` 比较的是数值（而非表示），因此 `new(2N, 1).compare(from_int(1))` 为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:411
msgid "`x.round_down(s)` and `x.round_up(s)` are the largest dyadic $\\le x$ and the smallest dyadic $\\ge x$ with scale $s$: $\\lfloor x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rfloor \\cdot 2^{-s}$ and $\\lceil x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rceil \\cdot 2^{-s}$."
msgstr "`x.round_down(s)` 和 `x.round_up(s)` 分别是标度为 $s$ 的二进有理数中 $\\le x$ 的最大者和 $\\ge x$ 的最小者：$\\lfloor x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rfloor \\cdot 2^{-s}$ 与 $\\lceil x \\cdot 2^{s} \\rceil \\cdot 2^{-s}$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:421
msgid "Abort if $s < 0$. When $s$ is at least the current scale the value is re-expressed exactly (the numerator is shifted left). Both directions are true floor and ceiling for negative numbers too: $-5/4$ rounds down to $-2$ and up to $-1$ at scale $0$."
msgstr "若 $s < 0$ 则中止。当 $s$ 不小于当前标度时，值被精确地重新表示（分子左移）。对于负数，两个方向也都是真正的下取整和上取整：在标度 $0$ 下，$-5/4$ 向下舍入为 $-2$，向上舍入为 $-1$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:428
msgid "`CertifiedInterval[T]` is an ordered pair `lower <= upper` used as an enclosure."
msgstr "`CertifiedInterval[T]` 是一个满足 `lower <= upper` 的有序对，用作包络。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:440
msgid "`new(lower, upper, compare)` checks the order with the given comparison and builds the pair; `lower` and `upper` return the endpoints."
msgstr "`new(lower, upper, compare)` 用给定的比较函数检查顺序并构建该二元组；`lower` 和 `upper` 返回端点。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:449
msgid "When `compare(lower, upper) > 0`, `new` returns a certification-failure error for the operation `\"interval\"` with stage `EnclosurePropagation`, reason `InvalidEnclosure`, target and working precision 1 and 0 refinements."
msgstr "当 `compare(lower, upper) > 0` 时，`new` 返回一个针对运算 `\"interval\"` 的认证失败错误，其阶段为 `EnclosurePropagation`，原因为 `InvalidEnclosure`，目标精度和工作精度为 1，细化次数为 0。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:455
msgid "`certified_dyadic_fraction(n, d, s)` encloses $n/d$ between two dyadics of scale $s$."
msgstr "`certified_dyadic_fraction(n, d, s)` 用两个标度为 $s$ 的二进有理数包络 $n/d$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:462
msgid "The result is $[\\lfloor n 2^{s}/d \\rfloor 2^{-s},\\ \\lceil n 2^{s}/d \\rceil 2^{-s}]$ for either sign of $n$: it contains $n/d$, has width $0$ or $2^{-s}$, and is a point exactly when $d \\mid n 2^{s}$. A non-positive $d$ gives a domain error."
msgstr "无论 $n$ 的符号如何，结果都为 $[\\lfloor n 2^{s}/d \\rfloor 2^{-s},\\ \\lceil n 2^{s}/d \\rceil 2^{-s}]$：它包含 $n/d$，宽度为 $0$ 或 $2^{-s}$，且当且仅当 $d \\mid n 2^{s}$ 时为单点。非正的 $d$ 产生定义域错误。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:469
msgid "`certified_dyadic_div(a, b, s)` encloses the quotient $a/b$ of two dyadics at scale $s$."
msgstr "`certified_dyadic_div(a, b, s)` 以标度 $s$ 包络两个二进有理数的商 $a/b$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:476
msgid "$b = 0$ gives a division-by-zero error. Otherwise the result is `certified_dyadic_fraction` applied to $a/b$ written with a positive denominator."
msgstr "$b = 0$ 产生除以零错误。否则，结果是将 `certified_dyadic_fraction` 作用于写成正分母形式的 $a/b$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:496
msgid "Refinement budgets"
msgstr "细化预算"

#: manual/api/internal.md:500
msgid "`CertifiedRefinementBudget` tracks the working precision and the number of refinements of a Ziv-style evaluation loop."
msgstr "`CertifiedRefinementBudget` 跟踪 Ziv 式求值循环的工作精度和细化次数。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:513
msgid "`new(p, limit?)` starts at working precision $\\max(1, p)$ with zero refinements and a limit of $\\max(1, \\mathit{limit})$ refinements (default 12). `next()` increases the precision by $\\max(32, \\lfloor p/2 \\rfloor)$ and counts one refinement. `available()` is true while fewer than `limit` refinements were made."
msgstr "`new(p, limit?)` 以工作精度 $\\max(1, p)$、零次细化开始，细化次数上限为 $\\max(1, \\mathit{limit})$（默认 12）。`next()` 将精度增加 $\\max(32, \\lfloor p/2 \\rfloor)$，并计入一次细化。只要已进行的细化次数少于 `limit`，`available()` 就为真。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:527
msgid "`next` does not check `available`; a loop must test `available()` itself."
msgstr "`next` 不检查 `available`；循环必须自行检测 `available()`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:546
msgid "`certified_failure(operation, stage, reason, target_precision, budget)` builds the `ArithmeticError` a certified operation returns when it gives up."
msgstr "`certified_failure(operation, stage, reason, target_precision, budget)` 构建经认证运算放弃时返回的 `ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:553
msgid "The error's detail records the operation name, stage, reason, target precision, and the budget's current working precision and refinement count."
msgstr "该错误的详情记录运算名、阶段、原因、目标精度，以及预算当前的工作精度和细化次数。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:1
msgid "internal/conformance API"
msgstr "internal/conformance API"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:5
msgid "`internal/conformance` is the shared result model of the conformance frontends: source locations, per-case results with a disposition, run summaries with fixed counting rules, and deterministic shard selection. `frontend/gda_expr`, `frontend/itl_expr`, `frontend/mpfr_expr`, `frontend/testfloat_expr` and `internal/runner_cli` build on it and wrap its types in their own public types. It is an internal package: code outside the `Luna-Flow/floating` module cannot import it, and its interface may change without notice. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/internal/conformance.md) and the [design page](../../design/internal/conformance.md)."
msgstr "`internal/conformance` 是各符合性前端共享的结果模型：源位置、带处置类别的逐用例结果、采用固定计数规则的运行汇总，以及确定性的分片选择。`frontend/gda_expr`、`frontend/itl_expr`、`frontend/mpfr_expr`、`frontend/testfloat_expr` 和 `internal/runner_cli` 都建立在它之上，并用各自的公共类型包装它的类型。它是一个内部包：`Luna-Flow/floating` 模块之外的代码无法导入它，其接口也可能在不另行通知的情况下变更。参见[教程](../../tutorial/internal/conformance.md)和[设计页](../../design/internal/conformance.md)。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:25
msgid "The examples call the package as `@conformance.`. The manual's example checker has no alias for internal subpackages, so they are marked `nocheck`; each one is a copy of behaviour checked by the package's own tests or verified by hand against the source."
msgstr "示例以 `@conformance.` 调用该包。手册的示例检查器没有为内部子包提供别名，因此这些示例被标记为 `nocheck`；每个示例都复现了由该包自身测试检查过的行为，或已对照源代码手工验证。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:30
#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:28
msgid "Source locations"
msgstr "源位置"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:34
msgid "`SourceLocation` is a position in a named source."
msgstr "`SourceLocation` 表示某个具名源中的一个位置。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:44
msgid "`SourceLocation::new(source, line, column?)` creates a location."
msgstr "`SourceLocation::new(source, line, column?)` 创建一个位置。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:50
msgid "`column` defaults to `1`. Line and column are clamped to at least `1`, so a location always points at a real character position."
msgstr "`column` 默认为 `1`。行号和列号会被钳制为至少 `1`，因此位置总是指向一个真实的字符位置。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:55
msgid "These accessors return the components."
msgstr "这些访问器返回各个分量。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:72
msgid "Case results"
msgstr "用例结果"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:76
msgid "`CaseDisposition` classifies a selected case."
msgstr "`CaseDisposition` 对一个被选中的用例进行分类。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:87
msgid "`Executable`: the case was run; its `passed` flag is meaningful."
msgstr "`Executable`：该用例已执行；其 `passed` 标志有意义。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:88
msgid "`Diagnostic(reason)`: the case is not a valid test of this kind (for example a placeholder row)."
msgstr "`Diagnostic(reason)`：该用例不是此类测试的有效用例（例如占位行）。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:90
msgid "`Legacy(reason)`: the case belongs to an older version of the corpus format."
msgstr "`Legacy(reason)`：该用例属于旧版本的语料格式。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:91
msgid "`Unsupported(reason)`: the case is valid but the implementation does not provide the feature."
msgstr "`Unsupported(reason)`：该用例有效，但实现未提供相应功能。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:96
msgid "`CaseResult` is the outcome of one case."
msgstr "`CaseResult` 是单个用例的结果。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:106
msgid "`CaseResult::new(id, disposition, passed, message?)` builds a result; `CaseResult::executable(id, passed, message?)` is `new` with `Executable`."
msgstr "`CaseResult::new(id, disposition, passed, message?)` 构造一个结果；`CaseResult::executable(id, passed, message?)` 即以 `Executable` 调用的 `new`。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:114
msgid "`message` defaults to `\"\"`. No consistency check is made between `disposition` and `passed`; summaries only read `passed` for executable results."
msgstr "`message` 默认为 `\"\"`。`disposition` 与 `passed` 之间不做一致性检查；汇总只会读取可执行结果的 `passed`。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:120
msgid "These accessors return the stored fields."
msgstr "这些访问器返回存储的字段。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:129
msgid "Sharding"
msgstr "分片"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:133
msgid "`ShardSpec` is a validated pair (shard count, shard index)."
msgstr "`ShardSpec` 是经过校验的（分片数，分片索引）二元组。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:143
msgid "`ShardSpec::try_new(count, index)` validates and builds a shard; `ShardSpec::new` aborts with the same message instead of returning `Err`."
msgstr "`ShardSpec::try_new(count, index)` 校验并构造一个分片；`ShardSpec::new` 在相同情形下以同样的消息中止，而不是返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:151
msgid "Errors: `\"shard count must be positive\"` when `count <= 0`, and `\"shard index must be within shard count\"` unless `0 <= index < count`."
msgstr "错误：当 `count <= 0` 时为 `\"shard count must be positive\"`；除非 `0 <= index < count`，否则为 `\"shard index must be within shard count\"`。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:156
msgid "These accessors return the count $n$ and the index $i$."
msgstr "这些访问器返回分片数 $n$ 和索引 $i$。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:165
msgid "`shard.selects(k)` is true when the case with ordinal `k` belongs to this shard, that is when $k \\bmod n = i$."
msgstr "当序号为 `k` 的用例属于该分片时，即 $k \\bmod n = i$ 时，`shard.selects(k)` 为真。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:172
msgid "Ordinals are expected to be non-negative. MoonBit's `%` keeps the sign of the dividend, so a negative ordinal $k$ is selected by shard 0 when $n$ divides $k$ and by no shard otherwise (`ShardSpec::new(3, 0).selects(-3)` is `true`, `selects(-1)` is false for every index)."
msgstr "序号应为非负数。MoonBit 的 `%` 保留被除数的符号，因此负序号 $k$ 在 $n$ 整除 $k$ 时由分片 0 选中，否则不被任何分片选中（`ShardSpec::new(3, 0).selects(-3)` 为 `true`，而 `selects(-1)` 对每个索引都为 false）。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:187
msgid "Run summaries"
msgstr "运行汇总"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:191
msgid "`RunSummary` counts the results of one run or shard."
msgstr "`RunSummary` 统计一次运行或一个分片的结果。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:201
msgid "`RunSummary::from_results(total, results)` counts `results` and records `total` as the number of cases before shard selection."
msgstr "`RunSummary::from_results(total, results)` 统计 `results`，并将 `total` 记录为分片选择之前的用例数。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:208
msgid "Each result is counted once: an `Executable` result as passed or failed according to `passed()`, any other result as skipped and in its own disposition counter. The results are copied."
msgstr "每个结果只计数一次：`Executable` 结果根据 `passed()` 计为通过或失败，其他结果计为跳过，并计入其对应处置类别的计数器。结果会被复制。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:214
msgid "`RunSummary::merge(parts)` combines shard summaries."
msgstr "`RunSummary::merge(parts)` 合并各分片的汇总。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:220
msgid "All counters are summed except `total_cases`, which is the maximum over the parts; results are concatenated in the order of `parts`. An empty array gives an empty summary."
msgstr "除 `total_cases` 取各部分的最大值外，所有计数器均求和；结果按 `parts` 的顺序拼接。空数组给出空汇总。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:226
msgid "These accessors return the run-level counters."
msgstr "这些访问器返回运行级别的计数器。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:236
msgid "`total_cases` is the caller's total (the maximum over merged parts); `selected_cases` is the number of results."
msgstr "`total_cases` 是调用方给出的总数（合并时取各部分的最大值）；`selected_cases` 是结果的数目。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:241
msgid "These accessors return the skip counters, in total and per disposition."
msgstr "这些访问器返回跳过计数器，包括总数和按处置类别划分的数目。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:252
msgid "`results()` returns a copy of the results in counting order; `success()` is the verdict."
msgstr "`results()` 按计数顺序返回结果的副本；`success()` 是判定。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:260
msgid "The identities"
msgstr "以下恒等式"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:270
msgid "hold for every summary built by `from_results` or `merge`. `success()` is `failed_cases() == 0`; skipped cases never make it false, and a summary with no executable case (including `merge([])`) is a success. Frontends that need a stricter verdict (`itl_expr` also fails on diagnostics) add their own rule."
msgstr "对每个由 `from_results` 或 `merge` 构造的汇总都成立。`success()` 即 `failed_cases() == 0`；跳过的用例永远不会使其为假，没有可执行用例的汇总（包括 `merge([])`）也算成功。需要更严格判定的前端（`itl_expr` 在出现诊断时也判为失败）会添加自己的规则。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:292
msgid "All five types derive `Eq` and `Debug`; the promoted methods below compare all fields and render values. Use `==`, `!=` and `debug_inspect` in new code."
msgstr "这五个类型都派生了 `Eq` 和 `Debug`；下面这些提升的方法比较所有字段并渲染值。新代码请使用 `==`、`!=` 和 `debug_inspect`。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:311
msgid "Two dispositions with the same constructor and different reasons are different."
msgstr "构造器相同但原因不同的两个处置类别是不同的。"

#: manual/api/internal/conformance.md:338
msgid "Summary equality includes the order of the result list, so a merged summary equals the serial summary only in its counters, not as a value (see the [design page](../../design/internal/conformance.md))."
msgstr "汇总的相等性包括结果列表的顺序，因此合并得到的汇总只在计数器上等于串行汇总，作为值则不相等（参见[设计页](../../design/internal/conformance.md)）。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:1
msgid "internal/runner_cli API"
msgstr "internal/runner_cli API"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:5
msgid "`internal/runner_cli` holds the command-line plumbing shared by the conformance runners in `cli/`: parsing of the common options, reading files, collecting corpus files from directories, formatting diagnostics and building JSON output. It depends on `moonbitlang/x/fs`, so file access works on the targets that package supports (the runners are built for native). It is an internal package: code outside `Luna-Flow/floating` cannot import it. See the [tutorial](../../tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md) and the [design page](../../design/internal/runner_cli.md)."
msgstr "`internal/runner_cli` 包含 `cli/` 中各符合性运行器共享的命令行基础设施：通用选项的解析、文件读取、从目录收集语料文件、诊断信息格式化以及 JSON 输出构造。它依赖 `moonbitlang/x/fs`，因此文件访问可在该包支持的目标上工作（运行器面向 native 构建）。它是一个内部包：`Luna-Flow/floating` 之外的代码无法导入它。参见[教程](../../tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md)和[设计页](../../design/internal/runner_cli.md)。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:24
msgid "The examples call the package as `@runner_cli.`. The manual's example checker has no alias for internal subpackages, so they are marked `nocheck`; their outputs were checked against the current source."
msgstr "示例以 `@runner_cli.` 调用该包。手册的示例检查器没有为内部子包提供别名，因此这些示例被标记为 `nocheck`；它们的输出已对照当前源代码检查过。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:28
msgid "Command-line options"
msgstr "命令行选项"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:32
msgid "`CommonOptions` holds the options every runner understands and the arguments it did not consume."
msgstr "`CommonOptions` 保存每个运行器都能识别的选项，以及它未消耗的参数。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:43
msgid "`parse_common_options(arguments, allow_shard?)` extracts `--json` and the shard options from a full argument vector."
msgstr "`parse_common_options(arguments, allow_shard?)` 从完整的参数向量中提取 `--json` 和分片选项。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:50
msgid "`arguments[0]` is the program name and is skipped. Recognized options:"
msgstr "`arguments[0]` 是程序名，会被跳过。可识别的选项："

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:52
msgid "`--json`: sets `json()`;"
msgstr "`--json`：设置 `json()`；"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:53
msgid "`--shard-count N`, `--shard-count=N`, `--shard-index I`, `--shard-index=I`: only when `allow_shard` is true (the default); otherwise they are left in `remaining()`."
msgstr "`--shard-count N`、`--shard-count=N`、`--shard-index I`、`--shard-index=I`：仅当 `allow_shard` 为真（默认）时识别；否则保留在 `remaining()` 中。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:57
msgid "Every other argument is kept, in order, in `remaining()`. The separated form never takes another option as its value, so `--shard-count --json` fails with `\"--shard-count requires a value\"`. A repeated option keeps its last value. Errors: `\"--shard-count requires a value\"` (or `--shard-index`) when the option is the last argument or the next argument starts with `--`, `\"invalid shard count: X\"` or `\"invalid shard index: X\"` for a value `parse_int` rejects, and the `ShardSpec::try_new` messages when the final pair is not valid (count positive, index in `0 ..< count`). Defaults are one shard, index 0, JSON off."
msgstr "其他所有参数按原顺序保留在 `remaining()` 中。分开书写的形式从不把另一个选项当作其值，因此 `--shard-count --json` 会以 `\"--shard-count requires a value\"` 失败。重复的选项保留最后一个值。错误：选项是最后一个参数或下一个参数以 `--` 开头时为 `\"--shard-count requires a value\"`（或 `--shard-index`）；值被 `parse_int` 拒绝时为 `\"invalid shard count: X\"` 或 `\"invalid shard index: X\"`；最终的二元组无效时（分片数须为正，索引须在 `0 ..< count` 内）为 `ShardSpec::try_new` 的消息。默认值为一个分片、索引 0、关闭 JSON。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:69
msgid "These accessors return the parsed values and a copy of the unconsumed arguments."
msgstr "这些访问器返回解析得到的值以及未消耗参数的副本。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:93
msgid "`parse_int(name, text)` parses an `Int` for the option `name`."
msgstr "`parse_int(name, text)` 为选项 `name` 解析一个 `Int`。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:99
msgid "It delegates to `@string.parse_int` from `moonbitlang/core/string`, so it accepts MoonBit integer syntax, not only plain decimals: a leading `+` or `-`, the prefixes `0x`, `0o` and `0b`, and `_` separators (`\"0x10\"` and `\"1_000\"` parse as 16 and 1000). Whitespace and values outside the `Int` range are rejected. The error is `\"invalid NAME: TEXT\"`."
msgstr "它委托给 `moonbitlang/core/string` 中的 `@string.parse_int`，因此接受 MoonBit 整数语法，而不仅是普通十进制数：前导 `+` 或 `-`、前缀 `0x`、`0o` 和 `0b`，以及 `_` 分隔符（`\"0x10\"` 和 `\"1_000\"` 分别解析为 16 和 1000）。空白以及超出 `Int` 范围的值会被拒绝。错误为 `\"invalid NAME: TEXT\"`。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:113
msgid "Files"
msgstr "文件"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:117
msgid "`read_source(path, label?)` reads a whole UTF-8 file."
msgstr "`read_source(path, label?)` 读取整个 UTF-8 文件。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:123
msgid "The error is `\"cannot read LABEL: PATH\"`; `label` defaults to `\"file\"`."
msgstr "错误为 `\"cannot read LABEL: PATH\"`；`label` 默认为 `\"file\"`。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:127
msgid "`collect_files(paths, suffix)` expands a list of files and directories into the sorted list of files whose names end in `suffix`."
msgstr "`collect_files(paths, suffix)` 将文件和目录列表展开为名称以 `suffix` 结尾的文件的有序列表。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:134
msgid "A directory contributes its direct entries that are files ending in `suffix` (as `dir + \"/\" + entry`; subdirectories are not searched, even when their names end in `suffix`). A file contributes itself if it ends in `suffix`. The result is sorted in string order, so runs are reproducible across file systems, and each path appears once: a file named twice, or named as `dir/entry` and also found through `dir`, is listed once. Errors: `\"path does not exist: P\"`, `\"not a SUFFIX file: P\"` for a named file without the suffix, `\"cannot inspect path: P\"`, `\"cannot read directory: P\"`."
msgstr "目录贡献其直接子项中以 `suffix` 结尾的文件（形式为 `dir + \"/\" + entry`；不搜索子目录，即使其名称以 `suffix` 结尾）。文件若以 `suffix` 结尾则贡献其自身。结果按字符串顺序排序，因此运行在不同文件系统之间可复现，并且每个路径只出现一次：被指定两次的文件，或既以 `dir/entry` 形式指定又通过 `dir` 找到的文件，只列出一次。错误：`\"path does not exist: P\"`、对没有该后缀的被指定文件为 `\"not a SUFFIX file: P\"`、`\"cannot inspect path: P\"`、`\"cannot read directory: P\"`。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:144
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:148
msgid "These functions format a message as `source:line:column: message`."
msgstr "这些函数将消息格式化为 `source:line:column: message`。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:155
msgid "`format_diagnostic_at(source, line, message, column?)` builds the location with `SourceLocation::new` (column defaults to 1; line and column are clamped to at least 1)."
msgstr "`format_diagnostic_at(source, line, message, column?)` 使用 `SourceLocation::new` 构造位置（列号默认为 1；行号和列号被钳制为至少 1）。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:169
msgid "JSON output"
msgstr "JSON 输出"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:173
msgid "These functions build `Json` values for runner reports."
msgstr "这些函数为运行器报告构造 `Json` 值。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:183
msgid "`json_int` stores the integer with its exact decimal representation, so it prints without a fractional part. `json_object` keeps the order of the fields; a repeated key keeps its first position and its last value."
msgstr "`json_int` 以精确的十进制表示存储整数，因此打印时不带小数部分。`json_object` 保持字段顺序；重复的键保留其首次出现的位置和最后一次的值。"

#: manual/api/internal/runner_cli.md:189
msgid "`json_stringify(value)` prints a value as compact JSON with escaped strings."
msgstr "`json_stringify(value)` 将值打印为紧凑 JSON，字符串会被转义。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:1
msgid "numeric_expr API"
msgstr "numeric_expr API"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:5
msgid "`numeric_expr` is a small expression language for numeric test corpora and tools. On the current branch the GDA frontend `frontend/gda_expr` lowers its `.decTest` rows to it; the other frontends execute their rows directly. An `Expr` is a tree whose leaves are literals (raw source text) and whose inner nodes apply a named operation to argument expressions. The package does not know any number type: `evaluate` folds the tree with two callbacks supplied by the caller, one that decodes a literal and one that executes an operation. Every node carries a `SourceSpan` so that a failure can be reported at its source line. The [tutorial](../tutorial/numeric_expr.md) builds and evaluates expressions step by step, and the [design page](../design/numeric_expr.md) states the evaluation semantics and proves its invariants."
msgstr "`numeric_expr` 是一种面向数值测试语料和工具的小型表达式语言。在当前分支上，GDA 前端 `frontend/gda_expr` 将其 `.decTest` 行转换为该语言；其他前端则直接执行各自的行。`Expr` 是一棵树，其叶子是字面量（原始源文本），内部节点将具名操作应用于参数表达式。该包不了解任何数值类型：`evaluate` 借助调用者提供的两个回调折叠这棵树，一个解码字面量，一个执行操作。每个节点都携带一个 `SourceSpan`，以便在其源代码行处报告失败。[教程](../tutorial/numeric_expr.md)逐步构造并求值表达式，[设计页](../design/numeric_expr.md)给出求值语义并证明其不变量。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:26
msgid "The examples call the package as `@numeric_expr.`; they evaluate over `Int` with `String` errors, so no number package is needed."
msgstr "示例以 `@numeric_expr.` 调用该包；它们在 `Int` 上求值并使用 `String` 错误，因此不需要任何数值包。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:32
msgid "`SourceSpan` records where a syntax node came from: a source name (usually a file path), a line and a column."
msgstr "`SourceSpan` 记录语法节点的来源：源名称（通常是文件路径）、行号和列号。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:41
msgid "The fields are private and immutable. Two spans are equal when the source, line and column are all equal."
msgstr "这些字段是私有且不可变的。当源、行号和列号都相等时，两个区段相等。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:46
msgid "`SourceSpan::new(source, line?, column?)` creates a span."
msgstr "`SourceSpan::new(source, line?, column?)` 创建一个区段。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:52
msgid "`line` and `column` default to `0`, which means \"unknown\". The values are stored as given; no range check is made."
msgstr "`line` 和 `column` 默认为 `0`，表示“未知”。值按原样存储，不做范围检查。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:57
msgid "These accessors return the three components of a span."
msgstr "这些访问器返回区段的三个分量。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:77
msgid "Syntax nodes"
msgstr "语法节点"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:81
msgid "`Literal` is a leaf of an expression: the raw text of an operand, such as `\"1.20\"`, `\"-Inf\"` or `\"#7C00016E\"`, together with its span."
msgstr "`Literal` 是表达式的叶子：操作数的原始文本（例如 `\"1.20\"`、`\"-Inf\"` 或 `\"#7C00016E\"`）及其区段。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:90
msgid "The text is not parsed when the literal is built. Its meaning is decided by the `decode` callback of `evaluate`, so the same tree can be read as a binary, decimal or interval value."
msgstr "构造字面量时不会解析文本。其含义由 `evaluate` 的 `decode` 回调决定，因此同一棵树可以被读作二进制值、十进制值或区间值。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:96
msgid "`Literal::new(raw, span?)` builds a literal; `raw` and `span` read it back."
msgstr "`Literal::new(raw, span?)` 构造一个字面量；`raw` 和 `span` 将其读回。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:104
#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:132
msgid "The default span is `SourceSpan::new(\"\")`."
msgstr "默认区段为 `SourceSpan::new(\"\")`。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:108
msgid "`Operation` names the operation of an inner node, for example `\"add\"` or `\"squareroot\"`, together with its span."
msgstr "`Operation` 命名内部节点的操作（例如 `\"add\"` 或 `\"squareroot\"`），并带有其区段。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:117
msgid "The package attaches no meaning to the name and does not record an arity. The `invoke` callback of `evaluate` decides which names exist and how many arguments each one takes."
msgstr "该包不赋予名称任何含义，也不记录元数。由 `evaluate` 的 `invoke` 回调决定存在哪些名称以及每个名称接受多少个参数。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:123
msgid "`Operation::new(name, span?)` builds an operation; `name` and `span` read it back."
msgstr "`Operation::new(name, span?)` 构造一个操作；`name` 和 `span` 将其读回。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:134
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "表达式"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:138
msgid "`Expr` is an immutable expression tree."
msgstr "`Expr` 是不可变的表达式树。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:146
msgid "The representation is private. Only the two constructors below create expressions, so every `Expr` has the shape"
msgstr "其表示是私有的。只有下面两个构造器能创建表达式，因此每个 `Expr` 都具有如下形状"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:153
msgid "`Expr` has no equality, `Debug` or `Show` implementation; inspect an expression by evaluating it."
msgstr "`Expr` 没有相等性、`Debug` 或 `Show` 实现；要检查一个表达式，请对其求值。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:158
msgid "`Expr::literal(literal)` is the leaf expression for one literal."
msgstr "`Expr::literal(literal)` 是对应单个字面量的叶子表达式。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:166
msgid "`Expr::invoke(operation, arguments)` applies `operation` to the argument expressions, in order."
msgstr "`Expr::invoke(operation, arguments)` 将 `operation` 按顺序应用于各参数表达式。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:173
msgid "The array is copied into the tree, so later changes to `arguments` do not change the expression. An empty array is allowed and gives a nullary operation."
msgstr "数组会被复制到树中，因此之后对 `arguments` 的修改不会改变该表达式。允许空数组，此时得到零元操作。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:211
msgid "Evaluation"
msgstr "求值"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:215
msgid "`evaluate(expression, decode, invoke)` computes the value of `expression` bottom-up with the two callbacks."
msgstr "`evaluate(expression, decode, invoke)` 借助这两个回调自底向上计算 `expression` 的值。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:222
msgid "`V` is the value type and `E` the error type of the callbacks. The rules are:"
msgstr "`V` 是回调的值类型，`E` 是其错误类型。规则如下："

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:224
msgid "a literal $\\ell$ evaluates to `decode(ℓ)`; an `Err(e)` becomes `Err(LiteralFailure(ℓ, e))`;"
msgstr "字面量 $\\ell$ 求值为 `decode(ℓ)`；`Err(e)` 变为 `Err(LiteralFailure(ℓ, e))`；"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:226
msgid "an invocation $o(e_1, \\dots, e_n)$ first evaluates $e_1, \\dots, e_n$ from left to right. The first argument that fails ends the evaluation and its error is returned unchanged. When all arguments succeed with values $v_1, \\dots, v_n$, the result is `invoke(o, [v1, ..., vn])`, and an `Err(e)` becomes `Err(OperationFailure(o, e))`."
msgstr "调用 $o(e_1, \\dots, e_n)$ 先从左到右求值 $e_1, \\dots, e_n$。第一个失败的参数会终止求值，其错误原样返回。当所有参数都成功并得到值 $v_1, \\dots, v_n$ 时，结果为 `invoke(o, [v1, ..., vn])`，`Err(e)` 变为 `Err(OperationFailure(o, e))`。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:232
msgid "Consequently the callbacks are called in post-order (children left to right, then the parent), each node at most once, and evaluation stops at the first failure. On success `decode` runs once per literal leaf and `invoke` once per invocation node. The package performs no other effect. The recursion depth equals the height of the tree. The [design page](../design/numeric_expr.md) proves these properties."
msgstr "因此，回调按后序调用（先从左到右处理子节点，再处理父节点），每个节点至多一次，且求值在第一次失败时停止。成功时，`decode` 对每个字面量叶子运行一次，`invoke` 对每个调用节点运行一次。该包不产生任何其他副作用。递归深度等于树的高度。[设计页](../design/numeric_expr.md)证明了这些性质。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:239
msgid "`evaluate` never aborts on its own; any abort comes from the callbacks, or from stack exhaustion on a very deep tree, since the evaluation is recursive."
msgstr "`evaluate` 自身从不中止；任何中止都来自回调，或者由于求值是递归的，来自极深的树所导致的栈耗尽。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:245
msgid "`EvalError[E]` tells which node failed and carries the callback's error."
msgstr "`EvalError[E]` 指出哪个节点失败，并携带回调的错误。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:255
msgid "`LiteralFailure(literal, error)`: `decode(literal)` returned `Err(error)`. `literal.span()` locates the operand."
msgstr "`LiteralFailure(literal, error)`：`decode(literal)` 返回了 `Err(error)`。`literal.span()` 定位该操作数。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:257
msgid "`OperationFailure(operation, error)`: `invoke` returned `Err(error)` for `operation`, after all its arguments evaluated successfully."
msgstr "`OperationFailure(operation, error)`：在 `operation` 的所有参数都成功求值之后，`invoke` 对它返回了 `Err(error)`。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:259
msgid "`UnsupportedExpression(span)`: the tree contains a form the evaluator does not handle. Trees built with `Expr::literal` and `Expr::invoke` never produce it; the constructor is reserved for forms the private representation can hold but the public constructors cannot yet build, such as variables and binders."
msgstr "`UnsupportedExpression(span)`：树中包含求值器不处理的形式。用 `Expr::literal` 和 `Expr::invoke` 构造的树永远不会产生它；该构造器是为私有表示能够容纳、但公共构造器尚无法构造的形式（例如变量和绑定子）预留的。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:302
msgid "These methods compare all stored components (text or name and span). Use `==` and `!=` in new code."
msgstr "这些方法比较所有存储的分量（文本或名称，以及区段）。新代码请使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:314
msgid "Two literals with the same text but different spans are different."
msgstr "文本相同但区段不同的两个字面量是不同的。"

#: manual/api/numeric_expr.md:318
msgid "These methods render a value for `debug_inspect` and other `Debug` consumers."
msgstr "这些方法为 `debug_inspect` 及其他 `Debug` 使用者渲染值。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:1
msgid "semantic API"
msgstr "semantic API"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:5
msgid "`semantic` projects concrete values of `floating` onto a small representation-independent model: an exact reduced rational, a signed infinity, NaN, a closed interval of such scalars, and a short error vocabulary. Two values of different representations (for example a binary64 `BinFloat` and an IEEE `Decimal`) project to equal semantic values exactly when they denote the same number. The package performs no arithmetic and no rounding. The [tutorial](../tutorial/semantic.md) shows typical comparisons; the [design page](../design/semantic.md) derives why the projection is exact and what it forgets."
msgstr "`semantic` 将 `floating` 的具体值投影到一个与表示无关的小型模型上：精确的既约有理数、带符号的无穷、NaN、由此类标量构成的闭区间，以及一套简短的错误词汇。两个不同表示的值（例如 binary64 的 `BinFloat` 与 IEEE 的 `Decimal`）当且仅当表示同一个数时，投影为相等的语义值。本包不执行任何算术运算和舍入。[教程](../tutorial/semantic.md) 展示了典型的比较；[设计页面](../design/semantic.md) 推导了该投影为何是精确的以及它会丢弃哪些信息。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:17
msgid "Add the package and the representations you project to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将该包以及你要投影的表示添加到你的 `moon.pkg` 中："

#: manual/api/semantic.md:28
msgid "The examples call the package as `@semantic.`, the representations as `@bin_float.`, `@decimal.` and `@ball_float.`, and `Sign` as `@def.Sign`. They assume this helper, which prints a semantic scalar as `numerator/denominator`:"
msgstr "示例以 `@semantic.` 调用该包，以 `@bin_float.`、`@decimal.` 和 `@ball_float.` 调用各表示，以 `@def.Sign` 表示 `Sign`。它们假定有如下辅助函数，它将语义标量打印为 `numerator/denominator`："

#: manual/api/semantic.md:48
msgid "`ExactRational` is an exact rational number kept in lowest terms with a positive denominator."
msgstr "`ExactRational` 是以最简形式保存、分母为正的精确有理数。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:57
msgid "The fields are private, so every value is built by `ExactRational::new` or `ExactRational::from_scaled_integer` and satisfies the invariant"
msgstr "其字段是私有的，因此每个值都由 `ExactRational::new` 或 `ExactRational::from_scaled_integer` 构建，并满足不变式"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:64
msgid "Because this form is unique for every rational number, the derived `==` is equality of rational numbers."
msgstr "由于每个有理数的这种形式都是唯一的，派生的 `==` 就是有理数的相等。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:69
msgid "`new(numerator, denominator)` builds the rational $n/d$ and reduces it."
msgstr "`new(numerator, denominator)` 构建有理数 $n/d$ 并将其约简。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:75
msgid "A negative denominator moves its sign to the numerator; both parts are divided by their greatest common divisor (Euclid's algorithm on `BigInt`); zero becomes $0/1$. **Aborts** when `denominator` is zero."
msgstr "负分母的符号会移到分子上；分子分母同除以它们的最大公约数（在 `BigInt` 上使用欧几里得算法）；零变为 $0/1$。当 `denominator` 为零时**中止**。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:81
msgid "`from_scaled_integer(significand, radix, exponent)` builds the exact value $m \\cdot r^{e}$."
msgstr "`from_scaled_integer(significand, radix, exponent)` 构建精确值 $m \\cdot r^{e}$。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:88
msgid "For $e \\ge 0$ the result is $(m r^{e})/1$; for $e < 0$ it is $m / r^{-e}$, reduced. **Aborts** when `radix` $\\le 1$. The power is computed exactly, so the size of the result grows linearly with $|e|$ (about $|e| \\log_2 r$ bits)."
msgstr "对于 $e \\ge 0$，结果为 $(m r^{e})/1$；对于 $e < 0$，结果为约简后的 $m / r^{-e}$。当 `radix` $\\le 1$ 时**中止**。幂是精确计算的，因此结果的大小随 $|e|$ 线性增长（约 $|e| \\log_2 r$ 位）。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:94
msgid "These accessors return the reduced numerator (carrying the sign) and the positive denominator."
msgstr "这些访问器返回约简后的分子（带符号）和正的分母。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:120
msgid "Scalars"
msgstr "标量"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:124
msgid "`SemanticScalar` is the meaning of one floating-point datum."
msgstr "`SemanticScalar` 表示一个浮点数据的含义。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:134
msgid "`Rational` holds every finite value, including both signed zeros as $0/1$. `Infinity` carries `Negative` or `Positive`. `NaN` stands for every NaN: quiet or signalling, any payload, any sign. Equality is structural, so `NaN == NaN` is `true` here, unlike IEEE comparison."
msgstr "`Rational` 容纳每个有限值，两种带符号零都表示为 $0/1$。`Infinity` 携带 `Negative` 或 `Positive`。`NaN` 代表所有 NaN：静默或信号、任意载荷、任意符号。相等是结构相等，因此这里 `NaN == NaN` 为 `true`，与 IEEE 比较不同。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:141
msgid "`from_bin_float(x)` returns the exact meaning of a `BinFloat`."
msgstr "`from_bin_float(x)` 返回 `BinFloat` 的精确含义。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:147
msgid "A finite $x = (-1)^{s} c\\, 2^{e}$ maps to `Rational` of `from_scaled_integer(±c, 2, e)`; an infinity maps to `Infinity(x.sign())`; a NaN maps to `NaN`. Precision is dropped. Never aborts, but the result is exact: a `BinFloat` exponent can reach about $\\pm 2^{30}$, and the projection then builds a numerator or denominator of about $|e|$ bits (over 100 MB at the extremes)."
msgstr "有限的 $x = (-1)^{s} c\\, 2^{e}$ 映射为 `from_scaled_integer(±c, 2, e)` 的 `Rational`；无穷映射为 `Infinity(x.sign())`；NaN 映射为 `NaN`。精度被丢弃。从不中止，但结果是精确的：`BinFloat` 的指数可达约 $\\pm 2^{30}$，此时投影会构造约 $|e|$ 位的分子或分母（在极端情况下超过 100 MB）。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:156
msgid "`from_decimal(x)` returns the exact meaning of an IEEE `@decimal.Decimal`."
msgstr "`from_decimal(x)` 返回 IEEE `@decimal.Decimal` 的精确含义。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:162
msgid "A finite $x = (-1)^{s} c\\, 10^{q}$ maps to `Rational` of `from_scaled_integer(±c, 10, q)`, so every member of a cohort (`1.5`, `1.50`, `1.500`) maps to the same value $3/2$. Infinities and NaNs map as for binary. The GDA type `@decimal_gda.Decimal` has no projection in this package."
msgstr "有限的 $x = (-1)^{s} c\\, 10^{q}$ 映射为 `from_scaled_integer(±c, 10, q)` 的 `Rational`，因此同值类的每个成员（`1.5`、`1.50`、`1.500`）都映射为同一个值 $3/2$。无穷与 NaN 的映射方式与二进制相同。GDA 类型 `@decimal_gda.Decimal` 在本包中没有投影。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:198
msgid "Intervals"
msgstr "区间"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:202
msgid "`SemanticInterval` is a closed interval given by two semantic endpoints."
msgstr "`SemanticInterval` 是由两个语义端点给出的闭区间。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:211
msgid "The fields are public and read-only outside the package. The type does not check that `lower` does not exceed `upper`; the projection below uses the reversed pair $(+\\infty, -\\infty)$ for the empty set."
msgstr "其字段是公开的，在包外只读。该类型不检查 `lower` 是否不超过 `upper`；下文的投影使用反序对 $(+\\infty, -\\infty)$ 表示空集。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:217
msgid "`from_ball_float(x)` projects the two endpoints of a `BallFloat`."
msgstr "`from_ball_float(x)` 投影 `BallFloat` 的两个端点。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:223
msgid "`lower` is `from_bin_float(x.lower_bound())` and `upper` is `from_bin_float(x.upper_bound())`. A bounded interval gives two `Rational` endpoints, an unbounded side gives `Infinity`, the entire line gives $(-\\infty, +\\infty)$, and the empty interval gives $(\\texttt{Infinity(Positive)}, \\texttt{Infinity(Negative)})$. Precision is dropped. The function takes an undecorated `BallFloat`; for a `BallFloatDecorated`, project its interval and keep the decoration yourself."
msgstr "`lower` 为 `from_bin_float(x.lower_bound())`，`upper` 为 `from_bin_float(x.upper_bound())`。有界区间给出两个 `Rational` 端点，无界的一侧给出 `Infinity`，整条实数线给出 $(-\\infty, +\\infty)$，空区间给出 $(\\texttt{Infinity(Positive)}, \\texttt{Infinity(Negative)})$。精度被丢弃。该函数接受不带装饰的 `BallFloat`；对于 `BallFloatDecorated`，请投影其区间，并自行保留装饰。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:252
msgid "Errors and checked results"
msgstr "错误与 checked 结果"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:256
msgid "`SemanticError` is the representation-independent error vocabulary."
msgstr "`SemanticError` 是与表示无关的错误词汇。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:270
msgid "It mirrors `ArithmeticErrorKind` of Luna-Flow/arithmetic without messages and without the certification detail."
msgstr "它对应 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的 `ArithmeticErrorKind`，但不含消息，也不含认证细节。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:275
msgid "`from_arithmetic(err)` classifies an `ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "`from_arithmetic(err)` 对 `ArithmeticError` 进行分类。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:281
msgid "The kind is tested in the order division by zero, parse, domain, format, unordered comparison, certification failure; anything else (the `UnsupportedOperation` kind) maps to `UnsupportedOperation`. The message and the `CertificationFailureDetail` are discarded."
msgstr "种类按以下顺序检测：除以零、解析、定义域、格式、无序比较、认证失败；其他任何情况（`UnsupportedOperation` 种类）映射为 `UnsupportedOperation`。消息与 `CertificationFailureDetail` 被丢弃。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:288
msgid "`SemanticResult[T]` is a semantic value or a semantic error."
msgstr "`SemanticResult[T]` 是一个语义值或一个语义错误。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:299
msgid "These functions turn a checked result of a concrete package into a semantic result, using a caller-supplied projection for the success case."
msgstr "这些函数将具体包的 checked 结果转换为语义结果，成功情形使用调用者提供的投影。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:314
msgid "and likewise for intervals. `f` is called at most once."
msgstr "区间同理。`f` 至多调用一次。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:338
msgid "Every type of the package derives `Eq`; the `equal` and `not_equal` methods below are promoted explicitly. Prefer `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "本包的每个类型都派生 `Eq`；下面的 `equal` 和 `not_equal` 方法经显式提升。请优先使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:343
msgid "These methods compare the values of the value types."
msgstr "这些方法比较值类型的值。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:354
msgid "Equality of `ExactRational` is numeric equality because of the reduced form; equality of `SemanticScalar` adds `NaN == NaN` and distinguishes the two infinities; `SemanticInterval` compares both endpoints. No ordering is provided."
msgstr "由于采用约简形式，`ExactRational` 的相等即数值相等；`SemanticScalar` 的相等额外加入 `NaN == NaN`，并区分两种无穷；`SemanticInterval` 比较两个端点。不提供序关系。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:361
msgid "These methods compare error kinds and checked results."
msgstr "这些方法比较错误种类和 checked 结果。"

#: manual/api/semantic.md:370
msgid "Two `SemanticResult` values are equal when both are `Value`s with equal payloads or both are `Error`s of the same kind."
msgstr "当两个 `SemanticResult` 值都是载荷相等的 `Value`，或都是同一种类的 `Error` 时，二者相等。"

#: manual/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: manual/architecture.md:3
msgid "`floating` is organized as explicit numerical domains surrounded by thin composition, parsing and verification layers. The central rule is that numerical semantics stay pure and explicit, while files, processes, corpora and benchmarks stay at the edge of the repository. This guide maps the packages to those layers, follows one operation through a numeric core, and states the invariants every layer keeps."
msgstr "`floating` 由若干显式数值域组成，外围是轻量的组合层、解析层和验证层。核心原则是：数值语义保持纯粹且显式，而文件、进程、语料和基准测试都留在仓库边缘。本指南将各个包对应到这些层，追踪一次运算穿过数值核心的全过程，并列出每一层都遵守的不变量。"

#: manual/architecture.md:10
msgid "Layer map"
msgstr "分层图"

#: manual/architecture.md:12
#: manual/verification.md:11
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "层"

#: manual/architecture.md:12
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/architecture.md:12
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: manual/architecture.md:14
msgid "Shared vocabulary"
msgstr "共享词汇"

#: manual/architecture.md:14
msgid "`Sign`, `PartialOrder`, the `Floating` trait, predicates, re-exported `arithmetic` types"
msgstr "`Sign`、`PartialOrder`、`Floating` trait、谓词，以及重新导出的 `arithmetic` 类型"

