#: manual/architecture.md:43
msgid "The separation prevents lossy conversions such as treating a GDA trap as an IEEE flag, an IEEE infinity as a generic error, or Empty, Entire and NaI as interchangeable interval failures. [Numeric semantics](./numeric_semantics.md) defines each of these states."
msgstr "这种分离避免了有损转换，例如把 GDA 陷阱当作 IEEE 标志，把 IEEE 无穷大当作通用错误，或把 Empty、Entire 与 NaI 当作可互换的区间失败。[数值语义](./numeric_semantics.md)定义了上述每一种状态。"

#: manual/architecture.md:48
msgid "Numeric core pipeline"
msgstr "数值核心流水线"

#: manual/architecture.md:50
msgid "All scalar cores share one decomposition, even though their representations and standards differ:"
msgstr "所有标量核心都采用同一种分解方式，尽管它们的表示和标准各不相同："

#: manual/architecture.md:61
msgid "`BinFloat` stores a class, a sign, a non-negative binary coefficient with no trailing zero bits, an exponent, a precision, and NaN state (signaling bit and payload). `Decimal` and the GDA `Decimal` each store a sign, a package-owned base-$10^9$ coefficient, an exponent that is the quantum, a precision and the special state. `BallFloat` stores two `BinFloat` endpoints, a precision and an Empty marker; `BallFloatDecorated` adds a decoration without changing the bare representation."
msgstr "`BinFloat` 存储类别、符号、不含末尾零比特的非负二进制系数、指数、精度以及 NaN 状态（signaling 位与 payload）。`Decimal` 与 GDA `Decimal` 各自存储符号、由包自身管理的以 $10^9$ 为基数的系数、作为量子（quantum）的指数、精度以及特殊状态。`BallFloat` 存储两个 `BinFloat` 端点、精度以及 Empty 标记；`BallFloatDecorated` 在此基础上增加装饰，但不改变裸区间的表示。"

#: manual/architecture.md:69
msgid "Finalization is the semantic firewall. Kernels may compute exact sums, products, quotients, roots or guard and sticky bits, but only the finalizer decides the rounded value, the cohort, the flags, the traps, the decorations and the direction of interval endpoints. It also enforces the binary implementation exponent range $[1 - 2^{30},\\ 2^{30} - 1]$ for the leading bit: a result outside it is classified as an overflow or an underflow according to the rounding direction instead of being stored with a saturated exponent."
msgstr "最终化（finalization）是语义防火墙。计算内核可以计算精确的和、积、商、根或保护位与粘滞位，但只有最终化器决定舍入后的值、同值类（cohort）、标志、陷阱、装饰以及区间端点的方向。它还对首位比特强制实施二进制实现的指数范围 $[1 - 2^{30},\\ 2^{30} - 1]$：超出该范围的结果会按舍入方向被归类为上溢或下溢，而不是以饱和指数存储。"

#: manual/architecture.md:77
msgid "Operations whose exact value is enormous never materialize it. A far addend collapses to a sticky bit, the IEEE remainder reduces a huge dividend modulo $2y$ by square-and-multiply on $2^k$, rounding to an integer splits the coefficient by shifting, and interval endpoint sums drop an addend that lies more than $\\max(65536, p)$ bits below the other to a directed sticky term. Each shortcut feeds the finalizer exactly the round and sticky information the full computation would."
msgstr "精确值极其庞大的运算从不将其实际展开。相距很远的加数会折叠为一个粘滞位；IEEE 余数运算通过对 $2^k$ 平方再相乘，将巨大的被除数对 $2y$ 取模来约化；舍入到整数时通过移位拆分系数；区间端点求和时，若某个加数比另一个低超过 $\\max(65536, p)$ 比特，则将其舍弃为一个定向粘滞项。每种捷径都恰好向最终化器提供与完整计算相同的舍入位和粘滞信息。"

#: manual/architecture.md:85
msgid "Algorithm selection"
msgstr "算法选择"

#: manual/architecture.md:87
msgid "Large-integer kernels use a staged selector rather than one algorithm:"
msgstr "大整数内核使用分阶段选择器，而非单一算法："

#: manual/architecture.md:98
msgid "Division likewise moves from word division and Knuth's algorithm D to Burnikel–Ziegler and reciprocal Newton iteration where target measurements justify it. Sparse and unbalanced operands have their own paths, because an algorithm chosen only by the larger length can waste more on padding than it saves asymptotically."
msgstr "除法同样会在目标测量结果支持的情况下，从字除法和 Knuth 算法 D 过渡到 Burnikel–Ziegler 算法与倒数 Newton 迭代。稀疏和不平衡的操作数有各自的路径，因为仅按较长长度选择的算法，在填充上的浪费可能超过其渐近意义上的节省。"

#: manual/architecture.md:104
msgid "Crossover points are private, target-specific policy. They are measured with the Maremark benchmark hierarchy (`bench/*`) on dense, sparse, square, balanced and unbalanced data, and boundary tests compare exact results below, at and above every cutoff. Native, LLVM, Wasm, Wasm-GC and JavaScript may therefore pick different algorithms but must return the same public result."
msgstr "切换点是私有的、特定于目标平台的策略。它们通过 Maremark 基准测试层次（`bench/*`）在稠密、稀疏、平方、平衡和不平衡数据上测量，边界测试则在每个阈值之下、之上以及恰好处比较精确结果。因此 Native、LLVM、Wasm、Wasm-GC 和 JavaScript 可以选择不同的算法，但必须返回相同的公开结果。"

#: manual/architecture.md:110
#: manual/design/bin_float.md:571
#: manual/design/decimal.md:667
msgid "Certified elementary functions"
msgstr "经认证的初等函数"

#: manual/architecture.md:112
msgid "Elementary functions (exponentials, logarithms, powers, roots, trigonometric, hyperbolic and inverse functions) follow one proof contract across the binary, decimal and interval stacks, in the style of Ziv's strategy:[^ziv]"
msgstr "初等函数（指数、对数、幂、根、三角函数、双曲函数及其反函数）在二进制、十进制和区间三套实现中遵循同一份证明契约，采用 Ziv 策略的风格：[^ziv]"

#: manual/architecture.md:116
msgid "Decide results that are certainly outside the context range (overflow, underflow) from certified bounds on $\\log_2$ of the result, before any refinement."
msgstr "在任何细化之前，先根据结果 $\\log_2$ 的认证界判定那些必然超出上下文范围的结果（上溢、下溢）。"

#: manual/architecture.md:119
msgid "Compute directed lower and upper enclosures $[\\ell, h]$ of the exact value at a working precision $w = p + 64$."
msgstr "在工作精度 $w = p + 64$ 下，计算精确值的定向下包络与上包络 $[\\ell, h]$。"

#: manual/architecture.md:121
msgid "Round both endpoints to the target. Because rounding is monotone, if $\\operatorname{rnd}(\\ell) = \\operatorname{rnd}(h)$ with the same flags, every value in $[\\ell, h]$, including the exact one, rounds to that result."
msgstr "将两个端点舍入到目标精度。由于舍入是单调的，若 $\\operatorname{rnd}(\\ell) = \\operatorname{rnd}(h)$ 且标志相同，则 $[\\ell, h]$ 中的每个值（包括精确值）都会舍入到该结果。"

#: manual/architecture.md:124
msgid "Otherwise increase $w$ by $\\max(32, \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor)$ and repeat, at most 12 times."
msgstr "否则将 $w$ 增加 $\\max(32, \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor)$ 并重复，至多 12 次。"

#: manual/architecture.md:126
msgid "If no attempt agrees, `try_*` functions return a `CertificationFailure` with the stage, reason, precision, working precision and attempt count; the non-`try` functions return a defined invalid result (a quiet NaN with *invalid operation* in binary) and never abort."
msgstr "如果所有尝试都无法达成一致，`try_*` 函数返回一个 `CertificationFailure`，其中包含阶段、原因、精度、工作精度和尝试次数；非 `try` 函数则返回一个有定义的无效结果（在二进制中为带 *invalid operation* 的静默 NaN），且从不中止。"

#: manual/architecture.md:131
msgid "Step 3 needs only monotonicity: $\\ell \\le x \\le h$ gives $\\operatorname{rnd}(\\ell) \\le \\operatorname{rnd}(x) \\le \\operatorname{rnd}(h)$, so equal outer values force the middle one. The loop can only succeed if the exact value $x$ is not a *breakpoint* of the rounding function: a representable number under directed rounding, or a midpoint between two neighbours under rounding to nearest. At a breakpoint every enclosure $\\ell < x < h$ straddles a jump of $\\operatorname{rnd}$, at every working precision. The functions therefore decide their exact cases before the loop: $e^0 = 1$, $\\log_2 2^k = k$, $2^n$ and $10^n$ for integers $n$, powers and roots that are exact, $\\operatorname{sinpi}$ and $\\operatorname{cospi}$ at multiples of $\\tfrac12$, $\\operatorname{tanpi}$ at multiples of $\\tfrac14$, and so on. Elsewhere the exact value is not a dyadic number. For example, by the Lindemann–Weierstrass theorem $e^x$ is transcendental for every nonzero algebraic $x$, so $\\exp$ and $\\ln$ never return a breakpoint at a dyadic argument other than $0$ and $1$; by Niven's theorem $\\sin \\pi x$ at a rational $x$ is rational only when it is $0$, $\\pm\\tfrac12$ or $\\pm 1$, and at a dyadic $x$ only $0$ and $\\pm 1$ occur. A non-dyadic value has a positive distance $\\delta$ to the nearest breakpoint, so the loop succeeds as soon as the enclosure is narrower than $\\delta$. The budget is still finite: once $w \\ge 64$ each refinement multiplies $w$ by $1.5$, so twelve refinements reach about $1.5^{12} \\approx 130$ times the starting precision. For binary64 the hardest known cases of $\\exp$ and $\\ln$ need a little more than $2p$ bits, far below that, but no such bound is known for every precision, so a failure remains possible in principle and is reported rather than hidden."
msgstr "第 3 步只需要单调性：由 $\\ell \\le x \\le h$ 可得 $\\operatorname{rnd}(\\ell) \\le \\operatorname{rnd}(x) \\le \\operatorname{rnd}(h)$，因此外侧的两个值相等就迫使中间的值与之相同。只有当精确值 $x$ 不是舍入函数的*断点*时，循环才可能成功：断点在定向舍入下是可表示数，在就近舍入下是两个相邻可表示数之间的中点。在断点处，无论工作精度如何，每个包络 $\\ell < x < h$ 都跨越 $\\operatorname{rnd}$ 的一个跳跃。因此各函数在循环之前先判定其精确情形：$e^0 = 1$、$\\log_2 2^k = k$、整数 $n$ 的 $2^n$ 和 $10^n$、结果精确的幂和根、$\\tfrac12$ 的倍数处的 $\\operatorname{sinpi}$ 和 $\\operatorname{cospi}$、$\\tfrac14$ 的倍数处的 $\\operatorname{tanpi}$，等等。在其他地方，精确值不是二进有理数。例如，由 Lindemann–Weierstrass 定理，对每个非零代数数 $x$，$e^x$ 都是超越数，因此 $\\exp$ 和 $\\ln$ 在 $0$ 和 $1$ 以外的二进有理数参数处从不返回断点；由 Niven 定理，有理数 $x$ 处的 $\\sin \\pi x$ 仅当其为 $0$、$\\pm\\tfrac12$ 或 $\\pm 1$ 时才是有理数，而在二进有理数 $x$ 处只会出现 $0$ 和 $\\pm 1$。非二进有理数的值到最近断点的距离 $\\delta$ 为正，因此一旦包络比 $\\delta$ 更窄，循环就会成功。但预算仍然是有限的：一旦 $w \\ge 64$，每次细化都将 $w$ 乘以 $1.5$，因此十二次细化大约达到起始精度的 $1.5^{12} \\approx 130$ 倍。对于 binary64，$\\exp$ 和 $\\ln$ 已知最难的情形只需要略多于 $2p$ 位，远低于该值；但并不知道对每种精度都成立的这种界，因此原则上仍可能失败，而失败会被报告，而不是被隐藏。"

#: manual/architecture.md:157
msgid "`bin_float` owns the scalar dyadic certificates. `ball_float` lifts them over endpoints, critical points, poles and domain boundaries. `decimal` and `decimal_gda` convert exact decimal inputs to directed dyadic bounds, run the binary certificate, and convert the certified endpoints back through exact integer arithmetic; endpoints far outside the decimal range are replaced by representatives that round identically, so no huge decimal is expanded. Total interval functions may widen to a safe set such as $[-1, 1]$ or Entire, while their checked forms expose the failure. No path substitutes a host `Double` approximation."
msgstr "`bin_float` 负责标量二进数（dyadic）证书。`ball_float` 将其提升到端点、临界点、极点和定义域边界上。`decimal` 和 `decimal_gda` 将精确的十进制输入转换为定向的二进数界，运行二进制证书，再通过精确整数算术把认证后的端点转换回来；远超十进制范围的端点会被替换为舍入结果相同的代表值，因此不会展开任何巨大的十进制数。全函数形式的区间函数可以放宽到 $[-1, 1]$ 或 Entire 之类的安全集合，而其 checked 形式会暴露失败。任何路径都不会用宿主的 `Double` 近似值来替代。"

#: manual/architecture.md:167
msgid "A. Ziv, \"Fast evaluation of elementary mathematical functions with correctly rounded last bit\", *ACM TOMS* 17(3), 1991. Muller et al., *Handbook of Floating-Point Arithmetic*, 2nd ed., 2018, ch. 10, discusses the table-maker's dilemma this loop resolves."
msgstr "A. Ziv，\"Fast evaluation of elementary mathematical functions with correctly rounded last bit\"，*ACM TOMS* 17(3)，1991。Muller 等，*Handbook of Floating-Point Arithmetic*，第 2 版，2018，第 10 章讨论了这一循环所解决的制表者困境（table-maker's dilemma）。"

#: manual/architecture.md:172
msgid "Decimal text conversion"
msgstr "十进制文本转换"

#: manual/architecture.md:174
msgid "`BinFloat::from_string_ctx` and `to_decimal_string_ctx` are correctly rounded for every precision and exponent without expanding $10^{k}$ when $k$ is huge. Parsing first decides certain overflow or underflow from a logarithmic estimate; for small exponents it rounds the exact rational $D \\cdot 10^{k}$; for large ones it encloses $D \\cdot 10^{k}$ with directed powers of ten and widens the working precision until both ends round alike, which terminates because no tie is possible there. Formatting finds the leading decimal exponent from a binary estimate corrected by directed powers of ten, and `to_shortest_string_ctx` bisects on the digit count. Bisection is valid because the test it bisects on is monotone in the number of digits $n$. The test asks whether one of the two $n$-digit decimals that bracket $x$ reads back to $x$. The values that read back to $x$ form an interval $I(x)$ around $x$. If some $n$-digit decimal $d$ lies in $I(x)$, then $d$ is also an $(n+1)$-digit decimal, and the $(n+1)$-digit neighbour of $x$ on the side of $d$ lies between $x$ and $d$, hence in $I(x)$ as well."
msgstr "`BinFloat::from_string_ctx` 和 `to_decimal_string_ctx` 对任意精度和指数都是正确舍入的，且在 $k$ 极大时不会展开 $10^{k}$。解析时先根据对数估计判定必然的上溢或下溢；对较小的指数，直接舍入精确有理数 $D \\cdot 10^{k}$；对较大的指数，则用定向的十的幂包络 $D \\cdot 10^{k}$，并不断增大工作精度直到两端舍入结果一致——由于此处不可能出现平局，该过程必然终止。格式化时先由二进制估计求出首位十进制指数，再用定向的十的幂加以修正；`to_shortest_string_ctx` 对数字位数做二分搜索。二分搜索之所以成立，是因为它所依据的判定关于位数 $n$ 是单调的。该判定询问夹住 $x$ 的两个 $n$ 位十进制数中是否有一个能回读为 $x$。能回读为 $x$ 的值构成 $x$ 周围的一个区间 $I(x)$。若某个 $n$ 位十进制数 $d$ 位于 $I(x)$ 中，则 $d$ 也是一个 $(n+1)$ 位十进制数，而 $x$ 在 $d$ 一侧的 $(n+1)$ 位相邻数位于 $x$ 与 $d$ 之间，因此也在 $I(x)$ 中。"

#: manual/architecture.md:190
msgid "Context and status flow"
msgstr "上下文与状态的流动"

#: manual/architecture.md:192
msgid "No numerical package relies on an ambient rounding mode."
msgstr "任何数值包都不依赖环境中的舍入模式。"

#: manual/architecture.md:194
msgid "Binary and IEEE decimal contexts are immutable inputs; flags are explicit outputs that callers `combine`."
msgstr "二进制和 IEEE 十进制上下文是不可变的输入；标志是显式输出，由调用者自行 `combine`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:196
msgid "`decimal_gda` returns a new context whose status includes the raised flags, then selects at most one trap by fixed precedence."
msgstr "`decimal_gda` 返回一个新的上下文，其状态包含已触发的标志，然后按固定优先级至多选择一个陷阱。"

#: manual/architecture.md:198
msgid "`BallContext` fixes the endpoint precision and exponent bounds and returns `BallFlags`."
msgstr "`BallContext` 确定端点精度和指数界，并返回 `BallFlags`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:200
msgid "`BinFloat`, `Decimal` and GDA `Decimal` implement the contextual traits of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` (`AddContextual`, …, `ExpContextual`), so generic code can run all three under one `ArithmeticContext`; `BinaryContext::from_arithmetic_context` and the decimal equivalents carry its precision, rounding, exponent bounds and clamp."
msgstr "`BinFloat`、`Decimal` 和 GDA `Decimal` 实现了 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 的 contextual trait（`AddContextual`、…、`ExpContextual`），因此泛型代码可以在同一个 `ArithmeticContext` 下运行这三者；`BinaryContext::from_arithmetic_context` 及其十进制对应函数会携带该上下文的精度、舍入方式、指数界和 clamp。"

#: manual/architecture.md:205
msgid "`BinFloatResult` and `BallFloatResult` keep the first `ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "`BinFloatResult` 和 `BallFloatResult` 保留第一个 `ArithmeticError`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:206
msgid "`DecimalChecked` keeps defined IEEE results, accumulates flags, and keeps certification errors separately."
msgstr "`DecimalChecked` 保留有定义的 IEEE 结果，累积标志，并单独保存认证错误。"

#: manual/architecture.md:208
msgid "`GdaDecimalChecked` threads one outcome, stops on `Trapped`, and resumes only through the explicit `resume_defined` transition."
msgstr "`GdaDecimalChecked` 串联传递单一结果，在遇到 `Trapped` 时停止，且只能通过显式的 `resume_defined` 转换恢复。"

#: manual/architecture.md:211
msgid "These wrappers compose existing semantics; they add no arithmetic of their own and never merge incompatible status channels."
msgstr "这些包装器只是组合已有语义；它们自身不添加任何算术，也从不合并互不兼容的状态通道。"

#: manual/architecture.md:214
msgid "Public surface and trait methods"
msgstr "公开接口与 trait 方法"

#: manual/architecture.md:216
msgid "The generated `pkg.generated.mbti` of each package is the authority for what is public. With MoonBit 0.10, methods of a trait implementation are no longer promoted to the type automatically: a method such as `BinFloat::to_string`, `Decimal::add_contextual` or `BinFloat::sqrt_checked` is callable with dot syntax only because the package declares it with `pub extend`, and the `.mbti` then lists it as `pub fn Type::name`. A trait method that is not listed that way is still reachable through the trait (for example `@def.is_finite(x)` over `Floating`), but not as `x.method()`."
msgstr "每个包生成的 `pkg.generated.mbti` 是判断哪些内容公开的权威依据。自 MoonBit 0.10 起，trait 实现中的方法不再自动提升为该类型的方法：像 `BinFloat::to_string`、`Decimal::add_contextual` 或 `BinFloat::sqrt_checked` 这样的方法之所以能用点语法调用，只是因为包用 `pub extend` 声明了它，随后 `.mbti` 会将其列为 `pub fn Type::name`。未以这种方式列出的 trait 方法仍可通过 trait 访问（例如基于 `Floating` 的 `@def.is_finite(x)`），但不能写作 `x.method()`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:225
msgid "Parsing and execution"
msgstr "解析与执行"

#: manual/architecture.md:227
msgid "`numeric_expr` holds syntax data and post-order callback evaluation. It performs no IO and selects no numeric backend."
msgstr "`numeric_expr` 保存语法数据并提供后序回调求值。它不执行任何 IO，也不选择数值后端。"

#: manual/architecture.md:230
msgid "Each `frontend/*` package owns one external grammar:"
msgstr "每个 `frontend/*` 包负责一种外部语法："

#: manual/architecture.md:232
msgid "`gda_expr` parses `.decTest` directives and cases and executes GDA outcomes;"
msgstr "`gda_expr` 解析 `.decTest` 指令与用例，并执行 GDA 结果；"

#: manual/architecture.md:233
msgid "`testfloat_expr` parses Berkeley TestFloat vectors and binds format, operation, rounding, tininess and exactness;"
msgstr "`testfloat_expr` 解析 Berkeley TestFloat 向量，并绑定格式、运算、舍入、微小性（tininess）和精确性；"

#: manual/architecture.md:235
msgid "`mpfr_expr` parses the pinned MPFR square-root, integer-power and elementary witnesses;"
msgstr "`mpfr_expr` 解析固定版本的 MPFR 平方根、整数幂和初等函数见证数据；"

#: manual/architecture.md:237
msgid "`itl_expr` parses ITF1788 interval rows and classifies the declared support set."
msgstr "`itl_expr` 解析 ITF1788 区间测试行，并对声明的支持集合进行分类。"

#: manual/architecture.md:240
msgid "Frontends return typed summaries. The `cli` packages own files, filters, shards, rendering and exit codes, on top of `internal/conformance` (shards, case dispositions, summaries) and `internal/runner_cli` (options, files, JSON). Python tools under `tools/` fetch checksum-pinned data, plan tasks, run isolated targets and processes, and aggregate results; they never replace the MoonBit implementation."
msgstr "前端返回带类型的汇总。`cli` 包在 `internal/conformance`（分片、用例处置、汇总）和 `internal/runner_cli`（选项、文件、JSON）之上，负责文件、过滤、分片、渲染和退出码。`tools/` 下的 Python 工具负责获取经校验和固定的数据、规划任务、运行隔离的目标平台与进程并汇总结果；它们从不替代 MoonBit 实现。"

#: manual/architecture.md:247
msgid "Stability boundaries"
msgstr "稳定性边界"

#: manual/architecture.md:249
msgid "The application surface is `def`, the four numeric packages and the four checked wrappers. `semantic` and `numeric_expr` are provisional integration surfaces. Frontends are public so that repository runners can compose them, but their compatibility promise is limited to the declared corpora."
msgstr "应用接口包括 `def`、四个数值包和四个 checked 包装器。`semantic` 和 `numeric_expr` 是暂定的集成接口。前端之所以公开，是为了让仓库中的运行器能够组合它们，但其兼容性承诺仅限于声明的语料。"

#: manual/architecture.md:254
msgid "`internal` and `internal/*`, `cli` and `cli/*`, `bench` and `bench/*`, `consistency` and `doc_examples` are implementation and verification infrastructure. A symbol may appear in `pkg.generated.mbti` without becoming a long-term application contract; read the package's design page before depending on it."
msgstr "`internal` 与 `internal/*`、`cli` 与 `cli/*`、`bench` 与 `bench/*`、`consistency` 以及 `doc_examples` 属于实现与验证基础设施。某个符号出现在 `pkg.generated.mbti` 中，并不意味着它成为长期的应用契约；依赖它之前请先阅读该包的设计页面。"

#: manual/architecture.md:260
msgid "Invariants"
msgstr "不变量"

#: manual/architecture.md:262
msgid "The sign of a value is independent of its non-negative coefficient."
msgstr "值的符号独立于其非负系数。"

#: manual/architecture.md:263
msgid "Finite binary normalization removes only factors of two."
msgstr "有限二进制值的规范化只移除因子 2。"

#: manual/architecture.md:264
msgid "Decimal parsing preserves the quantum until a normalizing or reducing operation is called explicitly."
msgstr "十进制解析会保留量子（quantum），直到显式调用规范化或约简运算。"

#: manual/architecture.md:266
msgid "Context finalization is the only place where a bounded result is rounded and status is decided."
msgstr "上下文最终化是唯一对有界结果进行舍入并决定状态的地方。"

#: manual/architecture.md:268
msgid "Interval lower endpoints round toward $-\\infty$ and upper endpoints toward $+\\infty$."
msgstr "区间下端点向 $-\\infty$ 舍入，上端点向 $+\\infty$ 舍入。"

#: manual/architecture.md:270
msgid "Empty, Entire, NaI, NaN, signed zero and the infinities stay explicit states."
msgstr "Empty、Entire、NaI、NaN、带符号零和无穷大都保持为显式状态。"

#: manual/architecture.md:272
msgid "A finite result never carries an exponent outside the implementation range."
msgstr "有限结果的指数绝不会超出实现范围。"

#: manual/architecture.md:273
msgid "Fast paths and fallbacks cannot change public values or status."
msgstr "快速路径与回退路径不能改变公开的值或状态。"

#: manual/architecture.md:274
msgid "Conformance summaries partition the selected cases, and sharding is deterministic."
msgstr "符合性汇总对所选用例构成划分，且分片是确定性的。"

#: manual/architecture.md:276
msgid "IO, downloads, process state and parallel scheduling stay in the tooling."
msgstr "IO、下载、进程状态和并行调度都留在工具链中。"

#: manual/architecture.md:278
msgid "Extension rule"
msgstr "扩展规则"

#: manual/architecture.md:280
msgid "Add behaviour to the package that owns its semantics. Reuse the capability traits of `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` and `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` before creating an umbrella trait. Keep kernels private, contexts and status explicit, and external-format parsing outside the numeric types unless the format is a stable interchange contract. Promote a new trait method to dot syntax with `pub extend` when it belongs to the type's public surface."
msgstr "把行为添加到拥有其语义的包中。在创建总括性的 trait 之前，先复用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 和 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 的能力 trait。保持内核私有、上下文与状态显式；除非外部格式本身是稳定的交换契约，否则其解析应放在数值类型之外。当新的 trait 方法属于该类型的公开接口时，用 `pub extend` 将其提升为点语法可调用的方法。"

#: manual/architecture.md:287
msgid "Extending a conformance surface needs coordinated changes to the parser, executor, support classification, CLI schema, corpus manifest, tests, generated interfaces and documentation. Parsing a new operation is not support until strict execution has a defined comparison and reproducible evidence; see [verification](./verification.md)."
msgstr "扩展符合性测试范围需要协同修改解析器、执行器、支持分类、CLI 模式、语料清单、测试、生成的接口以及文档。能解析一个新运算并不等于支持它，除非严格执行具有明确定义的比较方式和可复现的证据；参见[验证](./verification.md)。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:1
msgid "ball_float conformance"
msgstr "ball_float 符合性"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:3
#: manual/performance_audit.md:154
msgid "Claim"
msgstr "声明"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:5
msgid "The current strict ITF1788 gate executes 4,656/4,656 selected cases with no failed, unsupported, or diagnostic rows. This is a claim about the pinned corpus revision, selected operation phases, and runner precision—not a claim of complete IEEE 1788 implementation."
msgstr "当前 strict ITF1788 门禁执行 4,656/4,656 个选中 case，failed、unsupported 与 diagnostic 均为零。该声明只覆盖固定语料 revision、已选 operation phase 和 runner precision，不等于完整实现 IEEE 1788。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:7
msgid "Semantic oracle"
msgstr "语义预言机"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:9
msgid "Expected results are compared by set meaning: endpoint containment, set relations, boolean relations, overlap states, numeric observations, and decorations use operation-specific comparators. A conservative interval may be valid when the contract permits widening; an enclosure that excludes an exact result is never valid."
msgstr "预期结果按集合意义比较：端点包含、集合关系、布尔关系、overlap state、数值观察和 decoration 分别使用操作专用比较器。合同允许放宽时，更宽区间可以正确；排除精确结果的包络永远错误。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:11
msgid "Supported phases"
msgstr "支持的阶段"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:13
msgid "The strict matrix covers sets, relations, observations, cancellation, add/subtract/multiply/divide, elementary core, exponential/logarithmic functions, general power, trigonometric functions, `atan2`, hyperbolic functions, inverse trigonometric functions, FMA, integer power, and extrema. Phase operation sets are disjoint so a row is never counted twice."
msgstr "strict 矩阵涵盖集合、关系、观察、抵消、加/减/乘/除、初等函数核心、指数/对数函数、一般幂、三角函数、`atan2`、双曲函数、反三角函数、FMA、整数幂以及极值。各阶段的运算集合互不相交，因此同一行不会被重复计数。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:15
msgid "Decorations and fallbacks"
msgstr "装饰与回退"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:17
msgid "Empty, Entire, and decorated NaI are separate states. Elementary kernels use directed dyadic certificates. When range reduction cannot be certified, `sin`/`cos` return `[-1,1]` and `tan` returns Entire; that preserves inclusion but does not promise tightness. A passing gate does not cover inputs outside the corpus: the remaining defects listed under [Known limitations](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations) (the decoration of `rootn` with a negative degree) are not exercised by the selected cases."
msgstr "Empty、Entire 和装饰后的 NaI 是彼此独立的状态。初等函数内核使用定向二进有理数证书。当范围约简无法认证时，`sin`/`cos` 返回 `[-1,1]`，`tan` 返回 Entire；这保持了包含性，但不保证紧致性。门禁通过并不覆盖语料之外的输入：[已知局限](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations)中列出的其余缺陷（负次数 `rootn` 的装饰）未被所选用例覆盖。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:19
msgid "Exclusions"
msgstr "排除范围"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:21
msgid "Reverse interval operations, every decoration rule outside the selected phases, arbitrary endpoint formats, and unpinned upstream revisions remain outside the claim."
msgstr "reverse interval operation、选定 phase 以外的全部 decoration 规则、任意 endpoint format 和未固定的上游 revision 均不在声明内。"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:23
#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:35
#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:49
#: manual/performance/ball_float.md:26
#: manual/performance/decimal.md:29
#: manual/performance/decimal_gda.md:29
msgid "Reproduction"
msgstr "复现"

#: manual/conformance/ball_float.md:31
msgid "See [the interval data guide](../../../testdata/interval/README.md) for provenance, phase counts, strict-mode behavior, and failure triage."
msgstr "语料来源、phase 计数、strict 模式和失败排查见[区间数据指南](../../../testdata/interval/README.md)。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:1
msgid "bin_float conformance"
msgstr "bin_float 符合性"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:3
msgid "This page records the `0.8.0` binary floating-point semantic and test boundary. It is evidence for a stated, finite corpus; it is not a proof that any implementation can be correct for every real input."
msgstr "本文记录 `0.8.0` 二进制浮点语义与验证边界。有限测试全部通过是声明范围内的证据，不是对所有实数输入的形式化证明。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:7
msgid "Normative and research sources"
msgstr "规范与研究来源"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:9
msgid "IEEE, *IEEE Standard for Floating-Point Arithmetic*, IEEE 754-2019: interchange formats, rounding-direction attributes, NaNs/infinities/signed zeros, exceptions, and tininess detection."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019：interchange format、舍入方向、带符号零、NaN、异常标志与 before/after rounding 的 tininess 语义。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:12
msgid "S. Fousse, G. Hanrot, V. Lefèvre, P. Pélissier, and P. Zimmermann, [MPFR: A Multiple-Precision Binary Floating-Point Library with Correct Rounding](https://doi.org/10.1145/1236463.1236468), ACM TOMS 33(2), 2007. MPFR supplies the exact-result-then-one-rounding model used for arbitrary precisions."
msgstr "Fousse、Hanrot、Lefèvre、Pélissier、Zimmermann， [MPFR: A Multiple-Precision Binary Floating-Point Library with Correct Rounding](https://doi.org/10.1145/1236463.1236468)， ACM TOMS 33(2), 2007：任意精度的“精确结果、仅一次舍入”模型。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:16
msgid "John Hauser's Berkeley [SoftFloat](https://www.jhauser.us/arithmetic/SoftFloat.html) and [TestFloat](https://www.jhauser.us/arithmetic/TestFloat.html), release 3e, provide the independently generated IEEE result/flag vectors."
msgstr "John Hauser 的 Berkeley [SoftFloat](https://www.jhauser.us/arithmetic/SoftFloat.html) 与 [TestFloat](https://www.jhauser.us/arithmetic/TestFloat.html)（release 3e）提供了独立生成的 IEEE 结果/标志向量。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:20
msgid "Mathematical model"
msgstr "数学模型"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:22
msgid "A finite nonzero `BinFloat` denotes the dyadic real"
msgstr "有限非零的 `BinFloat` 表示二进有理实数"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:24
msgid "`(-1)^negative * coefficient * 2^exponent2`, where `coefficient` is a non-negative `BinCoeff`."
msgstr "`(-1)^negative * coefficient * 2^exponent2`，其中 `coefficient` 是非负的 `BinCoeff`。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:27
msgid "The finite coefficient is normalized by removing factors of two, while the sign of zero remains observable. Infinity, qNaN, sNaN, NaN payload, and NaN sign are explicit states rather than sentinel finite values."
msgstr "有限系数通过去除因子 2 来规范化，同时零的符号仍然可观察。无穷、qNaN、sNaN、NaN 载荷和 NaN 符号都是显式状态，而非以哨兵有限值表示。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:31
msgid "For `add_ctx`, `sub_ctx`, `mul_ctx`, `div_ctx`, `sqrt_ctx`, and `pow_int_ctx`:"
msgstr "`add_ctx`、`sub_ctx`、`mul_ctx`、`div_ctx`、`sqrt_ctx` 与 `pow_int_ctx` 的顺序固定为：先处理 IEEE 特殊值；在 dyadic/有理数或平方根界上计算精确数学结果；按目标精度和方向仅舍入一次；最后做指数范围/subnormal 量化，并从该过程导出五个 IEEE 标志。实现不会根据测试 ID、测试数值或向量格式选择分支。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:33
msgid "IEEE special cases are resolved before finite arithmetic."
msgstr "IEEE 特殊情形在有限算术之前处理。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:34
msgid "Finite addition, subtraction, and multiplication use their exact dyadic result; division uses an exact integer quotient/remainder decision; square root uses an exact integer square root and an exact comparison with the rounding midpoint; integer powers certify a directed enclosure (Ziv loop) and fall back to the exact power when certification does not succeed."
msgstr "有限值的加法、减法和乘法使用其精确的二进有理结果；除法使用精确的整数商/余数判定；平方根使用精确的整数平方根，并与舍入中点做精确比较；整数幂对定向包络进行认证（Ziv 循环），认证不成功时回退到精确幂。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:39
msgid "The exact result is rounded once, in the requested direction, directly to the coarser of the precision grid and the subnormal grid of the exponent range (no double rounding); overflow is then decided on the rounded value."
msgstr "精确结果按所请求的方向只舍入一次，直接舍入到精度网格与指数范围的次正规网格两者中较粗的那个（不存在双重舍入）；随后根据舍入后的值判定是否上溢。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:42
msgid "The returned `BinaryFlags` is derived from that mathematical result: inexact, underflow, overflow, division-by-zero, and invalid-operation."
msgstr "返回的 `BinaryFlags` 由该数学结果推导而来：不精确、下溢、上溢、除以零和无效运算。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:45
msgid "This order matters. For example, binary16 `0x0400 * 0x3BFF` produces `0x0400` with `inexact | underflow`; after-rounding tininess is determined from the precision-rounded unbounded value, not merely from the final normal interchange encoding."
msgstr "例如 binary16 `0x0400 * 0x3BFF` 的结果位为 `0x0400`，标志仍为 `inexact | underflow`。after-rounding tininess 依据目标精度、无界指数的舍入结果，而不能由最终 normal 编码倒推。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:50
msgid "No operation branches on test identifiers, test values, or corpus format. The corpus interpreter is an adapter around the public contextual operations."
msgstr "没有任何运算会根据测试标识符、测试值或语料格式进行分支。语料解释器是包裹公开上下文运算的适配器。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:53
msgid "Interchange and context"
msgstr "交换格式与上下文"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:55
msgid "`BinaryInterchange` decodes and encodes IEEE binary16, binary32, binary64, and binary128 bit patterns. `BinaryContext` carries precision, rounding direction, paired exponent limits, and before/after tininess detection. Encoding and contextual arithmetic both return status flags; ordinary operators use an unbounded nearest-even context and intentionally do not expose those flags."
msgstr "`BinaryInterchange` 解码和编码 IEEE binary16、binary32、binary64 和 binary128 位模式。`BinaryContext` 携带精度、舍入方向、成对的指数界限以及舍入前/舍入后的微小性（tininess）检测方式。编码与上下文算术都返回状态标志；普通运算符使用无界的就近舍入（偶数优先）上下文，并有意不暴露这些标志。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:61
msgid "NaN comparisons in the TestFloat adapter are class-based only when an expected result is NaN. This is not a weakened finite-value comparison: non-NaN encoded bits and all exception bits must match exactly. It reflects IEEE's permitted choice of a newly generated NaN payload. The implementation itself preserves the selected input NaN's sign/payload and quiets signaling NaNs."
msgstr "TestFloat 适配器中的 NaN 比较仅在期望结果为 NaN 时才按类别进行。这并非弱化了有限值的比较：非 NaN 的编码位和所有异常位都必须完全一致。这反映了 IEEE 允许自行选择新生成 NaN 载荷的规定。实现本身会保留所选输入 NaN 的符号/载荷，并将信号 NaN 静默化。"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:67
msgid "Declared corpus and results"
msgstr "声明的语料与结果"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:69
msgid "The pinned full gate is documented in [`testdata/bin_float/README.md`](../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md)."
msgstr "完整门禁定义见 [`testdata/bin_float/README.md`](../../../testdata/bin_float/README.md)。"

