#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:75
msgid "4 formats × mulAdd (5 directions × 2 tininess modes), rem, roundToInt and four integer conversions (5 directions × exact/inexact variants), six comparison predicates"
msgstr "4 格式 × mulAdd（5 舍入 × 2 tininess）、rem、roundToInt 与四种整数转换（5 舍入 × exact/非 exact）、六个比较谓词"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:76
msgid "MPFR 4.2.2 `tests/data/sqrt`"
msgstr "MPFR 4.2.2 `tests/data/sqrt`"

#: manual/conformance/bin_float.md:76
