msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr "边界"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:29
msgid "The checked matrix is finite and does not claim every IEEE 754 operation, every payload propagation policy, or every possible decimal input. The supplementary `dd*`/`dq*` decTest rows are diagnostics, not an IEEE oracle."
msgstr "固定矩阵是有限的，不声明覆盖 IEEE 754 全部操作、所有 payload 传播策略或所有可能十进制输入。补充的 `dd*`/`dq*` decTest 行只作诊断，不是 IEEE oracle。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:31
msgid "The matrix passes on the current branch, which has no [known deviations](../design/decimal.md#known-deviations) left. Passing the gate is evidence for the covered rows only."
msgstr "该矩阵在当前分支上通过，且该分支已不再有[已知偏差](../design/decimal.md#known-deviations)。门禁通过仅是所覆盖各行的证据。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:43
msgid "See [the decimal data guide](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md) for corpus provenance, vector families, and failure records."
msgstr "语料来源、vector family 和失败记录见[十进制数据指南](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md)。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda conformance"
msgstr "decimal_gda 符合性"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:3
msgid "The implementation target is General Decimal Arithmetic Specification 1.70; the pinned executable corpus is the General Decimal Arithmetic testcase suite 2.62."
msgstr "实现目标是 General Decimal Arithmetic Specification 1.70；固定的可执行语料来自 General Decimal Arithmetic testcase suite 2.62。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:7
msgid "Published result"
msgstr "公布的结果"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:9
msgid "The pinned official corpus passes 64,986/64,986 legal executable scalar rows with zero failed, unsupported, or legacy rows. The remaining 141 rows are `#` placeholder or non-scalar invalid inputs and are reported as diagnostics outside the legal denominator."
msgstr "固定 official 语料的 64,986/64,986 条合法 executable 标量行全部通过，failed、unsupported 和 legacy 均为零。其余 141 行是 `#` placeholder 或 non-scalar 非法输入，作为 diagnostic 报告，不进入合法分母。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:11
msgid "Legacy corpus"
msgstr "遗留语料"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:13
msgid "The pinned `official0` corpus passes 16,124/16,124 legal executable rows with zero failures. It is retained for historical compatibility checks, not as the definition of the current surface."
msgstr "固定 `official0` 语料的 16,124/16,124 条合法 executable 行全部通过。它用于历史兼容检查，不定义当前公开面。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:15
msgid "State semantics"
msgstr "状态语义"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:17
msgid "Each operation returns a `GdaOutcome` containing the defined result, flags raised by that operation, and the next context with accumulated sticky status. Enabling a trap changes the outcome variant but does not erase the defined result."
msgstr "每个操作返回 `GdaOutcome`，其中包含 GDA 定义结果、本次操作 raised flags，以及累计 sticky status 的 next context。启用 trap 会改变 outcome variant，但不会删除定义结果。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:19
msgid "Runner model"
msgstr "运行器模型"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:21
msgid "Documents are parsed once, directive state is snapshotted per case, and deterministic shards execute disjoint case positions through the public `GdaContext`/`GdaOutcome` operation surface. Executable, diagnostic, unsupported, legacy, passed, and failed counts remain separate."
msgstr "文档只解析一次，directive state 按 case 固化，确定性 shard 通过公开 `GdaContext`/`GdaOutcome` operation surface 执行互不重叠的 case position。 executable、diagnostic、unsupported、legacy、passed 与 failed 计数始终分开。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:28
msgid "The claim covers legal scalar rows in the pinned corpora. Placeholder/non-scalar invalid rows, future directives, unpinned revisions, and an unbounded universe of decimal strings remain outside it."
msgstr "声明只覆盖固定语料中的合法标量行。placeholder/non-scalar 非法行、未来 directive、未固定 revision 和无限十进制字符串空间不在其内。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:30
msgid "Known deviations outside the corpus"
msgstr "语料之外的已知偏差"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:32
msgid "A passing corpus is a finite claim. Review of the implementation found these behaviours, none of which has a pinned row:"
msgstr "通过语料只是一个有限的声明。对实现的审查发现了以下行为，它们都没有对应的固定行："

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:35
msgid "Integer `power` is accurate to about 0.55 units in the last place (0.6 for negative exponents), not correctly rounded, as the specification allows."
msgstr "整数 `power` 的精度约为 0.55 个末位单位（负指数时为 0.6），并非正确舍入，这是规范所允许的。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:38
msgid "Isolation and native benchmark"
msgstr "隔离与原生基准测试"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:40
msgid "Production dependency scans require `decimal_gda`, `decimal_gda_checked`, and `frontend/gda_expr` to contain no IEEE `decimal` import or GDA profile bridge. IEEE tests and its independent conformance corpus are run separately."
msgstr "生产依赖扫描要求 `decimal_gda`、`decimal_gda_checked` 与 `frontend/gda_expr` 不包含 IEEE `decimal` import 或 GDA profile bridge。IEEE 测试和独立一致性语料单独运行。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:44
msgid "The quick benchmark builds only the current engine in an isolated snapshot and runs three native samples per cell. It reports arithmetic, parser, context, and elementary timing observations without treating performance as a conformance requirement or comparing against a historical adapter."
msgstr "快速 benchmark 只在隔离快照中构建当前引擎，每个 cell 运行 3 个 native sample。它报告算术、parser、context 与 elementary 的耗时观察值，不把性能作为 conformance 要求，也不与历史 adapter 比较。"

#: manual/conformance/decimal_gda.md:58
msgid "See [the decimal data guide](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md) for manifests, filters, phases, JSON output, and failure triage."
msgstr "manifest、过滤、phase、JSON 输出和失败排查见[十进制数据指南](../../../testdata/decimal/README.md)。"

#: manual/conventions.md:1
msgid "Repository conventions"
msgstr "仓库约定"

#: manual/conventions.md:3
msgid "These rules add to the Luna-Flow documentation standard for `floating`; they never relax it. The manual describes the implementation on the current branch. The current release is **`0.8.0`**, the version in `moon.mod`."
msgstr "这些规则是 `floating` 在 Luna-Flow 文档标准之上的补充，绝不会放宽该标准。本手册描述当前分支上的实现。当前发布版本为 **`0.8.0`**，即 `moon.mod` 中的版本。"

#: manual/conventions.md:7
msgid "Chapters and guides"
msgstr "章节与指南"

#: manual/conventions.md:9
msgid "Every package has one page per chapter, named after its package path:"
msgstr "每个包在每个章节中各有一页，以其包路径命名："

#: manual/conventions.md:11
msgid "**API reference (`api/<package>.md`)**, titled `# <package> API`, starts with `## Purpose` and `## Importing` (the `moon.pkg` import and the aliases the examples use), then lists every public item of `pkg.generated.mbti` under a heading that names it in code, grouped by purpose: the first sentence says what the item does, an `mbti` block gives the signature, and the text states its laws and edge behaviour (errors, flags, NaN, signed zero, overflow), with a small `test` example for the important items. Closely related items may share one heading."
msgstr "**API 参考（`api/<package>.md`）**，标题为 `# <package> API`，以 `## Purpose` 和 `## Importing`（`moon.pkg` 导入以及示例所用的别名）开头，然后按用途分组，在以代码形式命名该项的标题下列出 `pkg.generated.mbti` 的每个公共项：第一句说明该项的作用，一个 `mbti` 代码块给出签名，正文说明其定律和边界行为（错误、标志、NaN、带符号零、溢出），并为重要的项提供一个小型 `test` 示例。紧密相关的项可以共用一个标题。"

#: manual/conventions.md:19
msgid "**Tutorial (`tutorial/<package>.md`)**, titled `# <package> tutorial`, states its goal in the first paragraph, maps tasks to items in an `| I want to | Use |` table, and continues with `## Quick start`, `## Everyday tasks`, `## Going further`, `## Common pitfalls` and `## Next steps`. Its examples are complete and compile."
msgstr "**教程（`tutorial/<package>.md`）**，标题为 `# <package> tutorial`，在第一段说明其目标，用 `| I want to | Use |` 表格将任务映射到各项，然后依次是 `## Quick start`、`## Everyday tasks`、`## Going further`、`## Common pitfalls` 和 `## Next steps`。其示例完整且可编译。"

#: manual/conventions.md:24
msgid "**Design (`design/<package>.md`)**, titled `# <package> design`, explains the goal, the representation, the mathematics with its derivations, the invariants and the decisions taken, lists the alternatives rejected, and ends with `## Boundaries`."
msgstr "**设计（`design/<package>.md`）**，标题为 `# <package> design`，解释目标、表示方式、数学原理及其推导、不变量以及所做的决策，列出被否决的备选方案，并以 `## Boundaries` 作结。"

#: manual/conventions.md:29
msgid "The four numerical cores, `bin_float`, `decimal`, `decimal_gda` and `ball_float`, have two more chapters, as the standard allows:"
msgstr "四个数值核心 `bin_float`、`decimal`、`decimal_gda` 和 `ball_float` 在标准允许的范围内另有两个章节："

#: manual/conventions.md:32
msgid "**Conformance (`conformance/<package>.md`)** states a pinned, finite evidence claim and its exclusions."
msgstr "**符合性（`conformance/<package>.md`）** 给出固定版本的、有限的证据声明及其排除项。"

#: manual/conventions.md:34
msgid "**Performance (`performance/<package>.md`)** records reproducible measurements and target-specific dispatch evidence without making API promises."
msgstr "**性能（`performance/<package>.md`）** 记录可复现的测量结果和特定于目标平台的分派证据，不作 API 承诺。"

#: manual/conventions.md:38
msgid "The guides are fixed by `tools/doc_quality.py`: `index.md` (overview and package map), `getting_started.md` (package choice and first steps), `numeric_semantics.md` (shared numerical vocabulary), `architecture.md` (layers and responsibilities), `verification.md` (gates and conformance scope), `performance_audit.md` (audit of the historical performance baseline) and this page. Do not add or rename guides without updating that list."
msgstr "指南由 `tools/doc_quality.py` 固定：`index.md`（概览与包地图）、`getting_started.md`（包的选择与入门步骤）、`numeric_semantics.md`（共享的数值术语）、`architecture.md`（分层与职责）、`verification.md`（检查关卡与符合性范围）、`performance_audit.md`（历史性能基线的审计）以及本页。未同步更新该列表时，不要新增或重命名指南。"

#: manual/conventions.md:45
msgid "`README.md` positions the current release and points into the manual. `CHANGELOG.md` owns release history and migration notes."
msgstr "`README.md` 说明当前发布版本的定位并指向本手册。`CHANGELOG.md` 负责发布历史与迁移说明。"

#: manual/conventions.md:48
msgid "Package pages"
msgstr "包页面"

#: manual/conventions.md:50
msgid "Mirror every `moon.pkg`: the package in `src/<path>/moon.pkg` is documented in `api/<path>.md`, `tutorial/<path>.md` and `design/<path>.md`. Files do not create packages; `moon.pkg` boundaries do."
msgstr "镜像每个 `moon.pkg`：`src/<path>/moon.pkg` 中的包由 `api/<path>.md`、`tutorial/<path>.md` 和 `design/<path>.md` 记录。文件不会创建包，`moon.pkg` 边界才会。"

#: manual/conventions.md:53
msgid "Give every package all three pages. Packages without an application API (frontends, CLIs, `internal/*`, `bench/*`, `consistency`, `doc_examples`) still document their generated interface, maintainer workflow and stability boundary."
msgstr "为每个包提供全部三类页面。没有应用 API 的包（前端、CLI、`internal/*`、`bench/*`、`consistency`、`doc_examples`）仍需记录其生成接口、维护流程和稳定性边界。"

#: manual/conventions.md:57
msgid "Every package also keeps a `src/<path>/README.mbt.md`."
msgstr "每个包还要保留一个 `src/<path>/README.mbt.md`。"

#: manual/conventions.md:58
msgid "`pkg.generated.mbti` is the public-surface inventory; source and tests define behaviour. A method is documented as callable with dot syntax only if the `.mbti` lists it as `pub fn Type::name`; trait-implementation methods are not promoted implicitly and must be declared with `pub extend`."
msgstr "`pkg.generated.mbti` 是公开接口的清单；源码和测试定义行为。只有当 `.mbti` 将某方法列为 `pub fn Type::name` 时，才能将其记录为可用点语法调用；trait 实现中的方法不会被隐式提升，必须用 `pub extend` 声明。"

#: manual/conventions.md:62
msgid "Do not document planned APIs as existing, and do not keep research notes as separate pages. Promote durable conclusions into design, conformance or performance pages, and move superseded history to `CHANGELOG.md`."
msgstr "不要把计划中的 API 写成已存在，也不要把研究笔记保留为独立页面。将持久的结论提升到设计、符合性或性能页面中，并把已被取代的历史移入 `CHANGELOG.md`。"

#: manual/conventions.md:65
msgid "Pages name only the current release. A page may mention an older release only when it carries a `<!-- historical-performance-baseline: X.Y.Z -->` marker for that version; `tools/doc_quality.py` rejects any other historical version."
msgstr "页面只提及当前发布版本。只有当页面带有针对该版本的 `<!-- historical-performance-baseline: X.Y.Z -->` 标记时，才可以提及更早的版本；`tools/doc_quality.py` 会拒绝其他任何历史版本。"

#: manual/conventions.md:70
msgid "API snapshots"
msgstr "API 快照"

#: manual/conventions.md:72
msgid "Every API page ends with `## Complete public interface`, whose body is an exact copy of the package's `pkg.generated.mbti` between the markers `<!-- generated-api-start -->` and `<!-- generated-api-end -->`, fenced as `mbti`. Individual signatures in the page body are `mbti` blocks too. `tools/doc_quality.py` compares the snapshot with the generated file (it also accepts the older `moonbit` fence), so regenerate it whenever `moon info` changes the interface."
msgstr "每个 API 页面都以 `## Complete public interface` 结尾，其正文是该包 `pkg.generated.mbti` 的精确副本，位于 `<!-- generated-api-start -->` 与 `<!-- generated-api-end -->` 标记之间，并用 `mbti` 代码块围起。页面正文中的单个签名也使用 `mbti` 代码块。`tools/doc_quality.py` 会将快照与生成的文件进行比较（也接受旧的 `moonbit` 代码块），因此每当 `moon info` 改变接口时都要重新生成快照。"

#: manual/conventions.md:80
msgid "Numeric documentation rules"
msgstr "数值文档规则"

#: manual/conventions.md:82
msgid "Use `precision`, `rounding`, `classify`, `sign`, `normalized`, `quantum`, `context` and `flags` as defined in [numeric semantics](./numeric_semantics.md)."
msgstr "按照[数值语义](./numeric_semantics.md)中的定义使用 `precision`、`rounding`、`classify`、`sign`、`normalized`、`quantum`、`context` 和 `flags`。"

#: manual/conventions.md:85
msgid "Separate the stored representation, the exact value, the rounded result, status flags, checked errors and interval enclosures."
msgstr "区分存储表示、精确值、舍入结果、状态标志、checked 错误和区间包络。"

#: manual/conventions.md:87
msgid "State when parsing preserves the quantum and when normalization changes the cohort without changing the value."
msgstr "说明解析何时保留量子（quantum），以及规范化何时在不改变值的情况下改变同值类（cohort）。"

#: manual/conventions.md:89
msgid "Name the order an API uses. `compare`, `<` and sorting are a total preorder that puts every NaN above every number; the IEEE partial order (with *unordered*) and `totalOrder` are separate APIs. Never imply a scalar order for interval values."
msgstr "指明 API 所使用的序。`compare`、`<` 和排序是一个全预序，它把每个 NaN 排在所有数之上；IEEE 偏序（含 *unordered*）和 `totalOrder` 是单独的 API。切勿暗示区间值存在标量序。"

#: manual/conventions.md:93
msgid "For `*_ctx` APIs, document both the returned value and the flags."
msgstr "对于 `*_ctx` API，同时说明返回值和标志。"

#: manual/conventions.md:94
msgid "For checked APIs and wrappers, document the domain-specific transition: a result error, IEEE flag accumulation, or a GDA trap short-circuit and its recovery."
msgstr "对于 checked API 和包装器，说明其特定于数值域的状态转换：结果错误、IEEE 标志累积，或 GDA 陷阱短路及其恢复。"

#: manual/conventions.md:97
msgid "Document `decimal` and `decimal_gda` as separate contracts: IEEE operations return per-operation flags, while GDA operations thread sticky status and traps through `GdaOutcome`."
msgstr "必须把 `decimal` 与 `decimal_gda` 写成两个独立合同：IEEE 运算返回逐 operation flags，GDA 运算通过 `GdaOutcome` 传递 sticky status 与 traps。"

#: manual/conventions.md:100
msgid "Write mathematics in TeX (`$…$`, `$$…$$`) and cite the standard clause or classical result a derivation relies on."
msgstr "用 TeX（`$…$`、`$$…$$`）书写数学内容，并引用推导所依赖的标准条款或经典结果。"

#: manual/conventions.md:105
msgid "Runnable examples are complete top-level items, normally a `test` block, fenced `moonbit`, and they show their output with `inspect`. They must compile and pass against the current branch."
msgstr "可运行的示例是完整的顶层项，通常是一个 `test` 块，用 `moonbit` 代码块围起，并用 `inspect` 展示输出。它们必须能在当前分支上编译并通过。"

#: manual/conventions.md:108
msgid "Partial snippets, signatures in prose, executable-package code and `internal/*` code that cannot be imported from outside the module, and `moon.pkg` snippets are fenced `moonbit nocheck`; shell commands are fenced `bash`. `tools/check_doc_examples.py`, run by `just docs`, compiles and runs every other `moonbit` block of the manual."
msgstr "不完整的片段、行文中的签名、可执行包的代码、无法从模块外部导入的 `internal/*` 代码，以及 `moon.pkg` 片段，使用 `moonbit nocheck` 代码块；shell 命令使用 `bash` 代码块。由 `just docs` 运行的 `tools/check_doc_examples.py` 会编译并运行手册中其余所有 `moonbit` 代码块。"

#: manual/conventions.md:113
msgid "Import aliases: `@lf_alg` for `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` and `@lf_arith` for `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`; floating packages use their default aliases (`@bin_float`, `@decimal`, …)."
msgstr "导入别名：`Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 使用 `@lf_alg`，`Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 使用 `@lf_arith`；floating 的各个包使用其默认别名（`@bin_float`、`@decimal`、…）。"

#: manual/conventions.md:116
msgid "Call only what the `.mbti` lists. For example, `BinFloat` has no `to_double` or `is_finite` method; use `to_shortest_string` and `@def.is_finite(x)`."
msgstr "只调用 `.mbti` 中列出的内容。例如，`BinFloat` 没有 `to_double` 或 `is_finite` 方法；请使用 `to_shortest_string` 和 `@def.is_finite(x)`。"

#: manual/conventions.md:120
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "翻译"

#: manual/conventions.md:122
msgid "English pages in `doc/manual` are the only source. Translations live in the gettext catalogs `doc/locale/<locale>/LC_MESSAGES/manual.po` for the locales in `doc/conf.json` and are never edited as page copies. Do not translate identifiers, package names, paths, commands, version strings or mathematics. Typst attachments live in `doc/attachments/` and are shared by all locales."
msgstr "`doc/manual` 中的英文页面是唯一的源文本。译文存放在 gettext 目录 `doc/locale/<locale>/LC_MESSAGES/manual.po` 中，覆盖 `doc/conf.json` 所列的语言区域，绝不以页面副本的形式编辑。不要翻译标识符、包名、路径、命令、版本字符串或数学内容。Typst 附件位于 `doc/attachments/`，由所有语言区域共享。"

#: manual/conventions.md:128
msgid "Review checklist"
msgstr "审核清单"

#: manual/conventions.md:130
msgid "Run `moon info` and compare each changed `pkg.generated.mbti` with its API page; refresh the `## Complete public interface` snapshot."
msgstr "运行 `moon info`，将每个有改动的 `pkg.generated.mbti` 与其 API 页面进行比较，并刷新 `## Complete public interface` 快照。"

#: manual/conventions.md:132
msgid "Check that every `moon.pkg` still has its `api/`, `tutorial/` and `design/` pages (and the evidence pages of the four cores)."
msgstr "检查每个 `moon.pkg` 仍有对应的 `api/`、`tutorial/` 和 `design/` 页面（以及四个核心的证据页面）。"

#: manual/conventions.md:134
msgid "Compile and run every changed example (`moonbit` blocks) against the current branch."
msgstr "针对当前分支编译并运行每个有改动的示例（`moonbit` 代码块）。"

#: manual/conventions.md:136
msgid "Run `just docs`: `tools/doc_quality.py`, the manual examples and the `src/doc_examples` tests."
msgstr "运行 `just docs`：它会运行 `tools/doc_quality.py`、手册示例以及 `src/doc_examples` 测试。"

#: manual/conventions.md:138
msgid "Run `lunadoc update` to refresh `doc/locale/manual.pot` and merge the catalogs, translate new and fuzzy entries, then check `lunadoc status` (coverage per locale) and `lunadoc check --compile` (layout, catalogs, links and Typst attachments)."
msgstr "运行 `lunadoc update` 以刷新 `doc/locale/manual.pot` 并合并翻译目录，翻译新增和 fuzzy 条目，然后检查 `lunadoc status`（各语言区域的覆盖率）和 `lunadoc check --compile`（布局、翻译目录、链接和 Typst 附件）。"

#: manual/conventions.md:142
msgid "Run `moon fmt`, `moon check --target all --deny-warn`, the relevant tests, and `just pr` before submitting."
msgstr "提交前运行 `moon fmt`、`moon check --target all --deny-warn`、相关测试以及 `just pr`。"

#: manual/conventions.md:144
msgid "On a release bump, update `moon.mod`, the version in `README.md`, this page and `CHANGELOG.md` together."
msgstr "版本发布时，同时更新 `moon.mod`、`README.md` 中的版本号、本页以及 `CHANGELOG.md`。"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:1
msgid "ball_float design"
msgstr "ball_float 设计"

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:3
msgid "`ball_float` computes with sets of real numbers instead of single approximations. This page states the mathematical contract, derives the formulas the code uses, explains the choices behind them, and lists what the package does not do. The [API reference](../api/ball_float.md) documents each function; the [tutorial](../tutorial/ball_float.md) shows them in use."
msgstr "`ball_float` 以实数集合而非单个近似值进行计算。本页陈述其数学契约，推导代码所用的公式，解释其背后的取舍，并列出本包不做的事情。[API 参考](../api/ball_float.md) 说明了每个函数；[教程](../tutorial/ball_float.md) 展示了它们的用法。"

