msgstr "roundTiesToEven"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:174
msgid "$f > \\tfrac12$, or $f = \\tfrac12$ and $c$ odd"
msgstr "$f > \\tfrac12$，或 $f = \\tfrac12$ 且 $c$ 为奇数"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:177
msgid "For a negative $x$ the same rule is applied to $|x|$ and the sign restored, so `Ceiling` and `Floor` swap. Every mode $\\circ$ is **monotone**: $x \\le y \\Rightarrow \\circ(x) \\le \\circ(y)$. Monotonicity is what the certification of elementary functions relies on."
msgstr "对负的 $x$，对 $|x|$ 应用同一规则后恢复符号，因此 `Ceiling` 与 `Floor` 互换。每个模式 $\\circ$ 都是**单调的**：$x \\le y \\Rightarrow \\circ(x) \\le \\circ(y)$。初等函数的认证正依赖于单调性。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:182
msgid "Error model"
msgstr "误差模型"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:184
msgid "Let $x$ be in the normal range, $10^{e} \\le |x| < 10^{e+1}$. Representable numbers in that decade are spaced by one unit in the last place, $\\operatorname{ulp}(x) = 10^{e - p + 1}$. Rounding to nearest is off by at most half of it, so"
msgstr "设 $x$ 位于正规范围内，$10^{e} \\le |x| < 10^{e+1}$。在该十进位段内，可表示数之间的间距为末位单位，即 $\\operatorname{ulp}(x) = 10^{e - p + 1}$。就近舍入的误差至多为其一半，因此"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:198
msgid "The bound is approached, but not attained, near the bottom of a decade: for $x = 10^{e} + \\tfrac12\\operatorname{ulp}(x)$ the relative error is $\\tfrac12 10^{1-p}/(1 + \\tfrac12 10^{1-p}) < u$. Near the top, $|x| \\approx 10^{e+1}$, the same absolute error is only $\\tfrac12 10^{-p}$ relative. The ratio between the worst and the best relative error inside one decade is therefore"
msgstr "该界在十进位段的底部附近被逼近，但不会达到：对于 $x = 10^{e} + \\tfrac12\\operatorname{ulp}(x)$，相对误差为 $\\tfrac12 10^{1-p}/(1 + \\tfrac12 10^{1-p}) < u$。在顶部附近，$|x| \\approx 10^{e+1}$，同样的绝对误差仅相当于 $\\tfrac12 10^{-p}$ 的相对误差。因此，同一十进位段内最坏与最好相对误差之比为"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:209
msgid "the *wobble* of base $\\beta = 10$.[^wobble] In binary the wobble is 2, so for the same storage decimal has a slightly worse worst-case relative error: decimal64 has $u = \\tfrac12 10^{-15} = 5\\cdot 10^{-16}$, binary64 has $u = 2^{-53} \\approx 1.1 \\cdot 10^{-16}$. The directed modes have $|\\delta| < 10^{1-p} = 2u$. The machine epsilon, the distance from 1 to the next larger number, is $10^{1-p}$ — `epsilon_contextual` returns it and `next_plus(1)` in decimal64 is `1.000000000000001`. Below 1 the spacing is ten times smaller: `next_minus(1)` is `0.9999999999999999`."
msgstr "即基数 $\\beta = 10$ 的*摆动*（wobble）。[^wobble] 在二进制中摆动为 2，因此在相同存储下，十进制的最坏情形相对误差略差：decimal64 为 $u = \\tfrac12 10^{-15} = 5\\cdot 10^{-16}$，binary64 为 $u = 2^{-53} \\approx 1.1 \\cdot 10^{-16}$。定向舍入模式为 $|\\delta| < 10^{1-p} = 2u$。机器 epsilon，即 1 与下一个更大数之间的距离，为 $10^{1-p}$——`epsilon_contextual` 返回该值，`next_plus(1)` 在 decimal64 中为 `1.000000000000001`。在 1 以下间距小十倍：`next_minus(1)` 为 `0.9999999999999999`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:218
msgid "Goldberg, \"What every computer scientist should know about floating-point arithmetic\", *ACM Computing Surveys* 23(1), 1991, §1.2; Higham, *Accuracy and Stability of Numerical Algorithms*, 2nd ed., SIAM 2002, §2.1–2.2."
msgstr "Goldberg, \"What every computer scientist should know about floating-point arithmetic\", *ACM Computing Surveys* 23(1), 1991, §1.2；Higham, *Accuracy and Stability of Numerical Algorithms*, 2nd ed., SIAM 2002, §2.1–2.2。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:223
msgid "For a subnormal result the spacing is the fixed $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$, so the error bound becomes absolute, $|\\operatorname{fl}(x) - x| \\le \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$. Because every context operation is correctly rounded, the standard model $\\operatorname{fl}(a \\circ b) = (a \\circ b)(1+\\delta)$, $|\\delta| \\le u$, holds for $+,-,\\times,/,\\sqrt{\\ }$, `fma` and every elementary function whose result is normal, so the classical forward and backward error analyses of Higham carry over with $u = \\tfrac12 10^{1-p}$."
msgstr "对次正规结果，间距固定为 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$，因此误差界变为绝对误差界 $|\\operatorname{fl}(x) - x| \\le \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$。由于每个上下文运算都是正确舍入的，标准模型 $\\operatorname{fl}(a \\circ b) = (a \\circ b)(1+\\delta)$、$|\\delta| \\le u$ 对 $+,-,\\times,/,\\sqrt{\\ }$、`fma` 以及每个结果为正规数的初等函数都成立，因此 Higham 的经典前向与后向误差分析可以在 $u = \\tfrac12 10^{1-p}$ 下照搬。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:233
msgid "One representation, many contexts"
msgstr "一种表示，多种上下文"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:235
msgid "**Problem.** Applications need decimal32/64/128 and arbitrary precision, IEEE semantics and GDA compatibility, without converting between types."
msgstr "**问题。** 应用需要 decimal32/64/128 和任意精度、IEEE 语义和 GDA 兼容性，而又不想在类型之间转换。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:238
msgid "**Options.** One type per format (like hardware); one arbitrary-precision type with the format carried by a context; a type parameterised by the format."
msgstr "**方案。** 每种格式一个类型（类似硬件）；一个任意精度类型，格式由上下文携带；一个以格式为参数的类型。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:241
msgid "**Choice.** One `Decimal` type holding a sign, a coefficient of any length, an exponent, a class, a NaN-kind bit and a working-precision field, and a separate immutable `DecimalContext`. A decimal64 computation is a computation under `DecimalContext::decimal64()`; the interchange encoders apply the format context before encoding. This keeps the arithmetic in one place, lets a caller work at 50 digits and round to decimal64 at the end, and matches the General Decimal Arithmetic model. The precision field in the value serves only the context-free operators and conversions."
msgstr "**选择。** 一个 `Decimal` 类型，持有符号、任意长度的系数、指数、类别、一个 NaN 种类位和一个工作精度字段，再加上一个独立的不可变 `DecimalContext`。decimal64 计算就是在 `DecimalContext::decimal64()` 下的计算；交换编码器在编码前应用格式上下文。这样算术集中在一处，调用者可以用 50 位数字工作并在最后舍入到 decimal64，且与 General Decimal Arithmetic 模型一致。值中的精度字段只服务于无上下文的运算符和转换。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:250
msgid "Round once, in one place"
msgstr "只在一处、只舍入一次"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:252
msgid "**Problem.** Double rounding — rounding an already rounded value again — can change a correctly rounded result."
msgstr "**问题。** 双重舍入——对已舍入的值再次舍入——可能改变正确舍入的结果。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:255
msgid "**Choice.** Every finite context result goes through one finalization routine that receives an **exact** result $(s, C, Q)$, with $C$ possibly much longer than $p$. Operation kernels compute exact integers; they never round. The exceptions are operations whose exact result is infinite — division, square root, elementary functions — and two whose exact result would be needlessly long — a sum with a far smaller addend and an integer power — which are described below; each of them still decides the last digit from exact information."
msgstr "**选择。** 每个有限的上下文结果都经过同一个最终化例程，它接收一个**精确**结果 $(s, C, Q)$，其中 $C$ 可能远长于 $p$。运算内核计算精确整数，从不舍入。例外是精确结果为无限长的运算——除法、平方根、初等函数——以及两种精确结果会无谓地冗长的运算——与远小得多的加数求和、整数次幂——下文将分别说明；它们每一个仍然依据精确信息决定最后一位。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:264
msgid "A single rounding needs a single target exponent. With $D = \\operatorname{digits}(C)$, the exact value has adjusted exponent $a = Q + D - 1$, and the correctly rounded result has exponent"
msgstr "单次舍入需要单一的目标指数。设 $D = \\operatorname{digits}(C)$，精确值的调整指数为 $a = Q + D - 1$，而正确舍入结果的指数为"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:272
msgid "the first term keeping $p$ digits for a normal result and the second the subnormal grid; the result is $\\circ(C\\,10^{Q-t})\\,10^{t}$, followed by the overflow check (on the value rounded to $p$ digits with unbounded exponent), the subnormal/underflow flags and the fold-down."
msgstr "其中第一项对正规结果保留 $p$ 位，第二项对应次正规网格；结果为 $\\circ(C\\,10^{Q-t})\\,10^{t}$，随后依次进行上溢检查（针对以无界指数舍入到 $p$ 位的值）、次正规/下溢标志以及下折（fold-down）。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:277
msgid "The routine rounds to the subnormal grid only when $t = E_{\\text{tiny}} > Q$, which it tests as $Q + \\max(0, D - p) < E_{\\text{tiny}}$: the exact value is then below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ and $C$ is rounded once with shift $E_{\\text{tiny}} - Q$. Every other coefficient is rounded once to $p$ digits, also when $Q < E_{\\text{tiny}}$. Rounding such a *normal* result first to the grid $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ and then to $p$ digits would not be rounding once: if the first rounding lands exactly on a midpoint of the second grid, the tie rule of the second rounding decides a case the exact value had already decided. In decimal32 ($E_{\\text{tiny}} = -101$) the product $3.000001\\cdot 10^{-45} \\times 1.500001\\cdot 10^{-45} = 4500004500001\\cdot 10^{-102}$ would first become $450000450000\\cdot 10^{-101}$ (the dropped digit 1 is below half), the exact midpoint $4500004.5\\cdot 10^{-96}$, and `HalfEven` would then give $4.500004\\cdot 10^{-90}$; the exact value lies above the midpoint, and the single rounding returns $4.500005\\cdot 10^{-90}$. (The directed modes would be unaffected, because $\\lfloor\\lfloor y\\,10^{-s_1}\\rfloor 10^{-s_2}\\rfloor = \\lfloor y\\, 10^{-s_1-s_2}\\rfloor$ for every real $y \\ge 0$ and integers $s_1, s_2 \\ge 0$.)"
msgstr "只有当 $t = E_{\\text{tiny}} > Q$ 时，该例程才舍入到次正规网格，其判定方式为 $Q + \\max(0, D - p) < E_{\\text{tiny}}$：此时精确值低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$，$C$ 以移位 $E_{\\text{tiny}} - Q$ 舍入一次。其余每个系数都只舍入一次到 $p$ 位，$Q < E_{\\text{tiny}}$ 时也是如此。若把这样的*正规*结果先舍入到网格 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$，再舍入到 $p$ 位，就不是一次舍入了：若第一次舍入恰好落在第二个网格的中点上，第二次舍入的平局规则就会去裁决一个精确值早已裁决的情形。在 decimal32（$E_{\\text{tiny}} = -101$）中，乘积 $3.000001\\cdot 10^{-45} \\times 1.500001\\cdot 10^{-45} = 4500004500001\\cdot 10^{-102}$ 会先变为 $450000450000\\cdot 10^{-101}$（被丢弃的数字 1 小于一半），即恰好的中点 $4500004.5\\cdot 10^{-96}$，随后 `HalfEven` 会给出 $4.500004\\cdot 10^{-90}$；而精确值位于中点之上，单次舍入返回 $4.500005\\cdot 10^{-90}$。（定向模式则不受影响，因为对每个实数 $y \\ge 0$ 和整数 $s_1, s_2 \\ge 0$ 都有 $\\lfloor\\lfloor y\\,10^{-s_1}\\rfloor 10^{-s_2}\\rfloor = \\lfloor y\\, 10^{-s_1-s_2}\\rfloor$。）"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:295
msgid "Addition with a far smaller addend"
msgstr "与远小得多的加数相加"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:297
msgid "When one addend $\\ell$ lies far below the other, $h$, the exact sum can have many more digits than the result keeps. Let $t$ be the target exponent of $h$ alone and $g = \\min(q_h,\\ t - 2)$. Every digit of $h$ lies on the grid $10^{g}$, and so does every rounding boundary of the sum: the grid $10^{t}$, its midpoints, and the grid $10^{t-1}$ with its midpoints, which a cancellation can reach. If $0 < |\\ell| < 10^{g}$, the sum $h + \\ell$ lies strictly between the same two neighbours on that grid as the short value $h \\pm 10^{g-1}$, with the sign of $\\ell$. In an extended context `add_ctx` rounds that value once instead of the exact sum; result and flags are the same in every mode. With precision 7, $1598617.000000000001 - 2\\cdot 10^{-12}$ is `1598616` under `Down`, and $6.0000005\\cdot 10^{-73} + 10^{-101}$ is `6.000001E-73` under `HalfEven`."
msgstr "当一个加数 $\\ell$ 远低于另一个加数 $h$ 时，精确和的位数可能远多于结果所保留的位数。设 $t$ 为仅由 $h$ 决定的目标指数，$g = \\min(q_h,\\ t - 2)$。$h$ 的每一位都位于网格 $10^{g}$ 上，和的每个舍入边界也是如此：网格 $10^{t}$ 及其中点，以及抵消可能到达的网格 $10^{t-1}$ 及其中点。若 $0 < |\\ell| < 10^{g}$，则和 $h + \\ell$ 严格位于该网格上与短值 $h \\pm 10^{g-1}$（符号取 $\\ell$ 的符号）相同的两个相邻点之间。在扩展上下文中，`add_ctx` 对该值而非精确和舍入一次；在每种模式下结果与标志都相同。精度为 7 时，$1598617.000000000001 - 2\\cdot 10^{-12}$ 在 `Down` 下为 `1598616`，$6.0000005\\cdot 10^{-73} + 10^{-101}$ 在 `HalfEven` 下为 `6.000001E-73`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:310
msgid "How the rounding digit and sticky information are obtained"
msgstr "舍入位与粘滞信息如何获得"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:312
msgid "Rounding $C$ (a non-negative integer with $D$ digits) to $D - s$ digits divides by a power of ten,"
msgstr "把 $C$（一个有 $D$ 位数字的非负整数）舍入到 $D - s$ 位，就是除以十的幂，"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:319
msgid "and decides between $Q$ and $Q+1$ by comparing $2R$ with $10^{s}$. This single comparison carries exactly the information of the classical *rounding digit* and *sticky bit*. Write $R = r\\,10^{s-1} + R'$ with rounding digit $r \\in \\{0,\\ldots,9\\}$ and rest $0 \\le R' < 10^{s-1}$. Then"
msgstr "并通过比较 $2R$ 与 $10^{s}$ 在 $Q$ 和 $Q+1$ 之间作出选择。这一次比较恰好携带了经典的*舍入位*与*粘滞位*的信息。记 $R = r\\,10^{s-1} + R'$，其中舍入位为 $r \\in \\{0,\\ldots,9\\}$，余部为 $0 \\le R' < 10^{s-1}$。则"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:328
msgid "and since $0 \\le 2R' < 2\\cdot 10^{s-1}$:"
msgstr "且由于 $0 \\le 2R' < 2\\cdot 10^{s-1}$："

#: manual/design/decimal.md:338
msgid ""
"So $2R > 10^{s}$, $2R = 10^{s}$ and $2R < 10^{s}$ mean \"above, at, below the midpoint\", which is all the half modes need; $R \\n"
"e 0$ is the sticky information the directed modes need; and the last digit of $Q$ is all `ZeroFiveUp` and `HalfEven` need. When $s \\ge D$ the whole coefficient is discarded, $Q = 0$, and only $s = D$ can reach the midpoint: the code then compares $C$ with $5\\cdot 10^{D-1}$. A carry that turns $10^{p}-1$ into $10^{p}$ is removed by one exact division by 10 and an exponent increment."
msgstr ""
"因此 $2R > 10^{s}$、$2R = 10^{s}$ 和 $2R < 10^{s}$ 分别表示“高于、等于、低于中点”，这正是各 half 模式所需的全部信息；$R \\n"
"e 0$ 是定向模式所需的粘滞信息；$Q$ 的末位数字则是 `ZeroFiveUp` 和 `HalfEven` 所需的全部信息。当 $s \\ge D$ 时整个系数都被丢弃，$Q = 0$，只有 $s = D$ 能达到中点：此时代码比较 $C$ 与 $5\\cdot 10^{D-1}$。把 $10^{p}-1$ 变为 $10^{p}$ 的进位，通过一次精确除以 10 并使指数加一来消除。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:346
msgid ""
"`rounded` is raised whenever $s > 0$ and `inexact` whenever $R \\n"
"e 0$; trailing zeros are dropped before rounding so that discarding zeros raises only `rounded`."
msgstr ""
"只要 $s > 0$ 就引发 `rounded`，只要 $R \\n"
"e 0$ 就引发 `inexact`；末尾零在舍入前被去掉，使得丢弃零只引发 `rounded`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:350
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:506
msgid "Division"
msgstr "除法"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:352
msgid "The quotient $a/b$ of two finite non-zero values takes one of three exact routes, in this order."
msgstr "两个有限非零值的商 $a/b$ 依次采取以下三条精确路径之一。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:355
msgid "*Divisor a power of ten.* The quotient is $a$ with a shifted exponent."
msgstr "*除数是十的幂。* 商为 $a$，指数作相应平移。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:356
msgid "*Terminating quotient.* Reduce $c_a / c_b$ by $g = \\gcd(c_a, c_b)$ to $c_a'/c_b'$. The quotient has a finite decimal expansion if and only if $c_b' = 2^{i}5^{j}$; with $k = \\max(i, j)$,"
msgstr "*有限商。* 用 $g = \\gcd(c_a, c_b)$ 把 $c_a / c_b$ 约简为 $c_a'/c_b'$。商有有限十进制展开当且仅当 $c_b' = 2^{i}5^{j}$；取 $k = \\max(i, j)$，"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:362
msgid "so the exact result is the integer $c_a' 2^{k-i}5^{k-j}$ with exponent $q_a - q_b - k$, handed to the finalizer like any exact result."
msgstr "因此精确结果是整数 $c_a' 2^{k-i}5^{k-j}$，指数为 $q_a - q_b - k$，与其他精确结果一样交给最终化例程。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:364
msgid "*Non-terminating quotient.* The result is certainly inexact. Let $a_c = \\operatorname{adj}(c_a/c_b)$, found exactly by comparing $c_a$ with $c_b$ scaled by the right power of ten. Scaling the numerator (or the denominator) by $10^{p-1-a_c}$ makes the integer quotient have exactly $p$ digits: $N = Q D + R$. The increment decision compares $2R$ with $D$ — the same midpoint test as above, now with the exact remainder as sticky information — so the quotient is rounded once."
msgstr "*无限商。* 结果必然不精确。设 $a_c = \\operatorname{adj}(c_a/c_b)$，它通过比较 $c_a$ 与乘以适当十的幂后的 $c_b$ 精确求得。将分子（或分母）乘以 $10^{p-1-a_c}$，使整数商恰有 $p$ 位：$N = Q D + R$。是否进位通过比较 $2R$ 与 $D$ 决定——与上文相同的中点测试，只是现在以精确余数作为粘滞信息——因此商只被舍入一次。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:372
msgid "The third route is used for normal results in extended contexts. For subnormal results and subset contexts the code forms the integer quotient of $c_a\\,10^{k}$ by $c_b$ with $k = p + \\operatorname{digits}(c_b) + 2$ (about $\\operatorname{digits}(c_a) + p + 2$ digits), rounds it with `ZeroFiveUp`, and rounds that guarded quotient once more in the context mode, straight to its final grid: $p$ digits, or $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ for a subnormal quotient. The context-free operator `/` uses the same guarded scheme. By the `ZeroFiveUp` lemma below the two roundings equal one rounding of the exact quotient, so $15/83294$ at five digits is `0.00018009`,[^div-05up] and in decimal32 $1 / 1.9999999999998\\cdot 10^{101} = 5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$ gives `1E-101`."
msgstr "第三条路径用于扩展上下文中的正规结果。对次正规结果和子集上下文，代码求 $c_a\\,10^{k}$ 除以 $c_b$ 的整数商，其中 $k = p + \\operatorname{digits}(c_b) + 2$（约 $\\operatorname{digits}(c_a) + p + 2$ 位），先用 `ZeroFiveUp` 舍入，再按上下文模式把这个带保护位的商直接舍入到其最终网格：$p$ 位，或对次正规的商为 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$。与上下文无关的运算符 `/` 使用同样的带保护位方案。根据下文的 `ZeroFiveUp` 引理，这两次舍入等于对精确商的一次舍入，因此五位精度下 $15/83294$ 为 `0.00018009`，[^div-05up] 而在 decimal32 中 $1 / 1.9999999999998\\cdot 10^{101} = 5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$ 给出 `1E-101`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:384
msgid "Rounding the guarded quotient in the context mode instead could manufacture a tie: at five digits the guarded quotient of $15/83294$ would end in an exact half unit, and half-even would return `0.00018008`."
msgstr "若改为按上下文模式舍入带保护位的商，就可能人为制造出平局：五位精度下，$15/83294$ 的带保护位商会以恰好半个单位结尾，半值取偶会返回 `0.00018008`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:388
msgid "`ZeroFiveUp` exists precisely to make such two-step schemes safe. If $x$ is first rounded with `ZeroFiveUp` to $p + k$ digits ($k \\ge 1$) and then with any mode $\\circ$ to $p$ digits, the result equals $\\circ(x)$: an inexact `ZeroFiveUp` result ends in a digit other than 0 and 5, so it is never a $p$-digit number nor a $p$-digit midpoint, and it lies on the same side of every $p$-digit number and midpoint as $x$. The proof is in the attachment.[^attachment] The guarded division above relies on it; the finalizer needs no such lemma, because it rounds once at the target exponent $t$ derived above."
msgstr "`ZeroFiveUp` 正是为了让这类两步方案安全而存在的。若 $x$ 先用 `ZeroFiveUp` 舍入到 $p + k$ 位（$k \\ge 1$），再用任意模式 $\\circ$ 舍入到 $p$ 位，结果等于 $\\circ(x)$：不精确的 `ZeroFiveUp` 结果末位既不是 0 也不是 5，因此它既不是 $p$ 位数，也不是 $p$ 位数的中点，并且相对于每个 $p$ 位数及其中点，它都与 $x$ 位于同一侧。证明见附件。[^attachment] 上文的带保护位除法依赖于这一点；最终化例程则不需要这样的引理，因为它按上文导出的目标指数 $t$ 只舍入一次。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:398
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:540
msgid "Square root"
msgstr "平方根"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:400
msgid "Exact roots are detected first: after removing trailing zeros and making the exponent even, the operand is $c'\\,10^{2m}$, and $\\sqrt{x}$ is a decimal if and only if the integer $c'$ is a perfect square. Such a root is returned at the member closest to the preferred exponent $\\lfloor q/2 \\rfloor$; if it has more than $p$ digits it is rounded like any exact result. For every other operand $\\sqrt{x} = \\sqrt{c'}\\,10^{m}$ is irrational."
msgstr "首先检测精确根：去掉末尾零并使指数为偶数之后，操作数为 $c'\\,10^{2m}$，而 $\\sqrt{x}$ 是十进制数当且仅当整数 $c'$ 是完全平方数。这样的根以最接近首选指数 $\\lfloor q/2 \\rfloor$ 的成员返回；若它多于 $p$ 位，则像任何精确结果一样舍入。对其他所有操作数，$\\sqrt{x} = \\sqrt{c'}\\,10^{m}$ 是无理数。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:407
msgid ""
"For the irrational case let the target exponent be $t = \\max(E_{\\text{tiny}},\\\n"
"\\lfloor \\operatorname{adj}(x)/2 \\rfloor - p + 1)$. The root has adjusted exponent $\\lfloor \\operatorname{adj}(x)/2 \\rfloor$: from $10^{a} \\le x < 10^{a+1}$ follows $10^{a/2} \\le \\sqrt x < 10^{(a+1)/2}$, and both for even and for odd $a$ the integer part of the exponent is $\\lfloor a/2 \\rfloor$. So $t$ leaves $p$ digits, or stops at the subnormal grid. When $q - 2t \\ge 0$ the operand is scaled to the integer $M = c\\,10^{q - 2t}$ and $r = \\lfloor \\sqrt{M} \\rfloor$ is the truncated root at exponent $t$. When $q - 2t < 0$ the code takes the integer root of $c$ (of $10c$ if $-(q-2t)$ is odd) and divides it by $10^{\\lceil -(q-2t)/2 \\rceil}$; nested floors of a positive real by positive integers compose, so this is again $\\lfloor \\sqrt{x}\\,10^{-t} \\rfloor$. The integer root is computed with Newton's iteration on integers,"
msgstr ""
"对无理数情形，令目标指数为 $t = \\max(E_{\\text{tiny}},\\\n"
"\\lfloor \\operatorname{adj}(x)/2 \\rfloor - p + 1)$。根的调整指数为 $\\lfloor \\operatorname{adj}(x)/2 \\rfloor$：由 $10^{a} \\le x < 10^{a+1}$ 可得 $10^{a/2} \\le \\sqrt x < 10^{(a+1)/2}$，且无论 $a$ 为偶数还是奇数，指数的整数部分都是 $\\lfloor a/2 \\rfloor$。因此 $t$ 保留 $p$ 位，或止于次正规网格。当 $q - 2t \\ge 0$ 时，操作数被缩放为整数 $M = c\\,10^{q - 2t}$，而 $r = \\lfloor \\sqrt{M} \\rfloor$ 就是指数 $t$ 处截断的根。当 $q - 2t < 0$ 时，代码取 $c$ 的整数根（若 $-(q-2t)$ 为奇数则取 $10c$ 的整数根），再将其除以 $10^{\\lceil -(q-2t)/2 \\rceil}$；正实数依次除以正整数时，嵌套的下取整可以合并，因此这仍是 $\\lfloor \\sqrt{x}\\,10^{-t} \\rfloor$。整数根用整数上的牛顿迭代计算，"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:426
msgid "($N < 10^{\\operatorname{digits}(N)}$ gives $\\sqrt N < 10^{\\operatorname{digits}(N)/2} \\le a_0$). Because $\\lfloor (a + \\lfloor y \\rfloor)/2 \\rfloor = \\lfloor (a + y)/2 \\rfloor$ for an integer $a$, the AM–GM inequality $\\tfrac12(a + N/a) \\ge \\sqrt{N}$ gives $a_{k+1} \\ge \\lfloor \\sqrt N \\rfloor$; and $a_{k+1} < a_k$ exactly when $a_k^2 > N$. The iterates therefore decrease strictly to $\\lfloor \\sqrt N \\rfloor$, where the iteration stops."
msgstr "（由 $N < 10^{\\operatorname{digits}(N)}$ 可得 $\\sqrt N < 10^{\\operatorname{digits}(N)/2} \\le a_0$。）由于对整数 $a$ 有 $\\lfloor (a + \\lfloor y \\rfloor)/2 \\rfloor = \\lfloor (a + y)/2 \\rfloor$，算术–几何平均不等式 $\\tfrac12(a + N/a) \\ge \\sqrt{N}$ 给出 $a_{k+1} \\ge \\lfloor \\sqrt N \\rfloor$；并且 $a_{k+1} < a_k$ 当且仅当 $a_k^2 > N$。因此迭代值严格递减到 $\\lfloor \\sqrt N \\rfloor$，迭代在此停止。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:433
msgid "Since the root is irrational it is never exact and never a midpoint, so the increment decision needs only the comparison $\\sqrt{x}\\,10^{-t} \\gtrless r + \\tfrac12$, done exactly as $4M \\gtrless (2r+1)^2$ (or $4c \\gtrless (2r+1)^2\\,10^{-(q-2t)}$ in the second branch). Rounding directly at the subnormal target exponent avoids rounding twice for tiny roots."
msgstr "由于根是无理数，它从不精确，也从不是中点，因此进位判定只需比较 $\\sqrt{x}\\,10^{-t} \\gtrless r + \\tfrac12$，而这可以精确地按 $4M \\gtrless (2r+1)^2$ 进行（在第二个分支中为 $4c \\gtrless (2r+1)^2\\,10^{-(q-2t)}$）。直接在次正规目标指数处舍入，避免了对微小根的两次舍入。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:439
msgid "A root *can* be exactly halfway when it is exact but longer than $p$ digits: $\\sqrt{6.25} = 2.5$ at $p = 1$ gives `2` under `HalfEven` and `HalfDown` and `3` under `HalfUp`. A halfway root $(r + \\tfrac12)10^{t}$ squares to $(2r+1)^2\\cdot 25 \\cdot 10^{2t-2}$, an odd coefficient with at least $2p+1$ digits when $r$ has $p$ digits ($r \\ge 10^{p-1}$ gives $(2r+1)^2 \\cdot 25 > 10^{2p}$). A normal halfway root therefore needs an operand with more than $2p$ significant digits, and a subnormal one an operand below the format's range. An operand that fits the format (at most $p$ digits, value at least $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$) has a normal root whenever $e_{\\min} \\le 1 - p$, as in all interchange formats, because $\\sqrt{10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}} = 10^{(e_{\\min}-p+1)/2} \\ge 10^{e_{\\min}}$; for such operands the three half modes agree."
msgstr "当根是精确的但长于 $p$ 位时，它*可能*恰好位于中间：$p = 1$ 时，$\\sqrt{6.25} = 2.5$ 在 `HalfEven` 和 `HalfDown` 下得 `2`，在 `HalfUp` 下得 `3`。位于中间的根 $(r + \\tfrac12)10^{t}$ 的平方为 $(2r+1)^2\\cdot 25 \\cdot 10^{2t-2}$，当 $r$ 有 $p$ 位时，这是一个至少 $2p+1$ 位的奇数系数（由 $r \\ge 10^{p-1}$ 可得 $(2r+1)^2 \\cdot 25 > 10^{2p}$）。因此，正规的中间根需要有效数字多于 $2p$ 位的操作数，而次正规的中间根需要低于格式范围的操作数。适合该格式的操作数（至多 $p$ 位，值至少为 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$）只要 $e_{\\min} \\le 1 - p$（所有交换格式都如此）就有正规的根，因为 $\\sqrt{10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}} = 10^{(e_{\\min}-p+1)/2} \\ge 10^{e_{\\min}}$；对这样的操作数，三种 half 模式结果一致。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:452
msgid "[Rounding proofs for decimal](../../attachments/design_decimal_rounding.typ) contains the full proofs of the double-rounding lemma, the overflow table, the fold-down bound, the certification lemma and the NTT bound."
msgstr "[decimal 的舍入证明](../../attachments/design_decimal_rounding.typ)包含双重舍入引理、上溢表、下折界、认证引理和 NTT 界的完整证明。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:456
msgid "Exponent range"
msgstr "指数范围"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:458
msgid "The finalizer works on the rounded coefficient $C'$ with $p$ digits and exponent $Q'$, i.e. on the value rounded with an unbounded exponent range."
msgstr "最终化例程作用于有 $p$ 位数字、指数为 $Q'$ 的已舍入系数 $C'$，即在无界指数范围下舍入后的值。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:461
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:275
msgid "Overflow"
msgstr "上溢"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:463
msgid "If $\\operatorname{adj}(C' 10^{Q'}) > e_{\\max}$ the result overflows. IEEE 754 §7.4 defines the delivered result as the rounding of the exact value in a format with the same $p$ but unbounded exponent, then saturated: a direction that never increases magnitude cannot leave the finite range, a direction that may increase it goes to infinity. Hence, with $N_{\\max} = (10^{p}-1)10^{E_{\\text{top}}}$:"
msgstr "若 $\\operatorname{adj}(C' 10^{Q'}) > e_{\\max}$，结果上溢。IEEE 754 §7.4 规定，交付的结果是先在具有相同 $p$ 但指数无界的格式中对精确值舍入，然后饱和：从不增大量级的方向不会离开有限范围，可能增大量级的方向则得到无穷。因此，记 $N_{\\max} = (10^{p}-1)10^{E_{\\text{top}}}$："

#: manual/design/decimal.md:478
msgid "The half modes go to infinity because an overflowing exact value is at least $N_{\\max} + \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{top}}}$ (anything smaller rounds to a finite value and does not overflow), which is at or beyond the midpoint between $N_{\\max}$ and the next power of ten. `ZeroFiveUp` saturates because the last digit of $N_{\\max}$ is 9. Every overflow raises `overflow`, `inexact` and `rounded`."
msgstr "各 half 模式得到无穷，因为上溢的精确值至少为 $N_{\\max} + \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{top}}}$（更小的值都会舍入为有限值而不上溢），它位于 $N_{\\max}$ 与下一个十的幂之间的中点处或其外。`ZeroFiveUp` 会饱和，因为 $N_{\\max}$ 的末位数字是 9。每次上溢都会引发 `overflow`、`inexact` 和 `rounded`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:499
msgid "Subnormals, tininess and underflow"
msgstr "次正规数、微小性与下溢"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:501
msgid "If the exact value is below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ and needs an exponent below $E_{\\text{tiny}}$, it is rounded once to the subnormal grid: the shift becomes $s = E_{\\text{tiny}} - Q$ and the rounding rule above applies with fewer than $p$ digits kept. The result is **tiny** when its adjusted exponent is below $e_{\\min}$, measured on the exact value (`BeforeRounding`) or on the value rounded to $p$ digits with unbounded exponent (`AfterRounding`, the default). The two rules differ only for values just below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ whose rounding to $p$ digits reaches it; only an exact adjusted exponent of $e_{\\min} - 1$ can change sides, so the extra rounding to $p$ digits is done only there. With $p = 3$ and $e_{\\min} = 0$, $0.9951$ rounds to $0.995$ at three digits and is tiny (its subnormal-grid result is `1.00`), while $0.99951$ rounds to $1.00$ and is not. A tiny result raises `subnormal`; a tiny **and** inexact result also raises `underflow`, as IEEE 754 §7.5 requires for default exception handling. A result that rounds to zero gets exponent $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ and `clamped`."
msgstr "若精确值低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 且需要低于 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ 的指数，则一次舍入到次正规网格：移位量变为 $s = E_{\\text{tiny}} - Q$，并在保留少于 $p$ 位的情况下应用上述舍入规则。当结果的调整指数低于 $e_{\\min}$ 时称其为**微小的**（tiny），判定可以基于精确值（`BeforeRounding`），也可以基于在无界指数下舍入到 $p$ 位后的值（`AfterRounding`，默认）。两种规则只在略低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$、且舍入到 $p$ 位后达到它的值上有差异；只有精确调整指数为 $e_{\\min} - 1$ 的值才可能改变归属，因此额外的 $p$ 位舍入只在那里进行。当 $p = 3$ 且 $e_{\\min} = 0$ 时，$0.9951$ 在三位下舍入为 $0.995$，是微小的（其次正规网格上的结果为 `1.00`），而 $0.99951$ 舍入为 $1.00$，不是微小的。微小结果引发 `subnormal`；微小**且**不精确的结果还会引发 `underflow`，这是 IEEE 754 §7.5 对默认异常处理的要求。舍入为零的结果获得指数 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ 和 `clamped`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:517
#: manual/design/decimal_gda.md:258
msgid "Clamping"
msgstr "钳制"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:519
msgid "With `clamp` (all interchange formats), exponents above $E_{\\text{top}}$ are not representable, because the encoding has room only for $E_{\\text{top}} - E_{\\text{tiny}} + 1$ exponents. A result with $Q' > E_{\\text{top}}$ that did not overflow is **folded down**: the coefficient is multiplied by $10^{Q' - E_{\\text{top}}}$ and the exponent set to $E_{\\text{top}}$, raising `clamped`. This never needs more than $p$ digits:"
msgstr "在 `clamp` 下（所有交换格式均如此），高于 $E_{\\text{top}}$ 的指数不可表示，因为编码只容纳 $E_{\\text{top}} - E_{\\text{tiny}} + 1$ 个指数。$Q' > E_{\\text{top}}$ 且未上溢的结果会被**下折**（fold down）：系数乘以 $10^{Q' - E_{\\text{top}}}$，指数设为 $E_{\\text{top}}$，并引发 `clamped`。这永远不需要超过 $p$ 位："

#: manual/design/decimal.md:532
msgid "using $\\operatorname{adj} \\le e_{\\max}$. The value is unchanged; only the cohort member changes. In decimal32, `1E+96` is stored as `1000000E+90`."
msgstr "这里用到了 $\\operatorname{adj} \\le e_{\\max}$。值保持不变，只有同值类成员改变。在 decimal32 中，`1E+96` 存储为 `1000000E+90`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:546
msgid "Zeros have no digits to pad, so their exponent is simply clamped into $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, E_{\\text{top}}]$ (or $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$ without `clamp`), raising `clamped` when it changes."
msgstr "零没有可填充的数字，因此其指数只是被钳制到 $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, E_{\\text{top}}]$（无 `clamp` 时为 $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$），若有改变则引发 `clamped`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:550
msgid "Flags as returned values"
msgstr "标志作为返回值"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:552
msgid "**Problem.** IEEE 754 status flags are sticky process state in hardware; GDA adds traps. Hidden state conflicts with the Luna-Flow rule that semantics are explicit, and makes concurrent or compositional code fragile."
msgstr "**问题。** 在硬件中，IEEE 754 状态标志是粘滞的进程状态；GDA 又增加了陷阱。隐藏状态与 Luna-Flow“语义显式”的原则相冲突，也使并发或组合式代码变得脆弱。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:556
msgid "**Choice.** Each context operation returns its own `DecimalFlags`. `combine` is the field-wise OR, so flag sets form a commutative idempotent monoid with identity `DecimalFlags::new()`: accumulating them over a pipeline in any grouping gives the same set, which is exactly the sticky-flag semantics without the state. `decimal_checked` packages that accumulation; `decimal_gda` implements sticky status and traps as a separate model. The five IEEE exceptions map to `invalid_operation`, `division_by_zero`, `overflow`, `underflow` and `inexact`; the GDA conditions (`rounded`, `subnormal`, `clamped`, `lost_digits`, `conversion_syntax`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined`, `invalid_context`) refine them."
msgstr "**选择。** 每个上下文运算返回各自的 `DecimalFlags`。`combine` 是逐字段的 OR，因此标志集合构成以 `DecimalFlags::new()` 为单位元的交换幂等幺半群：在流水线上以任意结合方式累积它们，都得到同一集合，这恰好是去掉状态之后的粘滞标志语义。`decimal_checked` 封装了这种累积；`decimal_gda` 则作为独立模型实现粘滞状态与陷阱。五种 IEEE 异常对应 `invalid_operation`、`division_by_zero`、`overflow`、`underflow` 和 `inexact`；GDA 条件（`rounded`、`subnormal`、`clamped`、`lost_digits`、`conversion_syntax`、`division_impossible`、`division_undefined`、`invalid_context`）对它们作了细化。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:567
msgid "Quantize and same-quantum"
msgstr "quantize 与 same-quantum"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:569
msgid "`x.quantize(y)` returns the value of $x$ with exponent exactly $t = q_y$:"
msgstr "`x.quantize(y)` 返回 $x$ 的值，指数恰为 $t = q_y$："

#: manual/design/decimal.md:579
msgid "The result must be representable *at that exponent*: the new coefficient must have at most $p$ digits, $t$ must lie in $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$ and the result's adjusted exponent must not exceed $e_{\\max}$. Otherwise the operation is invalid. It never substitutes another exponent, because the exponent is the contract (an amount quantized to cents must have two decimal places). The only change of exponent is the fold-down of [clamping](#clamping): with `clamp`, a target $t \\in (E_{\\text{top}}, e_{\\max}]$ is accepted and the result is stored at $E_{\\text{top}}$ with `clamped`, exactly like any other result in that range. Rounding a coefficient up can add a digit ($9.99 \\to 10.0$ at two digits of precision), which is why the digit check comes after rounding. `same_quantum` is the predicate $q_x = q_y$ (true for two infinities or two NaNs); it is the test to use before combining values whose exponents must agree."
msgstr "结果必须*在该指数下*可表示：新系数至多 $p$ 位，$t$ 必须位于 $[E_{\\text{tiny}}, e_{\\max}]$ 内，且结果的调整指数不得超过 $e_{\\max}$。否则该运算无效。它从不替换为别的指数，因为指数本身就是契约（量化到分的金额必须有两位小数）。唯一的指数变化是[钳制](#clamping)中的下折：设置 `clamp` 时，目标 $t \\in (E_{\\text{top}}, e_{\\max}]$ 会被接受，结果以 $E_{\\text{top}}$ 存储并引发 `clamped`，与该范围内的任何其他结果完全一样。向上舍入系数可能多出一位（两位精度下的 $9.99 \\to 10.0$），所以位数检查在舍入之后进行。`same_quantum` 是谓词 $q_x = q_y$（对两个无穷或两个 NaN 为真）；在合并指数必须一致的值之前，应使用它进行检验。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:596
msgid "All three formats share one layout: a sign bit, a 5-bit *combination field* $G$, $w$ *exponent continuation* bits and a *trailing significand* of $10J$ bits, where $p = 3J + 1$:"
msgstr "三种格式共享同一布局：一个符号位、一个 5 位的*组合字段* $G$、$w$ 个*指数延续*位以及 $10J$ 位的*尾随有效数*，其中 $p = 3J + 1$："

#: manual/design/decimal.md:606
msgid "The biased exponent $E = q + \\text{bias}$ has $w + 2$ bits whose top two bits take only the values 00, 01, 10; this is the $3\\cdot 2^{w}$ count derived above."
msgstr "带偏置指数 $E = q + \\text{bias}$ 有 $w + 2$ 位，其最高两位只取 00、01、10；这就是上文推导出的 $3\\cdot 2^{w}$ 个数。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:610
msgid ""
"**DPD.** The combination field holds the top two exponent bits and the leading digit $d_0$: if $G = ab\\,cde$ with $ab \\n"
"e 11$, the exponent bits are $ab$ and $d_0 = cde \\in [0,7]$; if $G = 11\\,cd\\,e$ with $cd \\n"
"e 11$, the exponent bits are $cd$ and $d_0 = 8 + e$. $G = 11110$ is infinity and $G = 11111$ is NaN, the next bit distinguishing signaling from quiet. The other $3J$ digits are stored in $J$ *declets*, 10 bits for 3 digits, by densely packed decimal.[^dpd] Three digits have 1000 values and 10 bits 1024 codes, an efficiency of $\\log_2 1000 / 10 = 99.66\\%$. Call a digit *small* if it is 0–7 (3 bits) and *large* if it is 8 or 9 (1 bit). The declet $pqr\\,stu\\,v\\,wxy$ uses $v = 0$ for three small digits, which are then stored verbatim in $pqr$, $stu$, $wxy$; $v = 1$ marks at least one large digit, and $wx$, then $st$, say which. Counting by the number of large digits,"
msgstr ""
"**DPD。** 组合字段存放指数的最高两位和首位数字 $d_0$：若 $G = ab\\,cde$ 且 $ab \\n"
"e 11$，则指数位为 $ab$，并且 $d_0 = cde \\in [0,7]$；若 $G = 11\\,cd\\,e$ 且 $cd \\n"
"e 11$，则指数位为 $cd$，并且 $d_0 = 8 + e$。$G = 11110$ 表示无穷，$G = 11111$ 表示 NaN，下一位区分信号 NaN 与静默 NaN。其余 $3J$ 位数字以密集打包十进制（densely packed decimal）存放在 $J$ 个 *declet* 中，每 10 位存 3 位数字。[^dpd] 三位数字有 1000 个取值，10 位有 1024 个码字，效率为 $\\log_2 1000 / 10 = 99.66\\%$。称 0–7 的数字为*小*数字（3 位），8 或 9 为*大*数字（1 位）。declet $pqr\\,stu\\,v\\,wxy$ 用 $v = 0$ 表示三个小数字，此时它们原样存放在 $pqr$、$stu$、$wxy$ 中；$v = 1$ 标记至少有一个大数字，$wx$ 以及随后的 $st$ 说明是哪几个。按大数字的个数计数，"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:630
msgid "and $512 + 384 + 96 + 8 = 1000$. The first three cases use exactly 512, 384 and 96 codes. The last case has 32 codes for 8 values: $r$, $u$, $y$ carry the low bits of the three digits and $p$, $q$ are ignored, so **24 codes are redundant**: each value with three large digits has four encodings, of which the one with $pq = 00$ is canonical. Decoding accepts all four, `canonical()` rewrites them. For example, `125` is the declet `0010100101` = `0x0A5` (three small digits) and `999` is `0011111111` = `0x0FF`, also written `0x1FF`, `0x2FF`, `0x3FF`."
msgstr "且 $512 + 384 + 96 + 8 = 1000$。前三种情形恰好使用 512、384 和 96 个码字。最后一种情形用 32 个码字表示 8 个值：$r$、$u$、$y$ 携带三位数字的低位，$p$、$q$ 被忽略，因此**有 24 个冗余码字**：每个由三个大数字构成的值有四种编码，其中 $pq = 00$ 的那一种是规范编码。解码接受全部四种，`canonical()` 会将其改写。例如，`125` 是 declet `0010100101` = `0x0A5`（三个小数字），`999` 是 `0011111111` = `0x0FF`，也可写作 `0x1FF`、`0x2FF`、`0x3FF`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:638
msgid "M. F. Cowlishaw, \"Densely packed decimal encoding\", *IEE Proceedings — Computers and Digital Techniques* 149(3), 2002. IEEE 754-2019 §3.5.2 gives the encoding tables; the code implements them as Boolean formulas, and the conformance corpus checks all 1024 declets."
msgstr "M. F. Cowlishaw, \"Densely packed decimal encoding\", *IEE Proceedings — Computers and Digital Techniques* 149(3), 2002。IEEE 754-2019 §3.5.2 给出了编码表；代码以布尔公式实现它们，符合性测试语料检查了全部 1024 个 declet。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:643
msgid "**BID.** The coefficient is stored as a binary integer. If the two bits after the sign are not 11, the next $w+2$ bits are the biased exponent and the remaining $10J + 3$ bits the coefficient. Otherwise the exponent follows the 11 and the coefficient is $2^{10J+3}$ plus the remaining $10J+1$ bits (\"100\" implied). Since $10^{7} - 1 < 2^{24}$, $10^{16}-1 < 2^{54}$ and $10^{34}-1 < 2^{114}$, every coefficient fits; encodings with a coefficient $\\ge 10^{p}$ are non-canonical and decode to zero."
msgstr "**BID。** 系数以二进制整数存储。若符号位之后的两位不是 11，则接下来的 $w+2$ 位是带偏置指数，其余 $10J + 3$ 位是系数。否则指数紧随 11 之后，系数为 $2^{10J+3}$ 加上其余 $10J+1$ 位（隐含“100”）。由于 $10^{7} - 1 < 2^{24}$、$10^{16}-1 < 2^{54}$ 和 $10^{34}-1 < 2^{114}$，每个系数都能放下；系数 $\\ge 10^{p}$ 的编码是非规范的，解码为零。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:664
msgid "`DecimalInterchange` keeps the raw bits so that non-canonical input survives until the caller decides to canonicalize; arithmetic is always on `Decimal`."
msgstr "`DecimalInterchange` 保留原始比特，使非规范输入一直保留到调用者决定规范化为止；算术总是作用于 `Decimal`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:669
msgid "**Problem.** For transcendental $f$, $f(x)$ is irrational for almost every decimal $x$, so it can only be approximated; a correctly rounded result needs an approximation good enough to decide the rounding (the *table maker's dilemma*)."
msgstr "**问题。** 对超越函数 $f$，对几乎每个十进制 $x$，$f(x)$ 都是无理数，因此只能近似；正确舍入的结果需要足以判定舍入的近似（即*制表者困境*）。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:674
msgid "**Options.** A fixed-precision evaluation with an a-priori error bound (fast, but correctness then depends on the bound being right for every function and argument); Ziv's adaptive strategy[^ziv] with rigorous error bounds."
msgstr "**方案。** 带先验误差界的固定精度求值（速度快，但正确性取决于该界对每个函数和参数都成立）；或采用带严格误差界的 Ziv 自适应策略[^ziv]。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:679
msgid "**Choice.** A Ziv loop over rigorous enclosures. For an operation $f$ and input $x$:"
msgstr "**选择。** 在严格包络上运行 Ziv 循环。对运算 $f$ 和输入 $x$："

#: manual/design/decimal.md:682
msgid ""
"Convert $x$ exactly into a binary interval: $\\underline{x} = \\n"
"abla_w(x)$ and $\\overline{x} = \\Delta_w(x)$, `to_bin_float` with `TowardNegative` and `TowardPositive` at $w$ bits, so $x \\in [\\underline{x}, \\overline{x}]$."
msgstr ""
"把 $x$ 精确转换为二进制区间：$\\underline{x} = \\n"
"abla_w(x)$ 和 $\\overline{x} = \\Delta_w(x)$，`to_bin_float`，其中 `TowardNegative` 和 `TowardPositive` 取 $w$ 位，于是 $x \\in [\\underline{x}, \\overline{x}]$。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:686
msgid ""
"Evaluate $f$ on that interval with [`ball_float`](ball_float.md), which returns an interval $[L, U] \\n"
"i f(x)$ for every point of the input interval."
msgstr ""
"用 [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) 在该区间上计算 $f$，它返回一个对输入区间中每一点都成立的区间 $[L, U] \\n"
"i f(x)$。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:688
msgid "Convert $L$ and $U$ (dyadic, hence exact decimals) to `Decimal` exactly and round both with the target context. If both give the same representation (`compare_total` equal) and the same flags, return it."
msgstr "把 $L$ 和 $U$（二进分数，因而是精确的十进制数）精确转换为 `Decimal`，并用目标上下文分别舍入。若两者给出相同的表示（`compare_total` 相等）和相同的标志，则返回它。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:691
msgid "Otherwise increase $w \\leftarrow w + \\max(32, \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor)$ and repeat; after 12 evaluations report a certification failure."
msgstr "否则增大 $w \\leftarrow w + \\max(32, \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor)$ 并重复；求值 12 次之后报告认证失败。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:694
msgid "The acceptance test is sound because rounding is monotone: $L \\le f(x) \\le U$ implies $\\circ(L) \\le \\circ(f(x)) \\le \\circ(U)$, and if the outer two are the same representation, so is the middle one. The flags transfer as well, provided $f(x)$ is not itself representable: then one endpoint differs from the common result, so both are inexact, and `overflow`, `subnormal` and `underflow` are monotone in $|f(x)|$ on an interval that does not contain zero. Representable results are therefore handled before the loop (below)."
msgstr "接受测试是可靠的，因为舍入是单调的：$L \\le f(x) \\le U$ 蕴含 $\\circ(L) \\le \\circ(f(x)) \\le \\circ(U)$，若外侧两者是同一表示，中间的也是。标志同样可以传递，前提是 $f(x)$ 本身不可表示：此时有一个端点与公共结果不同，因此两者都不精确，而 `overflow`、`subnormal` 和 `underflow` 在不含零的区间上关于 $|f(x)|$ 单调。因此可表示的结果在循环之前就已处理（见下文）。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:703
msgid "The initial working precision is $w_0 = \\max(128,\\ 4\\max(D, p) + 64)$ bits, where $D$ is the number of input digits: one decimal digit needs $\\log_2 10 \\approx 3.32 < 4$ bits, so $4\\max(D,p)$ bits represent the input and the target with margin, and 64 bits more cover the loss of the enclosure. The schedule grows by a factor of about $3/2$ per step (exactly $w + \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor$ once $w \\ge 64$); the 12 evaluations use $w_0, w_1, \\ldots, w_{11}$, and the last one works with about $w_0 \\cdot (3/2)^{11} \\approx 86\\,w_0$ bits."
msgstr "初始工作精度为 $w_0 = \\max(128,\\ 4\\max(D, p) + 64)$ 位，其中 $D$ 为输入的位数：一位十进制数字需要 $\\log_2 10 \\approx 3.32 < 4$ 位，因此 $4\\max(D,p)$ 位足以带余量地表示输入和目标，再多 64 位用于覆盖包络的损失。精度安排每步大约增长 $3/2$ 倍（当 $w \\ge 64$ 时恰为 $w + \\lfloor w/2 \\rfloor$）；12 次求值使用 $w_0, w_1, \\ldots, w_{11}$，最后一次以约 $w_0 \\cdot (3/2)^{11} \\approx 86\\,w_0$ 位进行。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:712
msgid "Three kinds of inputs are decided outside the agreement test:"
msgstr "有三类输入在一致性测试之外判定："

#: manual/design/decimal.md:714
msgid "**Exact results.** If $f(x)$ is a representable decimal and the enclosure is not a point, $L < f(x) < U$ round to different neighbours in a directed mode, forever. In a half mode both endpoints round to $f(x)$ itself, but with `inexact`, so the agreement test would *accept* the right value with wrong flags and with all $p$ digits instead of the preferred exponent: the soundness argument above assumed that $f(x)$ is not representable. The code therefore detects exact cases before the loop (`exp(0)`, `ln(1)`, $\\log_{10} 10^{k}$, integer and half-integer arguments of `sinpi`/`cospi`/`tanpi`, odd quarter-integers of `tanpi`, `acos(1)`, integer arguments of `exp2`/`exp10`, $x^{1/2}$, integer powers, …). For the algebraic functions this is a finite integer computation: `rootn` strips the trailing zeros of the coefficient, aligns the exponent to a multiple of the degree $n$ and tests the integer $n$-th root (Newton's iteration from above) of the result, so $\\sqrt[3]{0.008} = 0.2$; `hypot` forms $x^2 + y^2$ exactly when the adjusted exponents of the operands differ by at most $p + 2$ (beyond that, $\\sqrt{x^2+y^2} - |x| \\approx y^2/(2|x|)$ is below the last digit the result could have) and tests it with the exact square root, so $\\operatorname{hypot}(0.3, 0.4) = 0.5$; a zero operand gives the other operand's magnitude. `ball_float` returns point intervals for exact binary results such as $\\log_2 8 = 3$, $\\log_2 0.125 = -3$ and $4^{1.5} = 8$. A power whose exact value is representable in decimal but not in binary is decided in decimal instead: the exponent is reduced to $p/q$ in lowest terms — a decimal exponent is $c \\cdot 10^{-k}$, so $q$ keeps only the twos and fives the coefficient cannot cancel — and the result is exact exactly when $x^{p/q}$ is a decimal. By Bézout there are integers $a, b$ with $ap + bq = 1$, so $x^{1/q} = (x^{p/q})^{a} x^{b}$ is rational whenever $x^{p/q}$ is, and a rational $q$-th root of a decimal is again a decimal (its denominator divides a power of ten). The test therefore writes $x = r \\cdot 10^{qe}$ with $r$ an integer keeping fewer than $q$ trailing zeros, decides whether $r$ is a perfect $q$-th power by a bisection over the root's digit count, and only then raises the root to $p$ (the reciprocal of the root, for a negative exponent). Every intermediate is then no longer than the result, so $0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$, $32^{0.2} = 2$ and $(2^{1200} \\cdot 10^{-1200})^{1.5} = 2^{1800} \\cdot 10^{-1800}$ at precision 1000 are all decided at once, although $x^{3}$ in the last one has 1084 digits. Only a value of at most $p + 1$ significant digits can sit on a rounding boundary — a representable value in the directed modes, a midpoint in the half modes — so the search covers exactly those and leaves a longer exact value, which lies strictly inside its rounding cell, to the enclosure."
msgstr "**精确结果。** 若 $f(x)$ 是可表示的十进制数而包络不是一个点，则在定向模式下 $L < f(x) < U$ 会舍入到不同的相邻值，永远如此。在 half 模式下两个端点都舍入到 $f(x)$ 本身，但带有 `inexact`，因此一致性测试会以错误的标志、并以全部 $p$ 位而非首选指数*接受*正确的值：上文的可靠性论证假设了 $f(x)$ 不可表示。因此代码在循环之前检测精确情形（`exp(0)`、`ln(1)`、$\\log_{10} 10^{k}$、`sinpi`/`cospi`/`tanpi` 的整数与半整数参数、`tanpi` 的奇数四分之一整数参数、`acos(1)`、`exp2`/`exp10` 的整数参数、$x^{1/2}$、整数次幂……）。对代数函数而言，这是有限的整数计算：`rootn` 去除系数的尾随零，把指数对齐到次数 $n$ 的倍数，再检验结果的整数 $n$ 次根（从上方逼近的 Newton 迭代），因此 $\\sqrt[3]{0.008} = 0.2$；当操作数的调整指数相差至多 $p + 2$ 时，`hypot` 精确构成 $x^2 + y^2$（超出此范围时，$\\sqrt{x^2+y^2} - |x| \\approx y^2/(2|x|)$ 低于结果可能具有的最后一位），并用精确平方根检验，因此 $\\operatorname{hypot}(0.3, 0.4) = 0.5$；零操作数给出另一个操作数的绝对值。对于精确的二进制结果，如 $\\log_2 8 = 3$、$\\log_2 0.125 = -3$ 和 $4^{1.5} = 8$，`ball_float` 返回点区间。精确值在十进制中可表示但在二进制中不可表示的幂，改为在十进制中判定：指数被约化为最简形式 $p/q$——十进制指数为 $c \\cdot 10^{-k}$，因此 $q$ 只保留系数无法约掉的 2 和 5——而结果精确的充要条件是 $x^{p/q}$ 为十进制数。由 Bézout 定理，存在整数 $a, b$ 使 $ap + bq = 1$，于是只要 $x^{p/q}$ 是有理数，$x^{1/q} = (x^{p/q})^{a} x^{b}$ 就是有理数；而十进制数的有理 $q$ 次根仍是十进制数（其分母整除 10 的某个幂）。因此检验把 $x$ 写成 $x = r \\cdot 10^{qe}$，其中整数 $r$ 的尾随零少于 $q$ 个，再对根的位数做二分来判定 $r$ 是否为完全 $q$ 次幂，最后才把根升到 $p$ 次（指数为负时则升根的倒数）。这样每个中间量都不比结果更长，因此 $0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$、$32^{0.2} = 2$，以及精度 1000 下的 $(2^{1200} \\cdot 10^{-1200})^{1.5} = 2^{1800} \\cdot 10^{-1800}$ 都能立即判定，尽管最后一例中的 $x^{3}$ 有 1084 位。只有至多 $p + 1$ 位有效数字的值才可能落在舍入边界上——定向模式下是可表示值，half 模式下是中点——因此搜索恰好覆盖这些值，而更长的精确值严格位于其舍入单元内部，交给包络处理。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:754
msgid "**Integer powers** are not certified; they are rounded once from exact integer information. `power_ctx` with an integral exponent $n$ that does not fit in $p$ digits first runs the General Decimal Arithmetic square-and-multiply with $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 2$ working digits. That scheme only ever discards zero digits of an exact power, so it reports `inexact` exactly when the true power is inexact, and it gives exact powers their GDA cohort and flags. In an extended context an inexact result is then replaced by the correctly rounded one. With $c$ the coefficient stripped of trailing zeros, if $|n| \\cdot \\operatorname{digits}(c) \\le \\max(4p, 64)$ the exact power $c^{|n|}$ is formed and rounded once (a negative $n$ divides once, correctly rounded). Otherwise $c^{|n|}$ has more than $p + 1$ significant digits and no trailing zero, so it is never a $p$-digit number or midpoint; lower and upper bounds from square-and-multiply in `Down` and `Up` at a working precision of $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 8$ digits, doubled on each attempt, are refined until they round to the same representation. So $3.339434^3 = 37.240765000\\ldots$ is `37.24077` in decimal32. If the bounds leave the working exponent range, and in a context that is not extended, the GDA result is kept; its error is below one unit in the last place."
msgstr "**整数次幂**不经过认证，而是依据精确的整数信息只舍入一次。当整数指数 $n$ 无法容纳在 $p$ 位中时，`power_ctx` 先以 $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 2$ 位工作精度运行 General Decimal Arithmetic 的平方再相乘算法。该方案只会丢弃精确幂中的零数字，因此恰在真实幂不精确时报告 `inexact`，并为精确幂给出其 GDA 同值类成员与标志。在扩展上下文中，不精确的结果随后被替换为正确舍入的结果。设 $c$ 为去除尾随零后的系数：若 $|n| \\cdot \\operatorname{digits}(c) \\le \\max(4p, 64)$，则构成精确幂 $c^{|n|}$ 并只舍入一次（负的 $n$ 再做一次正确舍入的除法）。否则 $c^{|n|}$ 有多于 $p + 1$ 个有效数字且没有尾随零，因此它绝不是 $p$ 位数或中点；以 $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 8$ 位工作精度（每次尝试加倍）在 `Down` 和 `Up` 下用平方再相乘算法得到下界和上界，并不断细化，直到它们舍入为同一表示。因此 $3.339434^3 = 37.240765000\\ldots$ 在 decimal32 中为 `37.24077`。若界超出工作指数范围，或在非扩展上下文中，则保留 GDA 结果；其误差小于最后一位的一个单位。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:774
msgid "**Out-of-range results.** An enclosure such as $[0, \\text{tiny}]$ has endpoints that round with different flags. Any value $\\ge 10^{e_{\\max}+2}$ overflows identically, and any non-zero value $\\le 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-2} < \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ rounds identically (to zero or to the smallest subnormal, depending only on the mode and sign), so far endpoints are replaced by such representatives; the binary test uses $3.322 > \\log_2 10$ so the replacement is conservative. For `exp`, $x \\ge 3(e_{\\max}+1)$ overflows because $x \\log_{10} e \\ge 3 \\cdot 0.434\\,(e_{\\max}+1) > e_{\\max}+1$, and $x \\le -3\\,|E_{\\text{tiny}} - 1|$ underflows below $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-1}$ by the same estimate. `power` bounds $y \\log_2 x$ with directed 128-bit arithmetic for the same purpose."
msgstr "**超出范围的结果。** 像 $[0, \\text{tiny}]$ 这样的包络，其端点在舍入时会产生不同的标志。任何 $\\ge 10^{e_{\\max}+2}$ 的值都以相同方式上溢，任何非零且 $\\le 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-2} < \\tfrac12 10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ 的值都以相同方式舍入（舍入为零或最小次正规数，仅取决于模式和符号），因此远处的端点会被替换为这样的代表值；二进制测试使用 $3.322 > \\log_2 10$，以保证替换是保守的。对于 `exp`，$x \\ge 3(e_{\\max}+1)$ 会上溢，因为 $x \\log_{10} e \\ge 3 \\cdot 0.434\\,(e_{\\max}+1) > e_{\\max}+1$；由同样的估计，$x \\le -3\\,|E_{\\text{tiny}} - 1|$ 会下溢到 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}-1}$ 以下。出于同样的目的，`power` 用定向的 128 位算术界定 $y \\log_2 x$。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:786
msgid "The elementary functions refuse contexts with $p$ or $|e|$ above 999,999 (`invalid_context`), which bounds the size of the exact endpoint conversions."
msgstr "初等函数拒绝 $p$ 或 $|e|$ 超过 999,999 的上下文（`invalid_context`），以此限制端点精确转换的规模。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:789
msgid "A. Ziv, \"Fast evaluation of elementary mathematical functions with correctly rounded last bit\", *ACM TOMS* 17(3), 1991; J.-M. Muller et al., *Handbook of Floating-Point Arithmetic*, 2nd ed., Birkhäuser 2018, ch. 12; J. van der Hoeven, \"Ball arithmetic\", 2009, for the enclosure model."
msgstr "A. Ziv, \"Fast evaluation of elementary mathematical functions with correctly rounded last bit\", *ACM TOMS* 17(3), 1991；J.-M. Muller et al., *Handbook of Floating-Point Arithmetic*, 2nd ed., Birkhäuser 2018, ch. 12；包络模型参见 J. van der Hoeven, \"Ball arithmetic\", 2009。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:794
msgid "Coefficient kernels"
msgstr "系数内核"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:796
msgid "**Problem.** Rounding at decimal positions needs fast division by powers of ten and fast digit counts; large precisions need sub-quadratic multiplication and division."
msgstr "**问题。** 在十进制位置上舍入需要快速除以十的幂和快速计数位数；大精度需要次二次复杂度的乘法和除法。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:800
msgid "**Choice.** The package-private `DecCoeff` is either an inline `UInt` below $10^{9}$ or a little-endian array of base-$10^{9}$ limbs with no leading zero limb and a cached digit count. Base $10^9$ is the largest power of ten below $2^{30}$, so a limb product is below $10^{18} < 2^{60}$; shifting by a multiple of nine digits moves limbs, and `digits10` is a limb count plus the digits of the top limb. `BigInt` appears only at the public boundary."
msgstr "**选择。** 包私有的 `DecCoeff` 要么是低于 $10^{9}$ 的内联 `UInt`，要么是以 $10^{9}$ 为基数的小端 limb 数组，没有前导零 limb，并缓存位数。基数 $10^9$ 是小于 $2^{30}$ 的最大的十的幂，因此 limb 乘积小于 $10^{18} < 2^{60}$；按九位的整数倍移位就是移动 limb，`digits10` 等于 limb 个数加上最高 limb 的位数。`BigInt` 只出现在公共边界上。"

