#: manual/design/decimal.md:865
msgid "(limbs of nine digits). On native the NTT threshold also depends on the transform length — 1,728, 2,816, 4,608, 7,680, then 8,192 limbs for multiplication and 640, 1,040, 1,824, 3,648, 7,296, then 8,192 for squaring — and the Burnikel–Ziegler entry moves to 5,120 and 10,240 limbs for larger block lengths. These are dispatch boundaries: they change cost, never results. The native Newton path is implemented and tested but disabled, because native measurements do not show a crossover."
msgstr "（limb 为九位数字。）在 native 上，NTT 阈值还取决于变换长度——乘法依次为 1,728、2,816、4,608、7,680，然后是 8,192 个 limb；平方依次为 640、1,040、1,824、3,648、7,296，然后是 8,192——而对于更大的分块长度，Burnikel–Ziegler 的起点移到 5,120 和 10,240 个 limb。这些是分派边界：它们只改变开销，从不改变结果。native 的 Newton 路径已实现并经过测试，但处于禁用状态，因为 native 上的测量没有显示出交叉点。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:875
msgid "**Representation.** A finite `Decimal` has $c \\ge 0$; `DecCoeff` limbs are canonical (no leading zero limb, exact digit count). A zero's sign is kept in the sign bit; `coefficient()` never carries a sign."
msgstr "**表示。** 有限的 `Decimal` 满足 $c \\ge 0$；`DecCoeff` 的 limb 是规范的（无前导零 limb，位数精确）。零的符号保存在符号位中；`coefficient()` 从不携带符号。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:878
msgid "**Single rounding.** Every context result of `+`, `-`, `×`, `/`, `fma`, `sqrt`, `scaleb`, quantize and the conversions is the exact result rounded once, in the normal and in the subnormal range; integer powers are correctly rounded in extended contexts; certified elementary results are correctly rounded whenever they are returned, and a failure is reported, never approximated. The exceptions are listed under [known deviations](#known-deviations)."
msgstr "**单次舍入。** `+`、`-`、`×`、`/`、`fma`、`sqrt`、`scaleb`、quantize 和各种转换的每个上下文结果，无论在正规范围还是次正规范围，都是精确结果舍入一次所得；整数次幂在扩展上下文中是正确舍入的；经认证的初等函数结果只要返回就是正确舍入的，失败时会报告失败，而绝不给出近似值。例外情况列于[已知偏差](#known-deviations)。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:885
msgid "**Error bound.** For normal results of those operations, $\\operatorname{fl}(x) = x(1+\\delta)$ with $|\\delta| \\le \\tfrac12 10^{1-p}$ in the half modes and $|\\delta| < 10^{1-p}$ in the directed modes."
msgstr "**误差界。** 对这些运算的正规结果，$\\operatorname{fl}(x) = x(1+\\delta)$，其中在 half 模式下 $|\\delta| \\le \\tfrac12 10^{1-p}$，在定向模式下 $|\\delta| < 10^{1-p}$。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:888
msgid "**Exactness is visible.** `inexact` is raised if and only if the returned value differs from the exact result; `rounded` whenever digits were dropped. Exact decimal results of non-integral powers violate the \"only if\" direction."
msgstr "**精确性可见。** 当且仅当返回值与精确结果不同时引发 `inexact`；只要有数字被丢弃就引发 `rounded`。非整数次幂的精确十进制结果违反了“仅当”这一方向。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:892
msgid "**Cohort preservation.** An exact result that fits is returned at the preferred exponent; `quantize` either returns exponent $q_y$ or fails."
msgstr "**同值类保持。** 能放下的精确结果以首选指数返回；`quantize` 要么返回指数 $q_y$，要么失败。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:894
msgid "**Flags.** `combine` is associative, commutative and idempotent with identity `new()`."
msgstr "**标志。** `combine` 满足结合律、交换律和幂等律，单位元为 `new()`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:896
msgid "**Ordering.** `compare` is a total preorder (NaNs equal to each other and above every number, $-0 = +0$); `compare_total` is a total order on representations and refines `compare` on non-NaN values."
msgstr "**序。** `compare` 是全预序（NaN 彼此相等且大于所有数，$-0 = +0$）；`compare_total` 是表示上的全序，并在非 NaN 值上细化 `compare`。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:899
msgid "**Encodings.** Decoding then encoding canonical bits is the identity; encoding then decoding a value that fits the format is the identity, including cohort, sign of zero and NaN payload (DPD and BID)."
msgstr "**编码。** 对规范比特先解码再编码是恒等映射；对适合该格式的值先编码再解码也是恒等映射，包括同值类、零的符号和 NaN 载荷（DPD 与 BID）。"

#: manual/design/decimal.md:902
msgid "**Complexity.** Comparison, addition, shifts and one-limb division are $O(n)$ in limbs; multiplication and division follow the dispatch table."
msgstr "**复杂度。** 比较、加法、移位和单 limb 除法相对 limb 数为 $O(n)$；乘法和除法遵循分派表。"

