#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:1
msgid "ball_float_checked tutorial"
msgstr "ball_float_checked 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to run an interval computation in which invalid input and uncertifiable steps are reported as errors while every valid result stays a guaranteed enclosure: you build intervals with validating constructors, chain interval arithmetic and elementary functions in a `BallFloatResult`, add your own checks with `bind`, and read the outcome once. The arithmetic comes from [`ball_float`](ball_float.md); the [design page](../design/ball_float_checked.md) explains which outcomes are errors; the [API reference](../api/ball_float_checked.md) lists every method."
msgstr "本教程展示如何运行这样一种区间计算：无效输入和无法认证的步骤会作为错误报告，而每个有效结果仍是有保证的包络。你将用带验证的构造器构造区间，在 `BallFloatResult` 中串联区间算术和初等函数，用 `bind` 加入自己的检查，并在最后一次性读取结果。算术来自 [`ball_float`](ball_float.md)；[设计页面](../design/ball_float_checked.md)解释了哪些结果属于错误；[API 参考](../api/ball_float_checked.md)列出了所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:14
msgid "build an enclosure from untrusted bounds or a `Double`"
msgstr "从不可信的界或 `Double` 构建包络"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:14
msgid "`from_bounds`, `from_double`, `exact` ([Validate measurements](#validate-measurements-at-the-boundary))"
msgstr "`from_bounds`、`from_double`、`exact`（[验证测量值](#validate-measurements-at-the-boundary)）"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:15
msgid "push uncertain inputs through a formula"
msgstr "让不确定的输入流经一个公式"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:15
msgid "`+ - * /` on `BallFloatResult` ([Propagate uncertainty](#propagate-uncertainty-through-a-formula))"
msgstr "`BallFloatResult` 上的 `+ - * /`（[传播不确定性](#propagate-uncertainty-through-a-formula)）"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:16
msgid "treat an empty or unbounded result as a success or as a failure"
msgstr "把空结果或无界结果视为成功或失败"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:16
msgid "`is_ok`, `bind` ([No information is not an error](#know-that-no-information-is-not-an-error), [Application rules](#turn-an-application-rule-into-an-error))"
msgstr "`is_ok`、`bind`（[没有信息不是错误](#know-that-no-information-is-not-an-error)、[应用规则](#turn-an-application-rule-into-an-error)）"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:17
msgid "find out why an elementary function failed"
msgstr "查明初等函数失败的原因"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:17
msgid "`error()`, `certification_failure_detail()` ([Certification failures](#certification-failures))"
msgstr "`error()`、`certification_failure_detail()`（[认证失败](#certification-failures)）"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:18
msgid "square an interval that contains 0 tightly"
msgstr "紧致地对包含 0 的区间求平方"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:18
msgid "`pow_int`, not `pow_nat` or `x * x` ([Powers](#powers-through-the-arithmetic-traits))"
msgstr "`pow_int`，而不是 `pow_nat` 或 `x * x`（[幂](#powers-through-the-arithmetic-traits)）"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:19
msgid "decide a comparison at the end of a pipeline"
msgstr "在流水线末端判定比较结果"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:19
msgid "`result()` and the enclosure traits ([Generic code](#generic-code-with-the-enclosure-relations))"
msgstr "`result()` 与包络 trait（[泛型代码](#generic-code-with-the-enclosure-relations)）"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:29
msgid "Import the wrapper and the endpoint package (the later examples also use `Luna-Flow/floating/ball_float` and `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` as `@lf_arith`):"
msgstr "导入包装包和端点包（后面的示例还会使用 `Luna-Flow/floating/ball_float`，并以 `@lf_arith` 的名义使用 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`）："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:41
msgid "Enclose $\\ln 2$ at 53 bits:"
msgstr "以 53 位精度包络 $\\ln 2$："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:57
msgid "The upper bound printed in lowest terms is $6243314768165360 \\cdot 2^{-53}$, so the two bounds are adjacent 53-bit numbers, and $\\ln 2$ lies between them."
msgstr "以最简形式打印的上界是 $6243314768165360 \\cdot 2^{-53}$，因此两个界是相邻的 53 位数，$\\ln 2$ 位于它们之间。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:62
msgid "The remaining examples print results with this helper; a bounded interval prints as `centre +/- radius` in exact binary notation:"
msgstr "其余示例用下面这个辅助函数打印结果；有界区间以精确二进制记法打印为 `centre +/- radius`："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:75
msgid "Validate measurements at the boundary"
msgstr "在边界处验证测量值"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:77
msgid "Input data enters through `from_bounds`, `from_double` or `exact`. Reversed bounds and non-finite sources become errors before any computation runs:"
msgstr "输入数据通过 `from_bounds`、`from_double` 或 `exact` 进入。上下界颠倒和非有限的来源会在任何计算运行之前就成为错误："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:100
msgid "Propagate uncertainty through a formula"
msgstr "让不确定性在公式中传播"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:102
msgid "Operators work on wrappers. The result encloses every value the formula can take for inputs in the intervals:"
msgstr "运算符作用于包装器。结果包络了输入落在各区间内时该公式可能取到的每个值："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:121
msgid "The area lies in $[2, 7.5]$, the product of the two ranges."
msgstr "面积位于 $[2, 7.5]$，即两个范围之积。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:123
msgid "Know that \"no information\" is not an error"
msgstr "“没有信息”并不是错误"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:125
msgid "Interval operations follow set semantics: points outside a function's domain are dropped, and an operation that can say nothing returns the whole line. These are successes, because they are correct enclosures:"
msgstr "区间运算遵循集合语义：函数定义域之外的点被舍弃，而无法给出任何信息的运算返回整条实轴。这些都算成功，因为它们是正确的包络："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:140
msgid "When an empty or unbounded result means failure in *your* application, say so with `bind`."
msgstr "如果在*你的*应用中空结果或无界结果意味着失败，就用 `bind` 明确表达。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:143
msgid "Turn an application rule into an error"
msgstr "把应用规则变成错误"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:170
msgid "Certification failures"
msgstr "认证失败"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:172
msgid "Elementary functions are evaluated with certified error bounds. When the library cannot certify an enclosure within its budget it reports a `CertificationFailure` with a detail record instead of returning a wrong or needlessly wide interval:"
msgstr "初等函数以经过认证的误差界求值。当库无法在预算内认证一个包络时，它会报告带有详情记录的 `CertificationFailure`，而不是返回错误的或不必要地宽的区间："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:193
msgid "Powers through the arithmetic traits"
msgstr "通过 arithmetic trait 求幂"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:195
msgid "`pow_nat` and `pow_int` go through the `PowNatChecked` and `PowIntChecked` traits of Luna-Flow/arithmetic. `pow_int` computes the power of one point of the interval (`BallFloat::pown`); for an interval containing zero this is tighter than repeated multiplication, which treats the two factors as independent. `pow_nat` *is* repeated multiplication, so it is as wide as the product:"
msgstr "`pow_nat` 和 `pow_int` 经由 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的 `PowNatChecked` 和 `PowIntChecked` trait 实现。`pow_int` 对区间中的同一个点求幂（`BallFloat::pown`）；对于包含零的区间，这比重复相乘更紧，因为重复相乘把两个因子视为相互独立。`pow_nat` *就是*重复相乘，因此它与乘积一样宽："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:220
msgid "Generic code with the enclosure relations"
msgstr "使用包络关系的泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:222
msgid "`BallFloat` implements the enclosure relations of Luna-Flow/arithmetic (`Contains`, `DefinitelyLt`, …). Extract the interval at the end of a pipeline and test it:"
msgstr "`BallFloat` 实现了 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的包络关系（`Contains`、`DefinitelyLt`……）。在流水线末尾取出区间并对其进行检验："

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:241
msgid "**Small default precision.** `from_int` and `from_coefficient` default to 16 bits. An integer that needs more bits is still enclosed, but by a two-point interval rather than a point. Pass `precision=53` (or more) for large integers."
msgstr "**默认精度较小。** `from_int` 和 `from_coefficient` 默认使用 16 位。需要更多位的整数仍会被包络，但得到的是两点区间而不是一个点。对于大整数请传入 `precision=53`（或更大）。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:245
msgid "**`pow_nat` is not tighter than a product.** Use `pow_int` for even powers of an interval that contains 0."
msgstr "**`pow_nat` 并不比乘积更紧。** 对包含 0 的区间求偶次幂时，请使用 `pow_int`。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:247
msgid "**Empty and whole are successes.** Test `is_empty` / `is_entire` on the final interval, or add a `bind` check."
msgstr "**空集和整条实轴都算成功。** 请对最终区间检验 `is_empty` / `is_entire`，或加入一个 `bind` 检查。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:249
msgid "**No decorations or flags.** The wrapper keeps neither IEEE 1788 decorations nor `BallFlags`; use the decorated and contextual APIs of `ball_float` when you need them."
msgstr "**没有装饰或标志。** 该包装器既不保留 IEEE 1788 装饰，也不保留 `BallFlags`；需要它们时请使用 `ball_float` 的装饰 API 和 contextual API。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:252
msgid "**Only the first error survives**, as in every checked wrapper."
msgstr "**只有第一个错误会保留下来**，所有 checked 包装器都是如此。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:253
msgid "**`[+inf, +inf]` is rejected.** IEEE 1788 intervals are subsets of the real line; use `whole()` or a half-infinite interval instead."
msgstr "**`[+inf, +inf]` 会被拒绝。** IEEE 1788 区间是实轴的子集；请改用 `whole()` 或半无穷区间。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:255
#: manual/tutorial/bin_float_checked.md:259
msgid "**`flat_map` is deprecated.** Use `bind`."
msgstr "**`flat_map` 已弃用。** 请使用 `bind`。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:259
msgid "[`ball_float_checked` design](../design/ball_float_checked.md): errors versus enclosures, and the composition laws."
msgstr "[`ball_float_checked` 设计](../design/ball_float_checked.md)：错误与包络的区别，以及组合律。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:261
msgid "[`ball_float_checked` API](../api/ball_float_checked.md): every method."
msgstr "[`ball_float_checked` API](../api/ball_float_checked.md)：所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/ball_float_checked.md:262
msgid "[`ball_float` tutorial](ball_float.md): decorations, contexts and the interval operations themselves."
msgstr "[`ball_float` 教程](ball_float.md)：装饰、上下文以及区间运算本身。"

