#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:96
msgid "Read an auto-tune result"
msgstr "阅读自动调优结果"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:98
msgid "The auto-tune suite prints one decision per dataset and a crossover:"
msgstr "自动调优套件为每个数据集打印一个决策，并打印一个交叉点："

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:106
msgid "`candidate` is the implementation with the smallest median per-call time on that dataset, and `samples` the number of valid confirmatory observations behind it. When the winner changes exactly once along the scales, the crossover line gives the last scale `below` the change and the first scale `at_or_above` it, and the policy line is the per-scale lookup table a kernel can embed. When it changes more than once the suite prints `MAREMARK_CROSSOVER=non-monotonic` and a `MAREMARK_POLICY=lookup` line; when it never changes, `MAREMARK_CROSSOVER=none` and no policy line."
msgstr "`candidate` 是该数据集上每次调用中位耗时最小的实现，`samples` 是其背后的有效确认性观测次数。当胜出者沿规模恰好变化一次时，交叉点行给出变化前的最后一个规模 `below` 和变化后的第一个规模 `at_or_above`，策略行则是内核可以嵌入的按规模查找表。当胜出者变化不止一次时，套件打印 `MAREMARK_CROSSOVER=non-monotonic` 和一行 `MAREMARK_POLICY=lookup`；当胜出者从不变化时，打印 `MAREMARK_CROSSOVER=none`，且没有策略行。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:115
msgid "Check a regression in code"
msgstr "在代码中检查性能退化"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:117
msgid "`confirmatory_regression` compares paired samples (same order, same blocks) and `is_significant_regression` applies the verdict:"
msgstr "`confirmatory_regression` 比较配对样本（相同顺序、相同分块），`is_significant_regression` 则给出判定："

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:130
msgid "A change of about 0.5 % is below the 3 % practical threshold, so it is not a regression even if it were statistically clear."
msgstr "约 0.5 % 的变化低于 3 % 的实际阈值，因此即使它在统计上是明确的，也不算性能退化。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:133
msgid "Write a new benchmark"
msgstr "编写新的基准测试"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:135
msgid "A benchmark is an `immutable_bench` specification plus a skipped async test that runs it and prints Maremark lines. The pattern used by every suite:"
msgstr "一个基准测试由一个 `immutable_bench` 规格加上一个被跳过的异步测试组成，该测试运行规格并打印 Maremark 行。所有套件都采用如下模式："

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:194
msgid "Keep the plan-compiles test unskipped: it checks the specification in every normal test run. Register the package in `tools/benchmark.py` so `just bench` collects its output."
msgstr "保持 plan-compiles 测试不被跳过：它会在每次常规测试运行中检查规格。在 `tools/benchmark.py` 中注册该包，以便 `just bench` 收集其输出。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:200
msgid "The protocol presets of Maremark fix warm-up, batch calibration, sample counts and order: `QuickCheck` (3 confirmatory blocks), `Development` (10 blocks, used by the suites) and `RegressionGate` (20 blocks, used by the auto-tune suite). See the [Maremark documentation](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/)."
msgstr "Maremark 的协议预设固定了预热、批次校准、样本数和顺序：`QuickCheck`（3 个确认性分块）、`Development`（10 个分块，各套件使用）和 `RegressionGate`（20 个分块，自动调优套件使用）。参见 [Maremark 文档](https://lunaflow.cn/en/mare_mark/)。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:205
msgid "[bench design](../design/bench.md) explains the estimators and the confidence interval."
msgstr "[bench 设计](../design/bench.md) 解释了估计量和置信区间。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:207
msgid "[Performance audit](../performance_audit.md) and the `performance/` pages record measured results."
msgstr "[性能审计](../performance_audit.md) 和 `performance/` 页面记录了实测结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:212
msgid "**Benchmarks are skipped by default.** `moon test` runs only the plan-compiles tests; use `just bench` (it passes `--include-skipped`, `--release` and `--no-parallelize`)."
msgstr "**基准测试默认被跳过。** `moon test` 只运行 plan-compiles 测试；请使用 `just bench`（它会传入 `--include-skipped`、`--release` 和 `--no-parallelize`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:215
msgid "**Native only.** `tools/benchmark.py` accepts only the native target."
msgstr "**仅限 native。** `tools/benchmark.py` 只接受 native 目标。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:216
msgid "**Pairing needs equal sample counts.** Both implementations of a comparison must have the same number of valid confirmatory observations; otherwise `paired_hotspot` returns `MismatchedPairs`."
msgstr "**配对需要相等的样本数。** 一次比较中的两个实现必须具有相同数量的有效确认性观测；否则 `paired_hotspot` 返回 `MismatchedPairs`。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench.md:219
msgid "**The tuning threshold does nothing.** `tune_dataset` always returns the candidate with the smallest median; its `practical_delta_pct` argument does not create ties, so two nearly equal candidates can alternate between datasets and make the crossover non-monotonic. Which secondary criterion is intended is open in [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60)."
msgstr "**调优阈值不起作用。** `tune_dataset` 总是返回中位数最小的候选；它的 `practical_delta_pct` 参数不会产生平局，因此两个几乎相等的候选可能在不同数据集之间交替胜出，使交叉点变得非单调。预期采用哪个次要判据，尚在 [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60) 中待定。"

