#: manual/tutorial/bench/bin_float.md:38
msgid "The analysis file contains `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…` for arithmetic, `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/elementary/OP/DATASET full_pct=…` for elementary functions, and `MAREMARK_TUNE`, `MAREMARK_CROSSOVER` and `MAREMARK_POLICY` lines for the square experiment. A `core_pct` value is the median paired difference between the core path and the kernel, in percent of the kernel's median time; `full_pct` is the same for the checked path against the core path. Positive values mean the higher layer is slower."
msgstr "分析文件中，算术部分为 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…` 行，初等函数部分为 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=bin-float/elementary/OP/DATASET full_pct=…` 行，平方实验则为 `MAREMARK_TUNE`、`MAREMARK_CROSSOVER` 和 `MAREMARK_POLICY` 行。`core_pct` 值是 core 路径与内核之间配对差值的中位数，以内核中位耗时的百分比表示；`full_pct` 同理，是 checked 路径相对 core 路径的差值。正值表示较高层更慢。"

