msgstr "运行器在 native 目标上以 release 模式执行 `src/bench/decimal` 中被跳过的性能测试，并写出 `.tmp/bench/SUITE.jsonl`（全部观测值）和 `.tmp/bench/SUITE.analysis.txt`（归约后的行），其中 `SUITE` 是传给 `just bench` 的名称。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal.md:35
msgid "The analysis file contains `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=decimal/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…`. A `core_pct` value is the median paired difference between the core path and the kernel, in percent of the kernel's median time; `full_pct` is the same for the checked path against the core path. Positive values mean the higher layer is slower."
msgstr "分析文件包含 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=decimal/OP/DATASET core_pct=… full_pct=…` 行。`core_pct` 值是 core 路径与内核之间配对差值的中位数，以内核中位耗时的百分比表示；`full_pct` 同理，是 checked 路径相对 core 路径的差值。正值表示较高层更慢。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal.md:64
msgid "[bench/decimal API](../../api/bench/decimal.md)"
msgstr "[bench/decimal API](../../api/bench/decimal.md)"

