msgstr "[bench/decimal 设计](../../design/bench/decimal.md)"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal_gda.md:1
msgid "bench/decimal_gda tutorial"
msgstr "bench/decimal_gda 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal_gda.md:3
msgid "This page shows how to run the General Decimal Arithmetic benchmarks and how to read their output. The suite compares implementation paths on identical inputs with paired measurements; see the [bench tutorial](../bench.md) for the toolkit and the artifact format."
msgstr "本页介绍如何运行 General Decimal Arithmetic 基准测试，并说明如何解读其输出。该套件在相同输入上以配对测量比较不同的实现路径；工具集与产物格式见 [bench 教程](../bench.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal_gda.md:26
msgid "The runner executes the skipped performance tests of `src/bench/decimal_gda` on the native target in release mode and writes `.tmp/bench/SUITE.jsonl` (all observations) and `.tmp/bench/SUITE.analysis.txt` (the reduced lines), where `SUITE` is the name given to `just bench`."
msgstr "运行器在 native 目标上以 release 模式执行 `src/bench/decimal_gda` 中被跳过的性能测试，并写出 `.tmp/bench/SUITE.jsonl`（全部观测值）和 `.tmp/bench/SUITE.analysis.txt`（归约后的行），其中 `SUITE` 是传给 `just bench` 的名称。"

#: manual/tutorial/bench/decimal_gda.md:35
msgid "The analysis file contains `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=decimal-gda/OP/DATASET full_pct=…`, where `DATASET` is the index 0 to 4 of the digit counts 1, 9, 18, 34 and 128. This suite has no kernel path, so there is no `core_pct`: `full_pct` is the median paired difference between the checked path and the core path, in percent of the core path's median per-call time. Positive values mean the checked path is slower."
msgstr "分析文件包含 `MAREMARK_HOTSPOT=decimal-gda/OP/DATASET full_pct=…`，其中 `DATASET` 是数字位数 1、9、18、34 和 128 对应的索引 0 到 4。此套件没有内核路径，因此没有 `core_pct`：`full_pct` 是 checked 路径与 core 路径之间配对差值的中位数，以 core 路径每次调用中位耗时的百分比表示。正值表示 checked 路径更慢。"

