msgstr "对运行分片"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:86
msgid "Shard `i` runs the rows whose position (after the `--cases` filter, across all files) is `i` modulo the shard count. Adding the JSON counters of all shards gives the counters of the unsharded run, except `totalCases`, which every shard already reports for the whole run."
msgstr "分片 `i` 运行位置（经 `--cases` 过滤后、跨所有文件计数）对分片数取模等于 `i` 的行。把所有分片的 JSON 计数器相加，即得到未分片运行的计数器；`totalCases` 除外，因为每个分片报告的已经是整个运行的值。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:91
msgid "Fail on unsupported rows"
msgstr "让不支持的行导致失败"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:97
msgid "With `--strict-supported` the exit status is `1` if any selected row is unsupported or legacy, even when all executed rows pass."
msgstr "使用 `--strict-supported` 时，只要有任何被选中的行不受支持或属于遗留（legacy）行，即使所有已执行的行都通过，退出状态也为 `1`。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:102
msgid "`just conformance run decimal_gda` fetches the pinned official corpora, splits them into the phases of `testdata/decimal/interpreter_stages.json` and runs the shards in parallel with this runner."
msgstr "`just conformance run decimal_gda` 会获取固定版本的官方语料，按 `testdata/decimal/interpreter_stages.json` 将其划分为各阶段，并用此运行器并行运行各分片。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:105
msgid "[gda_expr tutorial](../frontend/gda_expr.md) explains the row semantics and the pass rule."
msgstr "[gda_expr 教程](../frontend/gda_expr.md) 解释了行的语义和通过规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:110
msgid "**`--help` returns `2`.** The runner prints its usage as an error; through the dispatcher, `--help` shows the dispatcher usage instead."
msgstr "**`--help` 返回 `2`。** 运行器将其用法作为错误打印；经由分发器时，`--help` 显示的则是分发器的用法。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:112
msgid "**First parse error only.** A malformed line stops the run with one `file:line:1: message`; fix it and rerun to see the next."
msgstr "**只报告第一个解析错误。** 格式错误的行会以一条 `file:line:1: message` 终止运行；修正后重新运行才能看到下一个错误。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:114
msgid "**Non-recursive directories.** Subdirectories are not searched."
msgstr "**目录不递归。** 不会搜索子目录。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:115
msgid "**The suffix is case-sensitive.** A named file such as `add.dectest` or `add.txt` is the error `not a .decTest file: PATH` (exit `2`), and inside a directory such entries are skipped, so a directory without any `.decTest` file gives an empty run that exits with `0`."
msgstr "**后缀区分大小写。** 像 `add.dectest` 或 `add.txt` 这样的指定文件会产生错误 `not a .decTest file: PATH`（退出码 `2`），而在目录中这样的条目会被跳过，因此不含任何 `.decTest` 文件的目录会产生一次以 `0` 退出的空运行。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:122
msgid "[cli/gda_expr_cli API](../../api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md) for options, output keys and exit codes."
msgstr "[cli/gda_expr_cli API](../../api/cli/gda_expr_cli.md)：选项、输出键和退出码。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:124
msgid "[cli/gda_expr_cli design](../../design/cli/gda_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "[cli/gda_expr_cli 设计](../../design/cli/gda_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:125
msgid "[frontend/gda_expr tutorial](../frontend/gda_expr.md) for the row semantics."
msgstr "[frontend/gda_expr 教程](../frontend/gda_expr.md)：行的语义。"

