msgstr "运行文件"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:50
msgid "Paths must be files; they are read in the given order."
msgstr "路径必须是文件；按给定顺序读取。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:52
