msgid "Without the flag, unsupported cases are reported in `unsupportedIds` but do not change the exit status; diagnostic cases always do."
msgstr "不加该标志时，不支持的用例会在 `unsupportedIds` 中报告，但不影响退出状态；诊断用例则总会影响退出状态。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:72
msgid "`just conformance run interval` runs the phases listed in `testdata/interval/interpreter_stages.json` (files and operations per phase); add `--strict-supported` to forward strict mode to every phase."
msgstr "`just conformance run interval` 运行 `testdata/interval/interpreter_stages.json` 中列出的各阶段（每个阶段的文件与运算）；加上 `--strict-supported` 可将严格模式传递给每个阶段。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:75
msgid "[itl_expr tutorial](../frontend/itl_expr.md) explains the cases and the pass rule."
msgstr "[itl_expr 教程](../frontend/itl_expr.md) 解释了用例和通过规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:80
msgid "**No `--json` option.** The output is always JSON; passing `--json` is an unknown option (exit `2`)."
msgstr "**没有 `--json` 选项。** 输出总是 JSON；传入 `--json` 会被视为未知选项（退出码 `2`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:82
msgid "**No sharding.** ITL files are small; the tooling parallelizes by phase."
msgstr "**不支持分片。** ITL 文件很小；工具链按阶段并行。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:83
msgid "**All parse diagnostics are printed** as `PATH: MESSAGE`, and the run stops, even when the bad statement belongs to an operation you did not select."
msgstr "**打印所有解析诊断**，格式为 `PATH: MESSAGE`，并终止运行，即使出错的语句属于你未选择的运算也是如此。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/itl_expr_cli.md:85
msgid "**Strict mode counts unknown operations.** Without `--operation`, cases such as `nums2interval 1.0 2.0 = …` are unsupported; they do not change the exit status unless `--strict-supported` is given."
msgstr "**严格模式会计入未知运算。** 不使用 `--operation` 时，诸如 `nums2interval 1.0 2.0 = …` 的用例是不支持的；除非给出 `--strict-supported`，否则它们不会改变退出状态。"

