msgstr "**每次调用只处理一个文件。** 多余的路径、缺失的路径以及分片选项，都会打印用法行并以 `2` 退出。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:75
msgid "**A lone option is read as a path.** `mpfr --help` reports `cannot read file: --help`, not the usage line."
msgstr "**单独的选项会被当作路径读取。** `mpfr --help` 报告的是 `cannot read file: --help`，而不是用法行。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md:77
msgid "**Format detection is textual.** A square-root file that happens to contain `input_coefficient_hex` in a comment is parsed as power data."
msgstr "**格式检测基于文本。** 若平方根文件恰好在注释中包含 `input_coefficient_hex`，它会被当作幂运算数据解析。"

