msgstr "与 `testfloat_gen` 的选项保持一致"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:12
msgid "split a large file over processes"
msgstr "把大文件拆分到多个进程"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:15
msgid "run the whole TestFloat matrix"
msgstr "运行完整的 TestFloat 矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:19
msgid "The executable is built from a checkout of the repository with `just conformance build binary`."
msgstr "该可执行文件需从仓库的检出副本用 `just conformance build binary` 构建。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:22
msgid "Generate vectors with TestFloat's `testfloat_gen` and run them. `just conformance fetch binary` downloads the pinned SoftFloat and TestFloat sources; `just conformance run binary` builds `testfloat_gen` from them into `.tmp/binfloat-conformance/vendor/TestFloat-3e/build/Linux-x86_64-GCC/`."
msgstr "用 TestFloat 的 `testfloat_gen` 生成向量并运行它们。`just conformance fetch binary` 下载固定版本的 SoftFloat 和 TestFloat 源码；`just conformance run binary` 用这些源码把 `testfloat_gen` 构建到 `.tmp/binfloat-conformance/vendor/TestFloat-3e/build/Linux-x86_64-GCC/` 中。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:45
msgid "After `moon add Luna-Flow/floating@0.8.0`, import `\"Luna-Flow/floating/cli/testfloat_expr_cli\"` in `moon.pkg` and call `run` with the same arguments:"
msgstr "执行 `moon add Luna-Flow/floating@0.8.0` 之后，在 `moon.pkg` 中导入 `\"Luna-Flow/floating/cli/testfloat_expr_cli\"`，并以相同的参数调用 `run`："

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:57
msgid "Match the generator options"
msgstr "与生成器选项保持一致"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:59
msgid "Pass the same function, rounding and tininess as the generator, and `--exact` when the vectors were generated with `-exact`:"
msgstr "传入与生成器相同的函数、舍入模式和微小性（tininess）判定方式；若向量是用 `-exact` 生成的，还要加上 `--exact`："

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:67
msgid "Shard a large file"
msgstr "对大文件分片"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:73
msgid "Shard `i` runs the vectors whose index is `i` modulo the shard count."
msgstr "分片 `i` 运行索引对分片数取模等于 `i` 的向量。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:77
msgid "`--json` prints `function`, `rounding`, `tininess`, `exact`, `totalCases`, `selectedCases`, `passedCases`, `failedCases` and `failedIds` (`FUNCTION:LINE`)."
msgstr "`--json` 打印 `function`、`rounding`、`tininess`、`exact`、`totalCases`、`selectedCases`、`passedCases`、`failedCases` 和 `failedIds`（`FUNCTION:LINE`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:83
msgid "`just conformance run binary --level 1 --tininess after --tininess before` plans the full matrix, streams `testfloat_gen` output in chunks into temporary files, runs this runner on each chunk, and remaps the line-based ids to global vector numbers."
msgstr "`just conformance run binary --level 1 --tininess after --tininess before` 规划完整矩阵，将 `testfloat_gen` 的输出分块流式写入临时文件，对每一块运行此运行器，并把基于行号的 id 重新映射为全局向量编号。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:87
msgid "[testfloat_expr tutorial](../frontend/testfloat_expr.md) explains the pass rule."
msgstr "[testfloat_expr 教程](../frontend/testfloat_expr.md) 解释了通过规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:92
msgid "**Exactly one file.** A second path is an error."
msgstr "**只能有一个文件。** 第二个路径会报错。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:93
msgid "**Rounding defaults to `rnear_even`.** Always pass the generator's mode."
msgstr "**舍入模式默认为 `rnear_even`。** 务必传入生成器所用的模式。"

#: manual/tutorial/cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md:94
msgid "**Ids are line numbers of the file you pass.** When you split a stream into chunks, keep track of the offset yourself."
msgstr "**id 是所传文件中的行号。** 将数据流拆分为块时，需要自行记录偏移量。"

