#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:24
msgid "A passing run ends with `passed: N, failed: 0`. The suite is also part of `just pr`, which runs every native test of the module."
msgstr "通过的运行以 `passed: N, failed: 0` 结尾。该套件也是 `just pr` 的一部分，后者会运行模块的所有 native 测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:29
msgid "Run one test"
msgstr "运行单个测试"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:36
msgid "Add a cross-package law"
msgstr "添加跨包定律"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:38
msgid "Write a white-box test in `core_wbtest.mbt` (arithmetic laws) or `api_audit_wbtest.mbt` (observable API behaviour). State the law against an exact oracle whenever possible:"
msgstr "在 `core_wbtest.mbt`（算术定律）或 `api_audit_wbtest.mbt`（可观察的 API 行为）中编写白盒测试。尽可能以精确预言（oracle）来表述定律："

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:55
msgid "Use official decTest rows as fixed witnesses when you test GDA cohort or flag rules, and quote the row id in the test name."
msgstr "测试 GDA 同值类（cohort）或标志规则时，使用官方 decTest 行作为固定的见证，并在测试名中注明该行的 id。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:58
msgid "Decide where a test belongs"
msgstr "确定测试的归属"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:60
msgid "A law about one package goes into that package's own tests. A test belongs here when it needs two or more packages, or `internal` helpers from outside their package, or an oracle such as `semantic` exact rationals."
msgstr "只涉及单个包的定律放在该包自己的测试中。当测试需要两个或更多包、需要在 `internal` 辅助函数所属包之外使用它们，或者需要诸如 `semantic` 精确有理数这样的预言时，才应放在这里。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:66
msgid "The conformance corpora ([verification](../verification.md)) check each core against external references; this suite checks the cores against each other and against exact arithmetic."
msgstr "符合性语料（[验证](../verification.md)）将每个核心与外部参考进行比对；本套件则将各核心相互比对，并与精确算术比对。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:69
msgid "[internal tutorial](internal.md) shows the helpers several tests exercise."
msgstr "[internal 教程](internal.md) 展示了若干测试所用到的辅助函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:73
msgid "**Run from a workspace.** The package imports sibling Luna-Flow modules; use the repository wrapper or a workspace that resolves them."
msgstr "**在工作区中运行。** 该包导入了同级的 Luna-Flow 模块；请使用仓库的包装脚本，或使用能解析这些模块的工作区。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:75
msgid "**Keep tests deterministic.** Use fixed seeds and explicit contexts; no test may depend on timing or the target's `Double` formatting."
msgstr "**保持测试确定性。** 使用固定的随机种子和显式的上下文；任何测试都不得依赖计时或目标平台的 `Double` 格式化方式。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:80
msgid "[consistency API](../api/consistency.md) for the file layout."
msgstr "[consistency API](../api/consistency.md)：文件布局。"

#: manual/tutorial/consistency.md:81
msgid "[consistency design](../design/consistency.md) for what the suite proves."
msgstr "[consistency 设计](../design/consistency.md)：该套件所证明的内容。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:1
msgid "decimal tutorial"
msgstr "decimal 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to compute with decimal numbers that behave the way people write them: `0.1 + 0.2` is exactly `0.3`, `12.30` remembers that it has two decimal places, and every rounding is chosen by you and reported back to you. You will parse and format values, compute under a context and read its flags, round money with `quantize`, exchange decimal64 bits, and call certified elementary functions. The mathematics behind each step is in the [decimal design](../design/decimal.md); every function is specified in the [decimal API](../api/decimal.md)."
msgstr "本教程展示如何使用行为与人们书写方式一致的十进制数进行计算：`0.1 + 0.2` 恰好等于 `0.3`，`12.30` 记得自己有两位小数，每一次舍入都由你选择并向你报告。你将解析和格式化值，在上下文下计算并读取其标志，用 `quantize` 对金额舍入，交换 decimal64 位模式，并调用经过认证的初等函数。每一步背后的数学见 [decimal 设计](../design/decimal.md)；每个函数都在 [decimal API](../api/decimal.md) 中有规定。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:14
msgid "parse an amount and keep its decimal places"
msgstr "解析金额并保留其小数位数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:15
msgid "compute with a fixed precision and see what was rounded"
msgstr "以固定精度计算并查看哪些被舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:15
msgid "[`*_ctx` operations and `DecimalFlags`](#compute-under-a-context-and-keep-the-flags)"
msgstr "[`*_ctx` 运算与 `DecimalFlags`](#compute-under-a-context-and-keep-the-flags)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:16
msgid "round money to cents, half-even or half-up"
msgstr "把金额舍入到分，采用 half-even 或 half-up"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:17
msgid "get a guaranteed lower and upper bound"
msgstr "获得有保证的下界和上界"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:17
msgid "[directed rounding](#bound-a-result-from-both-sides)"
msgstr "[定向舍入](#bound-a-result-from-both-sides)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:18
msgid "read or write decimal64 bits (DPD or BID)"
msgstr "读写 decimal64 位模式（DPD 或 BID）"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:19
msgid "take a logarithm or an exponential"
msgstr "求对数或指数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:20
msgid "run generic `Ring` code on decimals"
msgstr "在十进制数上运行泛型 `Ring` 代码"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:20
msgid "[the algebra traits](#generic-code-over-the-algebra-traits)"
msgstr "[代数 trait](#generic-code-over-the-algebra-traits)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:21
msgid "sort stored values deterministically"
msgstr "确定性地对存储的值排序"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:22
msgid "accumulate flags over a long pipeline"
msgstr "在长流水线中累积标志"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:26
#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:27
msgid "Add `floating` to your module:"
msgstr "把 `floating` 加入你的模块："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:32
msgid "and import the package in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "然后在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:40
msgid "The smallest useful program adds two decimal fractions that a `Double` cannot represent:"
msgstr "最小的实用程序把两个 `Double` 无法表示的十进制小数相加："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:53
msgid "`0.1` is $1/10$, and no power of two is divisible by 5, so binary floating point can only approximate it; decimal floating point stores it exactly."
msgstr "`0.1` 是 $1/10$，而 2 的幂都不能被 5 整除，因此二进制浮点只能近似它；十进制浮点则能精确存储它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:58
msgid "Parse amounts and keep their scale"
msgstr "解析金额并保留其小数位数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:60
msgid "Parsing keeps the exponent of the text. Two values can be equal and still carry different information:"
msgstr "解析会保留文本中的指数。两个值可以相等却携带不同的信息："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:76
msgid "`12.30` and `12.3` are two members of the same *cohort*: numerically equal, written with different exponents. `normalized()` picks the shortest member. Do not call it on amounts whose number of decimal places matters; call it when you want a canonical key."
msgstr "`12.30` 和 `12.3` 是同一个*同值类*（cohort）的两个成员：数值相等，但以不同的指数书写。`normalized()` 选取最短的成员。不要对小数位数有意义的金额调用它；需要规范键时才调用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:81
msgid "Integers are built reduced: `Decimal::from_int(1000)` is stored as $1 \\times 10^{3}$ and prints as `1E+3`. Parse `\"1000\"` when you want the four digits."
msgstr "整数以约简形式构造：`Decimal::from_int(1000)` 存储为 $1 \\times 10^{3}$，打印为 `1E+3`。需要四位数字时请解析 `\"1000\"`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:84
msgid "Compute under a context and keep the flags"
msgstr "在上下文下计算并保留标志"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:86
msgid "A `DecimalContext` fixes the precision, rounding mode and exponent range. Each `*_ctx` operation returns the result and the flags it raised. Combine the flags as you go:"
msgstr "`DecimalContext` 确定精度、舍入模式和指数范围。每个 `*_ctx` 运算都返回结果及其引发的标志。边计算边合并标志："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:105
msgid "`inexact` tells you that $100/3 \\cdot 3$ was not computed exactly; it is not an error, so `has_error()` stays false. `has_error()` reports invalid operations, unparsable text, division by zero, impossible divisions and invalid contexts. Check the individual flags (`overflow`, `underflow`, `inexact`) when your application cares about them."
msgstr "`inexact` 告诉你 $100/3 \\cdot 3$ 没有被精确计算；它不是错误，因此 `has_error()` 仍为 false。`has_error()` 报告无效运算、无法解析的文本、除以零、不可能的除法和无效上下文。当你的应用关心 `overflow`、`underflow`、`inexact` 这些标志时，请逐个检查。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:112
msgid "Round money with `quantize`"
msgstr "用 `quantize` 对金额舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:114
msgid "`quantize` gives a value the exponent of a template value. Choose the rounding mode in the context; commercial rounding is `HalfUp`, which the shared `RoundingMode` enum does not have, so pass `decimal_rounding`:"
msgstr "`quantize` 使一个值具有模板值的指数。在上下文中选择舍入模式；商业舍入是 `HalfUp`，共享的 `RoundingMode` 枚举中没有它，因此请传入 `decimal_rounding`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:136
msgid "Half-even (\"banker's\") rounding sends the tie `2.345` to the even last digit `4`; half-up sends it away from zero. `quantize` never silently picks another exponent: if the result would need more digits than the precision, you get NaN with `invalid_operation`."
msgstr "半偶（“银行家”）舍入把平局 `2.345` 送到末位为偶数的 `4`；半上舍入则把它送向远离零的方向。`quantize` 从不悄悄选择另一个指数：如果结果所需的位数超过精度，你会得到带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:141
msgid "Bound a result from both sides"
msgstr "从两侧界定结果"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:143
msgid "Directed rounding gives guaranteed bounds. Rounding the same quotient toward $-\\infty$ and toward $+\\infty$ brackets the exact value:"
msgstr "定向舍入给出有保证的界。把同一个商分别向 $-\\infty$ 和向 $+\\infty$ 舍入，即可夹住精确值："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:159
msgid "The two results are adjacent decimal32 values, and $1/7$ lies strictly between them."
msgstr "两个结果是相邻的 decimal32 值，$1/7$ 严格位于它们之间。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:162
msgid "Exchange decimal64 bits"
msgstr "交换 decimal64 位模式"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:164
msgid "Interchange formats are what databases, files and other languages exchange. Encode in the encoding your peer expects, and decode with the same one:"
msgstr "交换格式是数据库、文件和其他语言之间交换数据所用的格式。请用对方期望的编码进行编码，并用同一编码解码："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:185
msgid "Both encodings keep the exponent, so `19.99` comes back with two decimal places. Bits you did not produce yourself may be non-canonical; keep them in a `DecimalInterchange` and call `canonical()` before comparing bit patterns."
msgstr "两种编码都保留指数，因此 `19.99` 读回时仍有两位小数。不是你自己产生的位模式可能是非规范的；把它们保存在 `DecimalInterchange` 中，并在比较位模式之前调用 `canonical()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:189
msgid "Call an elementary function"
msgstr "调用初等函数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:191
msgid "Logarithms, exponentials, powers and trigonometric functions are certified: the result is the correctly rounded value in every rounding mode, or an explicit failure. They need a context with a bounded exponent range, such as a format preset:"
msgstr "对数、指数、幂和三角函数都经过认证：结果在每种舍入模式下都是正确舍入的值，或者是一个明确的失败。它们需要一个指数范围有界的上下文，例如某个格式预设："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:212
msgid "`try_ln_ctx` returns `Err` only if the result could not be certified within the refinement budget; `ln_ctx` turns that case into NaN with `invalid_operation`. Exact results such as $\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$ come back without `inexact`."
msgstr "`try_ln_ctx` 只在结果无法在细化预算内认证时返回 `Err`；`ln_ctx` 把这种情形变为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN。$\\log_{10} 1000 = 3$ 这类精确结果返回时不带 `inexact`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:219
msgid "Generic code over the algebra traits"
msgstr "基于代数 trait 的泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:221
msgid "`Decimal` implements `Ring` from [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) through its plain operators, so generic code runs on it unchanged:"
msgstr "`Decimal` 通过其普通运算符实现了 [luna-generic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 的 `Ring`，因此泛型代码无需修改即可在其上运行："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:241
msgid "The plain operators have no context: `*` is exact, `+` rounds to the larger operand precision (34 digits by default) and returns the shortest cohort member. Code that needs a precision, an exponent range or flags should take a `DecimalContext` and call the `*_ctx` operations."
msgstr "普通运算符没有上下文：`*` 是精确的，`+` 舍入到较大的操作数精度（默认 34 位）并返回同值类中最短的成员。需要精度、指数范围或标志的代码应接收一个 `DecimalContext` 并调用 `*_ctx` 运算。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:246
msgid "The shared contextual traits"
msgstr "共享的 contextual trait"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:248
msgid "Code written against [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) uses `ArithmeticContext` and gets an `ArithmeticOutcome` with diagnostics:"
msgstr "针对 [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 编写的代码使用 `ArithmeticContext`，并得到带诊断信息的 `ArithmeticOutcome`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:267
msgid "Errors (`invalid_operation`, `division_by_zero`, …) become `Err`; inexactness and range events become diagnostics."
msgstr "错误（`invalid_operation`、`division_by_zero`……）变为 `Err`；不精确和范围事件变为诊断信息。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:270
msgid "Pipelines, GDA status and intervals"
msgstr "流水线、GDA 状态与区间"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:272
msgid "[`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) wraps a value, its context and its accumulated flags, so a long pipeline does not need explicit `combine` calls."
msgstr "[`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md) 包装一个值、它的上下文及其累积的标志，因此长流水线无需显式调用 `combine`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:275
msgid "[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) implements the General Decimal Arithmetic model with sticky status and traps. Its values are a separate type; use it when you need `.decTest` behaviour, not IEEE per-operation flags."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md) 实现了带粘滞状态和陷阱的通用十进制算术模型。它的值是一个独立的类型；当你需要 `.decTest` 的行为而不是 IEEE 的逐运算标志时，请使用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:278
msgid "To enclose a decimal value in a binary interval, convert it twice with `to_bin_float(mode=TowardNegative)` and `to_bin_float(mode=TowardPositive)` and build a [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) ball from both bounds."
msgstr "要把十进制值包络在二进制区间中，可分别用 `to_bin_float(mode=TowardNegative)` 和 `to_bin_float(mode=TowardPositive)` 转换两次，再以这两个界构造一个 [`ball_float`](ball_float.md) 球。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:282
msgid "A deterministic order for storage"
msgstr "用于存储的确定性顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:284
msgid "`compare_total` orders every representation, including cohorts, signed zeros and NaNs, so it is the right key for sorting stored values or deduplicating bit-exact records:"
msgstr "`compare_total` 对每种表示（包括同值类、带符号零和 NaN）都给出顺序，因此它是对存储值排序或对逐位相同的记录去重的合适键："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:300
msgid "**Elementary functions need a bounded context.** `DecimalContext::new()` has the exponent range $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$, which is outside what the elementary functions accept; they return NaN with `invalid_context`. Use `decimal32()`/`decimal64()`/`decimal128()` or pass `e_min`/`e_max` within $\\pm 999\\,999$."
msgstr "**初等函数需要有界上下文。** `DecimalContext::new()` 的指数范围为 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$，超出了初等函数所接受的范围；它们会返回带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN。请使用 `decimal32()`/`decimal64()`/`decimal128()`，或传入 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内的 `e_min`/`e_max`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:305
msgid "**Operators are not context operations.** `*` never rounds, so repeated products grow without bound; `/` rounds half-even to the operand precision and applies no exponent range. Use `mul_ctx` and `div_ctx` when the result must be bounded, rounded in another mode, or reported through flags."
msgstr "**运算符不是上下文运算。** `*` 从不舍入，因此反复相乘会无限增长；`/` 按半值取偶（half-even）舍入到操作数精度，且不应用指数范围。当结果必须有界、以其他模式舍入或通过标志报告时，请使用 `mul_ctx` 和 `div_ctx`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:309
msgid "**`==` is not IEEE equality.** `Eq` and `compare` treat every NaN as equal to every NaN and greater than every number, so sorting works. Use `compare_checked` or `is_nan` when a NaN must be unordered."
msgstr "**`==` 不是 IEEE 相等。** `Eq` 和 `compare` 把每个 NaN 视为与每个 NaN 相等且大于每个数，这样排序才能正常工作。当 NaN 必须无序时，请使用 `compare_checked` 或 `is_nan`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:312
msgid "**`has_error()` is narrow.** It ignores `inexact`, `overflow` and `underflow`. Check those flags yourself when they matter, for example `overflow` after a long product."
msgstr "**`has_error()` 的范围很窄。** 它忽略 `inexact`、`overflow` 和 `underflow`。当这些标志重要时，请自行检查，例如在长乘积之后检查 `overflow`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:315
msgid "**The checked powers convert the exponent at context precision.** `pow_int_checked` and `pow_nat_checked` turn the integer exponent into a `Decimal` with the context precision, so an exponent with more digits than the precision is rounded before the power is taken. Keep $|n| < 10^{p}$ or call `pown_ctx`, which converts the exponent exactly."
msgstr "**checked 幂运算按上下文精度转换指数。** `pow_int_checked` 和 `pow_nat_checked` 会把整数指数转换为具有上下文精度的 `Decimal`，因此位数超过精度的指数会在求幂之前被舍入。请保持 $|n| < 10^{p}$，或调用会精确转换指数的 `pown_ctx`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:320
msgid "**`with_rounding` cannot choose `HalfUp`, `HalfDown` or `ZeroFiveUp`.** Build the context with `DecimalContext::new(decimal_rounding=...)`."
msgstr "**`with_rounding` 无法选择 `HalfUp`、`HalfDown` 或 `ZeroFiveUp`。** 请用 `DecimalContext::new(decimal_rounding=...)` 构造上下文。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:322
msgid "**Binary conversions lose decimal meaning.** `from_double(0.1)` is the exact binary value `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827` (rounded to 34 digits), not `0.1`; parse text instead."
msgstr "**二进制转换会丢失十进制含义。** `from_double(0.1)` 是精确的二进制值 `0.1000000000000000055511151231257827`（舍入到 34 位），而不是 `0.1`；请改为解析文本。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:328
msgid "[decimal API](../api/decimal.md): every type and function with its exact semantics."
msgstr "[decimal API](../api/decimal.md)：每个类型和函数及其精确语义。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:330
msgid "[decimal design](../design/decimal.md): formats, cohorts, encodings, rounding, error bounds and certification."
msgstr "[decimal 设计](../design/decimal.md)：格式、同值类、编码、舍入、误差界与认证。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:332
msgid "[decimal conformance](../conformance/decimal.md) and [decimal performance](../performance/decimal.md): the finite evidence and the measurement method."
msgstr "[decimal 符合性](../conformance/decimal.md)和 [decimal 性能](../performance/decimal.md)：有限的证据与测量方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal.md:335
msgid "[`decimal_checked` tutorial](decimal_checked.md) and [`decimal_gda` tutorial](decimal_gda.md) for pipelines and GDA status."
msgstr "关于流水线与 GDA 状态，见 [`decimal_checked` 教程](decimal_checked.md)和 [`decimal_gda` 教程](decimal_gda.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_checked tutorial"
msgstr "decimal_checked 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to run an IEEE decimal calculation as one pipeline that remembers every exceptional condition: you fix a `DecimalContext`, start a `DecimalChecked` from a string or number, apply operations, and at the end read the value together with the union of all flags raised on the way. The typical use is an auditable calculation (money, measurements) where \"was anything rounded?\" or \"did anything overflow?\" must be answered for the whole computation, not for the last step. Arithmetic comes from [`decimal`](decimal.md); the [design page](../design/decimal_checked.md) gives the algebra of flag accumulation; the [API reference](../api/decimal_checked.md) lists every method."
msgstr "本教程展示如何把一次 IEEE 十进制计算作为一条记住每个异常情形的流水线来运行：你确定一个 `DecimalContext`，从字符串或数开始一个 `DecimalChecked`，依次应用运算，最后读取值以及途中引发的所有标志的并集。典型用途是可审计的计算（金额、测量值），其中“是否有任何舍入？”或“是否有任何上溢？”必须针对整个计算而不是最后一步来回答。算术来自 [`decimal`](decimal.md)；[设计页面](../design/decimal_checked.md)给出了标志累积的代数；[API 参考](../api/decimal_checked.md)列出了所有方法。"

