msgstr "从文本或数值开始一条流水线"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:17
msgid "know whether any step rounded"
msgstr "知道是否有任何步骤发生了舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:18
msgid "see what only the last step did"
msgstr "只查看最后一步做了什么"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:19
msgid "continue after a division by zero"
msgstr "在除以零之后继续"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:19
msgid "[flagged values](#keep-going-after-a-division-by-zero)"
msgstr "[带标志的值](#keep-going-after-a-division-by-zero)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:20
msgid "start a new audit period"
msgstr "开始新的审计周期"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:21
msgid "call `ln`, `exp` or `power` in a pipeline"
msgstr "在流水线中调用 `ln`、`exp` 或 `power`"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:21
msgid "[a bounded context](#elementary-functions-need-a-bounded-context)"
msgstr "[有界上下文](#elementary-functions-need-a-bounded-context)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:22
msgid "use an `ArithmeticContext`"
msgstr "使用 `ArithmeticContext`"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:23
msgid "hand the result to the contextual traits"
msgstr "把结果交给上下文 trait"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:33
msgid "and import both packages in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "然后在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入这两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:42
msgid "Divide 10 by 4 in decimal64 and check that the result is exact:"
msgstr "在 decimal64 下计算 10 除以 4，并检查结果是否精确："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:58
#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:58
msgid "The examples list flags with this helper:"
msgstr "示例使用如下辅助函数列出标志："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:78
msgid "Audit a price calculation"
msgstr "审计价格计算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:80
msgid "Compute a price with tax, rounded to cents. `raised()` describes the last step and `flags()` the whole pipeline:"
msgstr "计算含税价格并舍入到分。`raised()` 描述最后一步，`flags()` 描述整条流水线："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:96
msgid "The multiplication is exact ($19.99 \\times 1.0825 = 21.639175$); only the quantization to cents rounds, and the pipeline records that."
msgstr "乘法是精确的（$19.99 \\times 1.0825 = 21.639175$）；只有量化到分时发生了舍入，流水线记录了这一点。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:99
msgid "Find out that an earlier step rounded"
msgstr "发现先前某一步发生了舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:101
msgid "Flags of earlier steps stay in `flags()` even when later steps are exact:"
msgstr "即使后续步骤是精确的，先前步骤的标志也会保留在 `flags()` 中："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:116
msgid "Keep going after a division by zero"
msgstr "除以零之后继续执行"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:118
msgid "IEEE decimal arithmetic defines a result for every operation. Dividing by zero gives an infinity and the `division_by_zero` flag; the pipeline continues and the flag is kept:"
msgstr "IEEE 十进制算术为每个运算都定义了结果。除以零得到无穷和 `division_by_zero` 标志；流水线继续执行，标志被保留："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:135
msgid "Decide at the end what the flags mean for your application, for example with `DecimalFlags::has_error`, which is true when any of `invalid_operation`, `conversion_syntax`, `division_by_zero`, `division_impossible`, `division_undefined` or `invalid_context` is set."
msgstr "最后再决定这些标志对你的应用意味着什么，例如使用 `DecimalFlags::has_error`，只要 `invalid_operation`、`conversion_syntax`、`division_by_zero`、`division_impossible`、`division_undefined` 或 `invalid_context` 中任一被设置，它就为真。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:140
msgid "Start a new audit period"
msgstr "开始新的审计周期"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:142
msgid "`clear_flags` resets both the raised and the accumulated flags without touching the value:"
msgstr "`clear_flags` 同时重置最近引发的标志和累积的标志，而不改动值："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:159
msgid "Multiplying the 16-digit quotient by ten is exact, so the second phase reports no flags although the first one rounded."
msgstr "把 16 位的商乘以十是精确的，因此尽管第一阶段发生了舍入，第二阶段也不报告任何标志。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:164
msgid "Elementary functions need a bounded context"
msgstr "初等函数需要有界上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:166
msgid "Mathematical functions (`exp`, `ln`, `power`, the trigonometric family, …) follow the General Decimal Arithmetic restriction to precision and exponent limits within $\\pm 999\\,999$. Use one of the interchange contexts or explicit bounds; with the default unbounded range they return NaN with `invalid_context`:"
msgstr "数学函数（`exp`、`ln`、`power`、三角函数族……）遵循通用十进制算术的限制，精度和指数界须在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内。请使用某个交换格式上下文或显式的界；在默认的无界范围下，它们会返回带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:188
msgid "Start from a Luna-Flow/arithmetic context"
msgstr "从 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 上下文开始"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:190
msgid "Code that is generic over Luna-Flow/arithmetic carries an `ArithmeticContext`. `DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` maps its precision, rounding direction, exponent bounds and clamp flag; the predefined `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` maps to the same context as `DecimalContext::decimal64()`:"
msgstr "基于 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 的泛型代码携带一个 `ArithmeticContext`。`DecimalContext::from_arithmetic_context` 映射其精度、舍入方向、指数界和 clamp 标志；预定义的 `ArithmeticContext::decimal64()` 映射到与 `DecimalContext::decimal64()` 相同的上下文："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:208
msgid "Hand the result to the contextual traits"
msgstr "把结果交给 contextual trait"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:210
msgid "`result()` returns `Ok((value, flags))` or the recorded error. The `AddContextual`, `SqrtContextual`, … implementations of `Decimal` in Luna-Flow/arithmetic report diagnostics instead of flags; the six shared conditions (`inexact`, `rounded`, `overflow`, `underflow`, `subnormal`, `clamped`) can be carried over field by field:"
msgstr "`result()` 返回 `Ok((value, flags))` 或记录下的错误。`Decimal` 在 Luna-Flow/arithmetic 中的 `AddContextual`、`SqrtContextual`……实现报告的是诊断信息而不是标志；六种共享的情形（`inexact`、`rounded`、`overflow`、`underflow`、`subnormal`、`clamped`）可以逐字段转移过去："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:242
msgid "The [design page](../design/decimal_checked.md#from-flags-to-arithmetic-diagnostics) shows why converting the accumulated flags once gives the same diagnostics as combining the per-step diagnostics."
msgstr "[设计页面](../design/decimal_checked.md#from-flags-to-arithmetic-diagnostics)说明了为什么一次性转换累积的标志与合并逐步的诊断信息结果相同。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:248
msgid "**`raised()` is not the whole story.** It describes the latest step only; audit with `flags()`."
msgstr "**`raised()` 并不是全部。** 它只描述最近一步；审计请用 `flags()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:250
msgid "**Exceptional results are not errors.** NaN, infinities and rounded values are successes with flags. `is_err()` is true only for certification failures of elementary functions."
msgstr "**异常结果不是错误。** NaN、无穷和舍入后的值都是带标志的成功结果。`is_err()` 只在初等函数认证失败时为真。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:253
msgid "**Unbounded contexts disable the mathematical functions.** See above; this also applies to contexts built from an `ArithmeticContext` without `e_min` / `e_max`."
msgstr "**无界上下文会禁用数学函数。** 见上文；这同样适用于由不带 `e_min` / `e_max` 的 `ArithmeticContext` 构造的上下文。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:256
msgid "**Binary sources.** `from_double(0.1, …)` converts the binary value of `0.1` rounded to 17 digits, not one tenth and not the exact binary value (in decimal128 it is `0.10000000000000001`); parse the string `\"0.1\"` instead."
msgstr "**二进制来源。** `from_double(0.1, …)` 转换的是 `0.1` 的二进制值舍入到 17 位数字后的结果，既不是十分之一，也不是精确的二进制值（在 decimal128 中为 `0.10000000000000001`）；请改为解析字符串 `\"0.1\"`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:260
msgid "**`remainder` is the IEEE remainder.** It rounds the quotient to the nearest integer, so `1` remainder `0.6` is `-0.2`, not `0.4`."
msgstr "**`remainder` 是 IEEE 余数。** 它把商舍入到最近的整数，因此 `1` 对 `0.6` 取余的结果是 `-0.2`，而不是 `0.4`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:262
msgid "**Operands are plain `Decimal` values.** They are not rounded to the context before the operation; the operation rounds the result."
msgstr "**操作数是普通的 `Decimal` 值。** 它们在运算之前不会按上下文舍入；运算会对结果舍入。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:264
msgid "**`clear_flags` also works after an error,** but the error stays."
msgstr "**`clear_flags` 在出错之后也能使用，** 但错误仍然保留。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:268
msgid "[`decimal_checked` design](../design/decimal_checked.md): the state model, the flag monoid and the short-circuit rule."
msgstr "[`decimal_checked` 设计](../design/decimal_checked.md)：状态模型、标志幺半群与短路规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:270
msgid "[`decimal_checked` API](../api/decimal_checked.md): every method."
msgstr "[`decimal_checked` API](../api/decimal_checked.md)：所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:271
msgid "[`decimal` tutorial](decimal.md): contexts, rounding modes and interchange formats."
msgstr "[`decimal` 教程](decimal.md)：上下文、舍入模式与交换格式。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_checked.md:273
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` tutorial](decimal_gda_checked.md): the same idea for General Decimal Arithmetic with sticky status and traps."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` 教程](decimal_gda_checked.md)：同一思路在带粘滞状态和陷阱的通用十进制算术上的应用。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda tutorial"
msgstr "decimal_gda 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:3
msgid "This tutorial teaches you to compute with `decimal_gda`, the package that implements Cowlishaw's General Decimal Arithmetic (GDA): decimal numbers that keep their trailing zeros, a context that fixes precision, rounding and exponent limits, sticky status that records what happened, and traps that stop a calculation while still handing you the defined result. By the end you can thread a context through a calculation, round money, handle traps, overflow and underflow, call the elementary functions and pick the right comparison. The mathematics behind each rule is on the [design page](../design/decimal_gda.md); every public name is on the [API page](../api/decimal_gda.md)."
msgstr "本教程教你使用 `decimal_gda` 进行计算。该包实现了 Cowlishaw 的通用十进制算术（GDA）：保留尾随零的十进制数，确定精度、舍入和指数界限的上下文，记录所发生情况的粘滞状态，以及在终止计算的同时仍把确定结果交给你的陷阱。学完之后，你将能够在计算中传递上下文、对金额舍入、处理陷阱、上溢和下溢、调用初等函数，并选择合适的比较方式。每条规则背后的数学见[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda.md)；所有公开名称都在 [API 页面](../api/decimal_gda.md)上。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:15
msgid "Read a number under a context"
msgstr "在上下文下读取一个数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:16
msgid "Carry status from one operation to the next"
msgstr "把状态从一个运算传递到下一个运算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:17
msgid "Round an amount to cents"
msgstr "把金额舍入到分"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:18
msgid "Stop on a condition but keep the result"
msgstr "在某个条件下停止但保留结果"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:19
msgid "Control overflow and underflow"
msgstr "控制上溢与下溢"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:19
msgid "[exponent limits and rounding modes](#respect-the-exponent-range)"
msgstr "[指数界限与舍入模式](#respect-the-exponent-range)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:20
msgid "Compute `exp`, `ln`, `log10`, `sqrt` or `power`"
msgstr "计算 `exp`、`ln`、`log10`、`sqrt` 或 `power`"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:20
msgid "[elementary functions](#call-the-elementary-functions)"
msgstr "[初等函数](#call-the-elementary-functions)"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:21
msgid "Compare numbers or representations"
msgstr "比较数值或表示"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:22
msgid "Chain many operations without manual threading"
msgstr "串联多个运算而无需手动传递上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:23
msgid "Encode decimal32/64/128 bit patterns"
msgstr "编码 decimal32/64/128 位模式"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:33
msgid "Import the package in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入该包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:41
msgid "Every GDA operation takes its operands and a `GdaContext` and returns a `GdaOutcome`: the result, the context to use next, and the conditions this operation raised."
msgstr "每个 GDA 运算都接收操作数和一个 `GdaContext`，并返回一个 `GdaOutcome`：结果、下一步要使用的上下文，以及该运算引发的情形。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:58
msgid "`raised()` describes this one operation. `next_context().status()` is sticky: it collects every condition since the context was created or cleared."
msgstr "`raised()` 描述的是这一个运算。`next_context().status()` 是粘滞的：它收集自上下文创建或清除以来的所有情形。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:63
msgid "Thread the context through a calculation"
msgstr "在计算中传递上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:65
msgid "Status accumulates only when you pass each outcome's `next_context()` to the next operation. The context you started with never changes, because a context is a value, not a mutable object."
msgstr "只有把每个结果的 `next_context()` 传给下一个运算，状态才会累积。你最初使用的上下文永远不会改变，因为上下文是一个值，而不是可变对象。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:88
msgid "Keep and set the quantum"
msgstr "保留并设定量子"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:90
msgid "A GDA number is a coefficient and an exponent, so `2.50` and `2.5` are equal numbers with different exponents (different *quanta*). Arithmetic keeps the exponent that the exact result calls for, and `quantize` sets it explicitly. That is how you round an amount to cents:"
msgstr "GDA 数由系数和指数组成，因此 `2.50` 和 `2.5` 是相等的数，但指数不同（*量子*不同）。算术保留精确结果所要求的指数，而 `quantize` 显式地设定指数。这就是把金额舍入到分的方法："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:118
msgid "`reduce` goes the other way: it removes trailing zeros, so `reduce(7.50)` is `7.5`. Use it only when you really want the shortest cohort member."
msgstr "`reduce` 的作用正相反：它去除尾随零，因此 `reduce(7.50)` 是 `7.5`。只有在确实需要同值类中最短的成员时才使用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:121
msgid "Handle a trap without losing the result"
msgstr "处理陷阱而不丢失结果"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:123
msgid "Enable a trap by deriving a new context with `trap`. A trapped operation returns `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)`: the GDA-defined result is still there, and the sticky status is still updated."
msgstr "用 `trap` 派生出一个新上下文即可启用陷阱。被陷阱捕获的运算返回 `Trapped(signal, value, next_context, raised)`：GDA 定义的结果仍然在其中，粘滞状态也照样更新。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:145
msgid "An `InvalidOperation` trap also catches the four detailed invalid conditions (`ConversionSyntax`, `DivisionImpossible`, `DivisionUndefined`, `InvalidContext`). The basic context enables it, so a malformed literal traps:"
msgstr "`InvalidOperation` 陷阱也会捕获四种细分的无效情形（`ConversionSyntax`、`DivisionImpossible`、`DivisionUndefined`、`InvalidContext`）。basic 上下文启用了它，因此格式错误的字面量会触发陷阱："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:165
msgid "When one operation raises several trapped conditions, the package reports one of them by a fixed precedence (listed in the [API page](../api/decimal_gda.md#trap-selection)), so you never have to invent your own order."
msgstr "当一个运算引发多个被陷阱捕获的情形时，本包按固定的优先级（列于 [API 页面](../api/decimal_gda.md#trap-selection)）报告其中之一，因此你无需自行规定顺序。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:169
msgid "Respect the exponent range"
msgstr "遵守指数范围"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:171
msgid "A context bounds the adjusted exponent to `[e_min, e_max]`. Beyond `e_max` the result overflows; what it overflows *to* depends on the rounding mode. Below `e_min` the result becomes subnormal and loses digits:"
msgstr "上下文把调整后的指数限制在 `[e_min, e_max]` 之内。超出 `e_max` 时结果上溢；上溢*成*什么取决于舍入模式。低于 `e_min` 时结果成为次正规数并丢失数字："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:199
msgid "Call the elementary functions"
msgstr "调用初等函数"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:201
msgid "`sqrt`, `exp`, `ln` and `log10` are correctly rounded and always round half to even, whatever the context's rounding mode says. `power` with a non-integer exponent is also correctly rounded, but under the context's own rounding mode. As the GDA specification requires, `exp`, `ln`, `log10` and non-integer `power` only accept contexts with precision, `e_max` and `-e_min` at most 999,999; the decimal32/64/128 presets qualify, but the defaults of `GdaContext::new` and `context` (exponent range ±999,999,999) do not:"
msgstr "`sqrt`、`exp`、`ln` 和 `log10` 是正确舍入的，并且无论上下文的舍入模式如何，总是采用半偶舍入。非整数指数的 `power` 同样是正确舍入的，但使用上下文自身的舍入模式。按照 GDA 规范的要求，`exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和非整数 `power` 只接受精度、`e_max` 和 `-e_min` 都不超过 999,999 的上下文；decimal32/64/128 预设满足这一条件，而 `GdaContext::new` 和 `context` 的默认值（指数范围 ±999,999,999）不满足："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:233
msgid "Compare and print"
msgstr "比较与打印"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:235
msgid "`compare` is numeric and returns a decimal (`-1`, `0`, `1`, or NaN when an operand is NaN). `compare_total` orders representations, so it tells `2.50` from `2.5`. Printing a value gives its scientific string; `class_name` names its class:"
msgstr "`compare` 按数值比较并返回一个十进制数（`-1`、`0`、`1`，或在某个操作数为 NaN 时返回 NaN）。`compare_total` 对表示进行排序，因此能区分 `2.50` 和 `2.5`。打印一个值会得到其科学记数法字符串；`class_name` 给出其类别名称："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:267
msgid "Long chains with `decimal_gda_checked`"
msgstr "用 `decimal_gda_checked` 构建长链"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:269
msgid "Manual threading is clearest at boundaries. For a long linear pipeline, [`decimal_gda_checked`](decimal_gda_checked.md) keeps one outcome, threads the sticky context for you and stops after the first trap:"
msgstr "手动传递上下文在边界处最为清晰。对于较长的线性流水线，[`decimal_gda_checked`](decimal_gda_checked.md) 只保留一个结果，替你传递粘滞上下文，并在第一个陷阱之后停止："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:286
msgid "Generic code through `Luna-Flow/arithmetic`"
msgstr "通过 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 编写泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:288
msgid "`Decimal` implements the contextual traits of [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/), so code written against `AddContextual`, `DivContextual`, `SqrtContextual` and friends runs on it. These adapters use the five IEEE-style rounding modes of `ArithmeticContext`, report errors as `Err`, and know nothing about traps:"
msgstr "`Decimal` 实现了 [`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 的 contextual trait，因此针对 `AddContextual`、`DivContextual`、`SqrtContextual` 等编写的代码可以在其上运行。这些适配器使用 `ArithmeticContext` 的五种 IEEE 风格舍入模式，以 `Err` 报告错误，并且对陷阱一无所知："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:317
msgid "Subset arithmetic and lost digits"
msgstr "子集算术与丢失的数字"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:319
msgid "`GdaContext::basic()` is the GDA *basic default context*: precision 9, `HalfUp`, `extended=false`, with the `DivisionByZero`, `InvalidOperation`, `Overflow`, `Underflow` and `Clamped` traps enabled. A non-extended context rounds operands that are longer than the precision before using them and reports `LostDigits` when that loses information:"
msgstr "`GdaContext::basic()` 是 GDA 的*基本默认上下文*：精度 9、`HalfUp`、`extended=false`，并启用 `DivisionByZero`、`InvalidOperation`、`Overflow`、`Underflow` 和 `Clamped` 陷阱。非扩展上下文会在使用之前对长于精度的操作数进行舍入，并在因此丢失信息时报告 `LostDigits`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:339
msgid "`GdaInterchange` holds a decimal32, decimal64 or decimal128 bit pattern in the densely packed decimal (DPD) encoding, written as `#` and hexadecimal digits:"
msgstr "`GdaInterchange` 以密集压缩十进制（DPD）编码保存 decimal32、decimal64 或 decimal128 位模式，写作 `#` 加十六进制数字："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:354
msgid "**Reusing the original context.** Status only accumulates if you pass `next_context()` on. A trap set or status you put on a context also travels with every context derived from it."
msgstr "**重复使用原始上下文。** 只有把 `next_context()` 传递下去，状态才会累积。你在某个上下文上设置的陷阱集合或状态，也会随从它派生的每个上下文一起传递。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:357
msgid "**Treating `Trapped` as \"no value\".** A trap changes the variant, not the result; read the value with `value()` before you decide to stop."
msgstr "**把 `Trapped` 当作“没有值”。** 陷阱改变的是变体，而不是结果；在决定停止之前，请用 `value()` 读取值。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:359
msgid "**Expecting constructors to keep zeros.** `Decimal::from_int(100)` and `Decimal::make` remove trailing zeros, so `from_int(100)` prints `1E+2`. Use `Decimal::from_string(\"100\")` or `parse` when the quantum matters."
msgstr "**指望构造器保留零。** `Decimal::from_int(100)` 和 `Decimal::make` 会去除尾随零，因此 `from_int(100)` 打印为 `1E+2`。当量子重要时，请使用 `Decimal::from_string(\"100\")` 或 `parse`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:362
msgid "**Using the operators for GDA work.** `+`, `-`, `*` and `/` take no context: they round half-even to the larger operand precision (`*` is exact), never signal, and `+` and `/` return the shortest cohort member. Use the package functions whenever GDA results, flags or traps matter."
msgstr "**用运算符做 GDA 计算。** `+`、`-`、`*` 和 `/` 不接收上下文：它们以半偶舍入舍入到较大的操作数精度（`*` 是精确的），从不发出信号，并且 `+` 和 `/` 返回同值类中最短的成员。只要 GDA 的结果、标志或陷阱有意义，就请使用包中的函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:366
msgid "**Equality and NaN.** `==` and `compare` put every NaN equal to every other NaN and above every number (a total preorder, so sorting never aborts). Use `compare` (the package function), `compare_signal`, or `Decimal::compare_checked` when NaN must stay unordered."
msgstr "**相等性与 NaN。** `==` 和 `compare` 把每个 NaN 视为与其他所有 NaN 相等，并大于每个数（这是一个全预序，因此排序从不中止）。当 NaN 必须保持无序时，请使用 `compare`（包中的函数）、`compare_signal` 或 `Decimal::compare_checked`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:370
msgid "**Mixing the two decimal packages.** `@decimal_gda.Decimal` and `@decimal.Decimal` are different types with different contracts; cross between them through strings or interchange bits."
msgstr "**混用两个十进制包。** `@decimal_gda.Decimal` 和 `@decimal.Decimal` 是具有不同契约的不同类型；在它们之间转换请通过字符串或交换位模式。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:373
msgid "**Expecting `exp`, `ln`, `log10` or `sqrt` to follow the context rounding.** They always round half to even; only `power` follows the context."
msgstr "**指望 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 或 `sqrt` 遵循上下文的舍入。** 它们总是采用半偶舍入；只有 `power` 遵循上下文。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:375
msgid "**Calling `exp`, `ln`, `log10` or non-integer `power` with a default context.** `GdaContext::new()` and `context()` allow exponents up to ±999,999,999, which is outside the range these functions are defined for, so they return NaN and raise `InvalidContext` (an `InvalidOperation`). Use a preset or pass `e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999`. The same holds for an `ArithmeticContext` without `e_min` and `e_max`: no bounds are filled in for you, and `exp_contextual` returns `Err(unsupported)` with an `invalid context:` message naming the missing bounds."
msgstr "**用默认上下文调用 `exp`、`ln`、`log10` 或非整数 `power`。** `GdaContext::new()` 和 `context()` 允许指数达到 ±999,999,999，超出了这些函数有定义的范围，因此它们返回 NaN 并引发 `InvalidContext`（一种 `InvalidOperation`）。请使用预设，或传入 `e_min=-999_999, e_max=999_999`。未设置 `e_min` 和 `e_max` 的 `ArithmeticContext` 同样如此：不会替你补上边界，`exp_contextual` 返回 `Err(unsupported)`，其 `invalid context:` 消息会指出缺少的边界。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:386
msgid "[Design](../design/decimal_gda.md): the arithmetic model, ideal exponents, rounding functions, the signal and trap state machine, and how the elementary functions are certified."
msgstr "[设计](../design/decimal_gda.md)：算术模型、理想指数、舍入函数、信号与陷阱状态机，以及初等函数如何认证。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:389
msgid "[API reference](../api/decimal_gda.md): every type, function and method."
msgstr "[API 参考](../api/decimal_gda.md)：每个类型、函数和方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:390
msgid "[Conformance](../conformance/decimal_gda.md) and [performance](../performance/decimal_gda.md): the pinned test-suite result and how to measure speed."
msgstr "[符合性](../conformance/decimal_gda.md)和[性能](../performance/decimal_gda.md)：固定版本测试套件的结果以及如何测量速度。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:393
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` tutorial](decimal_gda_checked.md): trap short-circuiting and recovery in pipelines."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` 教程](decimal_gda_checked.md)：流水线中的陷阱短路与恢复。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda.md:395
msgid "[`decimal` tutorial](decimal.md): the IEEE 754 decimal model with per-operation flags."
msgstr "[`decimal` 教程](decimal.md)：带逐运算标志的 IEEE 754 十进制模型。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:1
msgid "decimal_gda_checked tutorial"
msgstr "decimal_gda_checked 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to run a General Decimal Arithmetic (GDA) calculation as a pipeline that honours GDA traps: you choose a `GdaContext` with the traps your application needs, start a `GdaDecimalChecked`, chain operations, detect the step that trapped, inspect the sticky status, and decide explicitly whether to continue. This is the model of Python's `decimal` module and of the GDA test suites: status flags are sticky, and an enabled trap stops the computation. The operations come from [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md); the [design page](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md) proves the status and trap laws; the [API reference](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md) lists every method."
msgstr "本教程展示如何把一次通用十进制算术（GDA）计算作为遵守 GDA 陷阱的流水线来运行：你选择一个带有应用所需陷阱的 `GdaContext`，开始一个 `GdaDecimalChecked`，串联运算，找出触发陷阱的步骤，检查粘滞状态，并显式决定是否继续。这正是 Python 的 `decimal` 模块和 GDA 测试套件所采用的模型：状态标志是粘滞的，已启用的陷阱会终止计算。运算来自 [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md)；[设计页面](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md)证明了状态与陷阱的定律；[API 参考](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md)列出了所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:15
msgid "Start a pipeline from text or a value"
msgstr "从文本或值开始一条流水线"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:16
msgid "Decide which conditions stop the calculation"
msgstr "决定哪些条件会停止计算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:17
msgid "See what the latest step raised and what happened so far"
msgstr "查看最近一步引发了什么以及迄今为止发生了什么"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:18
msgid "Find the step that trapped"
msgstr "找到触发陷阱的步骤"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:19
msgid "Continue with the defined result after a trap"
msgstr "在陷阱之后用定义的结果继续"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:20
msgid "Run an operation that has no pipeline method"
msgstr "运行没有流水线方法的运算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:30
msgid "Import both packages in your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中导入这两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:39
msgid "Divide under the GDA *basic* context, which traps division by zero:"
msgstr "在会捕获除以零的 GDA *basic* 上下文下做除法："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:76
msgid "Choose the traps"
msgstr "选择陷阱"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:78
msgid "A `GdaContext` carries a trap set. The predefined contexts differ: `GdaContext::default()` (the GDA basic context: precision 9, `HalfUp`) traps `DivisionByZero`, `InvalidOperation`, `Overflow`, `Underflow` and `Clamped`; `decimal32()`, `decimal64()`, `decimal128()` and `new(...)` trap nothing. Add or remove traps with `trap`:"
msgstr "`GdaContext` 携带一个陷阱集合。各预定义上下文有所不同：`GdaContext::default()`（GDA basic 上下文：精度 9、`HalfUp`）捕获 `DivisionByZero`、`InvalidOperation`、`Overflow`、`Underflow` 和 `Clamped`；`decimal32()`、`decimal64()`、`decimal128()` 和 `new(...)` 不捕获任何信号。用 `trap` 添加或移除陷阱："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:106
msgid "Read the sticky status"
msgstr "读取粘滞状态"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:108
msgid "`raised()` holds the signals of the latest operation, `status()` every signal since the context was created or its status was last cleared:"
msgstr "`raised()` 保存最近一次运算的信号，`status()` 保存自上下文创建或其状态上次被清除以来的所有信号："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:124
msgid "Nothing runs after a trap"
msgstr "陷阱之后不再执行任何运算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:126
msgid "Once trapped, every further operation returns the pipeline unchanged; the value is the defined result of the trapped step:"
msgstr "一旦被陷阱捕获，后续每个运算都原样返回流水线；值是被捕获步骤的确定结果："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:142
msgid "Resume deliberately"
msgstr "有意识地恢复"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:144
msgid "`resume_defined()` accepts the defined result and continues. The status still records the trapped signal, so the decision is visible afterwards:"
msgstr "`resume_defined()` 接受确定结果并继续执行。状态仍然记录着被捕获的信号，因此这一决定事后可见："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:161
msgid "The traps are still enabled after resuming: dividing by zero again traps again."
msgstr "恢复之后陷阱仍然启用：再次除以零会再次触发陷阱。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:166
msgid "Syntax errors are invalid operations"
msgstr "语法错误属于无效运算"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:168
msgid "GDA classifies conversion syntax, impossible and undefined divisions and invalid contexts as *invalid-operation conditions*. A context that traps `InvalidOperation` therefore stops on a malformed string, and the status gains `invalid_operation` next to the specific condition:"
msgstr "GDA 把转换语法错误、不可能的除法、未定义的除法和无效上下文归类为*无效运算情形*。因此，捕获 `InvalidOperation` 的上下文会在遇到格式错误的字符串时停止，并且状态中除具体情形外还会加入 `invalid_operation`："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:189
msgid "Mathematical functions need bounded contexts"
msgstr "数学函数需要有界上下文"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:191
msgid "`exp`, `ln`, `log10` and `power` follow the GDA restriction to precision and exponent limits within $\\pm 999\\,999$. The interchange contexts satisfy it; `GdaContext::new` with its default unbounded range does not, and the functions return NaN with `invalid_context` (which traps under `InvalidOperation`):"
msgstr "`exp`、`ln`、`log10` 和 `power` 遵循 GDA 的限制，精度和指数界须在 $\\pm 999\\,999$ 以内。交换格式上下文满足这一条件；采用默认无界范围的 `GdaContext::new` 则不满足，这些函数会返回带 `invalid_context` 的 NaN（在 `InvalidOperation` 下会触发陷阱）："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:213
msgid "Combine with the plain GDA functions"
msgstr "与普通 GDA 函数结合使用"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:215
msgid "Any `decimal_gda` operation returns a `GdaOutcome`. When the pipeline has no method for it, run it on `value()` and `context()` and wrap the outcome:"
msgstr "任何 `decimal_gda` 运算都返回一个 `GdaOutcome`。当流水线没有对应的方法时，在 `value()` 和 `context()` 上执行该运算，再包装其结果："

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:230
msgid "Do this only on a pipeline that is not trapped; `from_outcome` does not check the previous state."
msgstr "只在未被陷阱捕获的流水线上这样做；`from_outcome` 不检查先前的状态。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:235
msgid "**`default()` traps, `new()` does not.** Choose the context deliberately."
msgstr "**`default()` 会捕获陷阱，`new()` 不会。** 请审慎选择上下文。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:236
msgid "**`raised()` versus `status()`.** The first is the latest step, the second the sticky history."
msgstr "**`raised()` 与 `status()`。** 前者是最近一步，后者是粘滞的历史。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:238
msgid "**`resume_defined` keeps the status and the traps.** It clears only the trap marker and `raised()`. Clear the status with `GdaContext::clear_status` on a context and start a new pipeline if needed."
msgstr "**`resume_defined` 保留状态和陷阱。** 它只清除陷阱标记和 `raised()`。如有需要，请在上下文上用 `GdaContext::clear_status` 清除状态，并开始一条新的流水线。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:241
msgid "**No errors.** Traps are not converted to `ArithmeticError`; check `is_trapped()`."
msgstr "**没有错误。** 陷阱不会被转换为 `ArithmeticError`；请检查 `is_trapped()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:243
msgid "**Two decimal packages.** `decimal_gda.Decimal` is not `decimal.Decimal`; IEEE-style flag accumulation without traps is [`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md)."
msgstr "**两个十进制包。** `decimal_gda.Decimal` 不是 `decimal.Decimal`；不带陷阱的 IEEE 风格标志累积见 [`decimal_checked`](decimal_checked.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:249
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` design](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md): sticky status as a monoid, the trap predicate and the short-circuit proof."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` 设计](../design/decimal_gda_checked.md)：作为幺半群的粘滞状态、陷阱谓词以及短路的证明。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:251
msgid "[`decimal_gda_checked` API](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md): every method."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda_checked` API](../api/decimal_gda_checked.md)：所有方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/decimal_gda_checked.md:252
msgid "[`decimal_gda` tutorial](decimal_gda.md): contexts, rounding modes and the full GDA operation set."
msgstr "[`decimal_gda` 教程](decimal_gda.md)：上下文、舍入模式以及完整的 GDA 运算集合。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:1
msgid "def tutorial"
msgstr "def 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:3
msgid "The goal of this tutorial is to write code that works with every number type of `floating` at once: you inspect values through the `Floating` trait, test their class with the generic predicates, read IEEE comparison results as `PartialOrder`, and reuse the arithmetic context and error types that `def` re-exports. `def` itself does no arithmetic; the concrete packages ([`bin_float`](bin_float.md), [`decimal`](decimal.md), [`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md), [`ball_float`](ball_float.md)) do. The laws behind the trait are in the [design page](../design/def.md)."
msgstr "本教程的目标是编写能同时适用于 `floating` 所有数值类型的代码：通过 `Floating` trait 检视值，用泛型谓词检验其类别，把 IEEE 比较结果读作 `PartialOrder`，并复用 `def` 重新导出的算术上下文与错误类型。`def` 本身不做任何算术；算术由具体的包（[`bin_float`](bin_float.md)、[`decimal`](decimal.md)、[`decimal_gda`](decimal_gda.md)、[`ball_float`](ball_float.md)）完成。该 trait 背后的定律见[设计页面](../design/def.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:14
msgid "ask any value for its class, sign or precision"
msgstr "查询任意值的类别、符号或精度"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:15
msgid "test for NaN, infinity or zero generically"
msgstr "以泛型方式检测 NaN、无穷或零"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:16
msgid "round a value to fewer digits of its own radix"
msgstr "把值舍入到其自身基数下更少的位数"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:17
msgid "read the result of an IEEE comparison"
msgstr "读取 IEEE 比较的结果"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:18
msgid "compare decimal cohorts by their printed form"
msgstr "按打印形式比较十进制同值类"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:19
msgid "handle checked errors without importing `arithmetic`"
msgstr "不导入 `arithmetic` 即可处理 checked 错误"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:20
msgid "make my own type usable by generic code"
msgstr "让自己的类型可用于泛型代码"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:24
msgid "Add the module and import `def` next to the representation you use:"
msgstr "添加模块，并在你所用的表示之外再导入 `def`："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:37
msgid "The smallest useful program asks a value what it is:"
msgstr "最小的实用程序询问一个值是什么："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:51
msgid "Write one function for every representation"
msgstr "为所有表示编写同一个函数"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:53
msgid "A function bounded by `F : @def.Floating` accepts binary, IEEE decimal, GDA decimal and interval values. Call the trait methods in their qualified form, `@def.Floating::classify(x)`, because MoonBit no longer turns trait methods into dot methods of a type parameter."
msgstr "以 `F : @def.Floating` 为约束的函数可以接受二进制、IEEE 十进制、GDA 十进制和区间值。请以限定形式 `@def.Floating::classify(x)` 调用 trait 方法，因为 MoonBit 不再把 trait 方法变成类型参数的点方法。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:91
msgid "The interval case shows why the NaN test comes first: the empty interval classifies as `NaN`, and `BallFloat::sign` aborts on it."
msgstr "区间的情形说明了为什么要先检验 NaN：空区间被分类为 `NaN`，而 `BallFloat::sign` 在其上会中止。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:94
msgid "Change precision generically"
msgstr "泛型地改变精度"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:96
msgid "`with_precision` rounds to the requested number of significant digits of the value's own radix, bits for binary and digits for decimal:"
msgstr "`with_precision` 舍入到所要求的有效数字位数，位数以值自身的基数计：二进制为位，十进制为十进制数字："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:114
msgid "Eleven is `1011` in binary; three significant bits round it to `1100`, which `to_string` prints as $3 \\cdot 2^2$."
msgstr "十一的二进制是 `1011`；三位有效位把它舍入为 `1100`，`to_string` 将其打印为 $3 \\cdot 2^2$。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:117
msgid "Read an IEEE comparison"
msgstr "读取 IEEE 比较结果"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:119
msgid "Comparisons that follow IEEE 754 return a `PartialOrder`, whose fourth value `Unordered` reports a NaN operand:"
msgstr "遵循 IEEE 754 的比较返回一个 `PartialOrder`，其第四个值 `Unordered` 表示有 NaN 操作数："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:146
msgid "Normalize before comparing representations"
msgstr "比较表示之前先规范化"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:148
msgid "Decimal values with the same value can differ in their stored exponent (`1.5` and `1.500` belong to one *cohort*). `normalized` picks the canonical member, so the printed forms agree:"
msgstr "值相同的十进制数，其存储的指数可能不同（`1.5` 和 `1.500` 属于同一个*同值类*）。`normalized` 选取规范成员，从而使打印形式一致："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:168
msgid "Use the re-exported arithmetic types"
msgstr "使用重新导出的算术类型"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:170
msgid "`@def.ArithmeticContext`, `@def.ArithmeticError`, `@def.RoundingMode` and the other aliases are the types of [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/). Code that only needs the vocabulary can import `def` instead of `arithmetic`:"
msgstr "`@def.ArithmeticContext`、`@def.ArithmeticError`、`@def.RoundingMode` 以及其他别名都是 [Luna-Flow/arithmetic](https://lunaflow.cn/en/arithmetic/) 的类型。只需要这套词汇的代码可以导入 `def` 而不是 `arithmetic`："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:198
msgid "Implement `Floating` for your own type"
msgstr "为自己的类型实现 `Floating`"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:200
msgid "The trait is open. A wrapper type can delegate to an existing implementation; it must then keep the laws listed in the design page (for example, `normalized` must not change the value):"
msgstr "该 trait 是开放的。包装类型可以委托给已有的实现；但它必须遵守设计页面列出的定律（例如，`normalized` 不得改变值）："

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:248
msgid "`Sign::Zero` does not mean \"the value is zero\". It is also returned for NaN by the scalar types and for any interval that contains zero. Test `@def.is_nan` first, and for intervals use `BallFloat::contains_zero` or the bounds."
msgstr "`Sign::Zero` 并不意味着“值为零”。标量类型对 NaN 也返回它，任何包含零的区间也返回它。请先检验 `@def.is_nan`；对区间请使用 `BallFloat::contains_zero` 或其界。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:252
msgid "`@def.is_zero` on a `BallFloat` is true for $[-1, 1]$: the predicate is defined through `sign`, which for an interval means \"contains zero\"."
msgstr "对 `BallFloat` 而言，`@def.is_zero` 在 $[-1, 1]$ 上为真：该谓词通过 `sign` 定义，而它对区间的含义是“包含零”。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:254
msgid "`Sign` cannot tell $-0$ from $+0$. Use the concrete package (`BinFloat::is_negative_zero`, `Decimal::is_signed`) when the sign bit matters."
msgstr "`Sign` 无法区分 $-0$ 和 $+0$。当符号位重要时，请使用具体的包（`BinFloat::is_negative_zero`、`Decimal::is_signed`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:257
msgid "`PartialOrder` is not an ordering you can sort with: `Unordered` breaks trichotomy. Use the total orders of the concrete packages (`BinFloat::total_order_compare`, `Decimal::compare_total`) for sorting."
msgstr "`PartialOrder` 不是可以用来排序的序：`Unordered` 破坏了三分律。排序请使用具体包提供的全序（`BinFloat::total_order_compare`、`Decimal::compare_total`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:260
msgid "`with_precision` reports no flags and ignores context exponent limits (a `BinFloat` still overflows at its implementation range of about $2^{\\pm 2^{30}}$). When rounding must be observed, use the `*_ctx` operations of the concrete package."
msgstr "`with_precision` 不报告标志，也忽略上下文的指数界限（`BinFloat` 仍会在其约为 $2^{\\pm 2^{30}}$ 的实现范围处上溢）。当舍入必须可观测时，请使用具体包的 `*_ctx` 运算。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:264
msgid "On a `BallFloat`, `with_precision` returns the tightest enclosure of the input at the new precision (the endpoints rounded outward), and `normalized` returns the same set. Neither changes an interval that is already representable at the target precision."
msgstr "对 `BallFloat`，`with_precision` 返回输入在新精度下的最紧包络（端点向外舍入），`normalized` 返回同一个集合。两者都不会改变在目标精度下已可表示的区间。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:268
msgid "`with_precision(x, 0, mode)` is not an error: the precision is clamped to 1."
msgstr "`with_precision(x, 0, mode)` 不是错误：精度会被钳制为 1。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:272
msgid "[`def` design](../design/def.md): the trait laws and the order theory of `PartialOrder`."
msgstr "[`def` 设计](../design/def.md)：trait 定律以及 `PartialOrder` 的序理论。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:274
msgid "[`def` API](../api/def.md): every item with its signature."
msgstr "[`def` API](../api/def.md)：每个条目及其签名。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:275
msgid "[`semantic` tutorial](semantic.md): compare values of different representations exactly."
msgstr "[`semantic` 教程](semantic.md)：精确比较不同表示的值。"

#: manual/tutorial/def.md:277
msgid "[Numeric semantics guide](../numeric_semantics.md) for the shared vocabulary of the repository."
msgstr "本仓库的共享词汇见[数值语义指南](../numeric_semantics.md)。"

