#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:1
msgid "internal tutorial"
msgstr "internal 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to show maintainers of the numeric cores how the helpers of `internal` combine: rounding a decimal coefficient to a precision, parsing a decimal literal into exact parts, and writing a refinement loop that certifies a rounded result. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`, so only code inside the module can use it; the examples on this page compile inside the module."
msgstr "本页的目标是向数值核心的维护者展示 `internal` 中的辅助函数如何组合使用：将十进制系数舍入到指定精度、将十进制字面量解析为精确的组成部分，以及编写一个对舍入结果进行认证的细化循环。该包是 `Luna-Flow/floating` 的内部包，因此只有模块内部的代码才能使用它；本页的示例在模块内部编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:12
msgid "round a quotient of integers with a rounding mode"
msgstr "按某种舍入模式舍入整数之商"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:13
msgid "round a decimal coefficient to `p` digits"
msgstr "把十进制系数舍入到 `p` 位"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:14
msgid "split a decimal literal into sign, digits and exponent"
msgstr "把十进制字面量拆分为符号、数字和指数"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:15
msgid "drop trailing zeros while keeping the value"
msgstr "去掉末尾的零而保持值不变"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:16
msgid "enclose a ratio between two dyadics"
msgstr "用两个二进有理数包络一个比值"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:17
msgid "bound a Ziv refinement loop"
msgstr "限制 Ziv 细化循环"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:18
msgid "report that certification gave up"
msgstr "报告认证已放弃"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:22
msgid "There is nothing to install: the package ships inside `Luna-Flow/floating` and is visible only to its packages. Run its tests from the repository:"
msgstr "无需安装：该包随 `Luna-Flow/floating` 一起发布，且只对其中的包可见。在仓库中运行它的测试："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:29
msgid "In a package of the module, import it in `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在该模块的某个包中，于 `moon.pkg` 中导入它："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:37
msgid "Round $2/3$ to an integer in two modes:"
msgstr "以两种模式将 $2/3$ 舍入为整数："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:49
msgid "`round_positive_div` takes the magnitude $n/d$ and the sign of the true quotient separately, because directed modes round magnitudes differently for negative numbers."
msgstr "`round_positive_div` 分别接收量值 $n/d$ 和真实商的符号，因为对于负数，定向舍入模式对量值的舍入方向不同。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:55
msgid "Round a decimal coefficient to `p` digits"
msgstr "将十进制系数舍入到 `p` 位数字"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:57
msgid "A decimal $c \\cdot 10^{q}$ with more than $p$ digits is rounded by dividing the coefficient by $10^{k}$, $k = \\text{digits}(c) - p$, and adding $k$ to the exponent:"
msgstr "位数多于 $p$ 的十进制数 $c \\cdot 10^{q}$ 的舍入方式是：将系数除以 $10^{k}$（其中 $k = \\text{digits}(c) - p$），并把 $k$ 加到指数上："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:92
msgid "A carry can produce $10^{p}$ (for example $999.6 \\to 1000$); real cores renormalize that case, which this sketch omits."
msgstr "进位可能产生 $10^{p}$（例如 $999.6 \\to 1000$）；实际的核心会对这种情况重新规格化，此示意代码省略了这一步。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:95
msgid "Parse a literal into exact parts"
msgstr "将字面量解析为精确的组成部分"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:97
msgid "`split_decimal_string` does the lexical work for decimal parsers; trimming the result gives a canonical coefficient:"
msgstr "`split_decimal_string` 为十进制解析器完成词法层面的工作；对结果去除尾随零即可得到规范系数："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:115
msgid "So $-0.012500 \\times 10^{2} = -125 \\times 10^{-2}$."
msgstr "因此 $-0.012500 \\times 10^{2} = -125 \\times 10^{-2}$。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:117
msgid "Certify a rounding with a refinement loop"
msgstr "用细化循环认证舍入"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:119
msgid "The certified elementary functions follow Ziv's strategy: compute an enclosure at some working precision, and accept the rounded result only when both ends of the enclosure round to the same number; otherwise raise the precision. The budget bounds the loop. Here the \"function\" is the exact ratio $n/d$, rounded down to `target` fractional bits:"
msgstr "经认证的初等函数遵循 Ziv 策略：在某个工作精度下计算一个包络，只有当包络两端舍入到同一个数时才接受舍入结果；否则提高精度。预算限定了循环的次数。这里的“函数”是精确比值 $n/d$，向下舍入到 `target` 个小数位（二进制）："

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:167
msgid "`bin_float`, `decimal`, `decimal_gda` and `ball_float` create their refinement budgets at the target precision plus a guard margin and report `certified_failure` when the budget runs out; see the [bin_float design](../design/bin_float.md) for the certified elementary functions."
msgstr "`bin_float`、`decimal`、`decimal_gda` 和 `ball_float` 以目标精度加上保护余量来创建细化预算，并在预算耗尽时报告 `certified_failure`；经认证的初等函数参见 [bin_float 设计](../design/bin_float.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:172
msgid "`semantic` uses `ExactRat` as the canonical exact value of finite binary and decimal numbers."
msgstr "`semantic` 使用 `ExactRat` 作为有限二进制数和十进制数的规范精确值。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:174
msgid "The `consistency` package tests these helpers against `BigInt` oracles."
msgstr "`consistency` 包以 `BigInt` 预言为参照测试这些辅助函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:175
msgid "Run the package tests from a workspace containing the module: `moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating/internal`."
msgstr "在包含该模块的工作区中运行该包的测试：`moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating/internal`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:177
msgid "The decimal cores parse literals with `split_decimal_string_wide`, which returns the exponent as an `Int64` so that they can overflow or underflow on it (see the [API page](../api/internal.md#split_decimal_string-split_decimal_string_wide))."
msgstr "十进制核心用 `split_decimal_string_wide` 解析字面量，它以 `Int64` 返回指数，使它们能据此判定上溢或下溢（参见 [API 页面](../api/internal.md#split_decimal_string-split_decimal_string_wide)）。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:184
msgid "**Signed inputs.** `round_positive_div` aborts on a negative numerator; pass the magnitude and the sign separately."
msgstr "**带符号的输入。** `round_positive_div` 遇到负的分子会中止；请分别传入量值和符号。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:186
msgid "**`round_shift` with $s \\le 0$** returns the input unchanged; it never shifts left. With a negative magnitude it floors instead of rounding the magnitude, so pass $|m|$ and the sign separately, as for `round_positive_div`."
msgstr "**$s \\le 0$ 时的 `round_shift`** 原样返回输入；它从不左移。对于负的数值，它会向下取整，而不是对绝对值进行舍入，因此请像 `round_positive_div` 那样分别传入 $|m|$ 和符号。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:190
msgid "**Zero loses its exponent.** `remove_factor2`, `remove_factor10` and `trim_trailing_decimal_zeros` return exponent 0 for a zero coefficient. Keep the original exponent yourself if the cohort of zero matters."
msgstr "**零会丢失其指数。** 对于零系数，`remove_factor2`、`remove_factor10` 和 `trim_trailing_decimal_zeros` 返回指数 0。如果零的同值类（cohort）很重要，请自行保存原始指数。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:193
msgid "**Unnormalized dyadics.** `CertifiedDyadic` values with different scales may be numerically equal; compare with `compare`, not by fields."
msgstr "**未规格化的二进有理数。** 不同尺度的 `CertifiedDyadic` 值可能在数值上相等；请用 `compare` 比较，而不是逐字段比较。"

