#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:1
msgid "internal/conformance tutorial"
msgstr "internal/conformance 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to help maintainers who add or change a conformance frontend: it shows how a frontend records per-case results, summarizes a run, splits it into shards and merges the shards back, using the shared model of `internal/conformance`. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`, so the examples are written for code inside the module and are not compiled by the manual checker."
msgstr "本页的目标是帮助添加或修改符合性前端的维护者：介绍前端如何借助 `internal/conformance` 的共享模型记录每个用例的结果、汇总一次运行、将其拆分为分片并把各分片合并回来。该包是 `Luna-Flow/floating` 的内部包，因此这些示例是为模块内部代码编写的，不会由手册检查器编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:12
msgid "record the outcome of one case"
msgstr "记录单个用例的结果"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:13
msgid "say why a case was not run"
msgstr "说明某个用例为何未被运行"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:14
msgid "count a run"
msgstr "统计一次运行"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:15
msgid "run one shard of a corpus"
msgstr "运行语料的一个分片"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:16
msgid "combine shard summaries"
msgstr "合并分片摘要"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:17
msgid "turn user shard options into a usage error"
msgstr "把用户的分片选项转换为用法错误"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:18
msgid "keep the frontend API stable"
msgstr "保持前端 API 稳定"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:18
msgid "[wrapper types](#wrap-the-model-in-a-frontend-type)"
msgstr "[包装类型](#wrap-the-model-in-a-frontend-type)"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:22
#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:22
msgid "There is nothing to install: the package ships inside `Luna-Flow/floating`. Run its tests from the repository:"
msgstr "无需安装：该包随 `Luna-Flow/floating` 一起发布。在仓库中运行它的测试："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:29
msgid "In a frontend package of the module, import it in `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在该模块的某个前端包中，于 `moon.pkg` 中导入它："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:37
msgid "Record one result per case and summarize:"
msgstr "为每个用例记录一个结果并汇总："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:57
msgid "Pick a disposition"
msgstr "选择处置类型"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:59
msgid "Give every selected case exactly one disposition:"
msgstr "为每个被选中的用例赋予恰好一种处置类型："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:61
msgid "`Executable` when the case was run, with `passed` telling the outcome;"
msgstr "`Executable`：用例已运行，`passed` 表示结果；"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:62
msgid "`Diagnostic(reason)` when the corpus row is not a test of this kind;"
msgstr "`Diagnostic(reason)`：该语料行并非此类测试；"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:63
msgid "`Unsupported(reason)` when the row is valid but the feature is missing;"
msgstr "`Unsupported(reason)`：该行有效，但缺少相应功能；"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:64
msgid "`Legacy(reason)` when the row follows an older convention that is not claimed."
msgstr "`Legacy(reason)`：该行遵循旧的约定，不在声明范围之内。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:67
msgid "Skipped results never fail `success()`, so choose `Unsupported` honestly: runners with a strict mode turn unsupported rows into a failing exit code."
msgstr "被跳过的结果永远不会使 `success()` 失败，因此请如实选择 `Unsupported`：具有严格模式的运行器会把不支持的行变为失败的退出码。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:72
msgid "Number the cases that pass your filters $0, 1, 2, \\dots$ and keep those the shard selects. Pass the number of filtered cases as `total`:"
msgstr "将通过过滤器的用例编号为 $0, 1, 2, \\dots$，并保留分片所选中的那些。将过滤后的用例数作为 `total` 传入："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:97
msgid "Validate user input"
msgstr "校验用户输入"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:99
msgid "Command-line shard options come from users. Use `ShardSpec::try_new` and turn the `Err` into a usage error; `ShardSpec::new` aborts."
msgstr "命令行分片选项来自用户。请使用 `ShardSpec::try_new` 并将 `Err` 转为用法错误；`ShardSpec::new` 会直接中止。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:102
msgid "Wrap the model in a frontend type"
msgstr "将模型包装为前端类型"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:104
msgid "Public frontends do not expose these types directly: `gda_expr`, `mpfr_expr` and `testfloat_expr` wrap `CaseResult` and `RunSummary` in their own structs and forward the accessors they want to publish. Follow the same pattern so the internal model can change without breaking the frontend API."
msgstr "公开的前端不会直接暴露这些类型：`gda_expr`、`mpfr_expr` 和 `testfloat_expr` 将 `CaseResult` 和 `RunSummary` 包装在各自的结构体中，并转发它们想要公开的访问器。请遵循同样的模式，这样内部模型的变化就不会破坏前端 API。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:111
msgid "Run the package tests from a workspace that contains the module: `moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating/internal/conformance`."
msgstr "在包含该模块的工作区中运行该包的测试：`moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating/internal/conformance`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:113
msgid "[internal/runner_cli](runner_cli.md) parses the shared command-line options (`--json`, `--shard-count`, `--shard-index`) into a `ShardSpec`."
msgstr "[internal/runner_cli](runner_cli.md) 将共享的命令行选项（`--json`、`--shard-count`、`--shard-index`）解析为 `ShardSpec`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:118
msgid "**Wrong total.** `total_cases` should count the cases *after* filtering and *before* sharding, the same number in every shard; `merge` keeps the maximum."
msgstr "**total 错误。** `total_cases` 应统计过滤*之后*、分片*之前*的用例数，在每个分片中都是同一个数；`merge` 保留最大值。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:121
msgid "**Negative ordinals.** `selects` uses `%`, which keeps the sign of the ordinal: a negative multiple of the count goes to shard 0 and every other negative ordinal to no shard. Always count from 0."
msgstr "**负的序号。** `selects` 使用 `%`，结果保留序号的符号：计数的负倍数会落到分片 0，而其他所有负序号不属于任何分片。请始终从 0 开始计数。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:124
msgid "**`passed` on skipped results.** It is ignored by the counters; set it to `false` for clarity."
msgstr "**被跳过结果上的 `passed`。** 计数器会忽略它；为清晰起见，请将其设为 `false`。"

