msgstr "internal/runner_cli 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:3
msgid "The goal of this page is to show maintainers how to write a conformance runner in `cli/` with the shared helpers of `internal/runner_cli`: parse the common options, collect and read corpus files, report diagnostics, print a JSON summary and choose the exit code. The package is internal to `Luna-Flow/floating`; the examples are written for code inside the module and are not compiled by the manual checker."
msgstr "本页的目标是向维护者展示如何借助 `internal/runner_cli` 的共享辅助函数在 `cli/` 中编写符合性运行器：解析通用选项、收集并读取语料文件、报告诊断、打印 JSON 摘要并选择退出码。该包是 `Luna-Flow/floating` 的内部包；这些示例是为模块内部代码编写的，不会由手册检查器编译。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:12
msgid "parse `--json` and the shard options"
msgstr "解析 `--json` 和分片选项"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:13
msgid "expand files and directories into a sorted corpus list"
msgstr "把文件和目录展开为排序后的语料列表"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:14
msgid "read a corpus file with a usage-style error"
msgstr "读取语料文件，出错时给出用法类错误"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:15
msgid "print a diagnostic as `file:line:column: message`"
msgstr "以 `file:line:column: message` 格式打印诊断"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:16
msgid "print a stable machine-readable summary"
msgstr "打印稳定的机器可读摘要"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:17
msgid "add my own options"
msgstr "添加自己的选项"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:18
msgid "choose the exit code"
msgstr "选择退出码"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:18
msgid "[the exit-code convention](#follow-the-exit-code-convention)"
msgstr "[退出码约定](#follow-the-exit-code-convention)"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:29
msgid "Inside the module, import the helpers and a frontend:"
msgstr "在模块内部导入这些辅助函数和一个前端："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:38
msgid "A minimal runner (`run` receives the whole argument vector, program name first):"
msgstr "一个最小的运行器（`run` 接收完整的参数向量，程序名在首位）："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:102
msgid "Follow the exit-code convention"
msgstr "遵循退出码约定"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:104
msgid "All runners in `cli/` use the same codes, which `tools/*.py` relies on:"
msgstr "`cli/` 中的所有运行器都使用相同的退出码，`tools/*.py` 依赖于此："

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:108
msgid "every executed case passed (and, in strict mode, nothing was unsupported)"
msgstr "所有已执行的用例都通过（并且在严格模式下没有不支持的用例）"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:109
msgid "at least one case failed, or strict mode found unsupported cases (`gda-expr` also counts legacy rows)"
msgstr "至少一个用例失败，或严格模式发现了不支持的用例（`gda-expr` 还会计入 legacy 行）"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:110
msgid "usage error, unreadable file, or parse diagnostic"
msgstr "用法错误、文件无法读取或解析诊断"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:112
msgid "Add a runner-specific option"
msgstr "添加运行器专用选项"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:114
msgid "`parse_common_options` leaves every argument it does not know in `remaining()`, in order. Parse your own options from that array and treat the rest as paths. Pass `allow_shard=false` if your runner cannot shard; the shard options then stay in `remaining()` and your parser should reject them as unknown."
msgstr "`parse_common_options` 会把它不认识的所有参数按顺序留在 `remaining()` 中。从该数组中解析你自己的选项，其余的视为路径。如果你的运行器不能分片，请传入 `allow_shard=false`；此时分片选项会保留在 `remaining()` 中，你的解析器应将其作为未知选项拒绝。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:120
msgid "Keep output machine-readable"
msgstr "保持输出机器可读"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:122
msgid "Print exactly one JSON object per invocation when `--json` is given. Build it with `json_object` so the key order is the order you list, and use `json_int` for counts so they print as integers."
msgstr "给出 `--json` 时，每次调用只打印一个 JSON 对象。用 `json_object` 构造它，使键的顺序与你列出的顺序一致，并对计数使用 `json_int`，使其打印为整数。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:128
msgid "The four runners in `cli/` are complete examples: [gda_expr_cli](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md), [itl_expr_cli](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md), [mpfr_expr_cli](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) and [testfloat_expr_cli](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)."
msgstr "`cli/` 中的四个运行器都是完整的示例：[gda_expr_cli](../cli/gda_expr_cli.md)、[itl_expr_cli](../cli/itl_expr_cli.md)、[mpfr_expr_cli](../cli/mpfr_expr_cli.md) 和 [testfloat_expr_cli](../cli/testfloat_expr_cli.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:133
msgid "Build the native dispatcher with `sh tools/run_moon_clean_exec.sh run --release --target native src/cli -- --help`."
msgstr "用 `sh tools/run_moon_clean_exec.sh run --release --target native src/cli -- --help` 构建 native 分发器。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:135
msgid "Run the helper tests from a workspace that contains the module: `moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating/internal/runner_cli`."
msgstr "在包含该模块的工作区中运行辅助函数的测试：`moon test -p Luna-Flow/floating/internal/runner_cli`。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:140
msgid "**Program name.** `parse_common_options` skips `arguments[0]`. Pass the full vector, not a slice without the program name, or the first real argument is lost."
msgstr "**程序名。** `parse_common_options` 会跳过 `arguments[0]`。请传入完整的向量，而不是去掉程序名的切片，否则第一个真正的参数会丢失。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:143
msgid "**Directories are not searched recursively.** `collect_files` lists only the direct entries of a directory."
msgstr "**不递归搜索目录。** `collect_files` 只列出目录的直接条目。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:145
msgid "**Named files must have the suffix.** A file argument without the suffix is an error (`not a SUFFIX file: P`), so a mistyped name cannot pass as an empty run."
msgstr "**指定的文件必须带有后缀。** 没有该后缀的文件参数是一个错误（`not a SUFFIX file: P`），因此拼错的名称不会被当作一次空运行而通过。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:148
msgid "**Option values use MoonBit integer syntax.** `0x10` and `1_000` are accepted as 16 and 1000; an argument starting with `--` is never taken as a value, so `--shard-count --json` is a missing count."
msgstr "**选项值使用 MoonBit 整数语法。** `0x10` 和 `1_000` 分别被接受为 16 和 1000；以 `--` 开头的参数绝不会被当作值，因此 `--shard-count --json` 属于缺少计数值。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:151
msgid "**Native only in practice.** File access goes through `moonbitlang/x/fs`; the runners are built and run on the native target."
msgstr "**实际上仅支持 native。** 文件访问经由 `moonbitlang/x/fs`；运行器在 native 目标上构建和运行。"

