msgstr "[cli 教程](../cli.md)：调用各运行器的分发器。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:1
msgid "numeric_expr tutorial"
msgstr "numeric_expr 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:3
msgid "The goal of this tutorial is to describe a computation once as a `numeric_expr` tree and run it against any number type by supplying two callbacks: one that reads a literal and one that executes an operation. By the end you can evaluate expressions over `Int`, over `BinFloat` with IEEE flags, and report failures at their source line. This is the mechanism the GDA conformance frontend `frontend/gda_expr` uses to run `.decTest` corpora."
msgstr "本教程的目标是把一次计算描述为一棵 `numeric_expr` 树，并通过提供两个回调在任意数值类型上运行它：一个读取字面量，一个执行运算。学完本教程，你将能够在 `Int` 上、在带 IEEE 标志的 `BinFloat` 上对表达式求值，并在源代码行处报告失败。GDA 符合性前端 `frontend/gda_expr` 正是用这一机制来运行 `.decTest` 语料的。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:12
msgid "build an expression tree"
msgstr "构建表达式树"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:13
msgid "give operations a meaning"
msgstr "赋予运算含义"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:13
msgid "[the `invoke` callback](#write-a-small-interpreter)"
msgstr "[`invoke` 回调](#write-a-small-interpreter)"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:14
msgid "evaluate over a floating-point type with flags"
msgstr "在带标志的浮点类型上求值"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:14
msgid "[a pair value type](#evaluate-over-binfloat-and-collect-ieee-flags)"
msgstr "[二元组值类型](#evaluate-over-binfloat-and-collect-ieee-flags)"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:15
msgid "report a failure at its source line"
msgstr "在源代码行处报告失败"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:16
msgid "know which callbacks run, and in which order"
msgstr "了解哪些回调会运行以及运行顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:16
msgid "[post-order evaluation](#see-the-evaluation-order)"
msgstr "[后序求值](#see-the-evaluation-order)"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:17
msgid "keep domain errors as values"
msgstr "把定义域错误作为值保留"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:17
msgid "[checked value types](#going-further)"
msgstr "[checked 值类型](#going-further)"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:25
msgid "Add the package to `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "将该包添加到 `moon.pkg`："

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:33
msgid "Build `1 + 2` and evaluate it over `Int`:"
msgstr "构建 `1 + 2` 并在 `Int` 上求值："

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:54
msgid "`evaluate` decodes both literals, then calls the operation callback with the decoded arguments `[1, 2]`."
msgstr "`evaluate` 先解码两个字面量，然后以解码后的参数 `[1, 2]` 调用运算回调。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:59
msgid "Write a small interpreter"
msgstr "编写一个小型解释器"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:61
msgid "Most callers match on the operation name and the argument array. Matching the array pattern also checks the arity, which `numeric_expr` itself does not do:"
msgstr "大多数调用方会对运算名和参数数组做模式匹配。匹配数组模式还会检查元数，而 `numeric_expr` 本身并不做这一检查："

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:114
msgid "`sum` shows that an operation may take any number of arguments; the callback decides."
msgstr "`sum` 表明一个运算可以接受任意数量的参数；由回调决定。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:117
msgid "Evaluate over `BinFloat` and collect IEEE flags"
msgstr "在 `BinFloat` 上求值并收集 IEEE 标志"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:119
msgid "The value type `V` can carry more than a number. Here every value is a `BinFloat` together with the IEEE flags raised so far, and each operation merges the flags of its arguments with its own:"
msgstr "值类型 `V` 可以携带的不只是一个数。这里每个值都是一个 `BinFloat` 加上迄今为止引发的 IEEE 标志，每个运算都会把其参数的标志与自身的标志合并："

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:176
msgid "The same tree could be evaluated over `@decimal_gda.Decimal` by swapping the two callbacks; nothing in the expression depends on the number type."
msgstr "只需替换两个回调，同一棵树就可以在 `@decimal_gda.Decimal` 上求值；表达式中没有任何内容依赖于数值类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:179
msgid "Report errors at their source"
msgstr "在源头报告错误"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:181
msgid "Give every node the span of the text it came from. When a callback fails, the `EvalError` returns the failing node, so the span locates the error:"
msgstr "为每个节点赋予其来源文本的区间（span）。当回调失败时，`EvalError` 会返回失败的节点，从而可以借助该区间定位错误："

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:212
msgid "See the evaluation order"
msgstr "观察求值顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:214
msgid "The callbacks run in post-order, left to right, and evaluation stops at the first failure. A trace makes this visible:"
msgstr "回调按后序、从左到右运行，并在第一次失败时停止求值。跟踪记录可以直观地展示这一点："

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:240
msgid "The literal `1` and both `add` nodes are never visited, because `bad` fails first."
msgstr "字面量 `1` 和两个 `add` 节点都从未被访问，因为 `bad` 先失败了。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:245
msgid "**Corpus frontends.** `frontend/gda_expr` lowers each `.decTest` row `id operation operands -> expected conditions` into `Expr::invoke(Operation::new(op), operands.map(Expr::literal))` and evaluates it with callbacks over `@decimal_gda`. Read [gda_expr](frontend/gda_expr.md) for a complete example of the pattern."
msgstr "**语料前端。** `frontend/gda_expr` 把每个 `.decTest` 行 `id operation operands -> expected conditions` 降低为 `Expr::invoke(Operation::new(op), operands.map(Expr::literal))`，并用基于 `@decimal_gda` 的回调对其求值。完整的模式示例请阅读 [gda_expr](frontend/gda_expr.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:250
msgid "**Richer values.** `V` can be an enum when operations return different kinds of results (numbers, booleans, strings), as `gda_expr` does for `compare`, `class` and `isnan`."
msgstr "**更丰富的值。** 当运算返回不同种类的结果（数值、布尔值、字符串）时，`V` 可以是一个枚举，`gda_expr` 对 `compare`、`class` 和 `isnan` 就是这样做的。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:253
msgid "**Typed errors.** `E` can be your own enum instead of `String`; `EvalError[E]` keeps it unchanged."
msgstr "**带类型的错误。** `E` 可以是你自己的枚举而不是 `String`；`EvalError[E]` 会原样保留它。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:255
msgid "**Checked pipelines.** If you want domain errors to stay values instead of stopping the evaluation, make `V` a checked type such as `@bin_float_checked.BinFloatResult` and let the callbacks always return `Ok`."
msgstr "**checked 流水线。** 如果希望定义域错误作为值保留而不是终止求值，可让 `V` 为 checked 类型（如 `@bin_float_checked.BinFloatResult`），并让回调始终返回 `Ok`。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:261
msgid "**No arity check.** `Expr::invoke` accepts any number of arguments. Check the arity in `invoke` (an array pattern does it) and return `Err` on a mismatch."
msgstr "**没有元数检查。** `Expr::invoke` 接受任意数量的参数。请在 `invoke` 中检查元数（数组模式即可做到），并在不匹配时返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:263
msgid "**Early stop.** After the first failure no further callback runs. Do not rely on side effects of callbacks for nodes to the right of a failing node."
msgstr "**提前停止。** 第一次失败之后不再运行任何回调。不要依赖失败节点右侧节点的回调所产生的副作用。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:265
msgid "**Deep trees.** Evaluation is recursive; the stack depth equals the tree height. Very deep left-leaning trees (for example a sum of a million terms built as nested `add`) can exhaust the stack; build a flat `sum` node instead."
msgstr "**深层树。** 求值是递归的，栈深度等于树高。非常深的左倾树（例如以嵌套 `add` 构建的一百万项之和）可能耗尽栈空间；请改为构建一个扁平的 `sum` 节点。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:268
msgid "**Default spans.** Without an explicit span a node reports `SourceSpan::new(\"\")`, whose line and column are `0`."
msgstr "**默认区间。** 没有显式区间的节点报告 `SourceSpan::new(\"\")`，其行号和列号均为 `0`。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:270
msgid "**No literal parsing here.** A `Literal` stores raw text. Rounding, precision and flags of the conversion are decided entirely by your `decode` callback."
msgstr "**这里不解析字面量。** `Literal` 只存储原始文本。转换时的舍入、精度和标志完全由你的 `decode` 回调决定。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:275
msgid "[numeric_expr API](../api/numeric_expr.md) lists every item."
msgstr "[numeric_expr API](../api/numeric_expr.md) 列出了每个条目。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:276
msgid "[numeric_expr design](../design/numeric_expr.md) states the evaluation semantics and its invariants."
msgstr "[numeric_expr 设计](../design/numeric_expr.md) 阐述了求值语义及其不变式。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:278
msgid "[gda_expr tutorial](frontend/gda_expr.md) runs real decimal test rows through this package."
msgstr "[gda_expr 教程](frontend/gda_expr.md) 通过此包运行真实的十进制测试行。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:1
msgid "semantic tutorial"
msgstr "semantic 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:3
msgid "The goal of this tutorial is to compare values across representations without rounding: you project a binary float, an IEEE decimal or an interval onto exact rationals, test equality, order rationals with integer arithmetic, check whether an interval contains a decimal, and turn checked results into a common error vocabulary. The projection is useful in cross-representation tests, diagnostics and protocol boundaries; arithmetic stays in the concrete packages. The mathematics is in the [design page](../design/semantic.md); every item is listed in the [API reference](../api/semantic.md)."
msgstr "本教程的目标是在不舍入的前提下跨表示比较值：把二进制浮点数、IEEE 十进制数或区间投影到精确有理数，检验相等性，用整数算术对有理数排序，检查区间是否包含某个十进制数，并把 checked 结果转换为一套通用的错误词汇。该投影适用于跨表示的测试、诊断和协议边界；算术仍由具体的包完成。数学原理见[设计页面](../design/semantic.md)；所有条目都列在 [API 参考](../api/semantic.md)中。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:14
msgid "test whether a binary and a decimal value are the same number"
msgstr "检验一个二进制值和一个十进制值是否为同一个数"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:15
msgid "see the exact rational behind a float"
msgstr "查看浮点数背后的精确有理数"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:16
msgid "ignore cohorts, precision and signed zeros"
msgstr "忽略同值类、精度和带符号零"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:16
msgid "[the projection](#ignore-cohorts-precision-and-signed-zeros)"
msgstr "[投影](#ignore-cohorts-precision-and-signed-zeros)"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:17
msgid "order two values exactly"
msgstr "精确地比较两个值的大小"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:17
msgid "[cross-multiplication](#order-two-values-exactly)"
msgstr "[交叉相乘](#order-two-values-exactly)"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:18
msgid "check that an interval encloses a decimal"
msgstr "检查区间是否包络某个十进制数"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:19
msgid "compare errors of different packages"
msgstr "比较不同包的错误"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:20
msgid "cross-check two implementations"
msgstr "交叉检验两个实现"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:36
msgid "Three represented as a 32-bit binary float and as a decimal is the same number:"
msgstr "三表示为 32 位二进制浮点数和表示为十进制数时，是同一个数："

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:53
msgid "See the exact value of a float"
msgstr "查看浮点数的精确值"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:55
msgid "The examples below print a projected scalar with this helper:"
msgstr "下面的示例用这个辅助函数打印投影后的标量："

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:80
msgid "The denominator of the binary value is $2^{55}$; the decimal value is exactly $1/10$. The projections differ, so binary64 `0.1` is not one tenth."
msgstr "二进制值的分母是 $2^{55}$；十进制值恰好是 $1/10$。两者的投影不同，因此 binary64 `0.1` 不是十分之一。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:83
msgid "Ignore cohorts, precision and signed zeros"
msgstr "忽略同值类、精度和带符号零"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:85
msgid "Decimal `1.5`, `1.50` and `1.500` are different representations of one value (a cohort); a binary value carries a precision; zero has two signs. The projection forgets all of this:"
msgstr "十进制的 `1.5`、`1.50` 和 `1.500` 是同一个值的不同表示（一个同值类）；二进制值带有精度；零有两种符号。投影会忽略所有这些："

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:109
msgid "Order two values exactly"
msgstr "精确地比较两个值的大小"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:111
msgid "The package provides equality only. Because a projected rational exposes a reduced numerator and a positive denominator, you can order two of them with the cross-multiplication rule $a/b < c/d \\iff ad < cb$ (valid because $b, d > 0$):"
msgstr "本包只提供相等性。由于投影得到的有理数暴露了约分后的分子和正的分母，你可以用交叉相乘规则 $a/b < c/d \\iff ad < cb$ 对其中两个排序（因为 $b, d > 0$，该规则成立）："

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:134
msgid "Check that an interval encloses a decimal"
msgstr "检查区间是否包络某个十进制数"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:136
msgid "`SemanticInterval::from_ball_float` exposes the exact endpoints of a ball. With the comparison above you can check an enclosure against a decimal reference value without any rounding:"
msgstr "`SemanticInterval::from_ball_float` 暴露了球的精确端点。结合上面的比较，你可以在不做任何舍入的情况下，用十进制参考值检查包络："

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:170
msgid "The empty interval projects to the reversed pair $(+\\infty, -\\infty)$, so the helper rejects every value without a special case."
msgstr "空区间投影为反转的对 $(+\\infty, -\\infty)$，因此辅助函数无需特殊处理即可拒绝每个值。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:175
msgid "Compare checked results across packages"
msgstr "跨包比较 checked 结果"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:177
msgid "`semantic_scalar_result` maps a `Result[T, ArithmeticError]` to a `SemanticResult`, so an error from one package and the same error from another compare equal although their messages differ:"
msgstr "`semantic_scalar_result` 把 `Result[T, ArithmeticError]` 映射为 `SemanticResult`，因此来自一个包的错误与来自另一个包的同一错误比较为相等，尽管它们的消息不同："

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:200
msgid "Cross-check two implementations"
msgstr "交叉检验两种实现"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:202
msgid "A typical consistency test computes one result in two representations, rounds both to values that are exactly representable in each, and compares the projections. Square roots of perfect squares are exact in both radices:"
msgstr "典型的一致性测试在两种表示下计算同一个结果，把两者都舍入为在各自表示中都能精确表示的值，然后比较投影。完全平方数的平方根在两种基数下都是精确的："

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:225
msgid "`NaN == NaN` is `true` for `SemanticScalar`. The projection is a value model, not IEEE comparison; use the concrete packages for IEEE predicates."
msgstr "对 `SemanticScalar` 而言 `NaN == NaN` 为 `true`。投影是一种值模型，而不是 IEEE 比较；IEEE 谓词请使用具体的包。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:227
msgid "The projection drops the sign of zero, NaN payloads and signalling state, decimal cohorts, precision and flags. Do not use it to test those. Decorated intervals are not accepted at all."
msgstr "投影丢弃了零的符号、NaN 载荷与信号状态、十进制同值类、精度和标志。不要用它来检验这些属性。装饰区间则完全不被接受。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:230
msgid "There is no ordering in the package. Write the cross-multiplication yourself as above; never convert to `Double` to compare."
msgstr "本包没有提供序。请像上面那样自己写交叉相乘；切勿为了比较而转换为 `Double`。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:232
msgid "Projecting a value with a huge exponent (for example decimal `1E+999999`, or a `BinFloat` near its exponent limit $2^{30}$) builds a `BigInt` with as many digits or bits as the exponent. Keep projections to values of moderate exponent."
msgstr "投影一个指数极大的值（例如十进制数 `1E+999999`，或接近其指数界限 $2^{30}$ 的 `BinFloat`）会构造一个位数与指数相当的 `BigInt`。请只对指数适中的值进行投影。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:236
msgid "Only `@decimal.Decimal` has a projection; convert a `@decimal_gda.Decimal` through its string form if you need one."
msgstr "只有 `@decimal.Decimal` 有投影；如果需要投影 `@decimal_gda.Decimal`，请经由其字符串形式转换。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:238
msgid "`ExactRational::new` aborts on a zero denominator."
msgstr "`ExactRational::new` 在分母为零时中止。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:242
msgid "[`semantic` design](../design/semantic.md): the exact projection, the canonical form and the interval model."
msgstr "[`semantic` 设计](../design/semantic.md)：精确投影、规范形式与区间模型。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:244
msgid "[`semantic` API](../api/semantic.md): every item with its signature."
msgstr "[`semantic` API](../api/semantic.md)：每个条目及其签名。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:245
msgid "[`def` tutorial](def.md) for the shared vocabulary (`Sign`, `Floating`)."
msgstr "共享词汇（`Sign`、`Floating`）见 [`def` 教程](def.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:246
msgid "[`ball_float` tutorial](ball_float.md) for computing the enclosures you project."
msgstr "如何计算你要投影的包络，见 [`ball_float` 教程](ball_float.md)。"

#: manual/verification.md:1
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: manual/verification.md:3
msgid "The repository separates fast development checks from finite, reproducible conformance claims. Passing a corpus proves only the declared formats, operations, rounding modes, targets and fixture revisions. This guide lists the gates, what each published claim covers, and how to reproduce and triage a result."
msgstr "本仓库将快速的开发检查与有限、可复现的符合性结论区分开来。通过某个语料只能证明所声明的格式、运算、舍入模式、目标和 fixture 版本。本指南列出各个关卡、每项已发布结论的覆盖范围，以及如何复现和排查结果。"

#: manual/verification.md:9
msgid "Verification layers"
msgstr "验证层级"

#: manual/verification.md:11
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: manual/verification.md:13
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

