#~ msgstr "行为"

#~ msgid "Cause"
#~ msgstr "原因"

#~ msgid "Issue"
#~ msgstr "Issue"

#~ msgid "an exact decimal result of a non-integral power that is not a binary fraction ($0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$) carries `inexact` (half modes) or fails certification (directed modes)"
#~ msgstr "非整数次幂的精确十进制结果若不是二进制分数（$0.0016^{0.25} = 0.2$），会带有 `inexact`（half 模式）或认证失败（定向模式）"

