#~ msgid "[!WARNING] The exponent of the text is clamped to $\\pm 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$ without any signal. `from_string(\"1e1600000000\")` returns `1E+1500000000`, and `from_string(\"1e-1600000000\")` returns `1E-1500000000`. The same capped value reaches `from_string_ctx`, so under a context whose exponent range includes $\\pm 1.5\\cdot 10^{9}$ (for example `e_max=2000000000`) the conversion reports no flag at all instead of `overflow` or `underflow`. Contexts with the default range ($\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$) still overflow or underflow correctly, because the capped exponent is itself out of range. Tracked in [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108); a fix is proposed in [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 文本的指数会被钳制到 $\\pm 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$，且不发出任何信号。`from_string(\"1e1600000000\")` 返回 `1E+1500000000`，`from_string(\"1e-1600000000\")` 返回 `1E-1500000000`。同样被截断的值也会传给 `from_string_ctx`，因此在指数范围包含 $\\pm 1.5\\cdot 10^{9}$ 的上下文（例如 `e_max=2000000000`）下，该转换不报告任何标志，而不是报告 `overflow` 或 `underflow`。使用默认范围（$\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$）的上下文仍能正确地上溢或下溢，因为被截断的指数本身就超出范围。由 [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108) 跟踪；修复已在 [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] The exponent field of a literal saturates at $\\pm 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$ without any error: `from_string(\"1e1600000000\")` returns `1E+1500000000`. Exponents are 32-bit integers, and arithmetic on such values can wrap around: for `x = from_string(\"1E+1500000000\")`, `x * x` prints `1E-1294967296`, and `multiply(x, x, context())` returns `0E-1000000032` with `Underflow` instead of overflowing. The GDA `parse` under a context with $e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999\\,999$ is safe (it overflows to infinity), but a context with a larger $e_{\\max}$ accepts the saturated value silently. Keep literal exponents within $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$, the GDA limit. Tracked in [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108); a fix is proposed in [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 字面量的指数字段在 $\\pm 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$ 处饱和，且不报告任何错误：`from_string(\"1e1600000000\")` 返回 `1E+1500000000`。指数是 32 位整数，对此类值的运算可能发生回绕：对于 `x = from_string(\"1E+1500000000\")`，`x * x` 打印为 `1E-1294967296`，而 `multiply(x, x, context())` 返回带 `Underflow` 的 `0E-1000000032`，而不是上溢。在 $e_{\\max} \\le 999\\,999\\,999$ 的上下文下，GDA `parse` 是安全的（它上溢为无穷），但 $e_{\\max}$ 更大的上下文会无声地接受饱和后的值。请将字面量指数保持在 GDA 的限制 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$ 之内。由 [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108) 跟踪；修复已在 [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] The magnitude of the written exponent saturates at $1\\,500\\,000\\,000$ before the fraction digits are subtracted, so `1e1600000000` and `1e1500000000` split to the same exponent. `@decimal.Decimal::from_string` and `@decimal_gda.Decimal::from_string` (which keep any exponent when no context is given), and `from_string_ctx` with a context whose `e_max` exceeds $1.5 \\cdot 10^{9}$, therefore return `1E+1500000000` for `1e1600000000` instead of overflowing or keeping its value. Tracked in [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108); a fix is proposed in [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 书写的指数的绝对值在减去小数部分位数之前饱和于 $1\\,500\\,000\\,000$，因此 `1e1600000000` 和 `1e1500000000` 拆分后得到相同的指数。因此，`@decimal.Decimal::from_string` 和 `@decimal_gda.Decimal::from_string`（在未给出上下文时保留任意指数），以及使用 `e_max` 超过 $1.5 \\cdot 10^{9}$ 的上下文的 `from_string_ctx`，对 `1e1600000000` 返回 `1E+1500000000`，既不上溢，也不保留其值。由 [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108) 跟踪；修复已在 [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117) 中提出。"

