#~ msgid "It does not support exponents beyond the 32-bit range. Literal exponents saturate at $\\pm 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$ and exponent sums of such operands can wrap around (see the warning under `Decimal::parse` on the [API page](../api/decimal_gda.md#decimalparse-decimalfrom_string); tracked in [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108), with a fix proposed in [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117)); with operand exponents within the GDA limit of $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$ the sum or difference of two exponents stays below $2^{31}$."
#~ msgstr "它不支持超出 32 位范围的指数。字面量指数在 $\\pm 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$ 处饱和，此类操作数的指数之和可能回绕（参见 [API 页面](../api/decimal_gda.md#decimalparse-decimalfrom_string)上 `Decimal::parse` 下的警告；由 [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108) 跟踪，修复已在 [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117) 中提出）；当操作数指数在 GDA 限制 $\\pm 999\\,999\\,999$ 以内时，两个指数的和或差保持在 $2^{31}$ 以下。"

#~ msgid "`split_decimal_string` caps the magnitude of the written exponent at $C = 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$ while reading digits, then subtracts the number $f$ of fraction digits. The cap keeps the arithmetic in `Int`: the result $q \\in [-C - f, C]$ cannot overflow while $f < 2^{31} - 1 - C \\approx 6.5 \\cdot 10^{8}$, that is, for any literal shorter than about 650 million characters."
#~ msgstr "`split_decimal_string` 在读取数字时把所写指数的绝对值上限设为 $C = 1\\,500\\,000\\,000$，然后减去小数位数 $f$。该上限使运算保持在 `Int` 范围内：只要 $f < 2^{31} - 1 - C \\approx 6.5 \\cdot 10^{8}$，即对任何短于约 6.5 亿个字符的字面量，结果 $q \\in [-C - f, C]$ 都不会溢出。"

#~ msgid "The cap is invisible only when every exponent at or beyond $C$ already overflows or underflows in the caller's context. That holds for the standard interchange contexts ($e_{\\max} \\le 6144$) and for the default `DecimalContext` ($e_{\\max} = 999\\,999\\,999$), but not everywhere:"
#~ msgstr "只有当绝对值达到或超过 $C$ 的每个指数在调用者的上下文中本就会上溢或下溢时，该上限才是不可见的。对标准交换上下文（$e_{\\max} \\le 6144$）和默认的 `DecimalContext`（$e_{\\max} = 999\\,999\\,999$）这一点成立，但并非处处如此："

#~ msgid "`Decimal::from_string` without a context keeps any exponent, so `1e1600000000` becomes `1E+1500000000`, a different number, without an error;"
#~ msgstr "不带上下文的 `Decimal::from_string` 会保留任何指数，因此 `1e1600000000` 会在不报错的情况下变为另一个数 `1E+1500000000`；"

#~ msgid "`DecimalContext::new` accepts an `e_max` above $C$, and `from_string_ctx` under such a context makes the same substitution without raising `overflow`."
#~ msgstr "`DecimalContext::new` 接受大于 $C$ 的 `e_max`，而在这样的上下文下，`from_string_ctx` 会做同样的替换，且不引发 `overflow`。"

#~ msgid "A faithful fix keeps a saturated flag next to the exponent and lets the caller turn it into overflow, underflow or a parse error; the current code does not. Tracked in [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108); a fix is proposed in [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117). The substitution is recorded as a known defect on the [API page](../api/internal.md#split_decimal_string)."
#~ msgstr "忠实的修复应在指数旁保存一个饱和标志，让调用者将其转为上溢、下溢或解析错误；当前代码没有这样做。由 [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108) 跟踪；修复已在 [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117) 中提出。这一替换在 [API 页面](../api/internal.md#split_decimal_string)上被记录为已知缺陷。"

#~ msgid "**Huge exponents in text are capped.** The parsers clamp exponents beyond $\\pm 1.5\\cdot 10^{9}$ silently (`\"1e1600000000\"` becomes `1E+1500000000`). Reject such text before parsing if it can reach you. Tracked in [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108); a fix is proposed in [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117)."
#~ msgstr "**文本中的巨大指数会被截断。** 解析器会静默地把超出 $\\pm 1.5\\cdot 10^{9}$ 的指数钳制到该范围（`\"1e1600000000\"` 变为 `1E+1500000000`）。如果这类文本可能传到你这里，请在解析前拒绝它。由 [#108](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/108) 跟踪；修复已在 [#117](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/117) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "The decimal cores parse literals with `split_decimal_string`; its exponent saturation is a known defect described on the [API page](../api/internal.md#split_decimal_string)."
#~ msgstr "十进制核心用 `split_decimal_string` 解析字面量；它的指数饱和是一个已知缺陷，在 [API 页面](../api/internal.md#split_decimal_string)中有描述。"

#~ msgid "The `''` escape of quoted decTest strings is not recognized ([#63](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/63), no fix yet)."
#~ msgstr "带引号的 decTest 字符串中的 `''` 转义未被识别（[#63](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/63)，尚无修复）。"

#~ msgid "**Doubled quotes.** The tokenizer ends a quoted token at the next matching quote; the `''` escape of the decTest format is read as two tokens (tracked in [#63](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/63); no fix yet)."
#~ msgstr "**双写引号。** 词法分析器在下一个匹配的引号处结束一个带引号的记号；decTest 格式中的 `''` 转义会被读作两个记号（由 [#63](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/63) 跟踪；尚无修复）。"

#~ msgid "`precision` (default `53`) is the bit precision used to read bounds. Interval results are rounded with `@ball_float.BallContext::binary64()` regardless of `precision`, so the default is the meaningful value for ITF1788 data (tracked in [#62](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/62); no fix yet)."
#~ msgstr "`precision`（默认 `53`）是读取端点时使用的二进制位精度。无论 `precision` 为何，区间结果都用 `@ball_float.BallContext::binary64()` 舍入，因此对于 ITF1788 数据，默认值才是有意义的取值（由 [#62](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/62) 跟踪；尚无修复）。"

#~ msgid "Decimal bounds are rounded to nearest, not outward ([#62](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/62), no fix yet)."
#~ msgstr "十进制端点采用就近舍入，而非向外舍入（[#62](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/62)，尚无修复）。"

#~ msgid "Interval results are always rounded to binary64; `precision` only affects how bounds are read ([#62](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/62))."
#~ msgstr "区间结果总是舍入到 binary64；`precision` 只影响端点的读取方式（[#62](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/62)）。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] A non-integer power whose exact value is representable, such as $4^{1.5} = 8$, is a boundary of the rounding cell in the directed modes (`Down`, `Up`, `Ceiling`, `Floor`), so certification cannot succeed and the refinement loop runs to the end of its budget. On a native debug build `power(4, 1.5)` at precision 5 under `Down` did not return within fifteen minutes, while `HalfEven` returns `8.0000` at once. Some such powers, for example $16^{0.25}$, are recognized early and are fast in every mode. Tracked in [#112](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/112); a fix is proposed in [#116](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/116)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 精确值可表示的非整数次幂（例如 $4^{1.5} = 8$）在定向模式（`Down`、`Up`、`Ceiling`、`Floor`）下正好落在舍入单元的边界上，因此认证无法成功，细化循环会一直运行到预算耗尽。在原生调试构建中，`Down` 下精度为 5 的 `power(4, 1.5)` 在十五分钟内都没有返回，而 `HalfEven` 会立即返回 `8.0000`。某些此类幂（例如 $16^{0.25}$）会被提前识别，在所有模式下都很快。由 [#112](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/112) 跟踪；修复已在 [#116](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/116) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "A non-integer `power` with an exactly representable value, such as $4^{1.5}$, does not finish in reasonable time in the directed rounding modes ([API](../api/decimal_gda.md#power); tracked in [#112](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/112), fix proposed in [#116](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/116))."
#~ msgstr "值可精确表示的非整数 `power`（例如 $4^{1.5}$）在定向舍入模式下无法在合理时间内完成（[API](../api/decimal_gda.md#power)；由 [#112](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/112) 跟踪，修复已在 [#116](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/116) 中提出）。"

#~ msgid "**Exact cases first.** $\\exp 0 = 1$, $\\ln 1 = 0$, $\\log_{10} 10^k = k$, special operands, domain errors, and the cases `power` can decide exactly ($x^{1/2}$ via `sqrt`, powers of ten, $1^y$, guaranteed overflow or underflow) never reach the loop."
#~ msgstr "**先处理精确情形。** $\\exp 0 = 1$、$\\ln 1 = 0$、$\\log_{10} 10^k = k$、特殊操作数、定义域错误，以及 `power` 能精确判定的情形（经由 `sqrt` 的 $x^{1/2}$、十的幂、$1^y$、必然上溢或下溢）永远不会进入循环。"

#~ msgid "`normalized` rebuilds a bounded interval from its normalized center and radius (`BinFloat::normalized` removes trailing zero bits), and re-rounds the finite endpoints of an unbounded interval outward."
#~ msgstr "`normalized` 由规范化后的中心和半径重建有界区间（`BinFloat::normalized` 会去除末尾的零位），并将无界区间的有限端点向外重新舍入。"

#~ msgid "The result contains the input but, for the reason given under `with_precision`, can be strictly wider: `normalized` of $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ at 53 bits is $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$. It therefore satisfies only the enclosure form of the `@def.Floating` law \"normalizing keeps the value\". Tracked in [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "结果包含输入，但出于 `with_precision` 中所述的原因，可能严格更宽：在 53 位下，$[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ 的 `normalized` 为 $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$。因此它只满足 `@def.Floating` 定律“规范化保持值不变”的包络形式。由 [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`underflow` is raised only when the second, subnormal-grid step is inexact. IEEE 754 raises it for every tiny inexact result, so a tiny endpoint whose precision rounding is inexact but lands on the subnormal grid raises `inexact` without `underflow`: with $p = 4$ and $e_{\\min} = -2$, the lower endpoint $2^{-3}(1 + 2^{-10})$ becomes $2^{-3}$ and only `inexact` is set. Tracked in [#71](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/71); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "只有当第二步（次正规网格上的舍入）不精确时才会引发 `underflow`。IEEE 754 对每个不精确的极小结果都会引发它，因此若某个极小端点的精度舍入不精确、但落在次正规网格上，则只引发 `inexact` 而不引发 `underflow`：取 $p = 4$、$e_{\\min} = -2$，下端点 $2^{-3}(1 + 2^{-10})$ 变为 $2^{-3}$，只设置 `inexact`。由 [#71](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/71) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`midpoint_ctx` returns the center rounded to nearest at the context precision."
#~ msgstr "`midpoint_ctx` 返回以上下文精度就近舍入后的中心。"

#~ msgid "Subnormal results are rounded on the subnormal grid and raise `underflow` when inexact; `inexact` is set when the center changed. The exponent upper limit is not applied, so `overflow` is never raised ([#46](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/46)). Entire gives 0; Empty and half-bounded intervals abort."
#~ msgstr "次正规结果在次正规网格上舍入，不精确时触发 `underflow`；中心发生改变时设置 `inexact`。指数上限不被施加，因此从不触发 `overflow`（[#46](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/46)）。Entire 给出 0；Empty 和半无界区间会中止。"

#~ msgid "The center is rounded to nearest twice, first to $p$ bits and then onto the subnormal grid, and double rounding to nearest is not single rounding: with $p = 4$, $e_{\\min} = -2$ (grid $2^{-5}$) the center $2^{-6} + 2^{-20}$ is first rounded to the tie $2^{-6}$ and then to the even neighbour 0, whereas the nearest grid point is $2^{-5}$. Normal results are correctly rounded. Tracked in [#70](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/70); a fix for both defects is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "中心会被两次就近舍入，先舍入到 $p$ 位，再舍入到次正规网格上，而两次就近舍入不等于一次舍入：取 $p = 4$、$e_{\\min} = -2$（网格为 $2^{-5}$），中心 $2^{-6} + 2^{-20}$ 先被舍入为中点 $2^{-6}$，再舍入为偶数邻居 0，而最近的网格点是 $2^{-5}$。正规结果都是正确舍入的。由 [#70](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/70) 跟踪；针对这两个缺陷的修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`neg` and `abs` are the exact interval images $\\{-t\\}$ and $\\{|t|\\}$; `with_precision` returns an enclosure of the input at the new precision for every rounding mode (the mode only steers the center). `with_precision` and `normalized` rebuild the interval from its center and radius and can widen it by one ulp per side even at an unchanged precision (see [`BallFloat::with_precision`](ball_float.md#ballfloatwith_precision); tracked in [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69), with a fix proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91))."
#~ msgstr "`neg` 和 `abs` 是精确的区间像 $\\{-t\\}$ 和 $\\{|t|\\}$；`with_precision` 对每种舍入模式都返回输入在新精度下的包络（模式只影响中心）。`with_precision` 和 `normalized` 由中心和半径重建区间，即使精度不变，每侧也可能变宽一个 ulp（参见 [`BallFloat::with_precision`](ball_float.md#ballfloatwith_precision)；由 [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69) 跟踪，修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出）。"

#~ msgid "For `BallFloat` the result is an enclosure of the input: the centre is rounded with `mode` and the rounding error is added to the radius, so every member of `x` remains a member of the result whatever `mode` is (except for endpoints more than about $2^{16}$ binary orders of magnitude apart at a new precision above about 65536 bits, tracked in [#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44) with a fix proposed in [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68)). The result can be wider than `x` even when `p` equals the current precision, because the exact centre of $[\\ell, u]$ may need one bit more than the endpoints."
#~ msgstr "对于 `BallFloat`，结果是输入的包络：中心按 `mode` 舍入，舍入误差加到半径上，因此无论 `mode` 为何，`x` 的每个成员仍是结果的成员（端点在二进制数量级上相差超过约 $2^{16}$ 且新精度高于约 65536 位的情形除外，由 [#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44) 跟踪，修复已在 [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68) 中提出）。即使 `p` 等于当前精度，结果也可能比 `x` 更宽，因为 $[\\ell, u]$ 的精确中心可能比端点多需要一位。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `BallFloat::normalized` rebuilds the interval from its centre and radius at the stored precision, like `with_precision`. It returns an enclosure of the input, which can be strictly wider: at 53 bits, $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ becomes $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$. Do not use it where the interval must stay unchanged. Tracked in [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `BallFloat::normalized` 与 `with_precision` 一样，以存储的精度从中心和半径重建区间。它返回输入的一个包络，该包络可能严格更宽：在 53 位下，$[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ 变为 $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$。在区间必须保持不变的地方不要使用它。由 [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`midpoint_ctx` does not apply the context's $e_{\\max}$ and never raises `overflow`. It also rounds to nearest twice (to $p$ bits, then onto the subnormal grid), so a subnormal midpoint can be the wrong neighbour: with $p = 4$, $e_{\\min} = -2$, the center $2^{-6} + 2^{-20}$ gives 0 instead of $2^{-5}$. Tracked in [#46](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/46) and [#70](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/70); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "`midpoint_ctx` 不施加上下文的 $e_{\\max}$，也从不引发 `overflow`。它还会就近舍入两次（先到 $p$ 位，再到次正规网格上），因此次正规的中点可能是错误的相邻值：在 $p = 4$、$e_{\\min} = -2$ 时，中心 $2^{-6} + 2^{-20}$ 给出 0 而不是 $2^{-5}$。由 [#46](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/46) 和 [#70](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/70) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`apply_ctx` raises `underflow` only when the subnormal-grid step is inexact, not for every tiny inexact endpoint as IEEE 754 does. Tracked in [#71](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/71); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "`apply_ctx` 仅在次正规网格这一步不精确时才引发 `underflow`，而不像 IEEE 754 那样对每个微小且不精确的端点都引发。由 [#71](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/71) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`pow_nat_checked(Empty, 0)` returns $\\{1\\}$ (the power loop starts from $\\{1\\}$ without checking the base), whereas `pown(Empty, 0)` is Empty. Tracked in [#72](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/72); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "`pow_nat_checked(Empty, 0)` 返回 $\\{1\\}$（幂循环从 $\\{1\\}$ 开始而不检查底数），而 `pown(Empty, 0)` 为 Empty。由 [#72](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/72) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Why (F6) holds for `BallFloat`.** A bounded `BallFloat` stores its endpoints $\\ell \\le u$. Its centre $c = (\\ell + u)/2$ is computed exactly, and its radius $r$ is the half-width $(u - \\ell)/2$ rounded upward, so every member $t$ satisfies $|t - c| \\le (u - \\ell)/2 \\le r$. `with_precision` computes $\\tilde c = \\circ_{m,q}(c)$, rounds the error $|c - \\tilde c|$ and the radius upward to $\\tilde e \\ge |c-\\tilde c|$ and $\\tilde r \\ge r$, adds them with upward rounding to $R \\ge \\tilde r + \\tilde e$, and stores $[\\n"
#~ "abla(\\tilde c - R), \\Delta(\\tilde c + R)]$. For any member $t$ with $|t - c| \\le r$,"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**为什么 (F6) 对 `BallFloat` 成立。** 有界的 `BallFloat` 存储其端点 $\\ell \\le u$。其中心 $c = (\\ell + u)/2$ 是精确计算的，半径 $r$ 是向上舍入的半宽 $(u - \\ell)/2$，因此每个成员 $t$ 都满足 $|t - c| \\le (u - \\ell)/2 \\le r$。`with_precision` 计算 $\\tilde c = \\circ_{m,q}(c)$，把误差 $|c - \\tilde c|$ 和半径向上舍入为 $\\tilde e \\ge |c-\\tilde c|$ 和 $\\tilde r \\ge r$，以向上舍入把它们相加得到 $R \\ge \\tilde r + \\tilde e$，并存储 $[\\n"
#~ "abla(\\tilde c - R), \\Delta(\\tilde c + R)]$。对任意满足 $|t - c| \\le r$ 的成员 $t$，"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "so $\\n"
#~ "abla(\\tilde c - R) \\le \\tilde c - R \\le t \\le \\tilde c + R \\le \\Delta(\\tilde c + R)$. The direction $m$ only moves the centre; the enclosure holds for every $m$. If $\\tilde c \\pm R$ leaves the `BinFloat` range, the directed roundings go to $\\mp\\infty$, which still encloses. Unbounded intervals round the lower endpoint down and the upper endpoint up, which encloses trivially. The empty interval maps to the empty interval."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "因此 $\\n"
#~ "abla(\\tilde c - R) \\le \\tilde c - R \\le t \\le \\tilde c + R \\le \\Delta(\\tilde c + R)$。方向 $m$ 只移动中心；对每个 $m$ 包络都成立。若 $\\tilde c \\pm R$ 超出 `BinFloat` 的范围，定向舍入会得到 $\\mp\\infty$，仍然构成包络。无界区间把下端点向下舍入、上端点向上舍入，包络关系平凡成立。空区间映射为空区间。"

#~ msgid "The argument needs the exact centre. For endpoints more than about $2^{16}$ binary orders of magnitude apart, `center` replaces the smaller endpoint by a sticky surrogate (see the [`ball_float` design](ball_float.md#far-addends-bound-endpoint-sums-by-precision)), and at a new precision above about 65536 bits the rebuilt interval can miss the smaller endpoint. This is tracked in [#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44); a fix is proposed in [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68)."
#~ msgstr "该论证需要精确的中心。对于端点在二进制数量级上相差超过约 $2^{16}$ 的情形，`center` 会将较小的端点替换为一个粘滞替代值（参见 [`ball_float` 设计](ball_float.md#far-addends-bound-endpoint-sums-by-precision)），而在高于约 65536 位的新精度下，重建的区间可能遗漏较小的端点。这由 [#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44) 跟踪；修复已在 [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "**Why `BallFloat` has only (F7′).** `normalized` on a bounded interval calls the same centre–radius quantization at the stored precision $q$, so the argument above gives (F7′). Equality fails in general: the exact centre of two $q$-bit endpoints may need $q + 1$ bits, and then rounding it adds an error term to the radius. With $q = 53$, $\\ell = 1$ and $u = 1 + 2^{-52}$, the centre $1 + 2^{-53}$ rounds to $1$, the radius $2^{-53}$ grows by the error $2^{-53}$ to $2^{-52}$, and the result is $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}] \\supsetneq [\\ell, u]$. For the same reason `with_precision(x, precision(x), m)` is not the identity on intervals, and repeated normalization is not guaranteed to be stable (each step can only widen, and it stops widening once the centre is representable at $q$ bits and the endpoints are exact). The widening of representable intervals is tracked in [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "**为什么 `BallFloat` 只有 (F7′)。** 有界区间上的 `normalized` 以存储的精度 $q$ 调用同样的中心–半径量化，因此上述论证给出 (F7′)。等式一般不成立：两个 $q$ 位端点的精确中心可能需要 $q + 1$ 位，此时对它舍入会给半径加上一个误差项。取 $q = 53$、$\\ell = 1$、$u = 1 + 2^{-52}$，中心 $1 + 2^{-53}$ 舍入为 $1$，半径 $2^{-53}$ 加上误差 $2^{-53}$ 增大为 $2^{-52}$，结果为 $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}] \\supsetneq [\\ell, u]$。出于同样的原因，`with_precision(x, precision(x), m)` 在区间上不是恒等映射，重复规范化也不保证稳定（每一步只可能变宽；一旦中心可用 $q$ 位表示且端点精确，就不再变宽）。可表示区间的变宽由 [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`normalized` keeps the value only on scalars; on intervals it is an enclosure (F7′)."
#~ msgstr "`normalized` 只在标量上保持值不变；在区间上它是一个包络 (F7′)。"

#~ msgid "**Re-rounding can widen.** `with_precision` and `normalized` rebuild an interval from its center and radius. When the center needs more bits than the precision, the result is one ulp wider on each side, even at the same precision: $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ at 53 bits becomes $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$. To change precision without that loss, use `from_bounds(x.lower_bound(), x.upper_bound(), precision=q)`. This widening is tracked in [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91)."
#~ msgstr "**重新舍入可能使区间变宽。** `with_precision` 和 `normalized` 根据区间的中心和半径重建区间。当中心所需的位数多于精度时，即使精度不变，结果的每一侧也会变宽一个 ulp：53 位下的 $[1, 1 + 2^{-52}]$ 会变成 $[1 - 2^{-52}, 1 + 2^{-52}]$。若要改变精度而不受这种损失，请使用 `from_bounds(x.lower_bound(), x.upper_bound(), precision=q)`。这种变宽由 [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "On a `BallFloat`, `normalized` and `with_precision` return an enclosure that can be wider than the input, even at the same precision. Apart from endpoints more than about $2^{16}$ binary orders of magnitude apart at a precision above about 65536 bits ([#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44), with a fix proposed in [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68)) they never lose a member, but do not expect the bounds to stay the same (tracked in [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69); a fix is proposed in [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91))."
#~ msgstr "对于 `BallFloat`，`normalized` 和 `with_precision` 返回的包络可能比输入更宽，即使精度相同也是如此。除了端点在二进制数量级上相差超过约 $2^{16}$ 且精度高于约 65536 位的情形（[#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44)，修复已在 [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68) 中提出）之外，它们绝不会丢失成员，但不要指望上下界保持不变（由 [#69](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/69) 跟踪；修复已在 [#91](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/91) 中提出）。"

#~ msgid "For a bounded interval the center is rounded with `mode`, the displacement is added to the radius, and the result is rebuilt as in `BallFloat::new`. For an unbounded interval the finite endpoint is rounded outward and `mode` is ignored. Empty stays Empty with the new precision."
#~ msgstr "对于有界区间，中心按 `mode` 舍入，所产生的偏移加到半径上，然后像 `BallFloat::new` 那样重建结果。对于无界区间，有限端点向外舍入，`mode` 被忽略。Empty 仍为 Empty，但带上新的精度。"

#~ msgid "`with_precision` (and therefore `normalized`) rebuilds a bounded interval from `center()`, which uses the far-addend surrogate with round-to-nearest. For endpoints more than about $2^{16}$ binary orders of magnitude apart and a new precision large enough to store the surrogate exactly (more than about 65536 bits), the result can lose the smaller endpoint. Tracked in [#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44); a fix is proposed in [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68)."
#~ msgstr "`with_precision`（因而 `normalized` 也）从 `center()` 重建有界区间，而后者使用带就近舍入的远加数替身。当端点相距超过约 $2^{16}$ 个二进制数量级，且新精度大到足以精确存储该替身（超过约 65536 位）时，结果可能丢失较小的端点。由 [#44](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/44) 跟踪；修复已在 [#68](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/68) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Integrality and parity of $y$ are read from its odd coefficient: a finite nonzero $y$ is integral when `exponent2()` $\\ge 0$ and odd when it is $0$. Step 11 rounds its enclosure without moving a representable end inward, so an exponent so small that $x^y$ lies closer to $1$ than the target spacing is a `certification_failure`, for example $2^{2^{-16000}}$ in `binary128()`. Tracked in [#128](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/128); a fix is proposed in [#130](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/130)."
#~ msgstr "$y$ 的整数性和奇偶性由其奇数系数读出：有限非零的 $y$ 在 `exponent2()` $\\ge 0$ 时为整数，在其为 $0$ 时为奇数。第 11 步对其包络进行舍入时不会把可表示的端点向内移动，因此当指数小到 $x^y$ 距 $1$ 比目标间距还近时，结果为 `certification_failure`，例如 `binary128()` 中的 $2^{2^{-16000}}$。由 [#128](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/128) 跟踪；修复已在 [#130](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/130) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `div_ctx` by a power of ten takes an exact-quotient shortcut that rounds a result below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ only to the subnormal grid, not to $p$ digits: at precision 5 under `Up`, `4826437 / 1E+24` gives the six-digit `4.82644E-18` instead of `4.8265E-18`. Tracked in [#126](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/126); a fix is proposed in [#127](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/127)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 除以 10 的幂时，`div_ctx` 走一条精确商捷径，它把低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 的结果只舍入到次正规网格，而不是舍入到 $p$ 位：精度为 5、`Up` 模式时，`4826437 / 1E+24` 得到六位数字的 `4.82644E-18`，而不是 `4.8265E-18`。由 [#126](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/126) 跟踪；修复已在 [#127](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/127) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Two rounding defects that the `decimal` package no longer has remain here. A sum with a far smaller addend is decided without the addend's position relative to the rounding boundaries: at precision 7, `subtract(1598618, 9.9E-11)` under `ZeroFiveUp` gives `1598618` instead of `1598617`, and `add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` under `HalfEven` gives `1598618` instead of `1598619` ([#120](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/120)). A normal result whose exact exponent lies below $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ is rounded first to the subnormal grid and then to $p$ digits, and the exact-quotient shortcut of `divide` rounds only to the subnormal grid: in decimal32, `multiply(3.000001E-45, 1.500001E-45)` gives `4.500004E-90` instead of `4.500005E-90`, `divide(1, 1.9999999999998E+101)` gives `0E-101` instead of `1E-101`, and at precision 5 `divide(77223, 16E+21)` gives the six-digit `4.82644E-18` ([#121](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/121)). A fix for both is proposed in [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `decimal` 包已修复的两个舍入缺陷在这里仍然存在。加数远小于另一操作数时，和的判定没有考虑该加数相对于舍入边界的位置：精度为 7 时，`ZeroFiveUp` 下 `subtract(1598618, 9.9E-11)` 得到 `1598618` 而不是 `1598617`，`HalfEven` 下 `add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` 得到 `1598618` 而不是 `1598619`（[#120](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/120)）。精确指数低于 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 的正规结果先被舍入到次正规网格、再舍入到 $p$ 位，而 `divide` 的精确商捷径只舍入到次正规网格：在 decimal32 中，`multiply(3.000001E-45, 1.500001E-45)` 得到 `4.500004E-90` 而不是 `4.500005E-90`，`divide(1, 1.9999999999998E+101)` 得到 `0E-101` 而不是 `1E-101`，精度为 5 时 `divide(77223, 16E+21)` 得到六位数字的 `4.82644E-18`（[#121](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/121)）。两者的修复已在 [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] The `scaleb` finalization departs from the specification in three ways: an overflow gives $\\pm\\infty$ in every rounding mode (in decimal32 under `Down`, `scaleb(9E+96, 1)` is `Infinity` instead of `9.999999E+96`); a zero result keeps its exponent (`scaleb(0E+300, 400)` in decimal64 stays `0E+700` instead of being clamped); and a coefficient longer than $p$ digits is not rounded (`scaleb` of a 20-digit integer by 0 in decimal64 returns all 20 digits). Tracked in [#122](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/122); a fix is proposed in [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `scaleb` 的最终化在三个方面偏离规范：上溢在任何舍入模式下都给出 $\\pm\\infty$（在 decimal32 的 `Down` 下，`scaleb(9E+96, 1)` 为 `Infinity` 而不是 `9.999999E+96`）；零结果保留其指数（在 decimal64 中，`scaleb(0E+300, 400)` 仍为 `0E+700`，而没有被钳制）；长于 $p$ 位的系数不会被舍入（在 decimal64 中，把一个 20 位整数 `scaleb` 0 会返回全部 20 位）。由 [#122](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/122) 跟踪；修复已在 [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Sums with a far smaller addend can misround ([#120](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/120)); normal results whose exact exponent is below $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ are rounded twice, and an exact quotient below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ may keep more than $p$ digits ([#121](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/121)); `scaleb` neither rounds nor clamps and overflows to infinity in every mode ([#122](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/122)). A fix for all three is proposed in [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124) ([API](../api/decimal_gda.md#add-subtract-multiply-divide-fma))."
#~ msgstr "加数远小于另一操作数的和可能舍入错误（[#120](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/120)）；精确指数低于 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 的正规结果会被舍入两次，低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 的精确商可能保留多于 $p$ 位（[#121](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/121)）；`scaleb` 既不舍入也不钳制，并且在任何模式下都上溢为无穷（[#122](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/122)）。三者的修复都已在 [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124) 中提出（[API](../api/decimal_gda.md#add-subtract-multiply-divide-fma)）。"

#~ msgid "The finalizer applies this removal whenever $e < E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$, also for a result whose magnitude is normal, and then rounds again to $p$ digits; for such a result the two roundings can differ from one ([#121](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/121), fix proposed in [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124))."
#~ msgstr "只要 $e < E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$，最终化例程就会做这一移除，对量级为正规的结果也不例外，然后再舍入到 $p$ 位；对这样的结果，两次舍入可能不同于一次舍入（[#121](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/121)，修复已在 [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124) 中提出）。"

#~ msgid "The argument assumes that $x_1$ itself ends at or above the last retained position. When $x_1$ has digits below it, or is exactly a midpoint, $x_2$ can still move the sum across a boundary that the comparison with $u/2$ does not see, and the shortcut misrounds: at precision 7, `add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` under `HalfEven` gives `1598618`. The `decimal` package avoids this by replacing $x_2$ with a sticky unit placed just below every rounding boundary of the sum; porting that is tracked in [#120](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/120), with a fix proposed in [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124)."
#~ msgstr "该论证假定 $x_1$ 本身止于最后保留位置或其上方。当 $x_1$ 在其下方还有数字，或恰为中点时，$x_2$ 仍可能把和推过一个与 $u/2$ 比较所看不到的边界，此时捷径会舍入错误：精度为 7 时，`HalfEven` 下 `add(1598618.5, 1E-20)` 得到 `1598618`。`decimal` 包通过把 $x_2$ 替换为恰好位于和的所有舍入边界之下的粘滞单位来避免这一点；移植这一做法由 [#120](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/120) 跟踪，修复已在 [#124](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/124) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] The exact-power shortcut of `exp2_interval` does not respect the exponent range. An integer lower endpoint $n \\ge 2^{30}$ makes $2^n$ overflow to $+\\infty$ and the call aborts (\"ball lower bound must not be positive infinity\"). An integer upper endpoint $n < -2^{30} - p - 94$ (with $p$ the interval precision) makes $2^n$ underflow to 0, so the result misses the positive value $2^n$: at 53 bits, `exp2_interval` of $\\{-1073742000\\}$ is $\\{0\\}$. `try_exp2_interval` does not use the shortcut. Tracked in [#84](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/84); a fix is proposed in [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `exp2_interval` 的精确幂捷径不遵守指数范围。整数下端点 $n \\ge 2^{30}$ 会使 $2^n$ 上溢为 $+\\infty$，调用随之中止（\"ball lower bound must not be positive infinity\"）。整数上端点 $n < -2^{30} - p - 94$（$p$ 为区间精度）会使 $2^n$ 下溢为 0，因此结果漏掉了正值 $2^n$：在 53 位下，$\\{-1073742000\\}$ 的 `exp2_interval` 为 $\\{0\\}$。`try_exp2_interval` 不使用该捷径。由 [#84](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/84) 跟踪；修复已在 [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] On every target except JavaScript, `ln_interval` does not return for some arguments just above 1 at high precision, for example $\\{1 + 2^{-243}\\}$ at 245 or 300 bits, and neither do `asinh_interval` and `atanh_interval` (which evaluate `ln_interval`) for tiny arguments such as $\\{2^{-300}\\}$ at 53 bits. Their certified kernels convert series bounds to rationals with `BinCoeff::gcd`, which barely progresses for operands of very different lengths (see the warning under [`BinCoeff::gcd`](bin_float.md#bincoeffgcd)). The `try_` forms are not affected. Tracked in [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85); a fix is proposed in [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 在除 JavaScript 以外的所有目标上，对于高精度下略大于 1 的某些参数，`ln_interval` 不会返回，例如 245 位或 300 位下的 $\\{1 + 2^{-243}\\}$；对于极小参数（例如 53 位下的 $\\{2^{-300}\\}$），`asinh_interval` 和 `atanh_interval`（它们会计算 `ln_interval`）同样不会返回。它们经认证的内核使用 `BinCoeff::gcd` 把级数界转换为有理数，而该函数在操作数长度相差悬殊时几乎没有进展（参见 [`BinCoeff::gcd`](bin_float.md#bincoeffgcd) 下的警告）。`try_` 形式不受影响。由 [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85) 跟踪；修复已在 [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Two domain tests are incomplete, so the decoration can claim more than is true:"
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 有两项定义域检测不完整，因此装饰可能声称了超出事实的性质："

#~ msgid "`tanpi_interval` tests only for an Entire result. When a pole is an endpoint, the bare result is half-unbounded and the decoration becomes `dac`, although $\\tan \\pi\\xi$ is undefined at the pole: `tanpi([1/2, 1])` is `[-inf, 0]_dac` instead of `trv`."
#~ msgstr "`tanpi_interval` 只检测结果是否为 Entire。当极点是端点时，裸结果是半无界的，装饰变为 `dac`，尽管 $\\tan \\pi\\xi$ 在极点处无定义：`tanpi([1/2, 1])` 为 `[-inf, 0]_dac` 而非 `trv`。"

#~ msgid "Tracked in [#45](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/45) (`rootn`) and [#86](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/86) (`tanpi`); a fix is proposed in [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96)."
#~ msgstr "由 [#45](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/45)（`rootn`）和 [#86](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/86)（`tanpi`）跟踪；修复已在 [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `paired_hotspot` passes the confidence level as `0.95`, but Maremark reads it as a percentage. The reported `interval` is therefore the central 0.95 % of the bootstrap distribution, between its quantiles 0.49525 and 0.50475: a near-point at the bootstrap median, not a 95 % interval. For the five paired differences $10, 11, 10, 15, 6$ µs it reports $[10, 10]$, where `confirmatory_regression` reports the 95 % interval $[6, 15]$. Use `relative_delta_pct` and `decision`, or `confirmatory_regression`, when an interval matters. Tracked in [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60); a fix is proposed in [#80](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/80)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `paired_hotspot` 以 `0.95` 传递置信水平，但 Maremark 将其解读为百分数。因此报告的 `interval` 是 bootstrap 分布中央的 0.95 %，位于其分位数 0.49525 与 0.50475 之间：这几乎就是 bootstrap 中位数处的一个点，而不是 95 % 区间。对于五个配对差值 $10, 11, 10, 15, 6$ µs，它报告 $[10, 10]$，而 `confirmatory_regression` 报告 95 % 区间 $[6, 15]$。当区间很重要时，请使用 `relative_delta_pct` 和 `decision`，或使用 `confirmatory_regression`。由 [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60) 跟踪；修复已在 [#80](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/80) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] On every target except JavaScript, `gcd` can run practically forever when the operands have very different lengths. Unless both operands fit in four 32-bit limbs it uses Lehmer batches, and the batch loop takes each operand's own top limb as its leading digit. For operands of different lengths these digits have unrelated scales, so each round removes only a small multiple of the smaller operand: a 301-bit odd number and $2^{543}$ need about $2^{220}$ rounds. The certified kernels of `ball_float` call `gcd` when they convert series bounds to rationals, which is why `ln_interval`, `asinh_interval` and `atanh_interval` hang for some arguments. The JavaScript target uses the host `BigInt` and is not affected. Tracked in [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85); a fix is proposed in [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 在除 JavaScript 以外的所有目标上，当操作数长度相差很大时，`gcd` 实际上可能永远运行下去。除非两个操作数都能放入四个 32 位 limb，否则它使用 Lehmer 批处理，而批处理循环把每个操作数各自的最高 limb 当作其首位数字。对于长度不同的操作数，这些数字的量级互不相关，因此每一轮只消去较小操作数的一个小倍数：一个 301 位的奇数与 $2^{543}$ 需要大约 $2^{220}$ 轮。`ball_float` 的认证内核在把级数界转换为有理数时会调用 `gcd`，这就是 `ln_interval`、`asinh_interval` 和 `atanh_interval` 对某些参数挂起的原因。JavaScript 目标使用宿主的 `BigInt`，不受影响。由 [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85) 跟踪；修复已在 [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Two families of inputs defeat the certification on the current branch."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 在当前分支上，有两类输入会使认证失效。"

#~ msgid "**Tiny arguments.** For `exp`, `expm1`, `exp2`, `sin` and `atan` (and possibly others built the same way) an argument so small that the series stops after its first term yields an enclosure with one end exactly on a representable number ($1$ for `exp`, $x$ itself for `sin`). That end rounds without `inexact`, the other end with it, so the flags never agree and the budget runs out. For example `try_sin_ctx` of $2^{-6000}$ at 53 bits, of $2^{-8000}$ in `binary128()`, and `try_exp_ctx` of $2^{-20000}$ at 53 bits all return a `certification_failure`, and the plain forms return NaN. Arguments of binary64 size are not affected. For such tiny $x$ use the first terms of the series yourself ($\\sin x \\approx x$, $e^x \\approx 1 + x$) with a directed rounding. Tracked in [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102); a fix is proposed in [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107)."
#~ msgstr "**极小参数。** 对于 `exp`、`expm1`、`exp2`、`sin` 和 `atan`（以及可能以同样方式构建的其他函数），参数小到级数在第一项后就停止时，所得包络的一端恰好落在可表示数上（对 `exp` 为 $1$，对 `sin` 为 $x$ 本身）。这一端舍入时不带 `inexact`，另一端则带，因此标志永远不一致，预算最终耗尽。例如，`try_sin_ctx` 作用于 53 位下的 $2^{-6000}$ 和 `binary128()` 中的 $2^{-8000}$，以及 `try_exp_ctx` 作用于 53 位下的 $2^{-20000}$ 时，都返回 `certification_failure`，而普通形式返回 NaN。binary64 大小的参数不受影响。对于这样极小的 $x$，请自行使用级数的前几项（$\\sin x \\approx x$，$e^x \\approx 1 + x$）并配合定向舍入。由 [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102) 跟踪；修复已在 [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "**Exact results that are not filtered.** A result that is exactly representable but not recognised before the loop is returned with a spurious `inexact` under nearest rounding and is a `certification_failure` under a directed rounding. This happens for `pow` with a non-integral exponent such as $16^{3/4} = 8$, for `rootn` with a negative degree such as $8^{-1/3} = 1/2$ (and `pow(4, -0.5)`), and for $10^n$ and $\\log_{10} 10^n$ with $n > 4096$ at a precision large enough to hold $10^n$. Tracked in [#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49) (`pow`), [#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90) (`rootn`) and [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102) ($10^n$); fixes are proposed in [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) and [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107)."
#~ msgstr "**未被过滤的精确结果。** 可精确表示但未在循环之前被识别出的结果，在就近舍入下会带着虚假的 `inexact` 返回，在定向舍入下则为 `certification_failure`。这发生在：非整数指数的 `pow`，例如 $16^{3/4} = 8$；负次数的 `rootn`，例如 $8^{-1/3} = 1/2$（以及 `pow(4, -0.5)`）；以及在足以容纳 $10^n$ 的精度下 $n > 4096$ 的 $10^n$ 与 $\\log_{10} 10^n$。由 [#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49)（`pow`）、[#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90)（`rootn`）和 [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102)（$10^n$）跟踪；修复已在 [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) 和 [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Special values and domain as for `ln`. $x = 10^k$ with $1 \\le k \\le 4096$ gives the exact integer $k$."
#~ msgstr "特殊值和定义域同 `ln`。满足 $1 \\le k \\le 4096$ 的 $x = 10^k$ 给出精确整数 $k$。"

#~ msgid "A negative finite $x$, including $-0$, is a `domain_error`."
#~ msgstr "负的有限 $x$（包括 $-0$）为 `domain_error`。"

#~ msgid "$(+0)^{y<0} = +\\infty$ with `division_by_zero`, $(+0)^{y>0} = +0$; $(\\pm\\infty)^{y<0} = +0$, $(\\pm\\infty)^{y>0} = +\\infty$."
#~ msgstr "$(+0)^{y<0} = +\\infty$ 并触发 `division_by_zero`，$(+0)^{y>0} = +0$；$(\\pm\\infty)^{y<0} = +0$，$(\\pm\\infty)^{y>0} = +\\infty$。"

#~ msgid "An infinite $y$ gives $+\\infty$ or $+0$ according to whether $|x^y|$ grows."
#~ msgstr "无穷的 $y$ 根据 $|x^y|$ 是否增长给出 $+\\infty$ 或 $+0$。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Step 5 comes too early, and steps 6 and 7 ignore the sign of an infinite base, so `pow` departs from IEEE 754 `pow` for some inputs: a negative base with an integral exponent of magnitude at least $2^{31}$, a base of $-0$ with any exponent not handled by steps 1 to 3, and a negative finite base with an infinite exponent (IEEE gives $1$ for $(-1)^{\\pm\\infty}$) are `domain_error`s; $(-\\infty)^y$ for an odd integral $y$ with $|y| \\ge 2^{31}$ has the wrong sign; and $(+0)^{-\\infty} = +\\infty$ raises `division_by_zero`, which IEEE does not. Dyadic results of non-integral exponents, such as $16^{3/4} = 8$, carry a spurious `inexact` or fail under directed rounding (see the warning above). Tracked in [#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49) and [#89](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/89); a fix is proposed in [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 第 5 步执行得过早，且第 6、7 步忽略了无穷底数的符号，因此 `pow` 在某些输入上偏离 IEEE 754 的 `pow`：负底数配绝对值至少为 $2^{31}$ 的整数指数、底数为 $-0$ 且指数未被第 1 至 3 步处理、以及负的有限底数配无穷指数（IEEE 对 $(-1)^{\\pm\\infty}$ 给出 $1$），都是 `domain_error`；当奇整数 $y$ 满足 $|y| \\ge 2^{31}$ 时，$(-\\infty)^y$ 的符号错误；并且 $(+0)^{-\\infty} = +\\infty$ 会触发 `division_by_zero`，而 IEEE 不会。非整数指数的二进有理数结果，例如 $16^{3/4} = 8$，会带着虚假的 `inexact`，或在定向舍入下失败（参见上文的警告）。由 [#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49) 和 [#89](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/89) 跟踪；修复已在 [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "$n = 0$ is a `domain_error`, and $|n| > 10^9$ a `certification_failure`. Odd $n$ accepts a negative $x$ ($\\operatorname{rootn}(-8, 3) = -2$); a negative finite $x$ with even $n$ is a `domain_error`. A negative $n$ gives $x^{-1/|n|}$. Zeros: $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n > 0)$ is $\\pm 0$ for odd $n$ and $+0$ for even $n$; $\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n < 0)$ is $\\pm\\infty$ (odd) or $+\\infty$ (even) with `division_by_zero`. For $n > 1$, degree at most 64 and a coefficient of at most 4096 bits, an exact root is detected and returned without `inexact`."
#~ msgstr "$n = 0$ 为 `domain_error`，$|n| > 10^9$ 为 `certification_failure`。奇数 $n$ 接受负的 $x$（$\\operatorname{rootn}(-8, 3) = -2$）；偶数 $n$ 配负的有限 $x$ 为 `domain_error`。负的 $n$ 给出 $x^{-1/|n|}$。零：$\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n > 0)$ 对奇数 $n$ 为 $\\pm 0$，对偶数 $n$ 为 $+0$；$\\operatorname{rootn}(\\pm 0, n < 0)$ 为 $\\pm\\infty$（奇数）或 $+\\infty$（偶数）并触发 `division_by_zero`。当 $n > 1$、次数至多为 64 且系数至多 4096 位时，精确的根会被检测出来并以不带 `inexact` 的方式返回。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] $\\operatorname{rootn}(-\\infty, n)$ with even $n$ returns $+\\infty$ (and $+0$ for even negative $n$) instead of a `domain_error`, unlike a finite negative argument. Exact roots with a negative degree are not detected (see the warning at the start of this section). Tracked in [#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90); a fix is proposed in [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 偶数 $n$ 的 $\\operatorname{rootn}(-\\infty, n)$ 返回 $+\\infty$（偶数负 $n$ 时返回 $+0$），而不是像负的有限参数那样返回 `domain_error`。负次数的精确根不会被检测出来（参见本节开头的警告）。由 [#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90) 跟踪；修复已在 [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "The squares are formed exactly and one correctly rounded square root is taken, so the result is $\\circ(\\sqrt{x^2+y^2})$ and exact when the root is. $\\operatorname{hypot}(\\pm\\infty, y) = +\\infty$ even when $y$ is a NaN (`invalid_operation` is raised only for a signaling NaN). Because the exact sum is built, operands whose stored exponents differ by more than $500\\,000$ (possible only in wide or unbounded contexts) give a `certification_failure`. Tracked in [#103](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/103); a fix is proposed in [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107)."
#~ msgstr "各平方精确构造，并只取一次正确舍入的平方根，因此结果为 $\\circ(\\sqrt{x^2+y^2})$，且当根精确时结果也精确。即使 $y$ 为 NaN，$\\operatorname{hypot}(\\pm\\infty, y) = +\\infty$（只有信号 NaN 才触发 `invalid_operation`）。由于要构造精确和，存储指数相差超过 $500\\,000$ 的操作数（只可能出现在宽或无界的上下文中）会给出 `certification_failure`。由 [#103](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/103) 跟踪；修复已在 [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] For odd $n$ the sign of the zero differs from IEEE 754, which gives $\\operatorname{tanpi}(n) = -0$ for positive odd and $+0$ for negative odd $n$: `tanpi(1)` is $+0$ here. Tracked in [#81](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/81); a fix is proposed in [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 对于奇数 $n$，零的符号与 IEEE 754 不同：IEEE 754 对正奇数 $n$ 给出 $\\operatorname{tanpi}(n) = -0$，对负奇数给出 $+0$，而这里 `tanpi(1)` 为 $+0$。由 [#81](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/81) 跟踪；修复已在 [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101) 中提出。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The receiver is the ordinate $y$. Infinite operands follow IEEE 754: for example $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm\\infty, -\\infty) = \\pm 3\\pi/4$, $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm\\infty, +\\infty) = \\pm\\pi/4$, $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, -\\infty) = \\pm\\pi$ and $\\operatorname{atan2}(y, +\\infty) = \\pm 0$ with the sign of $y$ for finite $y$. $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, x > 0) = \\pm 0$ and $\\operatorname{atan2}(y \\n"
#~ "e 0, \\pm 0) = \\pm\\pi/2$."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "接收者是纵坐标 $y$。无穷操作数遵循 IEEE 754：例如 $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm\\infty, -\\infty) = \\pm 3\\pi/4$，$\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm\\infty, +\\infty) = \\pm\\pi/4$，对有限的 $y$，$\\operatorname{atan2}(y, -\\infty) = \\pm\\pi$、$\\operatorname{atan2}(y, +\\infty) = \\pm 0$（符号与 $y$ 相同）。$\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, x > 0) = \\pm 0$，$\\operatorname{atan2}(y \\n"
#~ "e 0, \\pm 0) = \\pm\\pi/2$。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `atan2` ignores the sign of a zero in two IEEE special cases: $\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, \\pm 0)$ returns $\\pm\\pi/2$ (sign of $y$) instead of $\\pm 0$ for $x = +0$ and $\\pm\\pi$ for $x = -0$, and $\\operatorname{atan2}(-0, x < 0)$ returns $+\\pi$ instead of $-\\pi$. Tracked in [#48](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/48); a fix is proposed in [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `atan2` 在两个 IEEE 特殊情形中忽略了零的符号：$\\operatorname{atan2}(\\pm 0, \\pm 0)$ 返回 $\\pm\\pi/2$（符号同 $y$），而不是在 $x = +0$ 时返回 $\\pm 0$、在 $x = -0$ 时返回 $\\pm\\pi$；$\\operatorname{atan2}(-0, x < 0)$ 返回 $+\\pi$ 而不是 $-\\pi$。由 [#48](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/48) 跟踪；修复已在 [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Errors are taken in the order ordinate, abscissa, operation. `atan2` uses `BinaryContext::unbounded` at the larger operand precision. The signed-zero defects of `BinFloat::atan2` carry over (tracked in [#48](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/48); a fix is proposed in [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101))."
#~ msgstr "错误按纵坐标、横坐标、运算的顺序选取。`atan2` 使用较大操作数精度下的 `BinaryContext::unbounded`。`BinFloat::atan2` 的有符号零缺陷也会延续到这里（由 [#48](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/48) 跟踪；修复已在 [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101) 中提出）。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] An elementary file with a `pow`, `hypot` or `atan2` row whose second operand is `-` parses, and then aborts the process during execution instead of returning `1` (see [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md#parse_elementary_data)). Tracked in [#61](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/61); a fix is proposed in [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 若初等函数文件中含有第二个操作数为 `-` 的 `pow`、`hypot` 或 `atan2` 行，该文件能通过解析，但随后会在执行期间中止进程，而不是返回 `1`（参见 [`frontend/mpfr_expr`](../frontend/mpfr_expr.md#parse_elementary_data)）。由 [#61](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/61) 跟踪；修复已在 [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `AfterRounding` does not implement that rule yet: it tests the result rounded on the subnormal grid (at $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$), which keeps fewer digits. The two differ for results just below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ that round up to $10^{e_{\\min}}$ at $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ but not at $p$ digits: with $p = 3$ and $e_{\\min} = 0$, `plus_ctx` of `0.9951` gives `1.00` without `underflow` or `subnormal`, while IEEE 754 rounds it to `0.995` and calls it tiny. Tracked in [#110](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/110); a fix is proposed in [#115](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/115)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `AfterRounding` 尚未实现该规则：它检测的是在次正规网格上（于 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 处）舍入后的结果，该结果保留的位数更少。对于刚好低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$、在 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 处向上舍入为 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 但在 $p$ 位下不会的结果，两者会有差异：当 $p = 3$ 且 $e_{\\min} = 0$ 时，`0.9951` 的 `plus_ctx` 给出 `1.00`，且不引发 `underflow` 或 `subnormal`，而 IEEE 754 将其舍入为 `0.995` 并判定为微小。由 [#110](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/110) 跟踪；修复已在 [#115](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/115) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Two paths round twice, so a result can differ from the correctly rounded one by one unit in the last place in the half modes (`HalfEven`, `HalfUp`, `HalfDown`):"
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 有两条路径会舍入两次，因此在 half 模式（`HalfEven`、`HalfUp`、`HalfDown`）下，结果可能与正确舍入的结果相差一个末位单位："

#~ msgid "When the **exact** result has an exponent below $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ but a *normal* magnitude, it is first rounded to the subnormal grid $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$ and then to $p$ digits. This happens for operands longer than $p$ digits and for products of two small in-format numbers: in decimal32, `3.000001E-45 * 1.500001E-45` (exact `4.500004500001E-90`) gives `4.500004E-90` instead of `4.500005E-90`, and `apply_ctx` of `1.00000050000001E-89` gives `1.000000E-89` instead of `1.000001E-89`. It affects every operation that ends in this finalization, including `mul_ctx`, `fma_ctx`, `apply_ctx`, `plus_ctx`, a sum with a zero operand, and the elementary functions (`exp_ctx(-215.35)` in decimal32 gives `2.983206E-94`; the exact value is $2.98320653\\ldots\\cdot 10^{-94}$)."
#~ msgstr "当**精确**结果的指数低于 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ 但其量级为*正规*时，它会先被舍入到次正规网格 $10^{E_{\\text{tiny}}}$，再舍入到 $p$ 位。这种情况发生在长于 $p$ 位的操作数上，以及两个格式内可表示的微小数之积上：在 decimal32 中，`3.000001E-45 * 1.500001E-45`（精确值 `4.500004500001E-90`）得到 `4.500004E-90` 而非 `4.500005E-90`，对 `1.00000050000001E-89` 执行 `apply_ctx` 得到 `1.000000E-89` 而非 `1.000001E-89`。它影响所有以这一收尾步骤结束的运算，包括 `mul_ctx`、`fma_ctx`、`apply_ctx`、`plus_ctx`、含零操作数的求和，以及初等函数（decimal32 中 `exp_ctx(-215.35)` 得到 `2.983206E-94`；精确值为 $2.98320653\\ldots\\cdot 10^{-94}$）。"

#~ msgid "`div_ctx` with a **subnormal** quotient goes through the same finalization, after its guarded quotient: in decimal32, `1 / 1.9999999999998E+101` (exact $5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$) gives `0E-101` instead of `1E-101`."
#~ msgstr "**次正规**商的 `div_ctx` 在计算出带保护位的商之后，也会经过同样的收尾步骤：在 decimal32 中，`1 / 1.9999999999998E+101`（精确值 $5.0000000000005\\cdot 10^{-102}$）得到 `0E-101` 而非 `1E-101`。"

#~ msgid "Results whose exact exponent is at least $E_{\\text{tiny}}$, which covers almost all computations away from the underflow threshold, are correctly rounded. The directed modes are not affected, because rounding twice in the same direction equals rounding once. Tracked in [#87](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/87); a fix is proposed in [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100)."
#~ msgstr "精确指数不低于 $E_{\\text{tiny}}$ 的结果（涵盖了远离下溢阈值的几乎所有计算）都是正确舍入的。定向模式不受影响，因为沿同一方向舍入两次等同于舍入一次。由 [#87](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/87) 跟踪；修复已在 [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `add_ctx` and `sub_ctx` take a shortcut when one operand lies far below the other's rounding position, and the shortcut can misround: with precision 7, `1598617.000000000001 - 0.000000000002` under `Down` gives `1598617` instead of `1598616`, and the sum `6.0000005E-73 + 1E-101` under `HalfEven` gives `6.000000E-73` instead of `6.000001E-73`. The larger operand having digits below the rounding position, an exact midpoint, and `ZeroFiveUp` are affected. Tracked in [#88](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/88); a fix is proposed in [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 当一个操作数远低于另一个操作数的舍入位置时，`add_ctx` 和 `sub_ctx` 会走一条捷径，而这条捷径可能舍入错误：精度为 7 时，`Down` 下 `1598617.000000000001 - 0.000000000002` 得到 `1598617` 而不是 `1598616`；`HalfEven` 下和 `6.0000005E-73 + 1E-101` 得到 `6.000000E-73` 而不是 `6.000001E-73`。受影响的情形有：较大操作数在舍入位置以下还有数字、恰为中点，以及 `ZeroFiveUp`。由 [#88](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/88) 跟踪；修复已在 [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Unlike every other operation, `scaleb_ctx` ignores the rounding direction on overflow: in decimal64 with `TowardZero`, `9E+384` scaled by 1 is `inf`, not the largest finite number that IEEE 754 §7.4 and General Decimal Arithmetic prescribe. A zero result keeps the unclamped exponent (`0` scaled by 700 in decimal64 is `0E+700`, outside the format), and a finite result keeps a coefficient longer than $p$ digits. Tracked in [#52](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/52) (overflow) and [#95](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/95) (zero exponent, long coefficient); a fix is proposed in [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 与其他所有运算不同，`scaleb_ctx` 在上溢时忽略舍入方向：在 decimal64 中使用 `TowardZero` 时，`9E+384` 按 1 缩放得到 `inf`，而不是 IEEE 754 §7.4 和 General Decimal Arithmetic 所规定的最大有限数。零结果保留未钳制的指数（decimal64 中 `0` 按 700 缩放得到 `0E+700`，超出该格式），有限结果则保留长于 $p$ 位的系数。由 [#52](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/52)（上溢）和 [#95](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/95)（零指数、长系数）跟踪；修复已在 [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Correct rounding has these exceptions on the current branch:"
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 在当前分支上，正确舍入有以下例外："

#~ msgid "**Integer powers that do not fit in $p$ digits** (`power_ctx` with an integral exponent, `pown_ctx`, `pow_int_checked`, `pow_nat_checked`, and `exp2_ctx`/`exp10_ctx` of an integer) use the General Decimal Arithmetic square-and-multiply with $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 2$ working digits and round the product again; the error is below one unit in the last place but the result is not always the correctly rounded one. In decimal32, `power_ctx(3.339434, 3)` returns `37.24076`; the exact cube is $37.240765000\\ldots$, so `37.24077` is correct. Tracked in [#104](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/104); a fix is proposed in [#113](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/113)."
#~ msgstr "**无法容纳于 $p$ 位的整数次幂**（带整数指数的 `power_ctx`、`pown_ctx`、`pow_int_checked`、`pow_nat_checked`，以及整数参数的 `exp2_ctx`/`exp10_ctx`）使用 General Decimal Arithmetic 的平方-乘算法，以 $p + \\operatorname{digits}(n) + 2$ 位工作精度计算，并再次对乘积舍入；误差小于一个末位单位，但结果并不总是正确舍入的结果。在 decimal32 中，`power_ctx(3.339434, 3)` 返回 `37.24076`；精确的立方为 $37.240765000\\ldots$，因此正确结果是 `37.24077`。由 [#104](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/104) 跟踪；修复已在 [#113](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/113) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "**Results near the underflow threshold** inherit the double rounding of the [context finalization](#context-arithmetic) ([#87](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/87), fix proposed in [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100))."
#~ msgstr "**下溢阈值附近的结果**继承了[上下文收尾步骤](#context-arithmetic)的两次舍入（[#87](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/87)，修复已在 [#100](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/100) 中提出）。"

