#~ msgstr "$x<0$，$\\pm\\infty$（见警告）"

#~ msgid "$x<-1$, $\\pm\\infty$ (see warning)"
#~ msgstr "$x<-1$，$\\pm\\infty$（见警告）"

#~ msgid "$y = \\pm 0$ and $x = -0$ (see warning)"
#~ msgstr "$y = \\pm 0$ 且 $x = -0$（见警告）"

#~ msgid "$-\\infty$ (see warning)"
#~ msgstr "$-\\infty$（见警告）"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Some special values do not follow IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1 on the current branch:"
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 在当前分支上，部分特殊值不符合 IEEE 754-2019 §9.2.1："

#~ msgid "`atan2_ctx(y, x)` and `try_atan2_ctx` **abort the program** when either operand is an infinity (the enclosure constructor rejects an infinite bound). Test `is_infinite()` before calling them."
#~ msgstr "当任一操作数为无穷时，`atan2_ctx(y, x)` 和 `try_atan2_ctx` 会**中止程序**（包络构造函数拒绝无穷的边界）。调用它们之前请先检查 `is_infinite()`。"

#~ msgid "`atan2_ctx(±0, -0)` is NaN with `invalid_operation` instead of $\\pm\\pi$."
#~ msgstr "`atan2_ctx(±0, -0)` 是带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，而不是 $\\pm\\pi$。"

#~ msgid "`cosh_ctx(-∞)` is NaN with `invalid_operation` instead of $+\\infty$."
#~ msgstr "`cosh_ctx(-∞)` 是带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，而不是 $+\\infty$。"

#~ msgid "`log2_ctx(+∞)` is NaN with `invalid_operation` instead of $+\\infty$."
#~ msgstr "`log2_ctx(+∞)` 是带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，而不是 $+\\infty$。"

#~ msgid "`log1p_ctx(+∞)` is NaN with `invalid_operation` instead of $+\\infty$."
#~ msgstr "`log1p_ctx(+∞)` 为带 `invalid_operation` 的 NaN，而不是 $+\\infty$。"

#~ msgid "The `atan2_ctx` cases are tracked in [#92](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/92) and the others in [#93](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/93); a fix is proposed in [#98](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/98)."
#~ msgstr "`atan2_ctx` 的情形由 [#92](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/92) 跟踪，其余情形由 [#93](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/93) 跟踪；修复已在 [#98](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/98) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `atan2` aborts the program, instead of recording an error, when the current value or the abscissa is an infinity, because `Decimal::try_atan2_ctx` does. Check `value().is_infinite()` and the operand first. Tracked in [#92](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/92); a fix is proposed in [#98](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/98)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 当当前值或横坐标为无穷时，`atan2` 会中止程序而不是记录错误，因为 `Decimal::try_atan2_ctx` 就是如此。请先检查 `value().is_infinite()` 以及该操作数。由 [#92](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/92) 跟踪；修复已在 [#98](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/98) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "A value with negative exponent is quantized to exponent 0; `to_integral_exact` raises `Inexact` and `Rounded` when digits are dropped and `to_integral_value` never does. A value with exponent $\\ge 0$ is passed through `apply`, so it is rounded to the context precision if it is longer than $p$ digits."
#~ msgstr "指数为负的值被量化到指数 0；丢弃数字时 `to_integral_exact` 引发 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`，而 `to_integral_value` 从不引发。指数 $\\ge 0$ 的值经由 `apply` 处理，因此若它长于 $p$ 位，就会被舍入到上下文精度。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Both functions treat an integral part longer than $p$ digits differently from the GDA reference implementation, which never rounds to the precision here. At precision 3, `12345` becomes `1.23E+4` with `Inexact` and `Rounded` (GDA: `12345` unchanged, no flags), and `12345.6` becomes NaN with `InvalidOperation`, because the quantize step refuses a 5-digit coefficient (GDA: `12346`, with `Inexact` and `Rounded` for `to_integral_exact`). The pinned test suite has no such row. Keep the precision at least as large as the number of integer digits. Tracked in [#59](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/59) and [#109](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/109); a fix is proposed in [#114](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/114)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 对于长于 $p$ 位的整数部分，这两个函数的处理与 GDA 参考实现不同，后者在此处从不舍入到精度。在精度 3 下，`12345` 变为带 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded` 的 `1.23E+4`（GDA：`12345` 保持不变，无标志），而 `12345.6` 变为带 `InvalidOperation` 的 NaN，因为量化步骤拒绝 5 位系数（GDA：`12346`，`to_integral_exact` 还带 `Inexact` 和 `Rounded`）。所固定的测试套件中没有这样的测试行。请使精度至少等于整数部分的位数。由 [#59](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/59) 和 [#109](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/109) 跟踪；修复已在 [#114](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/114) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`BeforeRounding` tests the adjusted exponent of the exact result against $e_{\\min}$, as GDA does. `AfterRounding` tests the adjusted exponent of the result after it has been rounded at $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$."
#~ msgstr "`BeforeRounding` 与 GDA 一样，将精确结果的调整后指数与 $e_{\\min}$ 比较。`AfterRounding` 检测在 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 处舍入之后的结果的调整后指数。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] `AfterRounding` is not the IEEE 754 after-rounding rule, which rounds to $p$ digits with an unbounded exponent range before the test. The two differ for results just below $10^{e_{\\min}}$ that round up to $10^{e_{\\min}}$ at $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ but not at $p$ digits: with $p = 3$ and $e_{\\min} = 0$, `0.9951` rounds to `1.00` at $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = -2$ and is not tiny here, while IEEE rounds it to `0.995` and calls it tiny. The `AfterRounding` rule of the [`decimal`](decimal.md) package currently behaves the same way. Tracked in [#110](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/110); a fix is proposed in [#115](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/115)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] `AfterRounding` 不是 IEEE 754 的舍入后规则，后者在检测前以无界指数范围舍入到 $p$ 位。对于刚好低于 $10^{e_{\\min}}$、在 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}}$ 处向上舍入为 $10^{e_{\\min}}$ 但在 $p$ 位下不会的结果，两者会有差异：当 $p = 3$ 且 $e_{\\min} = 0$ 时，`0.9951` 在 $E_{\\mathrm{tiny}} = -2$ 处舍入为 `1.00`，在这里不算微小，而 IEEE 将其舍入为 `0.995` 并判定为微小。[`decimal`](decimal.md) 包的 `AfterRounding` 规则目前的行为与此相同。由 [#110](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/110) 跟踪；修复已在 [#115](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/115) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] Two inputs are not handled as the GDA specification requires. A row whose directive context has a non-positive precision (for example `precision: 0`) aborts the whole call, because building the `decimal_gda` context aborts. A plain decimal operand with more than $\\max(64, p)$ significant digits is rounded half-even when it is decoded, so the operation sees a rounded operand and its result can be rounded twice. At precision 9 under `half_even`, `add` of `0` and the 67-digit operand made of `1000000014`, 56 nines and a final `5` gives `1.00000002E+66` instead of `1.00000001E+66`: reading the operand at 64 digits turns the tail `4999…95` into exactly one half, and the second rounding then breaks the tie to even. Tracked in [#73](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/73) (precision) and [#74](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/74) (long operands); a fix is proposed in [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 有两种输入没有按照 GDA 规范的要求处理。若某行的指令上下文精度非正（例如 `precision: 0`），整个调用会中止，因为构建 `decimal_gda` 上下文时会中止。有效数字超过 $\\max(64, p)$ 位的普通十进制操作数在解码时按就近舍入（偶数优先）舍入，因此运算看到的是已舍入的操作数，其结果可能被舍入两次。在精度 9、`half_even` 下，对 `0` 与由 `1000000014`、56 个 9 和末尾的 `5` 组成的 67 位操作数执行 `add`，得到 `1.00000002E+66` 而不是 `1.00000001E+66`：以 64 位读取该操作数会把尾部 `4999…95` 变成恰好一半，随后第二次舍入将这个平局舍入到偶数。由 [#73](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/73)（精度）和 [#74](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/74)（长操作数）跟踪；修复已在 [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Comments are recognized only at the start of a line. A `//` comment after a statement's `;` keeps the line from ending in `;`, so the statement silently absorbs the following lines up to the next line that ends in `;`: the text `add [1.0,2.0] [3.0,4.0] = [4.0,6.0]; // c` followed by a `sub` statement yields one case whose expected text is `[4.0,6.0]; // c sub [1.0,2.0] [3.0,4.0] = [-3.0,-1.0]`. Tracked in [#76](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/76); a fix is proposed in [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82)."
#~ msgstr "注释仅在行首被识别。语句的 `;` 之后的 `//` 注释会使该行不以 `;` 结尾，因此该语句会静默吸收后续各行，直到下一个以 `;` 结尾的行：文本 `add [1.0,2.0] [3.0,4.0] = [4.0,6.0]; // c` 后跟一条 `sub` 语句，会得到一个用例，其期望文本为 `[4.0,6.0]; // c sub [1.0,2.0] [3.0,4.0] = [-3.0,-1.0]`。由 [#76](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/76) 跟踪；修复已在 [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "The binary dispatch reads the operands before it looks at the operation, so an operation the executor does not know is a `Diagnostic`, not `Unsupported`, when one of its operands is not an interval literal: `nums2interval 1.0 2.0` and `rootn [1.0,8.0] 3` are diagnostics, while `sqrRev [0.0,1.0] [-1.0,1.0]` is unsupported. Because a diagnostic makes `RunSummary::success` false, run such operations only through an operation filter. Tracked in [#75](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/75); a fix is proposed in [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82)."
#~ msgstr "二元分派在查看运算之前先读取操作数，因此当执行器不认识的运算的某个操作数不是区间字面量时，它是 `Diagnostic` 而不是 `Unsupported`：`nums2interval 1.0 2.0` 和 `rootn [1.0,8.0] 3` 是诊断，而 `sqrRev [0.0,1.0] [-1.0,1.0]` 是不支持。由于诊断会使 `RunSummary::success` 为假，请只借助运算过滤器来运行这类运算。由 [#75](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/75) 跟踪；修复已在 [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "[!WARNING] The parser does not check that `y` is present for the two-operand functions `pow`, `hypot` and `atan2`, and the executor unwraps it: executing such a row with `y = -` aborts the whole run instead of failing the row. Tracked in [#61](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/61); a fix is proposed in [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82)."
#~ msgstr "[!WARNING] 解析器不检查双操作数函数 `pow`、`hypot` 和 `atan2` 是否提供了 `y`，而执行器会对其解包：执行 `y = -` 的此类行会中止整个运行，而不是使该行失败。由 [#61](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/61) 跟踪；修复已在 [#82](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/82) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Empty, Entire, and decorated NaI are separate states. Elementary kernels use directed dyadic certificates. When range reduction cannot be certified, `sin`/`cos` return `[-1,1]` and `tan` returns Entire; that preserves inclusion but does not promise tightness. A passing gate does not cover inputs outside the corpus: the known inclusion, decoration and termination defects listed under [Known limitations](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations) (extreme integer endpoints of `exp2`, decorated `tanpi` and negative-degree `rootn`, `ln` near 1 at high precision) are not caught by the selected cases. They are tracked in [#84](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/84), [#86](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/86), [#45](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/45) and [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85); fixes are proposed in [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97) and [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96)."
#~ msgstr "Empty、Entire 和带装饰的 NaI 是彼此不同的状态。初等函数内核使用定向的二进有理证书。当范围约简无法被认证时，`sin`/`cos` 返回 `[-1,1]`，`tan` 返回 Entire；这保持了包含性，但不保证紧致性。门禁通过并不覆盖语料之外的输入：[已知局限](../design/ball_float.md#known-limitations)中列出的已知包含性、装饰与终止性缺陷（`exp2` 的极端整数端点、带装饰的 `tanpi` 与负次数的 `rootn`、高精度下接近 1 的 `ln`）不会被所选用例捕获。它们由 [#84](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/84)、[#86](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/86)、[#45](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/45) 和 [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85) 跟踪；修复已在 [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97) 和 [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "The fixed-seed elementary inputs do not include the inputs on which the package is known to deviate: very tiny arguments of `exp`, `expm1`, `exp2`, `sin` and `atan`, exact results that the elementary functions do not filter (such as $16^{3/4}$ or $\\operatorname{rootn}(8, -3)$), the signed-zero cases of `atan2`, and the IEEE `pow` special cases that `pow` rejects. They are listed in the [API reference](../api/bin_float.md#elementary-functions) and tracked in [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102), [#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49), [#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90), [#48](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/48) and [#89](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/89); fixes are proposed in [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107), [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) and [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101)."
#~ msgstr "固定种子的初等函数输入不包含本包已知会偏离的输入：`exp`、`expm1`、`exp2`、`sin` 和 `atan` 的极小参数，初等函数未过滤的精确结果（例如 $16^{3/4}$ 或 $\\operatorname{rootn}(8, -3)$），`atan2` 的带符号零情形，以及被 `pow` 拒绝的 IEEE `pow` 特殊情形。它们列于[API 参考](../api/bin_float.md#elementary-functions)中，并由 [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102)、[#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49)、[#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90)、[#48](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/48) 和 [#89](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/89) 跟踪；修复已在 [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107)、[#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) 和 [#101](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/101) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`to_integral_exact` and `to_integral_value` round an integer longer than the precision (`12345` at precision 3 becomes `1.23E+4`) and return NaN with `InvalidOperation` when the integral part of a fractional operand is longer than the precision (`12345.6` at precision 3), where the reference implementation returns `12345` and `12346` ([API](../api/decimal_gda.md#to_integral_exact-to_integral_value); tracked in [#59](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/59) and [#109](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/109), fix proposed in [#114](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/114))."
#~ msgstr "`to_integral_exact` 和 `to_integral_value` 会对长于精度的整数进行舍入（精度为 3 时 `12345` 变为 `1.23E+4`），并且当小数操作数的整数部分长于精度时（精度为 3 时的 `12345.6`）返回带 `InvalidOperation` 的 NaN，而参考实现分别返回 `12345` 和 `12346`（[API](../api/decimal_gda.md#to_integral_exact-to_integral_value)；由 [#59](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/59) 和 [#109](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/109) 跟踪，修复已在 [#114](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/114) 中提出）。"

#~ msgid "`exp2_interval` replaces an integer endpoint $n$ by the exact power $2^n$, built without regard to the exponent range: an integer lower endpoint $n \\ge 2^{30}$ overflows to $+\\infty$ and the call aborts, and an integer upper endpoint $n < -2^{30} - p - 94$ underflows to 0, so the result misses $2^n > 0$ (at 53 bits, `exp2_interval` of $\\{-1073742000\\}$ is $\\{0\\}$). `try_exp2_interval` is not affected. Tracked in [#84](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/84); a fix is proposed in [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97)."
#~ msgstr "`exp2_interval` 将整数端点 $n$ 替换为精确幂 $2^n$，构造时不考虑指数范围：整数下端点 $n \\ge 2^{30}$ 会上溢为 $+\\infty$ 并使调用中止，整数上端点 $n < -2^{30} - p - 94$ 会下溢为 0，从而结果遗漏 $2^n > 0$（在 53 位下，$\\{-1073742000\\}$ 的 `exp2_interval` 为 $\\{0\\}$）。`try_exp2_interval` 不受影响。由 [#84](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/84) 跟踪；修复已在 [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`ln_interval` does not return (more than five minutes in a release build) for some arguments just above 1 at high precision, for example $\\{1 + 2^{-243}\\}$ or $\\{1 + 2^{-238}\\}$ at 245 bits and $\\{1 + 2^{-243}\\}$ at 300 bits, while $\\{1 + 2^{-230}\\}$ and $\\{1 + 2^{-244}\\}$ at 245 bits return at once. Because the total `asinh_interval` and `atanh_interval` evaluate `ln_interval` at $p + 192$ bits, they hang the same way for tiny arguments: neither returned within minutes for $\\{2^{-300}\\}$ at 53 bits. The `try_` forms are not affected. The cause is `BinCoeff::gcd`, which the certified kernels call when they convert series bounds to rationals: its Lehmer loop takes each operand's own top limb as its leading digit, so for operands of very different lengths it barely progresses (a 301-bit odd number and $2^{543}$ need about $2^{220}$ rounds). The JavaScript target computes the gcd with the host `BigInt` and is not affected. Tracked in [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85); a fix is proposed in [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97)."
#~ msgstr "对于高精度下略大于 1 的某些参数，`ln_interval` 不会返回（在 release 构建中超过五分钟），例如 245 位下的 $\\{1 + 2^{-243}\\}$ 或 $\\{1 + 2^{-238}\\}$，以及 300 位下的 $\\{1 + 2^{-243}\\}$；而 245 位下的 $\\{1 + 2^{-230}\\}$ 和 $\\{1 + 2^{-244}\\}$ 会立即返回。由于全函数形式的 `asinh_interval` 和 `atanh_interval` 在 $p + 192$ 位下计算 `ln_interval`，它们对极小参数也会以同样方式挂起：在 53 位下，两者对 $\\{2^{-300}\\}$ 都未在数分钟内返回。`try_` 形式不受影响。原因在于 `BinCoeff::gcd`：认证内核在把级数界转换为有理数时会调用它，而它的 Lehmer 循环把每个操作数各自的最高 limb 当作首位数字，因此对长度相差很大的操作数几乎没有进展（一个 301 位的奇数与 $2^{543}$ 需要大约 $2^{220}$ 轮）。JavaScript 目标用宿主的 `BigInt` 计算 gcd，不受影响。由 [#85](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/85) 跟踪；修复已在 [#97](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/97) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Decorated `rootn` with a negative degree does not lower the decoration to `trv` when 0 is in the argument. Tracked in [#45](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/45); a fix is proposed in [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96)."
#~ msgstr "负次数的装饰 `rootn` 在参数包含 0 时不会将装饰降为 `trv`。由 [#45](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/45) 跟踪；修复已在 [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "Decorated `tanpi_interval` lowers the decoration only when the result is Entire. When a pole is an endpoint (for example $[1/2, 1]$), the half-unbounded result is decorated `dac`, although the pole is outside the domain and the decoration must be `trv`. Tracked in [#86](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/86); a fix is proposed in [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96)."
#~ msgstr "带装饰的 `tanpi_interval` 仅在结果为 Entire 时才降低装饰。当极点是端点时（例如 $[1/2, 1]$），半无界结果的装饰为 `dac`，尽管极点不在定义域内，装饰应为 `trv`。由 [#86](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/86) 跟踪；修复已在 [#96](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/96) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "`confirmatory_regression` fixes $\\delta = 3\\,\\%$, $R = 10\\,000$ and $c = 95\\,\\%$, so a regression gate cannot be weakened by a caller. `paired_hotspot` takes $\\delta$ and the seed from the caller and uses $R = 2000$ for exploratory hotspot reports. It passes the confidence as `0.95`; Maremark interprets the value as a percentage, so $\\alpha = (100 - 0.95)/200 = 0.49525$ and the interval it reports is $[Q^{*}(0.49525), Q^{*}(0.50475)]$, the central 0.95 % of the bootstrap distribution and almost a point at the bootstrap median. This is a defect of the call, not a design choice; the suites only print $\\Delta_{\\%}$ from it, which is unaffected. Tracked in [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60); a fix is proposed in [#80](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/80)."
#~ msgstr "`confirmatory_regression` 固定 $\\delta = 3\\,\\%$、$R = 10\\,000$ 和 $c = 95\\,\\%$，因此调用者无法削弱回归门禁。`paired_hotspot` 从调用者获取 $\\delta$ 和种子，并使用 $R = 2000$ 生成探索性的热点报告。它以 `0.95` 传入置信水平；Maremark 将该值解释为百分数，因此 $\\alpha = (100 - 0.95)/200 = 0.49525$，它报告的区间是 $[Q^{*}(0.49525), Q^{*}(0.50475)]$，即 bootstrap 分布中央的 0.95 %，几乎就是 bootstrap 中位数处的一个点。这是调用上的缺陷，而非设计选择；测试套件只打印由此得到的 $\\Delta_{\\%}$，不受影响。由 [#60](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/60) 跟踪；修复已在 [#80](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/80) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "**Known gaps.** Two families break these conditions on the current branch."
#~ msgstr "**已知缺口。** 在当前分支上，有两类情形违反了这些条件。"

#~ msgid "*Unfiltered exact results.* `pow` with a non-integral exponent whose result is dyadic ($16^{3/4} = 8$; $x^y$ for dyadic $x, y$ is not covered by the theorems above), `rootn` with a negative degree ($8^{-1/3} = 1/2$), and $10^n$, $\\log_{10} 10^n$ for $n > 4096$ at a precision that holds $10^n$. By the flag argument above these return a spurious `inexact` under nearest rounding and fail under directed rounding. Tracked in [#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49), [#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90) and [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102); fixes are proposed in [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) and [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107)."
#~ msgstr "*未过滤的精确结果。* 指数非整数而结果为二进有理数的 `pow`（$16^{3/4} = 8$；对二进有理数 $x, y$，$x^y$ 不在上述定理的覆盖范围内）、负次数的 `rootn`（$8^{-1/3} = 1/2$），以及在能容纳 $10^n$ 的精度下 $n > 4096$ 时的 $10^n$、$\\log_{10} 10^n$。根据上文关于标志的论证，它们在就近舍入下返回虚假的 `inexact`，在定向舍入下失败。由 [#49](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/49)、[#90](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/90) 和 [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102) 跟踪；修复已在 [#106](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/106) 和 [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "*Tiny arguments.* For $|x|$ so small that the first omitted term is below the absolute threshold, the series stops after its first term and one end of the enclosure is exactly representable: $U = x$ for $\\sin$ and $\\operatorname{atan}$ (alternating series bracketed by $x$), $L = 1$ for $e^x$. That end rounds without `inexact` while the other end does, so the test fails until $w$ exceeds about $3\\log_2(1/|x|)$ (respectively $\\log_2(1/|x|)$), which the budget does not reach for $|x| \\lesssim 2^{-w_{11}/3}$. Measured: `sin` and `atan` of $2^{-6000}$ at 53 bits, `sin` of $2^{-8000}$ in binary128, and `exp`, `expm1`, `exp2` of $2^{-20000}$ at 53 bits all fail. A fix would use the first term with a strict inequality ($x - x^3/6 < \\sin x < x$ gives $U = x^-$ after one step toward zero), as MPFR does. Tracked in [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102); a fix is proposed in [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107)."
#~ msgstr "*极小参数。* 当 $|x|$ 小到第一个省略项低于绝对阈值时，级数在第一项之后就停止，包络的一端可以精确表示：对 $\\sin$ 和 $\\operatorname{atan}$ 为 $U = x$（以 $x$ 为界的交错级数），对 $e^x$ 为 $L = 1$。该端点舍入时不带 `inexact`，而另一端带，因此测试会一直失败，直到 $w$ 超过约 $3\\log_2(1/|x|)$（相应地 $\\log_2(1/|x|)$），而对于 $|x| \\lesssim 2^{-w_{11}/3}$，预算达不到这一点。实测：53 位下 $2^{-6000}$ 的 `sin` 和 `atan`、binary128 中 $2^{-8000}$ 的 `sin`，以及 53 位下 $2^{-20000}$ 的 `exp`、`expm1`、`exp2` 全部失败。一种修复方法是像 MPFR 那样以严格不等式使用第一项（$x - x^3/6 < \\sin x < x$ 给出向零方向走一步后的 $U = x^-$）。由 [#102](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/102) 跟踪；修复已在 [#107](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/107) 中提出。"

#~ msgid "\"At most once\" is checked on the stored value: an empty `--backend=` leaves it empty, so a later `--backend NAME` is still accepted ([#78](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/78), fix proposed in [#83](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/83))."
#~ msgstr "“至多一次”是针对已存储的值检查的：空的 `--backend=` 使其保持为空，因此之后的 `--backend NAME` 仍会被接受（[#78](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/78)，修复已在 [#83](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/83) 中提出）。"

#~ msgid "No recursion into subdirectories, and files without the `.decTest` suffix are ignored without a message ([#77](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/77), fix proposed in [#83](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/83))."
#~ msgstr "不会递归进入子目录，不带 `.decTest` 后缀的文件会被忽略且不给出任何消息（[#77](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/issues/77)，修复已在 [#83](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/floating/pull/83) 中提出）。"

