#~ msgid "Build immutable Maremark plans and reduce versioned observations without coupling numeric packages to benchmark code."
#~ msgstr "构建不可变 Maremark 计划并归约版本化 observation，避免数值包依赖 benchmark 代码。"

#~ msgid "Data Flow"
#~ msgstr "数据流"

#~ msgid "Datatype fixtures produce inputs, Maremark validates reference equivalence, balanced timed blocks emit observations, and pure reducers calculate paired hotspots or tuning winners."
#~ msgstr "数据类型 fixture 生成输入，Maremark 校验参考等价性，平衡计时块产生 observation，纯函数归约得到热点与调优 winner。"

#~ msgid "Setup stays outside timed payloads; comparisons use matching dataset and block identifiers; auto-tune candidates must be semantically equivalent."
#~ msgstr "setup 必须位于计时 payload 外；成对比较必须匹配 dataset 与 block；auto-tune 只能比较语义等价候选。"

#~ msgid "Effects"
#~ msgstr "副作用"

#~ msgid "The shared package is pure except for its explicit async runner boundary. JSONL printing and filesystem writes remain in tests and `tools/benchmark.py`."
#~ msgstr "公共层除显式 async runner 边界外保持纯函数；JSONL 输出与文件写入留在测试和 `tools/benchmark.py`。"

#~ msgid "Isolate binary-kernel, interval-core, and checked-wrapper costs."
#~ msgstr "隔离二进制核、区间核心与 checked 包装的成本。"

#~ msgid "Exact singleton intervals make add, multiply, and divide comparable to their `BinFloat` reference results."
#~ msgstr "精确单点区间使加、乘、除能够与对应 `BinFloat` 参考值比较。"

#~ msgid "Core and checked outputs must remain singleton intervals centered on the reference value."
#~ msgstr "核心与 checked 输出必须保持以参考值为中心的单点区间。"

#~ msgid "Maremark owns calibration and timing; the Python runner owns process and artifact IO."
#~ msgstr "Maremark 负责校准与计时，Python runner 负责进程和 artifact IO。"

#~ msgid "Measure coefficient kernels, `BinFloat`, checked wrappers, the elementary matrix, and square crossover candidates."
#~ msgstr "测量系数核、`BinFloat`、checked 包装、完整初等函数矩阵与平方 crossover 候选。"

#~ msgid "Exact generated coefficients feed coefficient, core, and checked implementations under one validated Maremark case."
#~ msgstr "确定性精确系数在同一 Maremark case 中进入系数、核心与 checked 实现。"

#~ msgid "Arithmetic layers must return the same exact value; elementary core and checked paths must agree before timing; tuning compares only `mul(x, x)` with `square(x)`."
#~ msgstr "算术分层必须得到同一精确值；初等函数核心与 checked 路径必须先通过一致性校验；调优只比较 `mul(x, x)` 与 `square(x)`。"

#~ msgid "Skipped tests stream `mmka_1` JSONL and hotspot/tuning lines only when the unified runner includes them."
#~ msgstr "只有统一 runner 显式包含 skipped test 时才会流式输出 `mmka_1` JSONL 与热点/调优结果。"

#~ msgid "Separate coefficient cost from contextual `Decimal` and `DecimalChecked` overhead."
#~ msgstr "分离系数成本、上下文 `Decimal` 成本与 `DecimalChecked` 包装成本。"

#~ msgid "Deterministic decimal coefficients are materialized before timing and evaluated at 9, 34, 128, and 512 digits."
#~ msgstr "确定性十进制系数在计时外生成，并覆盖 9、34、128 与 512 位十进制精度。"

#~ msgid "Precision is large enough for exact arithmetic, so every layer is checked against the same integer reference."
#~ msgstr "工作精度足以保持精确算术，因此各层都以同一整数参考值校验。"

#~ msgid "Only explicitly included skipped tests measure time and emit artifacts."
#~ msgstr "只有显式包含的 skipped test 才计时并输出 artifact。"

#~ msgid "Measure GDA core operations and sticky-context checked composition."
#~ msgstr "测量 GDA 核心运算与 sticky-context checked 组合。"

#~ msgid "Exact non-trapping inputs cover add, multiply, divide, fused multiply-add, and parse across representative digit counts."
#~ msgstr "精确且不触发 trap 的输入覆盖加、乘、除、fma 与 parse。"

#~ msgid "Core and checked values must be equal before their observations enter hotspot analysis."
#~ msgstr "核心值与 checked 值必须先相等，才能进入热点分析。"

#~ msgid "Context creation, input parsing, JSONL streaming, and reporting stay outside timed payloads."
#~ msgstr "context 创建、输入解析、JSONL 输出与报告均位于计时 payload 外。"

#~ msgid "MoonBit `check` blocks exercise supported binary, decimal, GDA, interval, checked, semantic, expression, and frontend workflows."
#~ msgstr "MoonBit `check` 代码块覆盖受支持的二进制、十进制、GDA、区间、checked、semantic、expression 与 frontend 工作流。"

